Jain /vegetarian / non–vegetarian dinners.\n01 Local dinner.\n\nNote: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian. In certain places, there is a possibility of providing cash out to the passengers instead of packed lunches.'], 'visa': ['As per itinerary', 'Visa Requirements:\n\nMultiple entry Schengen & UK visa.\xa0\nThis cost includes documentation, processing and consulate fees.\n'], 'transfer': ['\nAll transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the itinerary) by a deluxe air conditioned coach.\n', '\nAs per itinerary\n'], 'sightseeing': ['As per itinerary', 'Highlights:\nLondon\n\nGuided City Tour Of London\nVisit To Madame Tussauds Wax Museum\nRide On The London Eye\xa0\xa0\n\nEurostar To Paris\nParis\n\nGuided City Tour Of Paris\nVisit 3rd Level Of Eiffel Tower\nGuided Tour Of Versailles Palace\nVisit Disneyland® Paris (01 Day 01 Park)\nSeine River Cruise\nEnjoy Illumination Tour of Paris\n\n\xa0\nBelgium\n\nOrientation Tour Of Brussels\nPhoto Stop At Atomium\nVisit Beer Museum\n\nNetherlands\n\nVisit Madurodam (Till 17th May)\nVisit Keukenhof (From 18th May)\nCheese Farm And Wooden Shoe Making\nAmsterdam Canal Cruise\n\n\xa0\nGermany\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\n\nPhoto Stop At The Cologne Cathedral\nEnjoy River Rhine Cruise\nVisit Black Forest\nCuckoo Clock Demonstration\n\n\xa0\nSwitzerland\n\nExcursion To Jungfraujoch With Lunch And Interlaken\nVisit Mt. Titlis\nOrientation Tour Of Lucerne\nOrientation Tour Of Laax\nRhine Gorge Train\n\n\xa0\nLiechtenstein\n\nOrientation Tour Of Vaduz\n\n\xa0\nAustria\n\nVisit The Swarovski Crystal Worlds\nOrientation Tour Of Innsbruck\n\n\xa0Italy\nVenice\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\n\nVisit St. Mark’s Square On A Private Boat\nOrientation Tour Of Venice\n\n\xa0\nFlorence\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\n\nGuided Walking Tour Of Florence\n\n\xa0\nRome\n\nGuided City Tour Of Rome\n\n\xa0\nVatican City\n\nVisit The St. Peter’s Basilica And Square\n\n\xa0\nPisa\n\nVisit The Field Of Miracles – See The Leaning Tower Of Pisa\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '<p>Rest assured, Thomas Cook\'s experienced &amp; knowledgeable&nbsp;<span data-markjs="true" data-ogac="" data-ogab="" data-ogsc="" data-ogsb="">tour</span>&nbsp;<span data-markjs="true" data-ogac="" data-ogab="" data-ogsc="" data-ogsb="">manager</span>&nbsp;will be with the group at every step of the journey. Be it transportation, accommodation &amp; everything in between, ensuring a seamless &amp; stress-free travel experience from start to finish. Whether it\'s a question or a challenge, our&nbsp;<span data-markjs="true" data-ogac="" data-ogab="" data-ogsc="" data-ogsb="">tour</span>&nbsp;<span data-markjs="true" data-ogac="" data-ogab="" data-ogsc="" data-ogsb="">manager</span>&nbsp;is always readily available to offer support, assistance &amp; ensure that your trip becomes a most cherished memory. (Presence of the&nbsp;<span data-markjs="true" data-ogac="" data-ogab="" data-ogsc="" data-ogsb="">Tour</span>&nbsp;<span data-markjs="true" data-ogac="" data-ogab="" data-ogsc="" data-ogsb="">Manager</span>&nbsp;is subject to a minimum of 15 - 20 customers, depending on package/destination booked)</p>', 'flightDescription': '<ul>\n<li>Return economy class group airfare as per the itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', 'inclusions': '\nReturn economy class group airfare as per the itinerary.\xa0\nAll local taxes and services as of 1st July, 2026.\nCost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the duration of the tour.\xa0\nSightseeing and accommodation as per the above mentioned itinerary.\nAll transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the itinerary) by a deluxe air-conditioned coach.\nServices of a professional, friendly and multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to minimum 15 customers).\n\n\xa0\nVisa Requirements:\n\nMultiple entry Schengen & UK visa.\xa0\nThis cost includes documentation, processing and consulate fees.\n', 'exclusions': '\nIf you wish to travel in advance i.e., before the published departure date as mentioned in the brochure or like to come back on a later date after the tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable (subject to availability of seats for the given dates & ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff / travel agent. Kindly note, the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days prior to departure date.\xa0\nTipping is expected from anyone providing your service e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel & Restaurant staff etc. It is mandatory to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 15 Days, the total Tips amount is EUR 45 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour.\nCost of Basic Travel Quota equivalent to USD 250,000.\nAny increase in the airfare charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as on 1st July, 2026)\nGovernment Taxes as applicable are extra.\nThe tour cost does not include POE charges and passport charges.\nNo porterage included.\nAny expenses of a personal nature such as porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food and drink not in the regular menu provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc.\nMeals other than that are mentioned in your itinerary.\nCost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees and local guides availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in your itinerary.\nPrivate airport transfers, Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions.\n', 'termsAndConditions': '', 'pkgSubtypeId': 3, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'GIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': -1, 'productId': 4, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package includes flights in the package price.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015052/Swiss_267.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015052/itinerary/LondonTowerBridge7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015052/itinerary/LondonEye.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015052/itinerary/VersaillesPalace_new_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015052/itinerary/Eiffel_Tower_SienRiver_Cruise_7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015052/itinerary/74758_Grand_Place_Brussels_Belgium_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015052/itinerary/Kukenhof_Tulip_Garden_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015052/itinerary/09227_Cologne_Cathedral_Germany_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015052/itinerary/Cuckoo_Clock_Germany_BlackForest_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015052/itinerary/Interlaken_Train_to_Jungfrau_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015052/itinerary/Mt_Titlis_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015052/itinerary/Sworowski_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015052/itinerary/Venice_Adobe_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015052/itinerary/Florence_City_Adobe_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015052/itinerary/Colleseum_Rome_Adobe_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015052/itinerary/Pisa.jpg']}, 'score': 5.526697, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014515', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014515', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'East European Exclusive', 'days': 9, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Prague', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Prague', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Budapest', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Budapest', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Salzburg', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Salzburg', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Vienna', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Vienna', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Vienna', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014515_0_20260918230253', 'price': 168435, 'packageSummary': "The 'East European Exclusive' package is a 9-day tour covering the historic and picturesque cities of Salzburg, Prague, Budapest, and Vienna. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the majestic Prague Castle, the magnificent Schönbrunn Palace in Vienna, the scenic Buda Castle, and the charming Mirabell Gardens in Salzburg. Participants will enjoy guided city tours, leisurely walks through medieval old towns, and a scenic cruise along the Danube River, offering a comprehensive and memorable experience of Eastern Europe's rich cultural heritage.", 'images': ['497110_Prague_753.jpg', '23139_Charles_Bridge_Prague_Czech_Republic_753.jpg', '61588_Budapest_Danube_Cruise_753.jpg', '107107_Hungalian_Parliament_and_Danube_River_Budapest_753.jpg', 'FestungHohensalzburg_753.jpg', 'Salzburg_753.jpg', 'Vienna_City_Hall_753.jpg', 'Schonbrunnpalace753.jpg', 'Vienna_753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 168435, 'thumbnailImage': 'vienna-city.jpeg', 'packageTheme': ['Adventure', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Budget Friendly', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014515 is named 'East European Exclusive' and spans 9 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Prague, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Prague Transfers: Upon your arrival you will meet the representative and then be transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle. Special Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15:00 hrs. or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Prague, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Prague City Tour Prague City Tour: Prague Castle! St. Vitus Cathedral! Charles Bridge! Visit the most significant Czech monument - an ancient symbol of the Czech State with a tradition of more than 1000 years. Learn about its history and the most important monarchs who ruled the Czech Lands from the heights of the Prague Castle. See St. Vitus Cathedral, Old Royal Palace, St. George’s Basilica, and much more. Enjoy panoramic views over Prague - all this with a knowledgeable guide! (Duration of the tour: 3 hrs), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Budapest, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Prague To Budapest Via Train (Approx 6 Hrs) Transfers: Make your way to the train station to board the train to Budapest! Welcome to Budapest! Upon your arrival at Budapest train station, make your way to the hotel. Special Note: Please note cost of the ticket is included, however the same is subject to vary until ticketed. Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Budapest, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Budapest City Tour Budapest City Tour: On this tour you will be passing by the Parliament building before crossing the Danube on the Margaret Bridge and drive to the Royal Castle on the Buda side of the city. Here you will have some free time to yourself to visit the Fishermen's Bastion which offers stunning views over the city and the Mathias Church. The tour will continue to the Gillert Hill before crossing the Elisabeth Bridge from where you will drive towards the Heroes' Square. Passing by the Opera and St Stephen's Basilica you reach the Hotel Intercontinental where your tour ends. [Duration of this tour: Approx 3 hrs], GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Salzburg, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Budapest To Salzburg By Train (Approx 6 Hrs) Transfers: Make your way to the train station to board the train to Salzburg! Special Note: Please note cost of the ticket is included, however the same is subject to vary until ticketed Welcome to Salzburg! Upon your arrival at Salzburg train station, make your way to the hotel on your own., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Salzburg, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Salzburg: Sound Of Music Tour Sound of Music Tour: Follow in the footsteps of the Von Trapp family and relive the classic movie on the Sound of Music tour. See the Mirabell Palace and gardens, where Maria and the children sing Do-Re-Mi and Residenz Square, which Maria crosses by bus from Nonnberg Abbey – where the real-life Maria and Baron von Trapp were married in 1927 – on her way to the Trapp Villa singing I have confidence in me. The Rock Riding School is a particularly significant location as the real-life Trapp family sang there before they fled Austria following the Nazi takeover. In the film, they sing Do-Re-Mi, Edelweiss and So Long, Farewell in a memorable scene. Leopoldskron Palace was used as the Von Trapp family home and while the gazebo used for the famous ‘I am 16 going on 17' scene was here in the film, it is actually at the Hellbrunn Palace., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Vienna, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Salzburg To Vienna (Duration: 3 Hrs) Transfers: Make your way to the train station to board the train to Vienna! Upon your arrival at Vienna train station, you will make your way to the hotel Special Note: Please note cost of the ticket is included, however the same is subject to vary until ticketed, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Vienna, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Vienna City Tour Vienna City Tour: Take a tour of the main sights within the city centre and visit the magnificently decorated rooms of Schonbrunn Palace. This city tour will introduce you to the most important sights of the Austrian capital. As we drive around the famous 'Ringstrasse', Vienna's main boulevard, we pass by the State Opera, the Museums of Fine Art and Natural History, the Parliament building, the Burgtheater (National Theatre), the City Hall and the University. The highlight of this programme is the visit to Schonbrunn Palace where we take a tour of some of the most magnificently decorated rooms. (Duration of the Tour: 3 hours), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 9 - Vienna, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Vienna Transfers: From Vienna hotel to the Airport in private transfer. Special Notes: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 168435.0. Hotels envisaged include: \xa0\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\nCities\n\nDeluxe Category\n\n\n\nPrague\xa0\n\nHotel Carlton / Louis Leger / Royal Court Hotel / Best Western City Hotel Moran / Clarion Prague City / NH Prague City or similar\n\n\n\n\nBudapest\n\n\nRoyal Park Boutique Hotel / Corvin Center Suites / City Inn or similar\n\n\n\nVienna\xa0\n\nHotel Zeitgeist Vienna, Mercure Wien Westbahnhof, Mercure Wien City or similar\xa0\n\n\n\nSalzburg\n\nBest Western Plus Amedia Art Salzburg / H+ Hotel Salzburg / Austria Trend Hotel Europa Salzburg / Hotel Am Mirabellplatz or similar\n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\nCities\n\nStandard Category\n\n\n\nPrague\xa0\n\nSt. George Hotel / Hotel Prague Central Plaza / Galileo Hotel / Ibis Praha (Wenceslas Square) / Ibis Praha (Mala Strana) or similar\n\n\n\n\nBudapest\n\n\nBenczur / City Hotel Ring / Hotel Charles / Hotel Orion Varkert or similar\n\n\n\nVienna\xa0\n\nArt Hotel Vienna / Ibis Wien Hauptbahnhof / Ibis Wien Mariahilf Hotel/ Admiral or similar\n\n\n\nSalzburg\n\nStar Inn Hotel Salzburg Zentrum / Astoria Salzburg / Hotel Jedermann / Austria Trend Hotel Salzburg Mitte or similar\n\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ accommodation in Prague based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Budapest based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Salzburg based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Vienna based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transfers: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis] Arrival Airport Transfer from Prague Airport to Prague Hotel Departure Airport transfer from Vienna Hotel to Vienna Airport Train Pass: [Seat Reservation would be additional] 2nd Class Train Ticket cost from Prague to Budapest 2nd Class Train Ticket cost from Budapest to Salzburg 2nd Class Train Ticket cost from Salzburg to Vienna Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) Prague – City Tour including Prague Castle Budapest City Tour Vienna City Tour with Schonbrunn Palace Salzburg - Sound of Music Tour Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Notes: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost. Terms and Conditions: Travel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 September 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'East European Exclusive' package is a 9-day tour covering the historic and picturesque cities of Salzburg, Prague, Budapest, and Vienna. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the majestic Prague Castle, the magnificent Schönbrunn Palace in Vienna, the scenic Buda Castle, and the charming Mirabell Gardens in Salzburg. Participants will enjoy guided city tours, leisurely walks through medieval old towns, and a scenic cruise along the Danube River, offering a comprehensive and memorable experience of Eastern Europe's rich cultural heritage.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0Arrive Prague\n\xa0\nTransfers: Upon your arrival you will meet the representative and then be transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle. \n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15:00 hrs. or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel St. George (Standard) / Carlton (Value) or similar in Prague'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nPrague City Tour\nPrague City Tour: Prague Castle! St. Vitus Cathedral! Charles Bridge! Visit the most significant Czech monument - an ancient symbol of the Czech State with a tradition of more than 1000 years. Learn about its history and the most important monarchs who ruled the Czech Lands from the heights of the Prague Castle. See St. Vitus Cathedral, Old Royal Palace, St. George’s Basilica, and much more. Enjoy panoramic views over Prague - all this with a knowledgeable guide! (Duration of the tour: 3 hrs)\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel St. George (Standard) / Carlton (Value) or similar in Prague'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nPrague To Budapest Via Train (Approx 6 Hrs)\n\xa0\nTransfers: Make your way to the train station to board the train to Budapest!\xa0\n\xa0\nWelcome to Budapest! Upon your arrival at Budapest train station, make your way to the hotel.\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nPlease note cost of the ticket is included, however the same is subject to vary until ticketed.\nCheck in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\xa0\n\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Benczur (Standard) / Royal Park Boutique (Value) or similar in Budapest'}, {'day': 4, 'description': "\xa0\nBudapest City Tour\n\xa0\nBudapest City Tour: On this tour you will be passing by the Parliament building before crossing the Danube on the Margaret Bridge and drive to the Royal Castle on the Buda side of the city. Here you will have some free time to yourself to visit the Fishermen's Bastion which offers stunning views over the city and the Mathias Church. The tour will continue to the Gillert Hill before crossing the Elisabeth Bridge from where you will drive towards the Heroes' Square. Passing by the Opera and St Stephen's Basilica you reach the Hotel Intercontinental where your tour ends. [Duration of this tour: Approx 3 hrs]\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Benczur (Standard) / Royal Park Boutique (Value) or similar in Budapest'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nBudapest To Salzburg By Train (Approx 6 Hrs)\n\xa0\nTransfers: Make your way to the train station to board the train to Salzburg!\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Please note cost of the ticket is included, however the same is subject to vary until ticketed\n\xa0\nWelcome to Salzburg! Upon your arrival at Salzburg train station, make your way to the hotel on your own.\xa0\xa0\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Star Inn Salzburg Zentrum (Standard) / Best Western Plus Amedia Art Salzburg (Value) or similar in Salzburg'}, {'day': 6, 'description': "\xa0\nSalzburg: Sound Of Music Tour\n\xa0\nSound of Music Tour: Follow in the footsteps of the Von Trapp family and relive the classic movie on the Sound of Music tour. See the Mirabell Palace and gardens, where Maria and the children sing Do-Re-Mi and Residenz Square, which Maria crosses by bus from Nonnberg Abbey – where the real-life Maria and Baron von Trapp were married in 1927 – on her way to the Trapp Villa singing I have confidence in me.\n\xa0\nThe Rock Riding School is a particularly significant location as the real-life Trapp family sang there before they fled Austria following the Nazi takeover. In the film, they sing Do-Re-Mi, Edelweiss and So Long, Farewell in a memorable scene. Leopoldskron Palace was used as the Von Trapp family home and while the gazebo used for the famous ‘I am 16 going on 17' scene was here in the film, it is actually at the Hellbrunn Palace.\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Star Inn Salzburg Zentrum (Standard) / Best Western Plus Amedia Art Salzburg (Value) or similar in Salzburg'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nSalzburg To Vienna (Duration: 3 Hrs)\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station to board the train to Vienna!\xa0\nUpon your arrival at Vienna train station, you will make your way to the hotel\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Please note cost of the ticket is included, however the same is subject to vary until ticketed\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Art Vienna (Standard) / Zeitgeist (Value) or similar in Vienna'}, {'day': 8, 'description': "\xa0\nVienna City Tour\n\xa0\nVienna City Tour: Take a tour of the main sights within the city centre and visit the magnificently decorated rooms of Schonbrunn Palace. This city tour will introduce you to the most important sights of the Austrian capital. As we drive around the famous 'Ringstrasse', Vienna's main boulevard, we pass by the State Opera, the Museums of Fine Art and Natural History, the Parliament building, the Burgtheater (National Theatre), the City Hall and the University. The highlight of this programme is the visit to Schonbrunn Palace where we take a tour of some of the most magnificently decorated rooms. (Duration of the Tour: 3 hours)\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Art Vienna (Standard) / Zeitgeist (Value) or similar in Vienna'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Vienna\n\xa0\nTransfers: From Vienna hotel to the Airport in private transfer.\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Notes: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight.\n\xa0\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\nCities\n\nDeluxe Category\n\n\n\nPrague\xa0\n\nHotel Carlton / Louis Leger / Royal Court Hotel / Best Western City Hotel Moran / Clarion Prague City / NH Prague City or similar\n\n\n\n\nBudapest\n\n\nRoyal Park Boutique Hotel / Corvin Center Suites / City Inn or similar\n\n\n\nVienna\xa0\n\nHotel Zeitgeist Vienna, Mercure Wien Westbahnhof, Mercure Wien City or similar\xa0\n\n\n\nSalzburg\n\nBest Western Plus Amedia Art Salzburg / H+ Hotel Salzburg / Austria Trend Hotel Europa Salzburg / Hotel Am Mirabellplatz or similar\n\n\n\n', '\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\nCities\n\nStandard Category\n\n\n\nPrague\xa0\n\nSt. George Hotel / Hotel Prague Central Plaza / Galileo Hotel / Ibis Praha (Wenceslas Square) / Ibis Praha (Mala Strana) or similar\n\n\n\n\nBudapest\n\n\nBenczur / City Hotel Ring / Hotel Charles / Hotel Orion Varkert or similar\n\n\n\nVienna\xa0\n\nArt Hotel Vienna / Ibis Wien Hauptbahnhof / Ibis Wien Mariahilf Hotel/ Admiral or similar\n\n\n\nSalzburg\n\nStar Inn Hotel Salzburg Zentrum / Astoria Salzburg / Hotel Jedermann / Austria Trend Hotel Salzburg Mitte or similar\n\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'0': '\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\nCities\n\nStandard Category\n\n\n\nPrague\xa0\n\nSt. George Hotel / Hotel Prague Central Plaza / Galileo Hotel / Ibis Praha (Wenceslas Square) / Ibis Praha (Mala Strana) or similar\n\n\n\n\nBudapest\n\n\nBenczur / City Hotel Ring / Hotel Charles / Hotel Orion Varkert or similar\n\n\n\nVienna\xa0\n\nArt Hotel Vienna / Ibis Wien Hauptbahnhof / Ibis Wien Mariahilf Hotel/ Admiral or similar\n\n\n\nSalzburg\n\nStar Inn Hotel Salzburg Zentrum / Astoria Salzburg / Hotel Jedermann / Austria Trend Hotel Salzburg Mitte or similar\n\n\n\n', '1': '\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n