, Old Royal Palace, St. George’s Basilica, and much more. Enjoy panoramic views over Prague - all this with a knowledgeable guide! (Duration of the tour: 3 hrs)\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel St. George (Standard) / Carlton (Value) or similar in Prague'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nPrague To Budapest Via Train (Approx 6 Hrs)\n\xa0\nTransfers: Make your way to the train station to board the train to Budapest!\xa0\n\xa0\nWelcome to Budapest! Upon your arrival at Budapest train station, make your way to the hotel.\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nPlease note cost of the ticket is included, however the same is subject to vary until ticketed.\nCheck in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\xa0\n\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Benczur (Standard) / Royal Park Boutique (Value) or similar in Budapest'}, {'day': 4, 'description': "\xa0\nBudapest City Tour\n\xa0\nBudapest City Tour: On this tour you will be passing by the Parliament building before crossing the Danube on the Margaret Bridge and drive to the Royal Castle on the Buda side of the city. Here you will have some free time to yourself to visit the Fishermen's Bastion which offers stunning views over the city and the Mathias Church. The tour will continue to the Gillert Hill before crossing the Elisabeth Bridge from where you will drive towards the Heroes' Square. Passing by the Opera and St Stephen's Basilica you reach the Hotel Intercontinental where your tour ends. [Duration of this tour: Approx 3 hrs]\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Benczur (Standard) / Royal Park Boutique (Value) or similar in Budapest'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nBudapest To Salzburg By Train (Approx 6 Hrs)\n\xa0\nTransfers: Make your way to the train station to board the train to Salzburg!\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Please note cost of the ticket is included, however the same is subject to vary until ticketed\n\xa0\nWelcome to Salzburg! Upon your arrival at Salzburg train station, make your way to the hotel on your own.\xa0\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Star Inn Salzburg Zentrum (Standard) / Best Western Plus Amedia Art Salzburg (Value) or similar in Salzburg'}, {'day': 6, 'description': "\xa0\nSalzburg: Sound Of Music Tour\n\xa0\nSound of Music Tour: Follow in the footsteps of the Von Trapp family and relive the classic movie on the Sound of Music tour. See the Mirabell Palace and gardens, where Maria and the children sing Do - Re - Mi and Residenz Square, which Maria crosses by bus from Nonnberg Abbey - where the real - life Maria and Baron von Trapp were married in 1927 - on her way to the Trapp Villa singing I have confidence in me.\nThe Rock Riding School is a particularly significant location as the real - life Trapp family sang there before they fled Austria following the Nazi takeover. In the film, they sing Do - Re - Mi, Edelweiss and So Long, Farewell in a memorable scene. Leopoldskron Palace was used as the Von Trapp family home and while the gazebo used for the famous ‘I am 16 going on 17' scene was here in the film, it is actually at the Hellbrunn Palace.\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Star Inn Salzburg Zentrum (Standard) / Best Western Plus Amedia Art Salzburg (Value) or similar in Salzburg'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nSalzburg To Vienna (Duration: 3 Hrs)\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station to board the train to Vienna!\xa0\nUpon your arrival at Vienna train station, you will make your way to the hotel\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Please note cost of the ticket is included, however the same is subject to vary until ticketed', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Art Vienna (Standard) / Zeitgeist (Value) or similar in Vienna'}, {'day': 8, 'description': "\xa0\nVienna City Tour\n\xa0\nVienna City Tour: Take a tour of the main sights within the city centre and visit the magnificently decorated rooms of Schonbrunn Palace. This city tour will introduce you to the most important sights of the Austrian capital. As we drive around the famous 'Ringstrasse', Vienna's main boulevard, we pass by the State Opera, the Museums of Fine Art and Natural History, the Parliament building, the Burgtheater (National Theatre), the City Hall and the University. The highlight of this programme is the visit to Schonbrunn Palace where we take a tour of some of the most magnificently decorated rooms. (Duration of the Tour: 3 hours)\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Art Vienna (Standard) / Zeitgeist (Value) or similar in Vienna'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Vienna\n\xa0\nTransfers: From Vienna hotel to the Airport in private transfer.\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Notes: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight.\n\xa0\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\nCities\n\nValue Category\n\n\n\nPrague\xa0\n\nHotel Carlton / Louis Leger / Royal Court Hotel / Best Western City Hotel Moran / Clarion Prague City / NH Prague City or similar\n\n\n\n\nBudapest\n\n\nRoyal Park Boutique Hotel / Corvin Center Suites / City Inn or similar\n\n\n\nVienna\xa0\n\nHotel Zeitgeist Vienna, Mercure Wien Westbahnhof, Mercure Wien City or similar\xa0\n\n\n\nSalzburg\n\nBest Western Plus Amedia Art Salzburg / H+ Hotel Salzburg / Austria Trend Hotel Europa Salzburg / Hotel Am Mirabellplatz or similar\n\n\n\n', '\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\nCities\n\nStandard Category\n\n\n\nPrague\xa0\n\nSt. George Hotel / Hotel Prague Central Plaza / Galileo Hotel / Ibis Praha (W