'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Best Of Spain (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)' package is a 9-day tour covering the vibrant cities of Madrid, Valencia, Barcelona, and Seville. Throughout this exciting journey, participants will explore the rich culture, stunning architecture, and historic landmarks of these iconic Spanish destinations. A key highlight of this special holiday package is a complimentary upgrade to first-class train sector tickets, ensuring comfortable and scenic travel between cities.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Madrid\n\xa0\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at the Madrid airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Petit Palace Cliper Gran Via\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Eurostars Casa De La Lirica\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Madrid'}, {'day': 2, 'description': "\xa0\nMadrid: Panoramic City Bus Tour\nMadrid Panoramic City Bus Tour: Route 1 (Blue) will take you to discover Historical Madrid. This circular route takes you through a complete historical, artistic, and monumental circuit featuring the city’s key landmarks. Travel along the beautiful tree lined Paseo del Prado and admire the magnificent architectural treasures of the Habsburg royal legacy. Discover parts of Madrid’s Art Triangle and enjoy stunning views from the Royal Palace to the Temple of Debod.\nRoute 2 (Green) will take you to discover Modern Madrid. Explore the city beyond its historical landmarks and royal monuments. From Atocha Station to Nuevos Ministerios, and from the iconic Puerta de Alcala to Puerta del Sol. Admire the most contemporary architectural works in the capital, including the imposing KIO Towers, the modern sculptures of the Public Art Museum, and Real Madrid's Santiago Bernabéu Stadium. Discover Madrid’s vibrant life, art, and modern customs on this itinerary.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Petit Palace Cliper Gran Via\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Eurostars Casa De La Lirica\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Madrid'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nMadrid To Seville By Train\n\xa0\nTransfer:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the Madrid train station for your onward journey to Seville.\nUpon arrival at Seville train station make your way to the hotel.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nPlease note cost of the ticket is included, however the same is subject to vary until ticketed.\nCheck in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\xa0\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Derby (Standard) /\xa0NH Plaza de Armas (Value) or similar in\xa0Seville'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nSeville: Hop On Hop Off\xa0\n\xa0\nHop on Hop off Tour: Later enjoy Seville Hop on Hop off sightseeing. This tour is operated by double decker buses you can make a route through more emblematic places of the city of Seville, with commentaries in 16 different languages, which make possible to know the history, culture and heritage of the city, which origin goes back to Old Age, that way this city is a cultures mixing . This service is valid for 24 (basic) or 48 hours (Experience) with a hop on / hop off system , so during this period you can get on and get off of the bus such times as you want in any bus stop. The ticket can be purchase as in the bus as in any of two main bus stop, furthermore in any official sales point. Multilingual Audio System: 16 languages. Panoramic route on double decker buses with 14 stops at the most important locations of the city: Paseo Colon, Plaza de Espana, 1929 Exhibition, Triana San Jacinto, Triana Castilla, 1992 Universal Exhibition, Isla Magica, Macarena, Torre de los Perdigones, Alameda de Hercules, Plaza del Duque, Plaza de Armas, plaza de Cuba y Acuario de Sevilla. Hop on , hop off. Individual headsets. Free Entrance: El Salvador Church, Museo de Carruajes, Pabellon de la Navegacion, Casa de la Ciencia, Torre de los Perdigones, Iglesia de Santa Ana and Hospital de la Caridad.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Derby (Standard) /\xa0NH Plaza de Armas (Value) or similar in\xa0Seville'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nSeville To Valencia Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the Seville train station for your onward journey to Valencia.\xa0\nUpon your arrival at Valencia train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nPlease note cost of the ticket is included, however the same is subject to vary until ticketed.\nCheck in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\xa0\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Mediterraneo (Standard) /\xa0Senator Parque Central (Value) or similar in\xa0Valencia'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nValencia: Hop On Hop Off\n\xa0\nHop on Hop off Tour: Today enjoy Valencia Tourist Bus sightseeing. Get to know Valencia in a comfortable, rigorous and enjoyable way. You will be able to hop on and off the bus all day along the route of your choice or change to another, admiring the architectural and cultural magnificence of Valencia, with the commentaries offered through a headphones audio system in seven different languages (Spanish, English, French, German, Italian, Portuguese and Japanese). The tour offers you 2 Hop on Hop off routes (90 minutes duration each) to customise your own tour of Valencia. Route A (red colour) you will meet the city from a historical and monumental viewpoint and the route B (blue colour) you will know the Mediterranean Sea influence on the city of Valencia.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Mediterraneo (Standard) /\xa0Senator Parque Central (Value) or similar in\xa0Valencia'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nValencia To Barcelona Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Barcelona.\xa0\nUpon your arrival at Barcelona train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\n\nPlease note cost of the ticket is included, however the same is subject to vary until ticketed.\nCheck in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\xa0\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Viladomat By Silken (Standard) / Exe Cristal Palace (Value) or similar in Barcelona'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nBarcelona: Hop On Hop Off\nHop on Hop off Tour: Hop aboard the Barcelona Bus Turistic, and discover the best of the city aboard a panoramic double decker bus. Not only can you hop on and off as you wish, but you have the freedom to explore the beautiful city of Barcelona at your own leisure. Highlights - See the most iconic landmarks of the city - Hop on and off as you wish at conveniently located route stops - Learn about the city with a fascinating audioguide available in 16 languages The Barcelona Bus Turístic is the city’s official sightseeing hop on, hop off tour. The red route and the blue route take approximately two hours to complete. Others Both routes depart between 9 am and 9:30 am from any stop. The last departures leave at 7pm during the winter months and 8pm in summer. Depending on the season, the bus frequency varies, between 5 and 25 minutes.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Viladomat By Silken (Standard) / Exe Cristal Palace (Value) or similar in Barcelona'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Barcelona\n\xa0\n\xa0Transfers: You will have a private transfer from Barcelona hotel to the airport.\n\xa0\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nMadrid\n\n\nEurostars Casa De La Lirica / Hotel Madrid Plaza De Espana Affiliated By Melia /Petit Palace Plaza Espana / Catalonia Gran Via or similar \n\n\n\n\nSeville\n\n\nNH Sevilla Plaza de Armas / Catalonia Giralda / Hotel Las Casas de la Judería or similar\n\n\n\n\nValencia\n\n\nSenator Parque Central / Nh Valencia Center / Silken Puerta Valencia or similar\n\n\n\n\nBarcelona\n\n\nExe Cristal Palace / Catalonia Diagonal Centro / Zenit Borell / Catalonia Eixample 1864 / Catalonia Gran Via Bcn or similar\n\n\n\n', '\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nSTANDARD CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nMadrid\n\n\nPetit Palace Cliper Gran Via / Petit Palace Tres Cruces / Hotel Los Condes / Petit Palace Chueca / Hotel Madrid Centro, Affiliated by Melia or similar\n\n\n\n\nSeville\n\n\nHotel Derby Sevilla / Las Casas De Los Mercaderes By Silken / Eurostars Regina / H10 Corregidor Boutique Hotel or similar \n\n\n\n\nValencia\n\n\nMediterraneo / Hotel Kramer / Hotel