tel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014876/BArcelona_SRP.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014876/itinerary/Madrid2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014876/itinerary/MadridRoyalPalace.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014876/itinerary/seville1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014876/itinerary/Seville.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014876/itinerary/Valencia2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014876/itinerary/Valencia.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014876/itinerary/Barcelona.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014876/itinerary/BarcelonaSpain.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014876/itinerary/BarcelonaCIty.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014534', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014534', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'London Delights', 'days': 4, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'London', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'London', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'London', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'London', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014534_0_20260918121845', 'price': 99328, 'packageSummary': "The 'London Delights' package is a 4-day tour focusing exclusively on the historic and vibrant city of London. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as Buckingham Palace, the Tower of London, the British Museum, and the majestic Big Ben. Participants will enjoy a scenic cruise along the River Thames, a ride on the famous London Eye for panoramic city views, and guided walking tours through the city's historic royal parks and bustling West End district.", 'images': ['LondonTowerBridge7531.jpg', 'LondonEye.jpg', 'London_new.jpg', 'London2.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 99328, 'thumbnailImage': 'London26790.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Adventure'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Long Weekend Special', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014534 is named 'London Delights' and spans 4 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - London, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive London Transfer: Arrival in London Airport (LHR), you will be met by the representative and have a private transfer to the hotel. Special Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - London, Meals: Breakfast, Description: London London Sightseeing: This tour combines the flexibility of a hop-on hop-off bus with a ride on the London Eye. You can explore London's famous landmarks like the Tower of London and Buckingham Palace at your own pace by getting on and off the open-top bus as you please, while the bus tour itself provides commentary. The package also includes a 30-minute ride on the London Eye, giving you panoramic views of the city from a unique perspective., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - London, Meals: Breakfast, Description: London - Free Day Changing of the Guard Guided Tour at Buckingham Palace (Optional Activity) Walking Tour - English 09:00 [Duration approx. 90 mins] Begin this regal tour at the Duke of York Column in St. James's. Greet the guide and don a personal headset for a historical overview of the iconic Changing of the Guard ceremony. Unlike typical tours that gather outside Buckingham Palace, this experience utilizes handpicked vantage points to guarantee the best views of the royal tradition. Listen to expert commentary explaining each part of the performance as you admire the shimmering Household Cavalry and capture photographs of the King's foot soldiers in their iconic red and black attire. The tour concludes outside of Buckingham Palace (Spur Road, London, United Kingdom). [Supplement Cost - GBP 20 Per Adult and GBP 16 Per Child] Please Note: The Changing of the Guard ceremony is subject to schedule changes or cancellation by British authorities, often without prior notice before 11 am. If cancelled due to weather, a 'wet change' march without music still takes place. Jack the Ripper Small Group Guided Tour (Optional Activity) Walking Tour - English 18:00 [Duration Approximately 2 hours (6 stops, 20 minutes each] This is a walking tour of the Jack the Ripper murders in Whitechapel, London, with each 20-minute stop focusing on a different victim: Martha Tabram, Mary Ann Nichols, Annie Chapman, Elizabeth Stride, Catherine Eddowes, and Mary Jane Kelly. The tour is in the evening and is led by an expert guide who discusses the murders and the origin of the killer's name.[Supplement Cost - GBP 20 Per Adult and GBP 16 Per Child] OR Indulge in a Shopping Spree @ Ashford Designer Outlet Find your favourite brands at up to 60% off, all year round. Within our beautiful settings, you'll find cafes, restaurants, a children's adventure play area and over 90 boutiques. Our wide range of stores includes designer brands such as Armani, Boss, Calvin Klein, Coach, Maje, Michael Kors, Polo Ralph Lauren and Sandro. Fashion brands such as Abercrombie & Fitch, AllSaints, Hollister, Levi's, Reiss and Ted Baker. Athletic labels such as Nike, Adidas, Asics and Under Armour and high-street favourites such as M&S and Yankee Candle. [Ashford Designer Outlet is located approx. 40 – 50 mins from London], GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - London, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart London Transfer: 3- 4 hrs prior to your departure flight, you will have a private transfer from the hotel to London (LHR) airport. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 99328.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4*\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n\n\nPark Plaza London / Park International / Copthorne Tara London Kensington / Holiday Inn® London Kensington / Mercure London Paddington or similar\n\n\n\n, \xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n\n\nIbis London Earls Court Hotel /\xa0Point A Hotel, London Paddington / Best Western Buckingham Palace Rd\xa0\xa0/The W14 Hotel Kensington / London House Hotel / Mentone Hotel / BW Swiss Cottage or similar\n\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation: 3 Nights’ accommodation in London in the above mentioned hotel or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Sightseeing: [Tour starts from a city centre point, service to & from the hotel is not included] London Hop on Hop off Ticket (24 hours) London Eye Ticket Transfers: [Includes Point to Point Transfer with limited waiting hours] Arrival Airport transfers in London on Private basis Departure airport transfers in London on Private basis Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of GBP 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Note: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost. Terms and Conditions: Travel Validity: 01st April to 30th September 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. TCS & GST would be levied as applicable The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPric