 most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4*\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n\n\nPark Plaza London / Park International / Copthorne Tara London Kensington / Holiday Inn® London Kensington / Mercure London Paddington or similar\n\n\n\n', '\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n\n\nIbis London Earls Court Hotel /\xa0Point A Hotel, London Paddington / Best Western Buckingham Palace Rd\xa0\xa0/The W14 Hotel Kensington / London House Hotel / Mentone Hotel / BW Swiss Cottage or similar\n\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'0': '\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n\n\nIbis London Earls Court Hotel /\xa0Point A Hotel, London Paddington / Best Western Buckingham Palace Rd\xa0\xa0/The W14 Hotel Kensington / London House Hotel / Mentone Hotel / BW Swiss Cottage or similar\n\n\n\n', '1': '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4*\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n\n\nPark Plaza London / Park International / Copthorne Tara London Kensington / Holiday Inn® London Kensington / Mercure London Paddington or similar\n\n\n\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'GB', 'countryName': 'United Kingdom', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard', 'Value'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'price': 99300.0, 'hotels': ['\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n\n\nIbis London Earls Court Hotel /\xa0Point A Hotel, London Paddington / Best Western Buckingham Palace Rd\xa0\xa0/The W14 Hotel Kensington / London House Hotel / Mentone Hotel / BW Swiss Cottage or similar\n\n\n\n']}, {'category': 'Value', 'price': 119000.0, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4*\n\n\n\n\nLondon