 be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014534/London26790.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014534/itinerary/LondonTowerBridge7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014534/itinerary/LondonEye.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014534/itinerary/London_new.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014534/itinerary/London2.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014658', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014658', 'availableMonths': ['october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Greece Island Hopping', 'days': 8, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Athens', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Athens', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Mykonos', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Mykonos', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Santorini', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Santorini', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Athens', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Athens', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014658_0_20260830224818', 'price': 152370, 'packageSummary': "The 'Greece Island Hopping' package is an 8-day tour covering the historic city of Athens and the stunning islands of Mykonos and Santorini. Throughout this scenic journey, participants will experience the perfect blend of ancient history and island relaxation, featuring guided tours of the iconic Acropolis in Athens, leisure time to explore the winding cobblestone streets and vibrant nightlife of Mykonos, and opportunities to witness the world-famous volcanic sunsets and picturesque blue-domed churches of Santorini.", 'images': ['Athens.jpg', 'AcropolisinAthens.avif', 'AdobeStock_67990916.jpeg', 'Mykons753.jpg', 'Santorini_1.jpeg', 'SunsetonthefamousOiacityGreece.jpeg', 'Athense_4.jpeg', 'Athens_5.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 152370, 'thumbnailImage': 'OiaVillageduringsunset.GreeceSantorini.jpeg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': 'Package ID: PKG014658 is named \'Greece Island Hopping\' and spans 8 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Athens, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Athens Transfers: Upon arrival you will be met the representative & transferred to the hotel on private basis. Special Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Athens, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Athens City Tour With Acropolis Museum Athens City Tour with Acropolis Museum: This tour gives you an opportunity to observe the striking contrasts that make Athens such a fascinating city. The expert guides will take you to see the Panathenaic Stadium where the first Olympic Games of modern times were held in 1896 (short stop). Continue and pass by the Prime Ministers residence (ex Royal Palace) guarded by the Euzones in their colorful uniform, the Temple of Olympian Zeus, the Hadrians Arch, the Parliament and the memorial to the Unknown Soldier, the Academy, the University, the National Library, the Constitution Square (Syntagma). On the Acropolis visit the Architectural Masterpieces of the Golden Age of Athens: The Propylaea, the Temple of Athena Nike, the Erechtheion and finally "the harmony between material and spirit", the monument that "puts order in the mind", the Parthenon. Continue and visit the place where at last the statues found their home and admire the wonders of the classical era: The new Acropolis Museum. [Entrance fees to Acropolis & Museum is included] Special Note: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick-up for the same will be from selected central points., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Mykonos, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Athens To Mykonos Transfers: Today you will have a private transfer from the hotel to the Port for the ferry to Mykonos. Upon arrival at Mykonos there will be a shared transfer from the port to the Hotel. Special Note: The check in at the hotel will be as per the standard hotel time. Post check in the rest of the day will be free at leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Mykonos, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day Free At Leisure Mykonos Sightseeing (Optional). Today will be free in order explore the island. Among the cobbled streets, next to the churches, behind the freshly painted shutters, through the delivery of island living, the heavenly beaches and the liveliness of the night, Mykonos keeps its secrets: The happiest different moments for everyone, here, on the most famous island in the world, each one of us makes each moment UNIQUE. Mykonos retains full beauty through the passage of time, and is and always will be a perfect host to visitors, offering unlimited vacation and great expectations., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Santorini, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Mykonos To Santorini Transfers: Today you will have a shared transfer from the hotel to the Port for the ferry to Santorini. Upon arrival at Santorini there will be a shared transfer from the port to the Hotel. Special Note: The check in at the hotel will be as per the standard hotel time. Post check in the rest of the day will be free at leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Santorini, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Full Day Santorini Panorama Bus Tour Full day Santorini panorama bus tour: Today Embark on a mesmerizing journey through Santorinis iconic landscapes and its best kept secrets. As dawn breaks, gather at the heart of the island, ready to unravel Santorini’s tales and traditions. Begin with the historic Akrotiri Lighthouse, standing as a beacon since the 19th century. Its grandeur offers breathtaking panoramas of the Aegean’s endless blue. Let the horizon captivate the unique beauty of Perivolos. Here, the striking black sands meet crystal-clear waters in a dance of contrasts, a spectacle to behold and experience firsthand. From the shores, step into the time-capsule village of Megalochori. Stroll through its cobblestoned paths, past preserved bell towers and welcoming squares. The atmosphere is thick with tales from bygone eras, inviting you to get lost in its charm. As you leave its charm, ascend to Profitis Ilias, a vantage point that offers unparalleled views and serenity that words can scarcely describe. This enchantment continues at Panagia Episkopi, Santorini’s oldest preserved church. Marvel at the richness of its Byzantine heritage, a testament to time and faith. As afternoon shades into evening, indulge in the island’s vinicultural legacy. A local winery welcomes you to taste the notes of Santorini’s volcanic soil in every sip. Let stories of grapevines and harvests unfold as the taste of Assyrtiko graces your palate. And just as the day reaches its crescendo, you end the tour at the village of Oia, bathed in golden hues as the sun performs its final act melting into the horizon., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Athens, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Santorini To Athens Transfers: Today you will have a shared transfer from the hotel to the Port for the ferry to Athens. Upon arrival at Athens there will be a private transfer from the port to the Hotel. Special Note: The check in at the hotel will be as per the standard hotel time. Post check in the rest of the day will be free at leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Athens, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Athens Transfers: From Athens hotel to the Airport in private transfer. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 152370.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY (4* HOTELS OR SIMILAR)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nMykonos\n\n\nSantorini\n\n\n\n\nTitania Hotel or similar\n\n\nPetinos Hotel or similar\n\n\nSantorini Palace Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nPREMIUM CATEGORY (5* HOTELS OR SIMILAR)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nMykonos\n\n\nSantorini\n\n\n\n\nRoyal Olympic hotel\nor similar\n\n\nPetinos Beach hotel \nor similar\n\n\nMajestic hotel \nor similar\n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\n\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0STANDARD CATEGORY (3* HOTELS OR SIMILAR)\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nMykonos\n\n\nSantorini\n\n\n\n\nAcropolis Ami or Similar\n\n\nElena Hotel or Similar\n\n\nCosta Marina Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ accommodation in Athens based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Mykonos based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Santorini based on the hotel category selected or similar 1 Night accommodation in Athens based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: Private Airport Transfer from Athens Airport to Hotel Private transfer from Athens hotel to Port for the ferry to Mykonos Shared transport from Mykonos Port to the hotel and back to port Shared transport from Santorini port to hotel and back Private transfer from Athens port to the Hotel Private Airport transfer from Athens Hotel to Airport Ferry Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed] Normal Ferry ticket – Economy class from Athens to Mykonos Speed Ferry ticket - Economy class from Mykonos to Santorini Normal Ferry ticket – Economy class from Santorini to Athens Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point) Half-day City tour of Athens with new Acropolis Museum on sharing basis tour coach. Full day Santorini Panorama bus tour Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Notes: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability Terms and Conditions: Travel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 15 October 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .', 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Greece Island Hopping' package is an 8-day tour covering the historic city of Athens and the stunning islands of Mykonos and Santorini. Throughout this scenic journey, participants will experience the perfect blend of ancient history and island relaxation, featuring guided tours of the iconic Acropolis in Athens, leisure time to explore the winding cobblestone streets and vibrant nightlife of Mykonos, and opportunities to witness the world-famous volcanic sunsets and picturesque blue-domed churches of Santorini.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Athens\n\xa0\nTransfers: Upon arrival you will be met the representative & transferred to the hotel on private basis.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Acropolis Ami\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Titania (Value) /\xa0Royal Olympic (Premium) or similar\xa0in Athens'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nAthens City Tour With Acropolis Museum\n\xa0\n\xa0\nAthens City Tour with Acropolis Museum: This tour gives you an opportunity to observe the striking contrasts that make Athens such a fascinating city. The expert guides will take you to see the Panathenaic Stadium where the first Olympic Games of modern times were held in 1896 (short stop).\xa0Continue and pass by the Prime Ministers residence (ex Royal Palace) guarded by the Euzones in their colorful uniform, the Temple of Olympian Zeus, the Hadrians Arch, the Parliament and the memorial to the Unknown Soldier, the Academy, the University, the National Library, the Constitution Square (Syntagma).\xa0 On the Acropolis visit the Architectural Masterpieces of the Golden Age of Athens: The Propylaea, the Temple of Athena Nike, the Erechtheion and finally "the harmony between material and spirit", the monument that "puts order in the mind", the Parthenon.\xa0Continue and visit the place where at last the statues found their home and admire the wonders of the classical era: The new Acropolis Museum.\xa0 [Entrance fees to Acropolis & Museum is included]\n\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick-up for the same will be from selected central points.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Acropolis Ami (Standard) / Titania (Value) / Royal Olympic (Premium) or similar in Athens'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nAthens To Mykonos\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nToday you will have a private transfer from the hotel to the Port for the ferry to Mykonos.\nUpon arrival at Mykonos there will be a shared transfer from the port to the Hotel.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nThe check in at the hotel will be as per the standard hotel time.\xa0\nPost check in the rest of the day will be free at leisure.\n\n\xa0\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Elena (Standard) / Petinos (Value) / (Premium) or similar in Mykonos'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nDay Free At Leisure\xa0\n\xa0\nMykonos Sightseeing (Optional). Today will be free in order explore the island. Among the cobbled streets, next to the churches, behind the freshly painted shutters, through the delivery of island living, the heavenly beaches and the liveliness of the night, Mykonos keeps its secrets: The happiest different moments for everyone, here, on the most famous island in the world, each one of us makes each moment UNIQUE. Mykonos retains full beauty through the passage of time, and is and always will be a perfect host to visitors, offering unlimited vacation and great expectations.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Elena (Standard) / Petinos (Value) / (Premium) or similar in Mykonos'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nMykonos To Santorini\xa0\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nToday you will have a shared transfer from the hotel to the Port for the ferry to Santorini.\nUpon arrival at Santorini there will be a shared transfer from the port to the Hotel.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nThe check in at the hotel will be as per the standard hotel time.\xa0\nPost check in the rest of the day will be free at leisure.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Costa Marina (Standard) / Santorini Palace (Value) / Majestic (Premium) or similar in Santorini'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nFull Day Santorini Panorama Bus Tour\xa0\n\xa0\n\xa0\nFull day Santorini panorama bus tour: Today Embark on a mesmerizing journey through Santorinis iconic landscapes and its best kept secrets. As dawn breaks, gather at the heart of the island, ready to unravel Santorini’s tales and traditions.\xa0\xa0\n\xa0\nBegin with the historic Akrotiri Lighthouse, standing as a beacon since the 19th century. Its grandeur offers breathtaking panoramas of the Aegean’s endless blue. Let the horizon captivate the unique beauty of Perivolos. Here, the striking black sands meet crystal-clear waters in a dance of contrasts, a spectacle to behold and experience firsthand.\xa0\xa0\n\xa0\nFrom the shores, step into the time-capsule village of Megalochori. Stroll through its cobblestoned paths, past preserved bell towers and welcoming squares. The atmosphere is thick with tales from bygone eras, inviting you to get lost in its charm. As you leave its charm, ascend to Profitis Ilias, a vantage point that offers unparalleled views and serenity that words can scarcely describe.\xa0\n\xa0\nThis enchantment continues at Panagia Episkopi, Santorini’s oldest preserved church. Marvel at the richness of its Byzantine heritage, a testament to time and faith. As afternoon shades into evening, indulge in the island’s vinicultural legacy. A local winery welcomes you to taste the notes of Santorini’s volcanic soil in every sip. Let stories of grapevines and harvests unfold as the taste of Assyrtiko graces your palate. And just as the day reaches its crescendo, you end the tour at the village of Oia, bathed in golden hues as the sun performs its final act melting into the horizon.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Costa Marina (Standard) / Santorini Palace (Value) / Majestic (Premium) or similar in Santorini'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nSantorini To Athens\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nToday you will have a shared transfer from the hotel to the Port for the ferry to Athens.\nUpon arrival at Athens there will be a private transfer from the port to the Hotel.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nThe check in at the hotel will be as per the standard hotel time.\xa0\nPost check in the rest of the day will be free at leisure.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Acropolis Ami (Standard) / Titania (Value) / Royal Olympic (Premium) or similar in Athens'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nDepart Athens\n\xa0\n\xa0\nTransfers: From Athens hotel to the Airport in private transfer.\n\xa0\n\xa0\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY (4* HOTELS OR SIMILAR)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nMykonos\n\n\nSantorini\n\n\n\n\nTitania Hotel or similar\n\n\nPetinos Hotel or similar\n\n\nSantorini Palace Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n', '\n\n\n\nPREMIUM CATEGORY (5* HOTELS OR SIMILAR)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nMykonos\n\n\nSantorini\n\n\n\n\nRoyal Olympic hotel\nor similar\n\n\nPetinos Beach hotel \nor similar\n\n\nMajestic hotel \nor similar\n\n\n\n', '\n\n\n\n\xa0\x