 HOTELS OR SIMILAR)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nMykonos\n\n\nSantorini\n\n\n\n\nRoyal Olympic hotel\nor similar\n\n\nPetinos Beach hotel \nor similar\n\n\nMajestic hotel \nor similar\n\n\n\n']}], 'meals': ['\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n'], 'visa': ['As per itinerary'], 'transfer': ['\nPrivate Airport Transfer from Athens Airport to Hotel\nEscorted Tour from Day 2 to Day 5\nPrivate Airport transfer from Santorini Hotel to Airport\n'], 'sightseeing': ['Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n\nHalf-day City tour of Athens with new Acropolis Museum on sharing basis tour coach.\nFull day Santorini Panorama bus tour\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': '<p>Return Economy Class Airfare</p>', 'inclusions': 'Accommodation:\n\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Athens based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Mykonos based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Santorini based on the hotel category selected or similar\n1 Night accommodation in Athens based on the hotel category selected or similar\n\n\xa0\nMeals:\n\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n\n\xa0\nTransportation:\xa0\xa0\n\nPrivate Airport Transfer from Athens Airport to Hotel\nPrivate transfer from Athens hotel to Port for the ferry to Mykonos\nShared transport from Mykonos Port to the hotel and back to port\nShared transport from Santorini port to hotel and back\nPrivate transfer from Athens port to the Hotel\nPrivate Airport transfer from Athens Hotel to Airport\n\n\xa0\nFerry Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed]\n\nNormal Ferry ticket – Economy class from Athens to Mykonos\nSpeed Ferry ticket - Economy class from Mykonos to Santorini\nNormal Ferry ticket – Economy class from Santorini to Athens\n\n\xa0\nSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n\nHalf-day City tour of Athens with new Acropolis Museum on sharing basis tour coach.\nFull day Santorini Panorama bus tour\n\n\xa0\nInsurance:\n\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included\xa0\nCity taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nCost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.\n', 'termsAndConditions': '\xa0\nImportant Notes:\n\nThe above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together.\nThe above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\nMaximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room.\nMidnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\nWIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed.\xa0\n(Supplement charges may apply for such services)\nStandard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs.\nMost hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned.\nAt this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability\n\nTerms and Conditions:\xa0\n\nTravel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 15 October 2026\nBlack out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nMaximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\nSurcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking.\nTo proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour.\nShould the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014658/OiaVillageduringsunset.GreeceSantorini.jpeg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014658/itinerary/Athens.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014658/itinerary/AcropolisinAthens.avif', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014658/itinerary/AdobeStock_67990916.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014658/itinerary/Mykons753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014658/itinerary/Santorini_1.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014658/itinerary/SunsetonthefamousOiacityGreece.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014658/itinerary/Athense_4.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014658/itinerary/Athens_5.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014508', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014508', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Awesome Austria', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Vienna', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Salzburg', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Salzburg', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Innsbruck', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Innsbruck', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Vienna', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Vienna', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014508_0_20260916140412', 'price': 134748, 'packageSummary': "The 'Awesome Austria' package is a 7-day tour covering the picturesque cities of Innsbruck, Vienna, and Salzburg. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the famous Golden Roof, the magnificent Schönbrunn Palace, Mozart's Birthplace, and the beautiful Mirabell Gardens. Participants will enjoy guided city tours, breathtaking alpine sightseeing, classical music experiences, and leisurely walks through historic old towns.", 'images': ['ViennaOperaHouse_108156170.jpg', 'Schonbrunnpalace753.jpg', 'Salzburg_753.jpg', 'Innsbruck_cityscape_753.jpg', 'Swarovski_Museum_753.jpg', 'Vienna_City_Hall_753.jpg', 'Vienna_753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 134748, 'thumbnailImage': 'Viena_20.jpeg', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Youth Special'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Most Booked', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014508 is named 'Awesome Austria' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Vienna, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Vienna Transfers: Upon arrival you will be met our representative and escorted to the hotel on private basis. Grand Danube River Cruise (Optional): Even though the Danube Canal and Danube River are part of the same waterway, they offer entirely different Viennese experiences. Take a cruise on the narrow Danube Canal to view some of the city’s architectural landmarks, along with colorful canal-side graffiti, or stroll along the canal’s paved pathways, popular with locals. And, while the Danube Canal isn’t ideal for swimming, there are beaches here, including beach clubs that serve drinks to sunbathers. Special Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Salzburg, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Vienna to Salzburg Transfers: Make your way to the Vienna train station (on own) for your next destination Salzburg via Train (Duration: 1.5 – 2.5 Hrs.) Upon your arrival at Salzburg train station, make your way to the hotel on your own. Vienna City Tour with Schonbrunn Palace: Which includes skip the line access to the Schonbrunn Palace, the magnificent summer residence of the Habsburg dynasty. See all the main sights and attractions along the grand Ringstrasse. (Duration of the Tour: 3 hours) (By approx. 09:30 am). Best of Mozart Concert at Fortress Hohensalzburg in Salzburg (OPTIONAL): Experience Best of Mozart’s concerts in the Golden Hall of the world-famous Salzburg Fortress (Festung Hohensalzburg) and witness an unforgettable view of the town and province. Make this a unique experience while in Salzburg and enjoy an evening full of great music and excellent atmosphere. [Approx. Supplement Cost EUR 60 per person] Special Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs or subject to hotel discretion, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Salzburg, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Salzburg - Sound Of Music Tour 'Day Tour - The Sound of Music,' Do not miss out on this iconic tour of the picturesque World Heritage City of Salzburg: the original shooting location for the much-adored movie from the '60s: The Sound of Music. The English-speaking guide not only shows you the highlights of the film, but also the historical and architectural landmarks in the city, as well as a part of the picturesque lake district. [Duration of the tour: Approx 4 hours], GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Innsbruck, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Salzburg To Innsbruck Transfers: Today make your way to the Salzburg train station (on own) for your next destination Innsbruck via Train (Duration: 1.5 – 2.5 Hrs.) Special Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion) Tyrolean Evening with Family Gundolf (Optional). Enjoy traditional music, folk dances, yodeling, and lively “shoe-slapping,” performed in authentic costumes. The Gundolf family has hosted these events since 1967, offering a true taste of Tyrolean hospitality. You can upgrade to include a three-course meal with local specialties. [Approx. cost: EUR 85 per person], GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Innsbruck, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Visit to Swarovski Kristallwelten Swarovski Kristallwelten (Approx. 30 Mins Drive from Innsbruck). Swarovski Crystal Worlds, created in 1995 by multimedia artist André Heller, is a magical attraction that has amazed over sixteen million visitors. Inspired by the story of a Giant who explored the world’s wonders and settled in Wattens/Tyrol, the site features stunning crystal displays and the iconic Chambers of Wonder—modeled after the historic collection at Ambras Castle., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Vienna, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Innsbruck to Vienna Transfers: Today make your way to the Innsbruck train station (on own) for your next destination Vienna Via Train (Duration: 4.5 – 5 Hrs.) Vienna Hop on Hop off Tour (Optional): The tour lets you delve into Vienna’s rich history, sophisticated culture and stunning architecture. The flexibility of the hop-on hop-off tour allows the guests to immerse themself in Vienna's beautiful museums, magnificent palaces, grand monuments and rolling gardens at their own pace., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Vienna, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Vienna Transfers: From Vienna hotel to the Airport in private transfer. Special Note: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 134748.0. Hotels envisaged include: HOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\nCity\nVALUE CATEGORY 4*\xa0\n\n\nVienna\nHotel Zeitgeist Vienna / Mercure Wien Westbahnhof / Mercure Wien City Or similar\n\n\nSalzburg\nBest Western Plus Amedia Art Salzburg / H+ Hotel Salzburg / Austria Trend Hotel Europa Salzburg / Hotel Am Mirabellplatz or similar\n\n\nInnsbruck\nSailer / Best Western Plus Hotel Goldener Adler / Maximilian / Central or similar\n\n\n, HOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\nCity\nSTANDARD CATEGORY 3*\xa0\n\n\nVienna\nIbis Wien Mariahilf Hotel/ Admiral / Ibis Wien Messe / Hotel Pension Haydn or similar\n\n\nSalzburg\nInn Hotel Salzburg Zentrum / Astoria Salzburg / Hotel Jedermann / Austria Trend Hotel Salzburg Mitte or similar\n\n\nInnsbruck\nHotel Dollinger / Ramada Tivoli / Ibis Innsbruck / Hotel Engl / Hotel Goldene Krone or similar\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation: 1 Night accommodation in Vienna based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Salzburg based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Innsbruck based on the hotel category selected or similar 1 Night accommodation in Vienna based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis] Private Airport Transfer from Vienna Airport to Vienna Hotel Private Airport transfer from Vienna Hotel to Vienna Airport Train Pass: [Seat Reservation would be additional] Vienna to Salzburg with sector ticket Salzburg to Innsbruck with sector ticket Innsbruck to Vienna with sector ticket Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) Vienna City Tour with Schönbrunn Palace The Sound of Music and Salt Mines Visit in Salzburg - Seat in Coach Basis En