the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Aurangabad', 'cityCode': 'IXU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Awesome Austria' package is a 7-day tour covering the picturesque cities of Innsbruck, Vienna, and Salzburg. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the famous Golden Roof, the magnificent Schönbrunn Palace, Mozart's Birthplace, and the beautiful Mirabell Gardens. Participants will enjoy guided city tours, breathtaking alpine sightseeing, classical music experiences, and leisurely walks through historic old towns.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Vienna\n\xa0\nTransfers: Upon arrival you will be met our representative and escorted to the hotel on private basis.\n\xa0\nGrand Danube River Cruise (Optional): Even though the Danube Canal and Danube River are part of the same waterway, they offer entirely different Viennese experiences. Take a cruise on the narrow Danube Canal to view some of the city’s architectural landmarks, along with colorful canal-side graffiti, or stroll along the canal’s paved pathways, popular with locals. And, while the Danube Canal isn’t ideal for swimming, there are beaches here, including beach clubs that serve drinks to sunbathers.\xa0\n\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ibis Wien Mariahilf (Standard) / Zeitgeist (Value) or similar in Vienna'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nVienna to Salzburg\xa0\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the Vienna train station (on own) for your next destination Salzburg via Train (Duration: 1.5 – 2.5 Hrs.)\nUpon your arrival at Salzburg train station, make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nVienna City Tour with Schonbrunn Palace: Which includes skip the line access to the Schonbrunn Palace, the magnificent summer residence of the Habsburg dynasty. See all the main sights and attractions along the grand Ringstrasse. (Duration of the Tour: 3 hours) (By approx. 09:30 am).\n\xa0\nBest of Mozart Concert at Fortress Hohensalzburg in Salzburg (OPTIONAL): Experience Best of Mozart’s concerts in the Golden Hall of the world-famous Salzburg Fortress (Festung Hohensalzburg) and witness an unforgettable view of the town and province. Make this a unique experience while in Salzburg and enjoy an evening full of great music and excellent atmosphere. [Approx. Supplement Cost EUR 60 per person]\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs or subject to hotel discretion\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Inn Zentrum (Standard) / Best Western Plus Amedia Art (Value) or similar in Salzburg'}, {'day': 3, 'description': "\xa0\nSalzburg - Sound Of Music Tour\n'Day Tour - The Sound of Music,' Do not miss out on this iconic tour of the picturesque World Heritage City of Salzburg: the original shooting location for the much-adored movie from the '60s: The Sound of Music. The English-speaking guide not only shows you the highlights of the film, but also the historical and architectural landmarks in the city, as well as a part of the picturesque lake district. [Duration of the tour: Approx 4 hours]", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Inn Zentrum (Standard) / Best Western Plus Amedia Art (Value) or similar in Salzburg'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nSalzburg To Innsbruck\xa0\nTransfers: Today make your way to the Salzburg train station (on own) for your next destination Innsbruck via Train (Duration: 1.5 – 2.5 Hrs.)\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion)\n\xa0\nTyrolean Evening with Family Gundolf (Optional). Enjoy traditional music, folk dances, yodeling, and lively “shoe-slapping,” performed in authentic costumes. The Gundolf family has hosted these events since 1967, offering a true taste of Tyrolean hospitality. You can upgrade to include a three-course meal with local specialties. [Approx. cost: EUR 85 per person]\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Dollinger (Standard) / Sailer (Value) or similar in Innbruck'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nVisit to Swarovski Kristallwelten\n\xa0\nSwarovski Kristallwelten (Approx. 30 Mins Drive from Innsbruck). Swarovski Crystal Worlds, created in 1995 by multimedia artist André Heller, is a magical attraction that has amazed over sixteen million visitors. Inspired by the story of a Giant who explored the world’s wonders and settled in Wattens/Tyrol, the site features stunning crystal displays and the iconic Chambers of Wonder—modeled after the historic collection at Ambras Castle.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Dollinger (Standard) / Sailer (Value) or similar in Innbruck'}, {'day': 6, 'description': "\xa0\nInnsbruck to Vienna \n\xa0\nTransfers: Today make your way to the Innsbruck train station (on own) for your next destination Vienna Via Train (Duration: 4.5 – 5 Hrs.)\xa0\n\xa0\n\xa0\nVienna Hop on Hop off Tour (Optional): The tour lets you delve into Vienna’s rich history, sophisticated culture and stunning architecture. The flexibility of the hop-on hop-off tour allows the guests to immerse themself in Vienna's beautiful museums, magnificent palaces, grand monuments and rolling gardens at their own pace.\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ibis Wien Mariahilf\xa0 (Standard) / Zeitgeist (Value) or similar in Vienna'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Vienna\n\xa0\nTransfers: From Vienna hotel to the Airport in private transfer.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight.\n\xa0\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['HOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\nCity\nVALUE CATEGORY 4*\xa0\n\n\nVienna\nHotel Zeitgeist Vienna / Mercure Wien Westbahnhof / Mercure Wien City Or similar\n\n\nSalzburg\nBest Western Plus Amedia Art Salzburg / H+ Hotel Salzburg / Austria Trend Hotel Europa Salzburg / Hotel Am Mirabellplatz or similar\n\n\nInnsbruck\nSailer / Best Western Plus Hotel Goldener Adler / Maximilian / Central or similar\n\n\n', 'HOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\nCity\nSTANDARD CATEGORY 3*\xa0\n\n\nVienna\nIbis Wien Mariahilf Hotel/ Admiral / Ibis Wien Messe / Hotel Pension Haydn or similar\n\n\nSalzburg\nInn Hotel Salzburg Zentrum / Astoria Salzburg / Hotel Jedermann / Austria Trend Hotel Salzburg Mitte or similar\n\n\nInnsbruck\nHotel Dollinger / Ramada Tivoli / Ibis Innsbruck / Hotel Engl / Hotel Goldene Krone or similar\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'0': 'HOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\nCity\nSTANDARD CATEGORY 3*\xa0\n\n\nVienna\nIbis Wien Mariahilf Hotel/ Admiral / Ibis Wien Messe / Hotel Pension Haydn or similar\n\n\nSalzburg\nInn Hotel Salzburg Zentrum / Astoria Salzburg / Hotel Jedermann / Austria Trend Hotel Salzburg Mitte or similar\n\n\nInnsbruck\nHotel Dollinger / Ramada Tivoli / Ibis Innsbruck / Hotel Engl / Hotel Goldene Krone or similar\n\n\n', '1': 'HOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\nCity\nVALUE CATEGORY 4*\xa0\n\n\nVienna\nHotel Zeitgeist Vienna / Mercure Wien Westbahnhof / Mercure Wien City Or similar\n\n\nSalzburg\nBest Western Plus Amedia Art Salzburg / H+ Hotel Salzburg / Austria Trend Hotel Europa Salzburg / Hotel Am Mirabellplatz or similar\n\n\nInnsbruck\nSailer / Best Western Plus Hotel Goldener Adler / Maximilian / Central or similar\n\n\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'AT', 'countryName': 'Austria', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard', 'Value'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'price': 134700.0, 'hotels': ['HOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\nCity\nSTANDARD CATEGO