T; take a cable car to the Shymbulak Ski Resort.\xa0\n\xa0\nVisit KOLSAI LAKE & CHARYN CANYON;\xa0day excursion to the Kolsai Lake & Charyn Canyon.\xa0'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': '<p>Return Economy Class Airfare&nbsp;</p>', 'inclusions': '\nReturn Airport transfers.\n3 nights stay at Hotel Port Rivoli or similar in Baku.\n1 nights at Gabala Garden Hotel or similar in Gabala.\n4 nights at Astoria Hotel or similar in Tbilisi.\nSightseeing in districts (Baku, Absheron, Shahdag).\nEnglish speaking driver (for 2-6 PAX), English Speaking Guide (for 8-10 Pax)\nEntrance fee for Flame temple, Fire Mountain, Cable Car (2 Lines).\nGuided city tour of Tbilisi with Narikala Cable Car.\nFull Day Excursion to Dashbashi Canyon & Diamond Bridge.\nFull Day Excursion to WIne Country.\nFull Day Excursion to Gaudari & Kazbegi.\n2 Bottles of water per person per day.\nAll transfers according to program including airport transfers: Sedan (for 2-3 PAX), Mercedes Viano or Vito (for 4-6 PAX), Mercedes Sprinter (for 8-10 PAX)\nTravel Insurance (Valid till the age of 60 Yrs.)\n', 'exclusions': '\nTCS & GST\nVisa charges\nDeparture PCR test, if applicable\nAll flights services\nMeals not mentioned in the itinerary\nAny tips (Around USD 05.00 per person / per day) - for guide & Driver.\nAny other sightseeing entrance fees except for the ones mentioned in the Inclusions\nAnything not mentioned in the inclusions\nPre & Post tour services & cost\nExpenditure of personal nature (Such as the use of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & etc.)\nAll drink and beverages\nHotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel\nTourism Tax (if applicable)\nMidnight surcharge\nThe rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adults travelling together at all times.\n\n\nSINGLE SUPPLEMENT - USD 238.00\n', 'termsAndConditions': 'Test', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015440/AlmatyCity.jpeg', 'constructed_images': []}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014606', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014606', 'availableMonths': ['october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Athens With Thessaloniki', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Athens', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Athens', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Athens', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Thessaloniki', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Thessaloniki', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Thessaloniki', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Thessaloniki', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014606_0_20260903151509', 'price': 146935, 'packageSummary': "The 'Athens With Thessaloniki' package is a 7-day tour that takes travelers on a captivating journey through Greece, covering the historic cities of Athens and Thessaloniki. Throughout this week-long adventure, participants will immerse themselves in the rich cultural heritage of both destinations, enjoying guided city tours of iconic ancient landmarks, exploring vibrant local markets, and experiencing the unique culinary scenes and coastal charm that define these two legendary Greek cities.", 'images': ['Athens.jpg', 'AcropolisinAthens.jpg', 'Image_3.jpeg', 'Thessaloniki_1.jpeg', 'Metoro.jpeg', 'Halkidiki.jpeg', 'Thessaloniki.jpeg'], 'minimumPrice': 146935, 'thumbnailImage': 'Thessaloniki.jpeg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014606 is named 'Athens With Thessaloniki' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Athens, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Athens Transfers: Upon arrival you will be met the representative & transferred to the hotel on private basis. Special Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Athens, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Half-Day Guided Tour Of Athens On Shared Basis (SIC) Athens Sightseeing The Acropolis & Acropolis Museum Step into history on a half-day guided tour of Athens. The morning begins at the Panathenaic Stadium, birthplace of the modern Olympic Games, then past the Temple of Olympian Zeus and the elegant Athens Trilogy University, Academy, and National Library. Ascend to the legendary Acropolis to explore the Parthenon, Erechtheion, and Temple of Athena Nike. End your morning at the Acropolis Museum, where ancient treasures are brought to life. [Entrance fees to Acropolis & Museum is included] Special Note: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick up for the same will be from selected central points., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Athens, Meals: Breakfast and Lunch on Tour, Description: A Day At Sea: The Saronic Islands Cruise The Saronic Islands Cruise: Today, enjoy a full day cruise to the picturesque islands of Hydra, Poros, and Aegina. Sail across the Saronic Gulf, discovering Hydras car free charm, Poros lush scenery, and Aeginas lively harbor and local traditions. Time is provided on each island to explore, relax, or enjoy local flavors, making this a perfect blend of sightseeing and leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Thessaloniki, Meals: Breakfast, Description: From Athens To Thessaloniki A City Of Layers Transfers: Today you will have a private transfer from the hotel to Athens Airport for Thessaloniki Upon arrival at Thessaloniki there will be a private transfer from the airport to the Hotel. Special Note: Athens to Thessaloniki, can be organised by a private vehicle at a supplement cost. The check-in at the hotel will be as per the standard hotel time. Later, enjoy a panoramic city tour showcasing Thessalonikis multicultural heritage. Admire the iconic White Tower, the Arch of Galerius, the Rotunda, and the Roman Forum, while discovering the citys Byzantine and Ottoman past. A licensed guide may be added upon request., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Thessaloniki, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Meteora: Monasteries In The Sky Transfers: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick-up for the same will be from selected central points Meteora Excursion: Journey inland to Meteora, one of Greeces most breathtaking UNESCO World Heritage Sites. Towering rock pillars rise dramatically from the plain, crowned by centuries-old monasteries that seem suspended between earth and sky. Visit selected monasteries (subject to operating schedules) and take in sweeping views of the Thessalian landscape A day rich in spiritual atmosphere and natural grandeur. Special Note: Monastery entrance fees to be paid locally Above tour does not include Guided tour inside monasteries Lunch will be on your own and not included as a part of the tour, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Thessaloniki, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Halkidiki and Sithonia: Sea, Sunset and Olive Traditions Transfers: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick-up for the same will be from selected central points. Discover the flavors and beauty of Halkidiki on this immersive journey. Visit an olive grove Olive grove guided tour & tasting Euro 5 to 10 learn about local cultivation, and even package your own olives. Enjoy a tasting of olives, spreads, sweet treats, and olive chocolates. Then, relax on Kalogria Beach in Sithonia swim in turquoise waters, soak up the sun, or sip a drink by the shore. End the day with a magical Aegean sunset, the perfect close to your Halkidiki adventure. Sunbeds & umbrellas (optional), no meals or drinks included with this activity., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Thessaloniki, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Thessaloniki Transfers: From Thessaloniki hotel to the Airport in private transfer. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 146935.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nPremium\xa0Category (5* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nThessaloniki\n\n\n\n\nWyndham Grand Athens Hotel or similar\n\n\nThe MET Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nStandard Category (3* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\xa0\n\n\n\nATHENS\n\n\nThessaloniki\n\n\n\xa0\n\n\n\nCentral Hotel or similar\n\n\nDomotel Olympia Hotel or similar\n\n\n\xa0\n\n\n\xa0\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY (4* HOTELS OR SIMILAR)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nATHENS\n\n\nTHESSALONIKI\n\n\n\n\nAthens Avenue\xa0Hotel or similar\n\n\nAnatolia Hotel\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n. Inclusions: Accommodation: 3 Nights’ accommodation in Athens based on the hotel category selected or similar 3 Nights’ accommodation in Thessaloniki based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: Private Airport Transfer from Athens Airport to Hotel Private transfer from Athens hotel to Athens Airport Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point) Half-day City tour of Athens with new Acropolis Museum on sharing basis tour coach. The Saronic Islands Cruise on shared basis (SIC) Panoramic city tour of Thessaloniki on shared basis (SIC) Meteora Excursion on shared basis (SIC) Halkidiki & Sithonia Excursion on shared basis (SIC) Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head. Add On - Athens (1 Night Extension) Private transfers from airport-hotel-airport 1 Night accommodation in Athens as per hotels mentioned on Bed & Breakfast basis Please Refer to the below pricing for the Supplement Cost HOLIDAY PRICE (PER PERSON) IN EUR + INR (INSURANCE) Travel Validity: Average Pricing based on 6 Months (Apr - Sep 2026) CATEGORY TWIN SHARE TRIPLE SHARE SINGLE ROOMING CHILD WITH BED (06 - 11.99 YRS) CHILD W/O BED (02 – 05.99 YRS) 3 Euro 345 Euro 310 Euro 500 Euro295 Euro 295 4 Euro 355 Euro 295 Euro 485 Euro 305 Euro 305 5 Euro 360 Euro 300 Euro 510 Euro 340 Euro 340. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Notes: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability Terms and Conditions: Travel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 15 October 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Athens With Thessaloniki' package is a 7-day tour that takes travelers on a captivating journey through Greece, covering the historic cities of Athens and Thessaloniki. Throughout this week-long adventure, participants will immerse themselves in the rich cultural heritage of both destinations, enjoying guided city tours of iconic ancient landmarks, exploring vibrant local markets, and experiencing the unique culinary scenes and coastal charm that define these two legendary Greek cities.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Athens\n\xa0\nTransfers: Upon arrival you will be met the representative & transferred to the hotel on private basis.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Central (Standard) / Athens Avenue (Value) / Wyndham Grand (Premium) or similar in Athens'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nHalf-Day Guided Tour Of Athens On Shared Basis (SIC)\n\xa0\nAthens Sightseeing The Acropolis & Acropolis Museum Step into history on a half-day guided tour of Athens. The morning begins at the Panathenaic Stadium, birthplace of the modern Olympic Games, then past the Temple of Olympian Zeus and the elegant Athens Trilogy University, Academy, and National Library. Ascend to the legendary Acropolis to explore the Parthenon, Erechtheion, and Temple of Athena Nike. End your morning at the Acropolis Museum, where ancient treasures are brought to life. [Entrance fees to Acropolis & Museum is included]\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick up for the same will be from selected central points.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Central (Standard) / Athens Avenue (Value) / Wyndham Grand (Premium) or similar in Athens'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nA Day At Sea: The Saronic Islands Cruise\n\xa0\nThe Saronic Islands Cruise: Today, enjoy a full day cruise to the picturesque islands of Hydra, Poros, and Aegina. Sail across the Saronic Gulf, discovering Hydras car free charm, Poros lush scenery, and Aeginas lively harbor and local traditions. Time is provided on each island to explore, relax, or enjoy local flavors, making this a perfect blend of sightseeing and leisure.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Lunch on Tour', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Central (Standard) / Athens Avenue (Value) / Wyndham Grand (Premium) or similar in Athens'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nFrom Athens To Thessaloniki A City Of Layers\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nToday you will have a private transfer from the hotel to Athens Airport for Thessaloniki\nUpon arrival at Thessaloniki there will be a private transfer from the airport to the Hotel.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nAthens to Thessaloniki, can be organised by a private vehicle at a supplement cost.\xa0\nThe check-in at the hotel will be as per the standard hotel time.\xa0\n\n\xa0\nLater, enjoy a panoramic city tour showcasing Thessalonikis multicultural heritage. Admire the iconic White Tower, the Arch of Galerius, the Rotunda, and the Roman Forum, while discovering the citys Byzantine and Ottoman past. A licensed guide may be added upon request.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Domotel Olympia (Standard) / Anatolia (Value) / The MET (Premium) or similar in Thessaloniki'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nMeteora: Monasteries In The Sky\xa0\n\xa0\nTransfers: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick-up for the same will be from selected central points\n\xa0\nMeteora Excursion: Journey inland to Meteora, one of Greeces most breathtaking UNESCO World Heritage Sites. Towering rock pillars rise dramatically from the plain, crowned by centuries-old monasteries that seem suspended between earth and sky.\n\xa0\nVisit selected monasteries (subject to operating schedules) and take in sweeping views of the Thessalian landscape A day rich in spiritual atmosphere and natural grandeur.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nMonastery entrance fees to be paid locally\nAbove tour does not include Guided tour inside monasteries\nLunch will be on your own and not included as a part of the tour\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Domotel Olympia (Standard) / Anatolia (Value) / The MET (Premium) or similar in Thessaloniki'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nHalkidiki and Sithonia: Sea, Sunset and Olive Traditions\n\xa0 \xa0\nTransfers: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick-up for the same will be from selected central points.\n\xa0\nDiscover the flavors and beauty of Halkidiki on this immersive journey. Visit an olive grove Olive grove guided tour & tasting Euro 5 to 10 learn about local cultivation, and even package your own olives. Enjoy a tasting of olives, spreads, sweet treats, and olive chocolates.\n\xa0\nThen, relax on Kalogria Beach in Sithonia swim in turquoise waters, soak up the sun, or sip a drink by the shore. End the day with a magical Aegean sunset, the perfect close to your Halkidiki adventure. Sunbeds & umbrellas (optional), no meals or drinks included with this activity.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Domotel Olympia (Standard) / Anatolia (Value) / The MET (Premium) or similar in Thessaloniki'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart\xa0Thessaloniki\n\xa0\nTransfers: From Thessaloniki hotel to the Airport in private transfer.\n\xa0\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nPremium\xa0Category (5* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nThessaloniki\n\n\n\n\nWyndham Grand Athens Hotel or similar\n\n\nThe MET Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n', '\n\n\n\nStandard Category (3* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\xa0\n\n\n\nATHENS\n\n\nThessaloniki\n\n\n\xa0\n\n\n\nCentral Hotel or similar\n\n\nDomotel Olympia Hotel or similar\n\n\n\xa0\n\n\n\xa0\n\n\n', '\n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY (4* HOTELS OR SIMILAR)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nATHENS\n\n\nTHESSALONIKI\n\n\n\n\nAthens Avenue\xa0Hotel or similar\n\n\nAnatolia Hotel\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'2': '\n\n\n\nPremium\xa0Category (5* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nThessaloniki\n\n\n\n\nWyndham Grand Athens Hotel or similar\n\n\nThe MET Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n', '0': '\n\n\n\nStandard Category (3* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\xa0\n\n\n\nATHENS\n\n\nThessaloniki\n\n\n\xa0\n\n\n\nCentral Hotel or similar\n\n\nDomotel Olympia Hotel or similar\n\n\n\xa0\n\n\n\xa0\n\n\n', '1': '\n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY (4* HOTELS OR SIMILAR)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nATHENS\n\n\nTHESSALONIKI\n\n\n\n\nAthens Avenue\xa0Hotel or similar\n\n\nAnatolia Hotel\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'GR', 'countryName': 'Greece', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard', 'Value', 'Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 