 transferred from Stockholm hotel to the train station on private basis. Upon reaching Oslo train station you will have a private transfer to the hotel.\nSpecial Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15.00 hrs or at the discretion of the hotel management.\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Clarion hotel or similar in Oslo'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\n\n\xa0\nOslo Small Group Walking City Tour\nOslo Small Group Walking City Tour: Visit Oslos Royal Palace Vigeland Sculpture Park and Opera House. Explore the Kon Tiki FRAM and Maritime museums Akershus Fortress and its history museums then stroll Karl Johans Gate filled with shops cafes bars and nightlife.\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Clarion hotel or similar in Oslo'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\n\xa0\n\n\n\xa0\nDepart\nTransfers: You will be transferred from Oslo hotel to the airport on private transfer.\nSpecial Notes: You will reach airport three to four hours prior to your departure flight.\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'NA'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCOPENHAGEN\xa0\n\n\n\n\nScandic Hotel or similar\xa0\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSTOCKHOLM\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nClarion hotel or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOSLO\xa0\n\n\n\n\nClarion hotel or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'1': '\n\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCOPENHAGEN\xa0\n\n\n\n\nScandic Hotel or similar\xa0\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSTOCKHOLM\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nClarion hotel or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOSLO\xa0\n\n\n\n\nClarion hotel o