dard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\nOptional Activity: Bosphorus Dinner Cruise\nEnjoy an enchanting evening on the Bosphorus Strait with a leisurely dinner cruise that showcases Istanbul’s beauty by night. Sail between Europe and Asia as you pass iconic landmarks such as the Bosphorus Bridge, Dolmabahçe Palace, and the illuminated waterfront mansions. The experience is complemented by a delicious Turkish dinner and live entertainment, often including traditional music and folk dance performances, making it a memorable blend of scenic views, culture, and cuisine. [The supplement cost for this activity will be approx. US$ 80/- per adult & US$ 55/- for children below 6 years]', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Four Side Lions Taksim\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hilton Double Tree Piyalepasa\xa0(Premium) or similar in\xa0Istanbul'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nFull-Day Guided Tour Of Istanbul On Shared Basis (SIC)\nIstanbul City Tour : Between 07:30 and 09:00 hrs, you will be picked up from your hotel (pickup time subject to hotel location) for a full day guided city tour. The tour includes visits to the Hagia Sophia Mosque (entrance not included), the pride of Byzantine architecture; the Byzantine Hippodrome, once the venue for ancient chariot races; and the Blue Mosque, renowned for its exquisite blue Iznik tiles. You will also visit the Topkapi Palace (entrance not included), the former residence of the Ottoman Sultans, followed by time at the Grand Bazaar, Turkey’s largest covered market with over 4,000 shops.\nLunch will be served at a local restaurant, after which you will be transferred back to your hotel.\nSpecial Notes:\nSightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\nEntrance to the Hagia Sophia Mosque and Topkapi Palace is available at an additional supplement.\nSupplement costs:\nHagia Sophia: US$ 35 - 40/- Per adult (*Under 8 years Free)\xa0 \xa0\nTopkapi Palace US$ 65/- Per adult (*Under 6 years Free)\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Local Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Four Side Lions Taksim\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hilton Double Tree Piyalepasa\xa0(Premium) or similar in\xa0Istanbul'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nIstanbul To Cappadocia\nTransfers:\n\nToday you will have a private transfer from the hotel to the Airport for onward flight\nUpon arrival at Cappadocia, there will be a private transfer from the airport to the Hotel.\n\nSpecial Notes:\n\nPlease note that the domestic flight from Istanbul to Cappadocia is not included in the tour cost and will be charged as an additional supplement.\nPlease note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Dedeli\xa0Cave\xa0\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hanedan\xa0Cave\xa0Suites\xa0(Premium)\xa0or similar in\xa0Cappadocia'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nExplore Cappadocia\xa0\nOptional Activity: Hot Air Balloon\nIf a hot air balloon ride is on your bucket list, Cappadocia offers one of the most iconic experiences in the world. Drift gently at sunrise above a surreal, lunar like landscape of volcanic rock formations, fairy chimneys, and honeycombed valleys, as dozens of vibrantly colored balloons rise alongside you. This unforgettable experience offers breathtaking panoramic views and spectacular photo opportunities. [The supplement cost for this activity will be upon “On Request Basis”]\nPlease Note:\xa0 Children below 6 years of age or under 120 cm in height are not permitted to participate in the hot air balloon ride.\nCappadocia Sightseeing: After breakfast, between 09:00 and 10:00 hrs, you will be picked up from your hotel to begin a full day tour of Cappadocia. The first stop is Devrent Valley (Imagination Valley), known for its spectacular fairy chimneys and uniquely shaped rock formations set amidst beautiful landscape.\nYou will then visit Pasabag (Monks Valley), famous for its remarkable double\xa0and triple headed rock formations, once used as hermit dwellings by monks. Lunch will be served in Avanos, a town renowned for its traditional pottery craftsmanship and located along the Red River (Kizilirmak).\nAfter lunch, continue to the Goreme Open Air Museum, the heart of Cappadocia, celebrated for its rock cut churches adorned with wall paintings dating back to the 10th century, depicting scenes from the life of Jesus and early Christian monastic life.\nThe tour concludes with a photo stop at Uchisar Castle, a natural rock citadel and one of the largest fairy chimney formations in the region, offering panoramic views of Cappadocia.\nSpecial Notes:\xa0\n\nSightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Local Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Dedeli\xa0Cave\xa0\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hanedan\xa0Cave\xa0Suites\xa0(Premium)\xa0or similar in\xa0Cappadocia'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nCappadocia To Antalya\nTransfers:\xa0\n1. Today you will have a private transfer from the hotel to the Airport for onward flight\n2. Upon arrival at Antalya, there will be a private transfer from the airport to the hotel\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Notes:\xa0\n1. Please note that the domestic flight from Cappadocia to Antalya is not included in the tour cost and will be charged as an additional supplement.\n2. Please note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Best Western Khan (Value)/ Holiday Inn Lara Hotel (Premium) or similar\n\xa0\n\xa0\n\xa0'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nFull Day Pamukkale Tour On Shared Basis (Sic)\n\xa0\nTransfers: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick-up for the same will be from selected central points\nFull Day Pamukkale Tour on SIC basis: Enjoy a full-day guided tour of Pamukkale, including visits to the ancient city of Hierapolis and its remarkable landmarks. Explore the Domitian Gate, Latrina, Oil Factory, Agora, Byzantine Gate, Triton Fountain, and the Temple of Apollo, gaining insight into the region’s rich historical heritage.\nLunch will be served at a local restaurant.\nThe tour concludes with time to admire the spectacular Pamukkale travertines—the famous white terraces formed by mineral-rich thermal waters. Guests may enjoy a unique barefoot walk across these natural formations.\nAt the end of the tour, return transfer to the hotel.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast & Local Lunch as a part of the tour', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Best Western Khan (Value)/ Holiday Inn Lara Hotel (Premium) or similar\n\xa0'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nFull Day Antalya Tour On Shared Basis (Sic)\n\xa0\nTransfers: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick-up for the same will be from selected central points\nFull Day Antalya Tour on SIC basis: Enjoy a full day guided tour of Antalya, including a visit to Kursunlu Waterfall, followed by an explored walk through the charming Old Town of Kaleici, featuring highlights such as Hadrian’s Gate, Hidirlik Hill, the Clock Tower, the Fluted Minaret, and Palm Street. A traditional lunch at a local restaurant is included. After the tour, you will be transferred back to your hotel.', 'mealDescription': '\xa0Breakfast & Local Lunch as a part of the tour', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Best Western Khan (Value)/ Holiday Inn Lara Hotel (Premium) or similar'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Antalya\nTransfers: From Antalya hotel to Antalya Airport in a private transfer.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': '\xa0Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'NA'}]}, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels', '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n5* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nThe Elysium Taksim/Doubletree Hilton Piyalepasa Hotel\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nHanedan Cave Suites / Acer Cave Suites\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nAntalya\n\n\nHoliday Inn Lara / Doubletree Hilton City Center or similar\n\n\n\n', '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nFour Sides Lion Taksim / Erboy Hotel/ Konak Taksim\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nDedeli Cave / Sunak Cave Hote\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nAntalya\n\n\nBest western Khan / Prime Hotel / Ring Downtown or similar\n\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'0': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '2': '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n5* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nThe Elysium Taksim/Doubletree Hilton Piyalepasa Hotel\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nHanedan Cave Suites / Acer Cave Suites\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nAntalya\n\n\nHoliday Inn Lara / Doubletree Hilton City Center or similar\n\n\n\n', '1': '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nFour Sides Lion Taksim / Erboy Hotel/ Konak Taksim\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nDedeli Cave / Sunak Cave Hote\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nAntalya\n\n\nBest western Khan / Prime Hotel / Ring Downtown or similar\n\n\n\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'TR', 'countryName': 'Turkey', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Value', 'Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Value', 'price': 103500.0, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nFour Sides Lion Taksim / Erboy Hotel/ Konak Taksim\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nDedeli Cave / Sunak Cave Hote\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nAntalya\n\n\nBest western Khan / Prime Hotel / Ring Downtown or similar\n\n\n\n']}, {'category': 'Premium', 'price': 136600.0, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n5* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nThe Elysium Taksim/Doubletree Hilton Piyalepasa Hotel\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nHanedan Cave Suites / Acer Cave Suites\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nAntalya\n\n\nHoliday Inn Lara / Doubletree Hilton City Center or similar\n\n\n\n']}], 'meals': ['\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n4 Local Lunches as a part of the itinerary\n', 'Breakfast Included'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['\xa0\nSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n• Full Day Guided Tour of Istanbul on sharing basis (SIC)\n• Cappadocia Sightseeing Tour on sharing basis (SIC)\xa0\n• Full Day Pamukkale Tour on sharing basis (SIC)\xa0\n• Full Day Antalya Tour on sharing basis (SIC)\xa0', '\xa0Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n• Full Day Guided Tour of Istanbul on sharing basis (SIC)\n• Cappadocia Sightseeing Tour on sharing basis (SIC)\xa0\n• Full Day Pamukkale Tour on sharing basis (SIC)\xa0\n• Full Day Antalya Tour on sharing basis (SIC)\xa0\n\xa0'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': 'Accommodation:\n\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Istanbul based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Cappadocia based on the hotel category selected or similar\n3 Nights’ accommodation in Antalya based on the hotel category selected or similar\n\nMeals:\n• Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\xa0\xa0\n• 4 Local Lunches as a part of the itinerary\nTransportation:\xa0\xa0\n• Private Airport Transfer from Istanbul Airport to Hotel\n• Private transfer from Istanbul hotel to Istanbul Airprort\n• Private Airport Transfer from Kayseri Airport to Cappadocia Hotel\n• Private Airport transfer from Cappadocia Hotel to Kayseri Airport\n• Private Airport Transfer from Antalya Airport to Antalya Hotel\n• Private Airport transfer from Antalya Hotel to Antalya Airport\nSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n• Full Day Guided Tour of Istanbul on sharing basis (SIC)\n• Cappadocia Sightseeing Tour on sharing basis (SIC)\xa0\n• Full Day Pamukkale Tour on sharing basis (SIC)\xa0\n• Full Day Antalya Tour on sharing basis (SIC)\xa0\nInsurance:\n• Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)', 'exclusions': '\xa0\n\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included\xa0\nCity taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nCost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.\xa0\n\nBlackout Dates:\n\n\n\n\nHOLIDAY\n\n\nDATE\n\n\n\n\nNational Sovereignty and Children’s Day\xa0\n\n\n23-04-2026\n\n\n\n\nLabor and Solidarity Day\n\n\n01-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nCommemoration of Atatürk, Youth and Sports Day\n\n\n19-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nEid al-Adha 1st day\n\n\n27-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nEid al-Adha 2nd day\n\n\n28-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nEid al-Adha 3rd day\n\n\n29-04-2026\n\n\n\n\nEid al-Adha last day\n\n\n30-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nDemocracy and National Unity Day\n\n\n15-07-2026\n\n\n\n\nVictory Day\n\n\n30-08-2026\n\n\n\n\nRepublic Day\n\n\n29-10-2026\n\n\n\n', 'termsAndConditions': '', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014773/60842_Mevlana_Museum_in_Konya_Turkey_SRP.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014773/itinerary/Istanbul753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014773/itinerary/Istanbul.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014773/itinerary/Cappadocia7532.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014773/itinerary/Cappadocia7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014773/itinerary/Kusadasi_1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014773/itinerary/Pamukkale.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014773/itinerary/Antalya.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014773/itinerary/return_home.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG011510', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG011510', 'availableMonths': ['october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Amazing Albania', 'days': 8, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Tirana', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Tirana', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Shkoder', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Berat', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Vlore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Sarande', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Tirana', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Tirana', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': None, 'price': 123565, 'packageSummary': "The 'Amazing Albania' package is an 8-day tour covering Tirana, Vlore, Sarande, Shkoder, and Berat. The itinerary includes visits to the historic Rozafa Castle, the ancient ruins of Butrint National Park, the Blue Eye spring, and the UNESCO-listed Berat Castle. Participants will enjoy guided walking tours of vibrant city centers, scenic drives along the Albanian Riviera, boat trips on Lake Shkodra, and traditional food and wine tastings in local villages.", 'images': ['Tirana_n.jpg', 'TiranaClockTower.jpg', 'Shkoderjp.jpg', 'Beratjpp.jpg', 'Vlore.jpg', 'Sarande.jpg', 'TIRANAKOTOR.jpg', 'Tirana_D.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 123565, 'thumbnailImage': 'Dubrovnik_srp.png', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG011510 is named 'Amazing Albania' and spans 8 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Tirana, Meals: NA, Description: Arrive Tirana Transfers: Upon your arrival at Tirana International Airport, you will be transferred to the hotel on private basis. Special Note: 1. Welcome to Tirana, the vibrant capital of Albania, is a lively mix of colorful architecture, rich history, and modern culture. Surrounded by mountains, it offers bustling cafés, fascinating museums, and easy access to nature, making it a charming and energetic destination for travelers. 2. Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Tirana, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Tirana - Kruje - Tirana Visit to Kruja & Tirana City Tour: Today visit a historic town central to Albania’s resistance against the Ottomans, exploring Skanderbeg Castle, the museum, and the old bazaar, before continuing to Tirana for a guided city tour of Albania’s vibrant capital. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only. Optional Sightseeing: Albanian Night - Dinner with Folk Show @ EUR 85/- Per Adult & Child Enjoy an authentic Albanian evening with a traditional folk show and a 7 course local dinner. The experience includes one drink (glass of wine or raki, or a local beer) and duration of 2 hours., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Shkoder, Meals: Breakfast & Lunch at worldwide famous restaurant Mrizi i Zanava, Description: Tirana - Lezhe - Shkoder Transfers: Today travel from Tirana to Lezhe & from Lezhe to Shkoder by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 1 hour) Lezha City Tour: Visit to its top hill castle where you enjoy the fascinating panorama of the Adriatic Riviera and bronze age ancient city walls, and visit the Mausoleum of Skanderbeg (Albanian National Hero). City tour of Shkodra: This Tour includes, Old Bazaar, Centrum, Cathedral and Mosque. Visit the Castle of Rozafa and we will enjoy wonderful views of mountains (Albanian Alps), Shkodra’s lake (the biggest in the Balkans), Drini, Buna and Kir rivers with the valleys around from the top of Rozafa castle., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Berat, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Shkoder - Durres - Berat (Unesco) Transfers: This morning travel from Shkoder to Durres & Durres to Berat by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 2 hours. Enroute Sightseeing) Enroute Sightseeing of Durres: Discover Durres, one of the Mediterranean’s oldest cities, visiting the Balkan’s largest Roman amphitheater, ancient walls, and Byzantine relics. Berat City Tour: Continue to Berat, a UNESCO World Heritage city, Visit the castle of Berat with the Onufri museum and other churches inside; the Mosque of Berat and the old Bridge of Gorica, Onufri Museum and several churches and mosques. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Vlore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Ardenica Monastery - Apollonia (Unesco) - Vlore Transfers: Today travel from Berat - Vlore by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 2 hours). Enroute Sightseeing. Enroute Sightseeing of Ardenica Monastery: It is a 13th century Byzantine site famed for hosting Skanderbeg’s wedding, then explore the ancient atmospheric ruins of Apollonia. Vlore City Tour: Visit the city, including its old town, independence square and monument, where Albanian independence from the Ottomans was proclaimed on November 28th, 1912. Optional Activity: Dinner with Sea Food Experience in Vlore @ EUR 40/- Per Adult & Child Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Sarande, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Vlore - Himare - Ksamil - Butrint (Unesco) - Saranda Transfers: Today travel from Vlore to Saranda by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 3 hours). Enroute Sightseeing. Enroute Sightseeing of Vlora & Saranda: Travel south through spectacular coastal scenery along Vlora Bay and the Ionian Riviera, stopping in Ksamil/Saranda for lunch and time by the crystal clear sea. Butrint City Tour: Visit Butrint, Albania’s most important UNESCO archaeological site, explore numerous buildings including an acropolis, basilica and palace. The location of the site itself is also very attractive, surrounded by trees and water. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Tirana, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Saranda - Mesopotam - Blue Eye - Gjirokaster (Unesco) - Tirana Transfers: Today travel from Saranda to Tirana by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 4 hours). Enroute Sightseeing. Enroute Sightseeing of Mesopotam monastery & Blue Eye National Park: Travel to Gjirokaster, stopping at Mesopotam Monastery, built over the ancient temple inside the fortress. Later travel to the Blue Eye National Park. Gjirokaster City Tour: Explore this UNESCO listed Stone City, with its cobbled bazaar, distinctive stone houses, and the Gjirokaster Castle and Weapons Museum, before continuing to Tirana for leisure time. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Tirana, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Transfers: You will have a private transfer from Tirana hotel to Tirana International Airport. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 123565.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\nCity\n\xa0No Of Nts\n\xa0Hotel Name\n\n\nTirana\xa0\n\xa03 Nts\nAlbanopolis Hotel or similar\n\n\nShkoder\n\xa01Nts\nTradita G & Tosk Hotel or similar\n\n\nBerat\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHotel Republika or similar\n\n\nVlore\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHotel Partner or similar\n\n\nSaranda\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHavana Hotel or similar\n\n\n. Meals include: \nAs per the itineary\n. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ accommodation in Tirana based on the hotel mentioned or similar 1 Nights’ accommodation in Shkoder based on the hotel mentioned or similar 1 Nights’ accommodation in Berat based on the hotel mentioned or similar 1 Nights’ accommodation in Vlore based on the hotel mentioned or similar 1 Nights’ accommodation in Saranda based on the hotel mentioned or similar 1 Nights’ accommodation in Tirana based on the hotel mentioned or similarMeals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Lunch at worldwide famous restaurant Mrizi i ZanavaTransportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis] Private Transfer from Tirana Airport to Tirana Hotel Transportation with modern AC car/minibus/bus, etc during all tour itinerary on shared basis Private Transfer from Tirana Hotel to Tirana AirportSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point) Entry Fees (mandatory): Included (List of the museums and other sites included as per itinerary:) Skanderbeg Museum in Kruja Skanderbeg Mausoleum in Lezha Tophill Fortress in Lezha (+ cost for small vans to climb up to the fortress) Rozafa Castle in Shkodra (+ cost for small vans to climb up to the fortress) Amphitheater in Durres Onufri Museum and St. Mary Church in Berat Ardenica Monastery Apollonia Archeological Park Butrint Antic City Mesopotam monastery Blue Eye National Park Gjirokaster Castle (+ cost for luggage transfer to the hotel in Old Town)Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees - To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Note: Costing given is subject to change and availability. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Madurai', 'cityCode': 'IXM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', 'cityCode': 'STV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Nagpur', 'cityCode': 'NAG', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kannur', 'cityCode': 'CNN', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Vadodara', 'cityCode': 'BDQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Aurangabad', 'cityCode': 'IXU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Amazing Albania' package is an 8-day tour covering Tirana, Vlore, Sarande, Shkoder, and Berat. The itinerary includes visits to the historic Rozafa Castle, the ancient ruins of Butrint National Park, the Blue Eye spring, and the UNESCO-listed Berat Castle. Participants will enjoy guided walking tours of vibrant city centers, scenic drives along the Albanian Riviera, boat trips on Lake Shkodra, and traditional food and wine tastings in local villages.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Tirana\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at Tirana International Airport, you will be transferred to the hotel on private basis.\nSpecial Note:\n1.\xa0Welcome to Tirana, the vibrant capital of Albania, is a lively mix of colorful architecture, rich history, and modern culture. Surrounded by mountains, it offers bustling cafés, fascinating museums, and easy access to nature, making it a charming and energetic destination for travelers. \n2.\xa0Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion.', 'mealDescription': 'NA', 'overnightStay': 'Albanopolis Hotel or similar'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nTirana - Kruje - Tirana\nVisit to Kruja & Tirana City Tour: Today visit a historic town central to Albania’s resistance against the Ottomans, exploring Skanderbeg Castle, the museum, and the old bazaar, before continuing to Tirana for a guided city tour of Albania’s vibrant capital.\nSpecial Note:\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\nOptional Sightseeing: Albanian Night - Dinner with Folk Show @ EUR 85/- Per Adult & Child\nEnjoy an authentic Albanian evening with a traditional folk show and a 7 course local dinner. The experience includes one drink (glass of wine or raki, or a local beer) and duration of 2 hours.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Albanopolis Hotel or similar'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nTirana - Lezhe - Shkoder\nTransfers: Today travel from Tirana to Lezhe & from Lezhe to Shkoder by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 1 hour)\nLezha City Tour: Visit to its top hill castle where you enjoy the fascinating panorama of the Adriatic Riviera and bronze age ancient city walls, and visit the Mausoleum of Skanderbeg (Albanian National Hero).\nCity tour of Shkodra: This Tour includes, Old Bazaar, Centrum, Cathedral and Mosque. Visit the Castle of Rozafa and we will enjoy wonderful views of mountains (Albanian Alps), Shkodra’s lake (the biggest in the Balkans), Drini, Buna and Kir rivers with the valleys around from the top of Rozafa castle.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast & Lunch at worldwide famous restaurant Mrizi i Zanava\xa0 \xa0\xa0', 'overnightStay': 'Tradita G & Tosk Hotel or similar'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nShkoder - Durres - Berat (Unesco)\nTransfers: This morning travel from Shkoder to Durres & Durres to Berat by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 2 hours. Enroute Sightseeing)\nEnroute Sightseeing of Durres: Discover Durres, one of the Mediterranean’s oldest cities, visiting the Balkan’s largest Roman amphitheater, ancient walls, and Byzantine relics.\nBerat City Tour: Continue to Berat, a UNESCO World Heritage city, Visit the castle of Berat with the Onufri museum and other churches inside; the Mosque of Berat and the old Bridge of Gorica, Onufri Museum and several churches and mosques.\nSpecial Note:\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Republika or similar'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nArdenica Monastery - Apollonia (Unesco) - Vlore\nTransfers: Today travel from Berat - Vlore by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 2 hours). Enroute Sightseeing.\nEnroute Sightseeing of Ardenica Monastery: It is a 13th century Byzantine site famed for hosting Skanderbeg’s wedding, then explore the ancient atmospheric ruins of Apollonia.\nVlore City Tour: Visit the city, including its old town, independence square and monument, where Albanian independence from the Ottomans was proclaimed on November 28th, 1912.\nOptional Activity: Dinner with Sea Food Experience in Vlore @ EUR 40/- Per Adult & Child\nSpecial Note:\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Partner or similar'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nVlore - Himare - Ksamil - Butrint (Unesco) - Saranda\nTransfers: Today travel from Vlore to Saranda by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 3 hours). Enroute Sightseeing.\nEnroute Sightseeing of Vlora & Saranda: Travel south through spectacular coastal scenery along Vlora Bay and the Ionian Riviera, stopping in Ksamil/Saranda for lunch and time by the crystal clear sea.\nButrint City Tour: Visit Butrint, Albania’s most important UNESCO archaeological site, explore numerous buildings including an acropolis, basilica and palace. The location of the site itself is also very attractive, surrounded by trees and water.\nSpecial Note:\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Havana Hotel or similar'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nSaranda - Mesopotam - Blue Eye - Gjirokaster (Unesco) - Tirana\nTransfers: Today travel from Saranda to Tirana by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 4 hours). Enroute Sightseeing.\nEnroute Sightseeing of Mesopotam monastery & Blue Eye National Park: Travel to Gjirokaster, stopping at Mesopotam Monastery, built over the ancient temple inside the fortress. \xa0Later travel to the Blue Eye National Park.\nGjirokaster City Tour: Explore this UNESCO listed Stone City, with its cobbled bazaar, distinctive stone houses, and the Gjirokaster Castle and Weapons Museum, before continuing to Tirana for leisure time.\nSpecial Note:\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Albanopolis Hotel or similar'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart\nTransfers: You will have a private transfer from Tirana hotel to Tirana International Airport.\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'NA'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\nCity\n\xa0No Of Nts\n\xa0Hotel Name\n\n\nTirana\xa0\n\xa03 Nts\nAlbanopolis Hotel or similar\n\n\nShkoder\n\xa01Nts\nTradita G & Tosk Hotel or similar\n\n\nBerat\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHotel Republika or similar\n\n\nVlore\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHotel Partner or similar\n\n\nSaranda\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHavana Hotel or similar\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'1': '\n\n\nCity\n\xa0No Of Nts\n\xa0Hotel Name\n\n\nTirana\xa0\n\xa03 Nts\nAlbanopolis Hotel or similar\n\n\nShkoder\n\xa01Nts\nTradita G & Tosk Hotel or similar\n\n\nBerat\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHotel Republika or similar\n\n\nVlore\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHotel Partner or similar\n\n\nSaranda\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHavana Hotel or similar\n\n\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'AL', 'countryName': 'Albania', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Value'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Value', 'price': 123600.0, 'hotels': ['\n\n\nCity\n\xa0No Of Nts\n\xa0Hotel Name\n\n\nTirana\xa0\n\xa03 Nts\nAlbanopolis Hotel or similar\n\n\nShkoder\n\xa01Nts\nTradita G & Tosk Hotel or similar\n\n\nBerat\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHotel Republika or similar\n\n\nVlore\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHotel Partner or similar\n\n\nSaranda\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHavana Hotel or similar\n\n\n']}], 'meals': ['\nAs per the itineary\n'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['\nAs per the itineary\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': '\xa0 \xa0 \xa0 \xa0 \xa0 \xa0Accommodation:\n\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Tirana based on the hotel mentioned or similar\n1 Nights’ accommodation in Shkoder based on the hotel mentioned or similar\n1 Nights’ accommodation in Berat based on the hotel mentioned or similar\n1 Nights’ accommodation in Vlore based on the hotel mentioned or similar\n1 Nights’ accommodation in Saranda based on the hotel mentioned or similar\n1 Nights’ accommodation in Tirana based on the hotel mentioned or similarMeals:\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\nLunch at worldwide famous restaurant Mrizi i ZanavaTransportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis]\nPrivate Transfer from Tirana Airport to Tirana Hotel\nTransportation with modern AC car/minibus/bus, etc during all tour itinerary on shared basis\nPrivate Transfer from Tirana Hotel to Tirana AirportSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\nEntry Fees (mandatory):\xa0 Included (List of the museums and other sites included as per itinerary:)\nSkanderbeg Museum in Kruja\nSkanderbeg Mausoleum in Lezha\nTophill Fortress in Lezha (+ cost for small vans to climb up to the fortress)\nRozafa Castle in Shkodra (+ cost for small vans to climb up to the fortress)\nAmphitheater in Durres\nOnufri Museum and St. Mary Church in Berat\nArdenica Monastery\nApollonia Archeological Park\nButrint Antic City\nMesopotam monastery\nBlue Eye National Park\nGjirokaster Castle (+ cost for luggage transfer to the hotel in Old Town)Insurance:\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price.\nCity taxes / Resort Fees - To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.\n', 'termsAndConditions': '\xa0\nNote: Costing given is subject to change and availability', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'N', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011510/Dubrovnik_srp.png', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011510/itinerary/Tirana_n.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011510/itinerary/TiranaClockTower.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011510/itinerary/Shkoderjp.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011510/itinerary/Beratjpp.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011510/itinerary/Vlore.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011510/itinerary/Sarande.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011510/itinerary/TIRANAKOTOR.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG011510/itinerary/Tirana_D.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015029', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015029', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'december_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Swiss French Magic (Winter)', 'days': 8, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Zurich', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Zurich', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Lausanne', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Lausanne', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['Champagne lunch at Top of Jungfraujoch. Chocolate tasting at Lindt: Home of Chocolate. Fondue lunch at Glacier 3000'], 'pdfName': 'PKG000036_0_undefined.pdf', 'price': 311023, 'packageSummary': "The 'Swiss French Magic (Winter)' package is an 8-day tour covering the beautiful cities of Lausanne, Paris, and Zurich. Throughout this magical journey, participants will enjoy exclusive experiences including a champagne lunch at the Top of Jungfraujoch, a delicious chocolate tasting at Lindt: Home of Chocolate, and a scenic fondue lunch at Glacier 3000.", 'images': ['Zurich_Lake.jpg', 'Zurich753.jpg', '9063_Lucerne_Switzerland_753.jpg', 'Golden_Pass_Train.jpeg', 'EiffelTower_753.jpg', 'VersaillesPalace_new_753.jpg', 'DisneylandParis.jpg', 'Paris_new_753.jpeg'], 'minimumPrice': 311023, 'thumbnailImage': 'Switzerland567.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015029 is named 'Swiss French Magic (Winter)' and spans 8 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Zurich, Meals: Dinner, Description: Welcome to Zurich! On arrival, our Tour Manager / Local Representative will meet and welcome you outside the Airport. Later, we proceed to the hotel and check in. Note: Joining direct passenger / NRI can check in on your own at the hotel. The standard check in time is 1500 hrs. We may have to proceed directly for dinner or packed dinner will be provided in case of late arrivals of flight or long queue at the immigration., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Zurich, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner, Description: Orientation tour of Zurich - Visit Lindt: Home of Chocolate - Orientation Tour of Lucerne - Lake Lucerne Cruise Today, we proceed for an Orientation tour of Zurich where we explore the historic Old Town with its winding streets and iconic churches. Next, we proceed to Lindt: Home of Chocolate; where we get to discover Switzerland’s oldest chocolate brands and get to learn the art of chocolate making. In the evening, we proceed to Lucerne. On arrival we enjoy an orientation tour: See the Lion Monument, and Kapel Brücke with some free time to shop for famous Swiss watches, knives and chocolates. Later, we enjoy a cruise on Lake Lucerne. Note: If Lindt is not available, we shall take the group to an alternate Chocolate experience., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Lausanne, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner, Description: Excursion to Jungfraujoch with Lunch & Interlaken Today, we proceed for an excursion to Jungfraujoch - The Top of Europe. We take the cable car followed by a cogwheel train up to a height of 3,454 meters to Europe’s highest railway station. Visit the Ice Palace and the Sphinx observatory deck to view the longest glacier in the Alps. Enjoy lunch on Top. Later, descend and visit Interlaken., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Lausanne, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner, Description: Glacier 3000 - Orientation tour of Saanen & Gstaad – Golden Pass Train Today, we proceed on an excursion to Glacier 3000. Enjoy breath- taking views of the iconic mountains such as Mont Blanc, the Matterhorn, Eiger, Monch and Jungfrau from the Tissot Peak Walk. Next, we enjoy an orientation tour of Gstaad - a shooting location for Indian films. Later, we board the scenic Golden Pass train and enjoy panoramic views as we journey through alpine forest and picturesque villages. Note: On the days, Mt Glacier 3000 is closed due to maintenance or weather conditions, we shall take the group to an alternate excursion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Packed Lunch and Dinner, Description: Onto Paris Today, we proceed for a scenic drive to Paris. Upon arrival, we check in to the hotel., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner, Description: Guided city tour of Paris – Guided tour of Versailles Palace – Eiffel Tower (3rd Level) - Seine River cruise - Illumination Tour of Paris Today, we proceed on a Guided Tour of Paris: See the Alexander Bridge, Arc de Triomphe, Concorde Square, Opera House and Les Invalides. Next, proceed for a Guided Tour of Versailles Palace with private apartments, Opera Hall, the Chapel & Hall of Mirrors. Later, we visit the Eiffel Tower (3rd level). In the evening, we proceed for an ‘Illumination Tour of Paris’ on the Seine river cruise and see Paris by night, with some of the city’s famous monuments / sights lit up. Note: Visiting Eiffel Tower 3rd Level is subject to availability due to weather conditions / temporary operational closures. In case of such, the group shall visit the Eiffel Tower up till 2nd Level. Due to stringent security checks at the Eiffel Tower, it may take up to 4 - 5 hours in the queue. Due to revised Eiffel Tower regulations, guests may be required to queue at the ticket counter to collect their tickets. The Tour Manager will assist and guide guests throughout the process., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Packed Lunch and Dinner, Description: Disneyland® Paris (01 Day 01 Park) Today, we proceed to Disneyland® Paris where you can visit Disneyland® Park OR Walt Disney Studios® Park (Upto 5 hrs). Get charmed by Sleeping Beauty Castle, enjoy exciting rollercoaster rides, meet Alice in Wonderland, Pinocchio and others in Fantasyland as well as travelling to the four corners of the globe in Adventure Land., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Fly back home with pleasant memories! Today, we proceed to Paris airport for your flight back home. Kindly spare a few minutes to share your feedback with your Tour Manager. Your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your Europe tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime Note: In major European cities, there are parking restrictions for coaches and it is not possible to stop at all the places during the city tour. Your Tour Manager will try his/her best to stop coach wherever possible for a photo stop., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 311023.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at the Hotels, \n02 Nights at Hotel Novotel Zurich Messe / Movenpick / Courtyard by Marriott or similar in Zurich, Switzerland.\n02 Nights at Hotel Novotel / Agora by Fassbind / Central Residence / Eurotel Victoria / Corbetta or similar in Lausanne / Leysin / Villars, Switzerland.\n03 Nights at nights at Hotel Courtyard by Marriott / Hilton CDG / Hyatt CDG or similar in Paris (CDG Area), France.\n, \n03 nights at Hotel Zenitude CDG / Suite Novotel CDG or similar in Paris (CDG Area), France\n02 Nights at Hotel Alpine Classic / Moxy or similar in Leysin / Sion / Lausanne, Switzerland\xa0\n02 Nights at Hotel Novotel Zurich Messe or similar in Zurich, Switzerland\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included, \nDaily Continental Breakfast (Breakfast includes Bread with Butter, Jam, Cereals, Juice, Milk & Coffee).\n06 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non Vegetarian Lunches.\n07 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non Vegetarian Dinners.\n\nNote: Packed lunches, if applicable, will be Jain / vegetarian. In certain places, there is a possibility of providing cash out to the passengers instead of packed lunches., \nDaily Continental Breakfast (Breakfast includes Bread, Butter, Jam, Cereals, Juice, Milk & Coffee)\n03 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non-Vegetarian Lunches\n07 Indian Jain / Vegetarian / Non-Vegetarian Dinners.\n. Inclusions: Return economy class group airfare as per the itinerary. All local taxes and services as of 1st July, 2026. Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the duration of the tour. Sightseeing and accommodation as per the above mentioned itinerary. All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the itinerary) by a deluxe air conditioned coach. Services of a professional, friendly and multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative. (Subject to minimum 15 customers). Visa Requirements: Multiple entry Schengen visa. This cost includes documentation, processing and consulate fees.. Exclusions: If you wish to travel in advance i.e., before the published departure date as mentioned in the brochure or like to come back on a later date after the tour ends, there will be an additional charge that will be applicable (subject to availability of seats for the given dates & ticket validity) which will be advised to you by our sales staff / travel agent. Kindly note, the deviation will be actioned only 30 Days prior to departure date. Tipping is expected from anyone providing your service e.g., Coach Driver, Local Guides, Hotel & Restaurant staff etc. It is mandatory to tip a nominal amount of EUR 3 per person/per day. For the entire duration of this tour, which is 08 Days, the total Tips amount is EUR 24 per person to be paid to the Tour Manager on Day 01 of the tour. Cost of Basic Travel Quota equivalent to USD 250,000. Any increase in the airfare charged by the airline on your air ticket (presently calculated as on 1st July, 2026) Government Taxes as applicable are extra. The tour cost does not include POE charges and passport charges. No porterage included. Any expenses of a personal nature such as porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food and drink not in the regular menu provided by us, minibar, telephone calls, etc. Meals other than that are mentioned in your itinerary. Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees and local guides availed of by the passengers, other than that mentioned in your itinerary. Private airport transfers, Cost of Suggested / Optional Excursions.. Product Terms and Conditions: IMPORTANT NOTES: AIRLINE AND AIRFARE: The airfare is based on the fare structure existing as on 1st July, 2026. Any further increase in the airfare due to an increase in the fuel price, change in Government regulations, taxes, etc., charged by the airline will have to be borne by the passengers. Passengers missing flights note that the entire ticket gets no show and new return ticket needs to be bought by the passengers themselves. For prices and departure dates from your hub city please contact our local sales offices/travel agents. Passengers joining this tour must travel to / from the hub city at their own expense. JOINING DIRECT CLIENTS: Main Sector air tickets to reach the first overnight city and last departure city is not included in the Joining Direct package price. Arrival and Departure Transfers are not included in the package price. The Tour Manager shall meet the clients directly at the hotel. HOTELS: All hotels will be either around the airport area or on the outskirts. The hotel room size in Europe would be up to 16 – 18 sq. mts. Most hotels in Europe have only Twin beds. The double bed will be Queen size and not King size. As a 3rd person in a triple room, most hotels use rollaway beds and room size may be the same as the double room. For Child with bed: At times hotel don’t have enough roll away beds, in that case they might give a double and a separate single room. A person 11.99 years and below is considered a child and 12 years and above, an adult. Hotel rooms may not be air conditioned / air cooled nor will fans be provided. Air conditioning / cooling in hotels are set as per European weather conditions. Functioning of Air cooling / Air conditioning in hotels is subject to official declaration of summer by the local authority. During heat wave in Europe air conditioning of the hotels and coaches may cease to function as they are not built for such high temperatures. Most hotels in Europe do not provide tea kettles in the rooms. Due to international events and trade fairs all throughout Europe such as the Air Show, music festivals, ice skating championships etc., you may have to stay in hotels further away from the city. In Switzerland the stay may be split in two hotels. Any damage caused to the hotel rooms / Coach during your stay shall be payable by the passengers. We also reserve the right to substitute a hotel of similar class if it is deemed advisable or necessary. In certain cities hotels have not started the buffet breakfasts yet and if the same does not change by the time the tours begin, we will either provide breakfast or the groups will be taken to an Indian / local restaurant for breakfast. COACHES: Most of your journey in Europe is by coach and hence you are requested to keep the coach clean. Due to hygienic reasons, it is not permitted to use toilets on the coach. However, the tour manager will make comfort stops during long drives. Eating & drinking is not permitted on the coach. One check-in bag and one handbag per person only, due to limited boot space on the coach. In major European cities, there are parking restrictions for coaches, and it may not be possible to stop at all the places during the city tour. Tour Manager will try his/her best to stop coach wherever possible for a photo stop. Coaches are non-wheelchair compliant. There are steps to board / alight from the coach. Due to private coaches being forbidden inside most of the European cities, as per EU norms to preserve them and to avoid getting them polluted and overcrowded, most of your sightseeing will be done by local buses and on foot. MEALS: Meals are pre–set and a–la carte is not possible. On certain days, a packed lunch will be provided. SIGHTSEEING: On certain departures, we may sometimes amend / reverse the itinerary. However, all the services / inclusions will remain the same. Generally, you will have to walk to sightseeing places, amusement parks and the airports sometimes for a long distance; however, the same will be timely instructed by the Tour Manager. It is advisable to carry a good pair of comfortable sports shoes. The tour manager and the driver will do their best to get you as close to the monuments as possible. The Eiffel Tower on certain Days due to strong wind conditions or being overcrowded or for security reasons may be closed. The lifts at the Eiffel tower are currently closed due to safety. Hence the visit to the tower is only allowed by climbing the staircase. In case there is no change in the same on tour customers will be refunded the amount for the same if they chose not to climb the stairs. Due to stringent security checks at the Eiffel tower, it may take up to 4-5 hours in the queue. No refund will be provided in case the group is unable to visit Eiffel Tower 3rd Level due to weather conditions / operational closures. GENERAL: On some occasions you may have to join another group in case the group does not have adequate members. A local representative or a driver may only be there to assist you during your initial part of the tour. Arrival and Departure flights should be booked according to the group flight timings. In case there is any sightseeing involved on the first or last day of the itinerary to avoid missing any of the services. Please check with your sales officer for the group flight timings. Security alerts and random closures might affect the itinerary. Please take extra care of your personal belongings while on the tour, every country you travel to is prone to thefts and bag snatching. TCIL will not be liable for any loss of belongings / baggage. Disabled clients should carry their own wheelchair and should be accompanied by a qualified companion who is able to provide assistance to the disabled client. TCIL shall not accept any liability or responsibility for any damages, loss, baggage loss, theft, injury, accident, death, breakdown or irregularity, which may occur in carrying out the tour arrangement, weather conditions, strikes, war, quarantine and any other cause whatsoever and all such loss or expense must be borne by the passengers. Insurance policies must be carried while on tour. Normal insurance charges for the duration of the tour are included in the tour price. However, any passenger above the age of 60 years and those who wish to extend their stay will be required to pay additional charges. The management reserves the right to claim any additional expenses incurred due to delays or changes in schedules of train, airplane, bus, ship or other services. The Tour Manager and the company reserves the right to amend the itinerary, alter, vary or withdraw any particular departure, excursion advertised. For the convenience of our passengers, we will sometimes amend the itinerary. However, all the services will remain the same.. Highlights of the package: Champagne lunch at Top of Jungfraujoch. Chocolate tasting at Lindt: Home of Chocolate. Fondue lunch at Glacier 3000.", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZPE217', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZPE217', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZPE217', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZPE217', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZPE217', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZPE217', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZPE217', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZPE217', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Joining Direct', 'cityCode': 'JD', 'ltItineraryCode': 'ZPE217', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Swiss French Magic (Winter)' package is an 8-day tour covering the beautiful cities of Lausanne, Paris, and Zurich. Throughout this magical journey, participants will enjoy exclusive experiences including a champagne lunch at the Top of Jungfraujoch, a delicious chocolate tasting at Lindt: Home of Chocolate, and a scenic fondue lunch at Glacier 3000.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nWelcome to Zurich!\nOn arrival, our Tour Manager / Local Representative will meet and welcome you outside the Airport. Later, we proceed to the hotel and check in.\nNote: Joining direct passenger / NRI can check in on your own at the hotel. The standard check in time is 1500 hrs. We may have to proceed directly for dinner or packed dinner will be provided in case of late arrivals of flight or long queue at the immigration.', 'mealDescription': 'Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Novotel Zurich Messe / Movenpick / Courtyard by Marriott or similar in Zurich, Switzerland'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nOrientation tour of Zurich - Visit Lindt: Home of Chocolate - Orientation Tour of Lucerne\xa0 - Lake Lucerne Cruise\xa0\nToday, we proceed for an Orientation tour of Zurich where we explore the historic Old Town with its winding streets and iconic churches. Next, we proceed to Lindt: Home of Chocolate; where we get to discover Switzerland’s oldest chocolate brands and get to learn the art of chocolate making. In the evening, we proceed to Lucerne. On arrival we enjoy an orientation tour: See the Lion Monument, and Kapel Brücke with some free time to shop for famous Swiss watches, knives and chocolates. Later, we enjoy a cruise on Lake Lucerne.\nNote: If Lindt is not available, we shall take the group to an alternate Chocolate experience.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Novotel Zurich Messe / Movenpick / Courtyard by Marriott or similar in Zurich,\xa0Switzerland'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nExcursion to Jungfraujoch with Lunch & Interlaken\nToday, we proceed for an excursion to Jungfraujoch - The Top of Europe. We take the cable car followed by a cogwheel train up to a height of 3,454 meters to Europe’s highest railway station. Visit the Ice Palace and the Sphinx observatory deck to view the longest glacier in the Alps. Enjoy lunch on Top. Later, descend and visit Interlaken.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': '\nHotel Novotel / Agora by Fassbind / Central Residence / Eurotel Victoria or similar in Lausanne / Leysin / Villars, Switzerland'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nGlacier 3000 - Orientation tour of Saanen & Gstaad – Golden Pass Train\nToday, we proceed on an excursion to Glacier 3000. Enjoy breath- taking views of the iconic mountains such as Mont Blanc, the Matterhorn, Eiger, Monch and Jungfrau from the Tissot Peak Walk. Next, we enjoy an orientation tour of Gstaad - a shooting location for Indian films. Later, we board the scenic Golden Pass train and enjoy panoramic views as we journey through alpine forest and picturesque villages.\xa0\nNote:\xa0On the days, Mt Glacier 3000 is closed due to maintenance or weather conditions, we shall take the group to an alternate excursion.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Novotel\xa0/ Agora by Fassbind / Central Residence / Eurotel Victoria or similar in Lausanne / Leysin / Villars,\xa0Switzerland'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nOnto Paris\nToday, we proceed for a scenic drive to Paris. Upon arrival, we check in to the hotel.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Packed Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Courtyard by Marriott / Hilton CDG / Hyatt CDG or similar in Paris (CDG Area), France'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nGuided city tour of Paris – Guided tour of Versailles Palace – Eiffel Tower (3rd Level) - Seine River cruise - Illumination Tour of Paris\nToday, we proceed on a Guided Tour of Paris: See the Alexander Bridge, Arc de Triomphe, Concorde Square, Opera House and Les Invalides. Next, proceed for a Guided Tour of Versailles Palace with private apartments, Opera Hall, the Chapel & Hall of Mirrors. Later, we visit the Eiffel Tower (3rd level). In the evening, we proceed for an ‘Illumination Tour of Paris’ on the Seine river cruise and see Paris by night, with some of the city’s famous monuments / sights lit up.\nNote:\xa0\n\nVisiting Eiffel Tower 3rd Level is subject to availability due to weather conditions / temporary operational closures. In case of such, the group shall visit the Eiffel Tower up till 2nd Level.\nDue to stringent security checks at the Eiffel Tower, it may take up to 4 - 5 hours in the queue.\nDue to revised Eiffel Tower regulations, guests may be required to queue at the ticket counter to collect their tickets. The Tour Manager will assist and guide guests throughout the process.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Courtyard by Marriott / Hilton CDG /\xa0Hyatt CDG\xa0or similar in Paris (CDG Area),\xa0France'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nDisneyland® Paris (01 Day 01 Park)\nToday, we proceed to Disneyland® Paris where you can visit Disneyland® Park OR Walt Disney Studios® Park\xa0(Upto 5 hrs). Get charmed by Sleeping Beauty Castle, enjoy exciting rollercoaster rides, meet Alice in Wonderland, Pinocchio and others in Fantasyland as well as travelling to the four corners of the globe in Adventure Land.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Packed Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Courtyard by Marriott / Hilton CDG /\xa0Hyatt CDG\xa0or similar in Paris (CDG Area),\xa0France'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nFly back home with pleasant memories!\nToday, we proceed to Paris airport for your flight back home. Kindly spare a few minutes to share your feedback with your Tour Manager. Your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your Europe tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime\nNote:\nIn major European cities, there are parking restrictions for coaches and it is not possible to stop at all the places during the city tour. Your Tour Manager will try his/her best to stop coach wherever possible for a photo stop.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels', '\n02 Nights at Hotel Novotel Zurich Messe / Movenpick / Courtyard by Marriott or similar in Zurich, Switzerland.\n02 Nights at Hotel Novotel / Agora by Fassbind / Central Residence / Eurotel Victoria / Corbetta or similar in Lausanne / Leysin / Villars, Switzerland.\n03 Nights at nights at Hotel Courtyard by Marriott / Hilton CDG / Hyatt CDG or similar in Paris (CDG Area), France.\n', '\n03 nights at Hotel Zenitude CDG / Suite Novotel CDG or similar in Paris (CDG Area), France\n02 Nights at Hotel Alpine Classic / Moxy or similar in Leysin / Sion / Lausanne, Switzerland\xa0\n02 Nights at Hotel Novotel Zurich Messe or similar in Zurich, Switzerland\n'], 'hotels_list': {'2': '\n02 Nights at Hotel Novotel Zurich Messe / Movenpick / Courtyard by Marriott or similar in Zurich, Switzerland.\n02 Nights at Hotel Novotel / Agora by Fassbind / Central Residence / Eurotel Victoria / Corbetta or similar in Lausanne / Leysin / Villars, Switzerland.\n03 Nights at nights at Hotel Courtyard by Marriott / Hilton CDG / Hyatt CDG or similar in Paris (CDG Area), France.\n', '0': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '1': '\n03 nights at Hotel Zenitude CDG / Suite Novotel CDG or similar in Paris (CDG Area), France\n02 Nights at Hotel Alpine Classic / Moxy or similar in Leysin / Sion / Lausanne, Switzerland\xa0\n02 Nights at Hotel Novotel Zurich Messe or similar in Zurich, Switzerland\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'CH', 'countryName': 'Switzerland', 'continentName': 'Europe'}, {'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'FR', 'countryName': 'France', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Premium', 'price': 311000.