ommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nPrices are not valid during Trade Fair periods.\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\nInternational Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends.\nOffer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice.\nBookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nTCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012965/Georgia1.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012965/itinerary/georgia_753.png', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012965/itinerary/Kakheti-tour_C.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012965/itinerary/2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012965/itinerary/Kazbegi_C.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012965/itinerary/Mtskheta-D2.png', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG012965/itinerary/Georgia_Tbilis_753.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014942', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014942', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'UK With Scotland - Private Journeys (Winter)', 'days': 9, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'London', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'London', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'London', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Windermere Lake', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Windermere Lake', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Edinburgh', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Edinburgh', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Edinburgh', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Edinburgh', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014942_0_20260910115929.pdf', 'price': 513454, 'packageSummary': "The 'UK With Scotland - Private Journeys (Winter)' package is a 9-day tour covering Edinburgh, Windermere Lake, and London. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as Edinburgh Castle, the scenic Lake District, and the historic streets of London. Participants will enjoy private guided city tours, a scenic cruise on Windermere Lake, and exploring famous sights like Buckingham Palace and the Royal Mile, making for an unforgettable winter getaway.", 'images': ['25422_London_Tower_Bridge_753.jpg', '78202_Westminster_Parliament_London_753.jpg', 'WindsorCastle.jpg', 'Lake_Windermere.jpg', 'Windermere-lake-uk-london_C.jpg', 'EdinburghCity7534.jpg', '753_EdinburghCastle.jpg', 'Loch_Ness_753.jpg', 'Edinburgh_753.jpeg'], 'minimumPrice': 513454, 'thumbnailImage': 'Tower_Bridge_SRP.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Private Journeys', 'Family', 'Adventure'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014942 is named 'UK With Scotland - Private Journeys (Winter)' and spans 9 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - London, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive London Transfers: Upon your arrival at London International Airport, you will have a private transfer to the hotel in Central Switzerland. London Street Food Tour (Optional): Depending on your arrival time, enjoy a private, personalized London Street Food Tour with a local foodie. Discover inventive fusion eats beyond the classics—pork, halloumi fries, prawns or vegan bites—ending with wine, juice or craft beer. (Supplement cost GBP 220 per person) Special Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion Point to Point Airport transfer from London Airport to the Hotel, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - London, Meals: Breakfast, Description: London Eye & Thames River Cruise Ticket + Tower Of London London Eye Tour: Enjoy a panoramic ride on one of the world’s tallest observation wheels, rising 135 meters for stunning views of Big Ben, the Houses of Parliament, and Buckingham Palace. Thames River Cruise: Later Kick back and relax during a 40 minute cruise along the River Thames; next visit to the Tower of London! Tower of London: The Tower of London is a UNESCO World Heritage Site famed for Beefeater tours, historic architecture, royal intrigue, and the dazzling Crown Jewels, including the Koh i Nur diamond and the Imperial State Crown. Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - London, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day Trip To Windsor Castle, Stonehenge & Bath Windsor Castle Tour: Begin your journey at Windsor Castle, the world’s oldest occupied castle. Explore grand State Apartments, priceless artworks, and St George’s Chapel site of royal weddings and Queen Elizabeth II’s resting place. On select days, catch the Changing of the Guard. Stonehenge Tour: Discover Stonehenge, the 5,000 year old stone circle on Salisbury Plain. Explore this prehistoric wonder, its mysterious origins, and the award winning visitor centre with artefacts, exhibits, and recreated Neolithic houses. Bath Tour: Visit Bath, a UNESCO listed Georgian city famed for its elegant architecture and Roman Baths. Enjoy views of the hot springs, sip mineral water in the Pump Room, and stroll to Bath Abbey, Royal Crescent, and Pulteney Bridge. Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs. Please be aware that Windsor Castle is closed every Tuesday and Wednesday, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Windermere Lake, Meals: Breakfast, Description: London To Windermere : Lake District Transfer: Travel from London to Windermere, Lake District another region of United Kingdom on private basis. {Travel time of approx. 8 hrs. depending on traffic and stops in between cities} Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs. Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Windermere Lake, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Full Day Tour Of Lake District Full Day Tour of Lake District: Maximize a day in the Lake District on a private tour, visiting charming villages, lakes, waterfalls, and mountain passes. Relax with a driver and enjoy scenic stops at Kirkstone Pass, Castlerigg Stone Circle, Keswick, and Aira Force. Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs. This is a non-guided activity and there are no entrances included, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Edinburgh, Meals: Breakfast, Description: England To Scotland | Lake District To Edinburgh Transfer: Travel from Windermere, Lake District Edinburgh, Scotland on private basis. {Travel time of approx. 4 – 4.5 hrs. depending on traffic and stops in between cities} Luxury Whisky Tasting in Edinburgh's Underground Vaults (Optional): Later, enjoy free time or opt for a luxury whisky tasting in Edinburgh’s underground vaults. Just off the Royal Mile, sample five whiskies from different regions while a host shares stories of Scotland’s whisky heritage in a hidden Old Town venue. (Supplement Cost GBP 115 per person) Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Edinburgh, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Guided City Tour Of Edinburgh + Visit To Edinburgh Castle Guided City Tour of Edinburgh + Visit to Edinburgh Castle: Explore Edinburgh by private vehicle on an exclusive tour. Visit Edinburgh Castle (entry included) atop an extinct volcano, hear tales of its dramatic history, stroll the medieval Old Town, and contrast it with the elegant Georgian New Town., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Edinburgh, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day Trip To Lochness, Glencoe & Highlands Day Trip to Lochness, Glencoe & Highlands: See the best of the Scottish Highlands in a day on a private tour from Edinburgh. Travel with a dedicated driver guide through mountains, glens, and lochs, with highlights including Glencoe and an extended stop at legendary Loch Ness., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 9 - Edinburgh, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Edinburgh Transfers: From Edinburgh hotel to the Airport in private transfer. Special Note: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime. Standard Travel Validity from 1 JULY – 31 OCTOBER 2026 NOTE: ADULT & CHILD COSTING WILL BE THE SAME FOR PRIVATE JOURNEYS Package Cost on 3* (Standard) Hotels: Based on Per Person Per Slab Starting From 8 – 9 Guests 10 – 11 Guests 12 Guests £ 2,690 + INR 2250 £ 2,345 + INR 2250 £ 2,185 + INR 2250 Value Travel Validity from 1 JULY – 31 OCTOBER 2026 NOTE: ADULT & CHILD COSTING WILL BE THE SAME FOR PRIVATE JOURNEYS Package Cost on 4* (Value) Hotels: Based on Per Person Per Slab Starting From 8 – 9 Guests 10 – 11 Guests 12 Guests £ 3,050 + INR 2250 £ 2,685 + INR 2250 £ 2,500 + INR 2250, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 513454.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\nCity\n4*\n\n\nLondon\nPark Plaza London / Park International / Copthorne Tara London Kensington / Holiday Inn® London Kensington / Mercure London Paddington or similar\n\n\n\nWindermere\n\n\nMacdonald\xa0Old\xa0England\xa0Hotel\xa0&\xa0Spa\xa0/\xa0Lindeth\xa0Howe\xa0or\xa0similar\n\n\n\n\nEdinburgh\n\nLeonardo Royal Hotel Edinburgh Haymarket / Leonardo Royal Hotel Edinburgh / Novotel Edinburgh Centre Hotel / Mercure Edinburgh Haymarket or similar\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nHOTELS\xa0ENVISAGED\xa0OR\xa0SIMILAR\n\n\n\nCity\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n\nIbis London Earls Court Hotel / Lion & Key Hotel /The W14 Hotel Kensington / London House Hotel / Mentone Hotel / BW Swiss Cottage or similar\n\n\n\nWindermere\n\nWindermere Manor Hotel\xa0 / Beech Hill Hotel / The Ro Hotel or similar\n\n\n\nEdinburgh\n\nIbis Edinburgh Centre Royal Mile - Hunter Square / Leonardo Hotel Edinburgh City / Holiday Inn Express Edinburgh City - West / Ibis Edinburgh Centre South Bridge - Royal Mile or similar\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation: 3 Nights’ accommodation in London based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Windermere based on the hotel category selected or similar 3 Nights’ accommodation in Edinburgh based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transfers: [Includes Point to Point Transfer with limited waiting hours] Arrival Transfer from London Airport to London Hotel on private basis Interhotel transfer from London Hotel to Windermere Hotel Interhotel transfer from Windermere Hotel to Edinburgh Hotel Departure transfer from Edinburgh Hotel to Edinburgh Airport Vehicle at disposal for 10 hrs. as mentioned in the itinerary Sightseeing: [Tour timing will have to be decided at the time of booking] London panoramic sightseeing drive through London Eye & Thames River Cruise ticket Tower of London ticket Day trip to Windsor Castle, Stonehenge & Bath (No guide) Ticket to Windsor Castle Ticket to Stonehenge Full day tour of Lake District (No guide & entrances included) Guided city tour of Edinburgh Ticket to Edinburgh Castle Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Meals other than those specified (if any). Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of GBP 5 per person per day is not included City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head. Product Terms and Conditions: GENERAL NOTES: Quote for 2 guests is based on standard car like Toyota Prius or similar, Quote for 4 – 8 guests is based on Van like VW/Opel/Vito or similar, Quote from 10 guests it will be 14/16/19-seater vehicle or similar. If the guests exceed the seating capacity of the vehicle, then the rate will change based on a real-time basis as it will fall under coach packages For 2 to 6 guests, Vehicle is with driver cum guide. No separate guide If there are 5A + 3C or 6A + 2C or 4A + 4C etc. or similar, then we will have to check rates on real time basis. Blocking must be done a minimum 45 days prior to travel date with re-confirmation before 30 - 25 days of travel date unless there is an event then the booking has to be made on an immediate basis and the rate will be based on real-time availability If the travel date is during any festival, Sporting / Cultural / State or Government Event, Exhibition, Trade fairs etc. then the rate will change based on a real-time basis. SPECIAL NOTES: Hotels will be as per the names listed below or similar. If the requested hotels are not available, we will endeavor to book space in similarly priced hotels. Tips to drive & guide is not included (Nominal Tipping is GBP 5 Per person per day) We do not commit rooms with air conditioning. In case your guests are keen on the aircon, please let us know beforehand All the below itineraries have point to point transport on the arrival and departure day The vehicle will be on disposal for 10 driving hrs. per day. If guests exceed 10 hours, they will have to the pay extra hr. charges (to be advised at the time of booking) directly to the chauffeur. We aren’t holding any inventory of hotels / vehicles at the moment IMPORTANT NOTES: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost. TERMS AND CONDITIONS: Travel Validity: 1 July – 31 October 2026 // Except Blackout Period Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. TCS & GST would be levied as applicable The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedaba