nburgh Airport\nVehicle at disposal for 10 hrs. as mentioned in the itinerary\n\n\xa0\nSightseeing: [Tour timing will have to be decided at the time of booking]\n\nLondon panoramic sightseeing drive through\nLondon Eye & Thames River Cruise ticket\nTower of London ticket\nDay trip to Windsor Castle, Stonehenge & Bath (No guide)\nTicket to Windsor Castle\nTicket to Stonehenge\nFull day tour of Lake District (No guide & entrances included)\nGuided city tour of Edinburgh\nTicket to Edinburgh Castle\n\n\xa0\nInsurance:\n\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nMeals other than those specified (if any).\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of GBP 5 per person per day is not included\xa0\nCity taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nCost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head\n', 'termsAndConditions': 'GENERAL NOTES:\n\nQuote for 2 guests is based on standard car like Toyota Prius or similar,\xa0\nQuote for 4 – 8 guests is based on Van like VW/Opel/Vito or similar,\xa0\nQuote from 10 guests it will be 14/16/19-seater vehicle or similar.\xa0\nIf the guests exceed the seating capacity of the vehicle, then the rate will change based on a real-time basis as it will fall under coach packages\xa0\nFor 2 to 6 guests, Vehicle is with driver cum guide. No separate guide\nIf there are 5A + 3C or 6A + 2C or 4A + 4C etc. or similar, then we will have to check rates on real time basis.\nBlocking must be done a minimum 45 days prior to travel date with re-confirmation before 30 - 25 days of travel date unless there is an event then the booking has to be made on an immediate basis and the rate will be based on real-time availability\nIf the travel date is during any festival, Sporting / Cultural / State or Government Event, Exhibition, Trade fairs etc. then the rate will change based on a real-time basis.\n\n\xa0\nSPECIAL NOTES:\n\nHotels will be as per the names listed below or similar. If the requested hotels are not available, we will endeavor to book space in similarly priced hotels.\nTips to drive & guide is not included (Nominal Tipping is GBP 5 Per person per day)\nWe do not commit rooms with air conditioning. In case your guests are keen on the aircon, please let us know beforehand\xa0\nAll the below itineraries have point to point transport on the arrival and departure day\nThe vehicle will be on disposal for 10 driving hrs. per day. If guests exceed 10 hours, they will have to the pay extra hr. charges (to be advised at the time of booking) directly to the chauffeur.\xa0\nWe aren’t holding any inventory of hotels / vehicles at the moment\xa0\n\n\xa0\nIMPORTANT NOTES:\n\nThe above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together.\nThe above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\nMaximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room.\nMidnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\nWIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed.\xa0\n(Supplement charges may apply for such services)\nStandard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs.\nMost hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned.\nAt this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability\nTCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost.\n\n\xa0\nTERMS AND CONDITIONS:\n\nTravel Validity: 1 July – 31 October 2026 // Except Blackout Period\nBlack out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ.\nTCS & GST would be levied as applicable\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nMaximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\nSurcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking.\nTo proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour.\nShould the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014942/Tower_Bridge_SRP.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014942/itinerary/25422_London_Tower_Bridge_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014942/itinerary/78202_Westminster_Parliament_London_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014942/itinerary/WindsorCastle.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014942/itinerary/Lake_Windermere.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014942/itinerary/Windermere-lake-uk-london_C.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014942/itinerary/EdinburghCity7534.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014942/itinerary/753_EdinburghCastle.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014942/itinerary/Loch_Ness_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014942/itinerary/Edinburgh_753.jpeg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014555', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014555', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Swiss Surprise', 'days': 6, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Zurich', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Zurich', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014555_0_20260916161332.pdf', 'price': 140808, 'packageSummary': "The 'Swiss Surprise' package is a 6-day tour covering Zurich and the breathtaking regions of Central and Southern Switzerland. The itinerary includes exploring Zurich's historic Old Town, embarking on spectacular alpine excursions, and enjoying scenic train journeys through the majestic Swiss Alps. Participants will experience guided city sightseeing, visits to traditional chocolate factories, and serene lake cruises, offering a perfect blend of urban culture and natural beauty.", 'images': ['Lucerne.jpg', 'SwissDay2.jpg', 'JUNGFRAUJOCH_753.jpg', 'Schilthorn_4.jpeg', 'Zurich_753.jpg', '95133_Zurich_Switzerland_753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 140808, 'thumbnailImage': 'Titles753.jpeg', 'packageTheme': ['Adventure', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Most Booked', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014555 is named 'Swiss Surprise' and spans 6 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Zurich Transfers: Upon your arrival at the Zurich airport, you will walk across to the Flughafen station (located adjacent to the airport) for your train to Central Switzerland. From train station transfer on your own to the hotel. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Mt. Titlis Excursion Mt. Titlis Excursion: Don't miss the spectacular beauty of Mt Titlis! Discover eternal glaciers and other attractions from more than 3020m / 10000 ft high. Enjoy the spectacular sight of the glacier's deep crevasses and gigantic ice boulders from the revolving cable car ROTAIR. At the top of Mt. Titlis (10'000 ft. above sea level), a high alpine panorama awaits you. Visit the Ice Grotto or take a ride with the chairlift IceFlyer, which brings you close to the crevasses. Enjoy also the FunLift in the snow and the Cliff Walk, Europe's highest suspension bridge. (In conjunction with Swiss Pass), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Jungfraujoch Excursion (Optional) Jungfraujoch Excursion (Optional): Don't miss the highlight of any Swiss holiday and go for this thrilling and unforgettable excursion to Jungfraujoch, Top of Europe! From Interlaken, the heart of the Jungfrau region mountain world and uniquely situated between two lakes, you make your way to famous mountain resort Grindelwald where you board the cogwheel train for a spectacular ride via Kleine Scheidegg to Jungfraujoch. Enjoy stunning views of the world-famous triple peaks of Eiger, Monch and Jungfrau accompany you all the way to the top. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Central Switzerland - Schilthorn Schilthorn: Today get ready to experience the worlds steepest cable car. It is the steepest cable car in the world with a gradient of 159.4 per cent. The classic aerial cableway connects the valley floor with the car-free mountain village in just four minutes via the vertical walls of the Mürrenfluh. It covers a height of 775 meters on a journey of almost 1194 meters., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Zurich, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Central Switzerland To Zurich Via Train Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Zurich with Swiss Pass. Upon your arrival at Zurich train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. Local Sightseeing (Optional): Explore Zurich on a city tour. This panoramic tour takes you across the famous Bahnhofstrasse and the banking center of the lake with a view of the snow-capped mountains, part of the old town with its magnificent guild houses and the churches St. Peter, Grossmünster and Fraumünster. You’ll see the university quarter and residential area Zürichberg, the National Museum and the Kunsthaus., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Zurich, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Zurich Transfers: Make you way to the Zurich Airport for your journey back home. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 140808.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nSTANDARD CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nLa Pergola | Ibis Styles Bern City | Prizeotel Bern-city | Jardin | Sorell Hotel Ador or similar\n\n\n\n\nZurich\n\n\nIbis Zurich City West | Swiss Night By Fassbind | Ibis Styles Zurich City Center | Design Hotel Plattenhof | Montana | Welcome Inn| | Hotel Sternen Oerlikon Or Similar\n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nCampus Hotel Hertenstein | Romantik Hotel Beau Rivage - Weggis | Hotel Baren Sigriswil | Hotel Eden Spiez | Seegarten Marina or similar\n\n\n\n\nZurich\n\n\nZuri By Fassbind | 25hours Hotel Zurich West | Krone Unterstrass | Hotel Allegra | Holiday Inn Zurich Messe or similar\n\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation: 4 Nights’ accommodation in Central / Southern Switzerland based on the hotel category selected or similar 1 Night accommodation in Zurich based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: Train Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed] Swiss Pass 6 Days Consecutive Saver Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) Mt Titlis Excursion (in conjunction with Swiss Pass) Schilthorn Cable Car (in conjunction with Swiss Pass) Zurich: Zurich City Tour - Seat in Coach Basis Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of CHF 10 per person per day is not included City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Note: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability Terms and Conditions: Travel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 September 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Swiss Surprise' package is a 6-day tour covering Zurich and the breathtaking regions of Central and Southern Switzerland. The itinerary includes exploring Zurich's historic Old Town, embarking on spectacular alpine excursions, and enjoying scenic train journeys through the majestic Swiss Alps. Participants will experience guided city sightseeing, visits to traditional chocolate factories, and serene lake cruises, offering a perfect blend of urban culture and natural beauty.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Zurich\n\xa0\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at the Zurich airport, you will walk across to the Flughafen station (located adjacent to the airport) for your train to Central Switzerland. From train station transfer on your own to the hotel.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel La Pergola (Standard) / Campus Hertenstein (Value) or similar in Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 2, 'description': "\xa0\nMt. Titlis Excursion\n\xa0\nMt. Titlis Excursion: Don't miss the spectacular beauty of Mt Titlis! Discover eternal glaciers and other attractions from more than 3020m / 10000 ft high. Enjoy the spectacular sight of the glacier's deep crevasses and gigantic ice boulders from the revolving cable car ROTAIR. At the top of Mt. Titlis (10'000 ft. above sea level), a high alpine panorama awaits you. Visit the Ice Grotto or take a ride with the chairlift IceFlyer, which brings you close to the crevasses. Enjoy also the FunLift in the snow and the Cliff Walk, Europe's highest suspension bridge. (In conjunction with Swiss Pass)", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel La Pergola (Standard) / Campus Hertenstein (Value) or similar in Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 3, 'description': "\xa0\nJungfraujoch Excursion (Optional)\n\xa0\nJungfraujoch Excursion (Optional): Don't miss the highlight of any Swiss holiday and go for this thrilling and unforgettable excursion to Jungfraujoch, Top of Europe! From Interlaken, the heart of the Jungfrau region mountain world and uniquely situated between two lakes, you make your way to famous mountain resort Grindelwald where you board the cogwheel train for a spectacular ride via Kleine Scheidegg to Jungfraujoch. Enjoy stunning views of the world-famous triple peaks of Eiger, Monch and Jungfrau accompany you all the way to the top. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass)", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel La Pergola (Standard) / Campus Hertenstein (Value) or similar in Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nCentral Switzerland - Schilthorn\xa0\n\xa0\nSchilthorn: Today get ready to experience the worlds steepest cable car. It is the steepest cable car in the world with a gradient of 159.4 per cent. The classic aerial cableway connects the valley floor with the car-free mountain village in just four minutes via the vertical walls of the Mürrenfluh. It covers a height of 775 meters on a journey of almost 1194 meters.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel La Pergola (Standard) / Campus Hertenstein (Value) or similar in Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nCentral Switzerland To Zurich Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Zurich with Swiss Pass.\xa0\xa0\nUpon your arrival at Zurich train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nLocal Sightseeing (Optional): Explore Zurich on a city tour. This panoramic tour takes you across the famous Bahnhofstrasse and the banking center of the lake with a view of the snow-capped mountains, part of the old town with its magnificent guild houses and the churches St. Peter, Grossmünster and Fraumünster. You’ll see the university quarter and residential area Zürichberg, the National Museum and the Kunsthaus.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Ibis City West\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Zuri By Fassbind\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Zurich'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Zurich\nTransfers: Make you way to the Zurich Airport for your journey back home.\n\xa0\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nSTANDARD CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nLa Pergola | Ibis Styles Bern City | Prizeotel Bern-city | Jardin | Sorell Hotel Ador or similar\n\n\n\n\nZurich\n\n\nIbis Zurich City West | Swiss Night By Fassbind | Ibis Styles Zurich City Center | Design Hotel Plattenhof | Montana | Welcome Inn| | Hotel Sternen Oerlikon Or Similar