on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014555/Titles753.jpeg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014555/itinerary/Lucerne.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014555/itinerary/SwissDay2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014555/itinerary/JUNGFRAUJOCH_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014555/itinerary/Schilthorn_4.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014555/itinerary/Zurich_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014555/itinerary/95133_Zurich_Switzerland_753.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014524', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014524', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Best Of Portugal', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Lisbon', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Lisbon', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Porto', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Porto', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Porto', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Lisbon', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Lisbon', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG012121_0_20240110153038.pdf', 'price': 127547, 'packageSummary': "The 'Best Of Portugal' package is a 7-day tour covering the historic and scenic cities of Porto and Lisbon. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the historic Ribeira district, the majestic Belém Tower, and the stunning Jerónimos Monastery. Participants will enjoy guided city tours, a scenic cruise along the Douro River, traditional Port wine tastings in historic cellars, and an authentic evening of soulful Fado music.", 'images': ['Lisbon7532.jpg', 'Lisbon3.jpg', 'Porto7534.jpg', 'Porto7536.jpg', 'Porto_WineCeller.jpg', 'Lisbon7533.jpg', 'Lisbon7534.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 127547, 'thumbnailImage': 'Lisbon_1.jpeg', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Adventure'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014524 is named 'Best Of Portugal' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Lisbon, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Lisbon Transfers: Upon your arrival at the Lisbon airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Lisbon, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Hop On Hop Off Tour Hop on Hop Off Tour: Explore Lisbon’s limitless compelling sights with the freedom of a hop-on hop-off bus tour, with an optional line to Cascais. Tickets are valid for 24 hours to grant you the most sightseeing flexibility. This tour offers four different lines to choose from (tickets valid for one, two, three or four lines) with stops at Lisbon’s memorable monuments, viewpoints and neighborhoods. You’ll get a lasting taste of Lisbon’s history and culture on any line, so grab a ticket and hop on, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Porto, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Lisbon To Porto Via Train Transfers: Make your way to the Lisbon train station for your onward journey to Porto. (Duration approx. 3.5 hrs.) Upon your arrival at Porto train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Porto, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Porto Hop On Hop Off Tour Hop on Hop Off Tour: Explore the birthplace of port wine during an exciting hop-on hop-off Porto tour! With the bus tour tickets, you’re sure to experience a seamless, stress-free trip with a 24 hrs ticket. Get the transportation needs completely sorted out and all you need to do is to hop off the bus at the Porto attractions that pique your interest! With bus stops strategically located around the city, City Sightseeing Porto makes touring Porto both easy and fun. Just hop off to see the destinations you want to explore up close and then hop back on whenever you want, all you have to do is present your bus tour ticket! Remember, you can switch between bus routes whenever you like!, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Porto, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day Free At Leisure (Optional Activities) Porto Douro Valley Full-Day Wine Tasting & River Cruise with Lunch (Optional Tour 1): Douro Valley is known for being an excellent wine producing region, and on this tour, you’ll sample delicious wines, and visit Douro Valley’s highlights in a day. Take the stress out of booking your own transport by having Porto hotel pickup and drop-off included. After a convenient transfer to Douro Valley, you’ll taste wines at historic vineyards and wine estates, sample olive oil, go on a river cruise, and see spectacular viewpoints throughout the day. When you’ve worked up an appetite, a traditional Portuguese lunch is provided. The Best Douro Boat Tour (Optional Tour 2): A major river on the Iberian Peninsula, the Douro River (Rio Douro) flows from Duruelo de la Sierra in northern Spain all the way to Porto in Portugal, where it empties into the Atlantic Ocean. More than just the region’s lifeline, it’s also the centrepiece of the Douro Valley, Portugal’s most famous wine region and a UNESCO World Heritage Site. Climb aboard our sailboat for a panoramic tour of Porto. Start the adventure in the Douro marina and discover the Ribeira and Cais de Gaia. You will pass slowly along the bank to enjoy the views. (Approx. 1.5 hrs) Special Note: Any one optional tour needs to be selected from the given optional tours., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Lisbon, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Porto To Lisbon By Train Transfers: Make your way to the Porto train station for your onward journey to Lisbon. (Duration approx. 3.5 hrs.) Upon your arrival at Lisbon train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. Skip the Line - Live Fado Show In Lisbon: 'Fado In Chiado' (Optional in free time): Fado in Chiado is a live Fado Show, an excellent way to discover culture and the city. Enjoy a 50 minutes performance featuring two singers and two guitarists. Experience this passion in a show that expresses the soul of Lisbon., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Lisbon, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Lisbon Transfers: From Lisbon hotel to airport you will have private transfer. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 127547.0. Hotels envisaged include: \xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nStandard category\n\n\n\nMadrid\n\nPetit Palace Cliper Gran Via / Petit Palace Tres Cruces / Hotel Los Condes / Petit Palace Chueca / Hotel Madrid Centro, Affiliated by Melia or similar\n\n\n\n\nSeville\n\n\nHotel Derby Sevilla / Las Casas De Los Mercaderes By Silken / Eurostars Regina / H10 Corregidor Boutique Hotel or similar\n\n\n\nBarcelona\n\nHotel Viladomat By Silken / Catalonia Roma / Leonardo Hotel Barcelona Gran Via / Continental Palacete or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity\n\n\nValue category\n\n\n\n\nLisbon\n\n\nZenit Lisboa / Vip Executive Saldanha / BE Hotel Lisboa / Hotel Lisboa Plaza / Hotel Lisboa or similar\xa0\xa0\n\n\n\n\nPorto\n\n\nEurostars Heroismo / Premium Porto Downtown Hotel or similar\xa0\xa0\n\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ accommodation in Lisbon based on the hotel category selected or similar 3 Nights’ accommodation in Porto based on the hotel category selected or similar 1 Night accommodation in Lisbon based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis] Arrival & Departure Airport Transfer from Lisbon to hotel and back to Airport Train Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed] 2nd Class Train Ticket cost from Lisbon to Porto 2nd Class Train Ticket cost from Porto to Lisbon Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) Lisbon Hop On Hop Off (1 Day) Porto Hop-On Hop-Off Tour (1 Day) Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Note: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability Terms and Conditions: Travel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 September 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Best Of Portugal' package is a 7-day tour covering the historic and scenic cities of Porto and Lisbon. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the historic Ribeira district, the majestic Belém Tower, and the stunning Jerónimos Monastery. Participants will enjoy guided city tours, a scenic cruise along the Douro River, traditional Port wine tastings in historic cellars, and an authentic evening of soulful Fado music.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Lisbon\n\xa0\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at the Lisbon airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle.\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Zenit Lisboa or similar in Lisbon'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nHop On Hop Off Tour\n\xa0\nHop on Hop Off Tour: Explore Lisbon’s limitless compelling sights with the freedom of a hop-on hop-off bus tour, with an optional line to Cascais. Tickets are valid for 24 hours to grant you the most sightseeing flexibility. This tour offers four different lines to choose from (tickets valid for one, two, three or four lines) with stops at Lisbon’s memorable monuments, viewpoints and neighborhoods. You’ll get a lasting taste of Lisbon’s history and culture on any line, so grab a ticket and hop on', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Zenit Lisboa or similar in Lisbon'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nLisbon To Porto Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the Lisbon train station for your onward journey to Porto. (Duration approx. 3.5 hrs.)\nUpon your arrival at Porto train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Eurostars Heroismo or similar in\xa0Porto'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nPorto Hop On Hop Off Tour\n\xa0\nHop on Hop Off Tour: Explore the birthplace of port wine during an exciting hop-on hop-off Porto tour! With the bus tour tickets, you’re sure to experience a seamless, stress-free trip with a 24 hrs ticket. Get the transportation needs completely sorted out and all you need to do is to hop off the bus at the Porto attractions that pique your interest! With bus stops strategically located around the city, City Sightseeing Porto makes touring Porto both easy and fun. Just hop off to see the destinations you want to explore up close and then hop back on whenever you want, all you have to do is present your bus tour ticket! Remember, you can switch between bus routes whenever you like!', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Eurostars Heroismo or similar in\xa0Porto'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nDay Free At Leisure (Optional Activities)\n\xa0\nPorto Douro Valley Full-Day Wine Tasting & River Cruise with Lunch (Optional Tour 1): Douro Valley is known for being an excellent wine producing region, and on this tour, you’ll sample delicious wines, and visit Douro Valley’s highlights in a day. Take the stress out of booking your own transport by having Porto hotel pickup and drop-off included. After a convenient transfer to Douro Valley, you’ll taste wines at historic vineyards and wine estates, sample olive oil, go on a river cruise, and see spectacular viewpoints throughout the day. When you’ve worked up an appetite, a traditional Portuguese lunch is provided.\n\xa0\nThe Best Douro Boat Tour (Optional Tour 2): A major river on the Iberian Peninsula, the Douro River (Rio Douro) flows from Duruelo de la Sierra in northern Spain all the way to Porto in Portugal, where it empties into the Atlantic Ocean. More than just the region’s lifeline, it’s also the centrepiece of the Douro Valley, Portugal’s most famous wine region and a UNESCO World Heritage Site. Climb aboard our sailboat for a panoramic tour of Porto. Start the adventure in the Douro marina and discover the Ribeira and Cais de Gaia. You will pass slowly along the bank to enjoy the views. (Approx. 1.5 hrs)\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Any one optional tour needs to be selected from the given optional tours.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Eurostars Heroismo or similar in\xa0Porto'}, {'day': 6, 'description': "\xa0\nPorto To Lisbon By Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the Porto train station for your onward journey to Lisbon. (Duration approx. 3.5 hrs.)\nUpon your arrival at Lisbon train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nSkip the Line - Live Fado Show In Lisbon: 'Fado In Chiado' (Optional in free time): Fado in Chiado is a live Fado Show, an excellent way to discover culture and the city. Enjoy a 50 minutes performance featuring two singers and two guitarists. Experience this passion in a show that expresses the soul of Lisbon.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Zenit Lisboa or similar in Lisbon'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Lisbon\nTransfers: From Lisbon hotel to airport you will have private transfer.\n\xa0\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nStandard category\n\n\n\nMadrid\n\nPetit Palace Cliper Gran Via / Petit Palace Tres Cruces / Hotel Los Condes / Petit Palace Chueca / Hotel Madrid Centro, Affiliated by Melia or similar\n\n\n\n\nSeville\n\n\nHotel Derby Sevilla / Las Casas De Los Mercaderes By Silken / Eurostars Regina / H10 Corregidor Boutique Hotel or similar\n\n\n\nBarcelona\n\nHotel Viladomat By Silken / Catalonia Roma / Leonardo Hotel Barcelona Gran Via / Continental Palacete or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n', '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity\n\n\nValue category\n\n\n\n\nLisbon\n\n\nZenit Lisboa / Vip Executive Saldanha / BE Hotel Lisboa / Hotel Lisboa Plaza / Hotel Lisboa or similar\xa0\xa0\n\n\n\n\nPorto\n\n\nEurostars Heroismo / Premium Porto Downtown Hotel or similar\xa0\xa0\n\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'0': '\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nStandard category\n\n\n\nMadrid\n\nPetit Palace Cliper Gran Via / Petit Palace Tres Cruces / Hotel Los Condes / Petit Palace Chueca / Hotel Madrid Centro, Affiliated by Melia or similar\n\n\n\n\nSeville\n\n\nHotel Derby Sevilla / Las Casas De Los Mercaderes By Silken / Eurostars Regina / H10 Corregidor Boutique Hotel or similar\n\n\n\nBarcelona\n\nHotel Viladomat By Silken / Catalonia Roma / Leonardo Hotel Barcelona Gran Via / Continental Palacete or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n', '1': '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity\n\n\nValue category\n\n\n\n\nLisbon\n\n\nZenit Lisboa / Vip Executive Saldanha / BE Hotel Lisboa / Hotel Lisboa Plaza / Hotel Lisboa or similar\xa0\xa0\n\n\n\n\nPorto\n\n\nEurostars Heroismo / Premium Porto Downtown Hotel or similar\xa0\xa0\n\n\n\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'PT', 'countryName': 'Portugal', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Value'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Value', 'price': 127500.0, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity\n\n\nValue category\n\n\n\n\nLisbon\n\n\nZenit Lisboa / Vip Executive Saldanha / BE Hotel Lisboa / Hotel Lisboa Plaza / Hotel Lisboa or similar\xa0\xa0\n\n\n\n\nPorto\n\n\nEurostars Heroismo / Premium Porto Downtown Hotel or similar\xa0\xa0\n\n\n\n']}], 'meals': ['Breakfast Included'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary', 'Transportation:\xa0[Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis]\n\nArrival & Departure Airport Transfer from Lisbon to hotel and back to Airport\n\n\xa0\nTrain Tickets:\xa0[Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed]\n\n2nd Class Train Ticket cost from Lisbon to Porto\n2nd Class Train Ticket cost from Porto to Lisbon\n'], 'sightseeing': ['Sightseeing: (Tour starts from a city centre point, transportation to & from the hotel is not included)\n\nMadrid Highlights + Royal Palace Skip the Line Guided Tour on shared basis\nSeville Hop on Hop Off (24 Hrs) Ticket\nBarcelona Hop on Hop Off (24 Hrs) Ticket\n', 'Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point)\n\nLisbon Hop On Hop Off (1 Day)\nPorto Hop-On Hop-Off Tour (1 Day)\n\n\xa0'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': 'Accommodation:\n\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Lisbon based on the hotel category selected or similar\n3 Nights’ accommodation in Porto based on the hotel category selected or similar\n1 Night accommodation in Lisbon based on the hotel category selected or similar\n\n\xa0\nMeals:\n\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n\n\xa0\nTransportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis]\n\nArrival & Departure Airport Transfer from Lisbon to hote