otel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014524/Lisbon_1.jpeg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014524/itinerary/Lisbon7532.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014524/itinerary/Lisbon3.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014524/itinerary/Porto7534.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014524/itinerary/Porto7536.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014524/itinerary/Porto_WineCeller.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014524/itinerary/Lisbon7533.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014524/itinerary/Lisbon7534.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015079', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015079', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Finnish Lapland', 'days': 5, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Saariselka', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Igloo Stay', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rovaniemi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rovaniemi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rovaniemi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG012446_0_20240410184106.pdf', 'price': 360206, 'packageSummary': "The 'Finnish Lapland' package is a 5-day tour covering Rovaniemi and Saariselka, including a unique Igloo Stay. The itinerary includes visits to the famous Santa Claus Village, thrilling husky and reindeer safaris, and exciting excursions to witness the magical Northern Lights. Participants will enjoy guided Arctic wilderness tours, traditional Lappish dining, and the unforgettable experience of sleeping under the stars in a glass igloo.", 'images': ['Saariselka00.jpg', 'IGLOOSATY09887.jpg', 'Rovaniemi098.jpg', 'Rovaniemi.avif', 'Rovaniemi453.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 360206, 'thumbnailImage': 'Finland-Rovaniemi.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015079 is named 'Finnish Lapland' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Saariselka, Meals: NA, Description: Arrive Ivalo Transfers: Upon your arrival at the Ivalo Airport, you will meet the representative and then be transferred to the Saariselka hotel in a private vehicle. Saariselka Northern lights chase with reindeer sledding Tour: Experience a magical Northern Lights chase in Lapland. Ride a reindeer sleigh through quiet, snowy forests as you search for the auroras. Enjoy the peaceful night safari and the beauty of the Arctic wilderness. Special Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15:00 hrs. or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Igloo Stay, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Snowmobiling & Overnight In Glass Igloo Snowmobiling Experience: Ride a snowmobile through Lapland’s Forest trails and enjoy stunning winter scenery. Stop along the way to admire snowy landscapes while the expert guide provides safety tips and driving instructions for a safe, fun adventure. Overnight in Glass Igloo: Later you will be transferred to an amazing experience of sleeping in a glass igloo. Sleep under the stars in the accommodation of your dreams. Indulge in the cozy warmth while enjoying the sensational views of the glass igloos., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Rovaniemi, Meals: NA, Description: Saariselka To Rovaniemi By Car Transfers: You will be transferred from Saariselka to Rovaniemi by car on private basis. Rovaniemi Northern lights chase by minivan Tour: Enjoy a Northern Lights chase by minivan with an expert local guide. Travel away from city lights into Lapland’s wilderness in search of auroras, with convenient pickup and drop off from your accommodation., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Rovaniemi, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Visit Santa Village Visit Santa village: Enjoy a small group visit with Santa Claus! Meet Santa, share your wishes, and visit his Post Office where elves work year round. Send postcards, cross the Arctic Circle, and capture memorable photos and videos. Special Note: Husky Safari (Optional) @ EUR 210., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Rovaniemi, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Transfers: You will be transferred from Rovaniemi hotel to the Airport on private transfer. Special Notes: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 360206.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nValue Category\n\n\n\n\nSaariselka\n\n\nStar Arctic or similar\n\n\n\n\nIgloo Stay\n\n\nKakslauttanen resort, small glass igloo or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Pohjanhovi or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0, Overnight stay at the Hotels, \xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nHelsinki\n\n\nHotel Haaga Central Park / Hotel Anna / Hotel Arthur / Scandic Kallio or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Grand Marina /\xa0 Scandic Meilahti\xa0 / Scandic Marski / Valo Hotel Helsinki \xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0. Meals include: \n1 dinner included at Northern Lights Village Saariselka Resort\n5 lunches included (days 2, 3, 4, 5 and 6 of the program)\n, \nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n. Inclusions: Accommodation: 1 Nights’ accommodation in Saariselka based on the hotel category selected or similar 1 Night’ accommodation in Igloo Stay based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Rovaniemi based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Dinner as a part of Igloo Stay Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point-to-Point Basis] Arrival Transfers from Ivalo Airport to the Saariselka Hotel Private transfer from Saariselka to Rovaniemi by car Departure transfers from Rovaniemi hotel to the Airport Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) Saariselka Northern lights chase with reindeer sledding Tour Snowmobiling Experience Rovaniemi Northern lights chase by minivan Tour Visit Santa village Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees 