ours, traditional Lappish dining, and the unforgettable experience of sleeping under the stars in a glass igloo.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Ivalo\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at the Ivalo Airport, you will meet the representative and then be transferred to the Saariselka hotel in a private vehicle.\nSaariselka Northern lights chase with reindeer sledding Tour: Experience a magical Northern Lights chase in Lapland. Ride a reindeer sleigh through quiet, snowy forests as you search for the auroras. Enjoy the peaceful night safari and the beauty of the Arctic wilderness.\nSpecial Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15:00 hrs. or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only.', 'mealDescription': 'NA', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Star Arctic or similar in Saariselka'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nSnowmobiling & Overnight In Glass Igloo\nSnowmobiling Experience: Ride a snowmobile through Lapland’s Forest trails and enjoy stunning winter scenery. Stop along the way to admire snowy landscapes while the expert guide provides safety tips and driving instructions for a safe, fun adventure.\nOvernight in Glass Igloo: Later you will be transferred to an amazing experience of sleeping in a glass igloo. Sleep under the stars in the accommodation of your dreams. Indulge in the cozy warmth while enjoying the sensational views of the glass igloos.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Kakslauttanen resort /small glass igloo or similar in Igloo Stay'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nSaariselka To Rovaniemi By Car\nTransfers: You will be transferred from Saariselka to Rovaniemi by car on private basis.\nRovaniemi Northern lights chase by minivan Tour: Enjoy a Northern Lights chase by minivan with an expert local guide. Travel away from city lights into Lapland’s wilderness in search of auroras, with convenient pickup an