', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Nagpur', 'cityCode': 'NAG', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Truly Turkiye - SIC Tour' is a 9-day journey covering the historic and scenic destinations of Istanbul, Cappadocia, Kusadasi, and Antalya. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the Hagia Sophia, the ancient ruins of Ephesus, the breathtaking fairy chimneys, and the picturesque old town of Antalya. Participants will enjoy guided city tours, a scenic Bosphorus cruise, exploration of underground cities, and the opportunity to experience Turkey's rich cultural heritage and stunning coastal views.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': 'Arrival into Istanbul\nTransfers: Upon arrival you will be met the representative & transferred to the hotel on private basis.\nSpecial Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\nOptional Activity: Bosphorus Dinner Cruise\nEnjoy an enchanting evening on the Bosphorus Strait with a leisurely dinner cruise that showcases Istanbul’s beauty by night. Sail between Europe and Asia as you pass iconic landmarks such as the Bosphorus Bridge, Dolmabahçe Palace, and the illuminated waterfront mansions. The experience is complemented by a delicious Turkish dinner and live entertainment, often including traditional music and folk dance performances, making it a memorable blend of scenic views, culture, and cuisine. [The supplement cost for this activity will be approx. US$ 80/- per adult & US$ 55/- for children below 6 years]', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Four Side Lions Taksim\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hilton Double Tree Piyalepasa\xa0(Premium) or similar in\xa0Istanbul'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nFull-Day Guided Tour Of Istanbul On Shared Basis (SIC)\nIstanbul City Tour : Between 07:30 and 09:00 hrs, you will be picked up from your hotel (pickup time subject to hotel location) for a full day guided city tour. The tour includes visits to the Hagia Sophia Mosque (entrance not included), the pride of Byzantine architecture; the Byzantine Hippodrome, once the venue for ancient chariot races; and the Blue Mosque, renowned for its exquisite blue Iznik tiles. You will also visit the Topkapi Palace (entrance not included), the former residence of the Ottoman Sultans, followed by time at the Grand Bazaar, Turkey’s largest covered market with over 4,000 shops.\nLunch will be served at a local restaurant, after which you will be transferred back to your hotel.\nSpecial Notes:\nSightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\nEntrance to the Hagia Sophia Mosque and Topkapi Palace is available at an additional supplement.\nSupplement costs:\nHagia Sophia: US$ 35 - 40/- Per adult (*Under 8 years Free)\xa0 \xa0\nTopkapi Palace US$ 65/- Per adult (*Under 6 years Free)\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Local Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Four Side Lions Taksim\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hilton Double Tree Piyalepasa\xa0(Premium) or similar in\xa0Istanbul'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nIstanbul To Cappadocia\nTransfers:\n\nToday you will have a private transfer from the hotel to the Airport for onward flight\nUpon arrival at Cappadocia, there will be a private transfer from the airport to the Hotel.\n\nSpecial Notes:\n\nPlease note that the domestic flight from Istanbul to Cappadocia is not included in the tour cost and will be charged as an additional supplement.\nPlease note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Dedeli\xa0Cave\xa0\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hanedan\xa0Cave\xa0Suites\xa0(Premium)\xa0or similar in\xa0Cappadocia'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nExplore Cappadocia\xa0\nOptional Activity: Hot Air Balloon\nIf a hot air balloon ride is on your bucket list, Cappadocia offers one of the most iconic experiences in the world. Drift gently at sunrise above a surreal, lunar like landscape of volcanic rock formations, fairy chimneys, and honeycombed valleys, as dozens of vibrantly colored balloons rise alongside you. This unforgettable experience offers breathtaking panoramic views and spectacular photo opportunities. [The supplement cost for this activity will be upon “On Request Basis”]\nPlease Note:\xa0 Children below 6 years of age or under 120 cm in height are not permitted to participate in the hot air balloon ride.\nCappadocia Sightseeing: After breakfast, between 09:00 and 10:00 hrs, you will be picked up from your hotel to begin a full day tour of Cappadocia. The first stop is Devrent Valley (Imagination Valley), known for its spectacular fairy chimneys and uniquely shaped rock formations set amidst beautiful landscape.\nYou will then visit Pasabag (Monks Valley), famous for its remarkable double\xa0and triple headed rock formations, once used as hermit dwellings by monks. Lunch will be served in Avanos, a town renowned for its traditional pottery craftsmanship and located along the Red River (Kizilirmak).\nAfter lunch, continue to the Goreme Open Air Museum, the heart of Cappadocia, celebrated for its rock cut churches adorned with wall paintings dating back to the 10th century, depicting scenes from the life of Jesus and early Christian monastic life.\nThe tour concludes with a photo stop at Uchisar Castle, a natural rock citadel and one of the largest fairy chimney formations in the region, offering panoramic views of Cappadocia.\nSpecial Notes:\xa0\n\nSightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Local Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Dedeli\xa0Cave\xa0\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hanedan\xa0Cave\xa0Suites\xa0(Premium)\xa0or similar in\xa0Cappadocia'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nCappadocia To Izmir\nTransfers:\xa0\n1. Today you will have a private transfer from the hotel to the Airport for onward flight\n2. Upon arrival at Izmir, there will be a private transfer from the airport to the hotel in Kusadasi.\nSpecial Notes:\xa0\n1. Please note that the domestic flight from Cappadocia to Izmir is not included in the tour cost and will be charged as an additional supplement.\xa0\n2. Please note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Efe Boutique Hotel/ Karaaslan Inn hotel/ Ladies Beach or similar\n\xa0\n\xa0\n\xa0'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nFull Day Kusadasi Tour On Shared Basis (Sic)\n\xa0\nTransfers: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick-up for the same will be from selected central points\nFull Day Kusadasi Tour on SIC basis: Enjoy a full-day guided tour of Kusadasi, including a visit to the ancient city of Ephesus, one of the best-preserved archaeological sites in the Mediterranean and an exceptional showcase of the grandeur of Greco Roman civilization. Continue to the Temple of Artemis, once considered one of the Seven Wonders of the Ancient World.\nThe tour then takes you to the charming Sirince Village, known for its traditional architecture, local crafts, and scenic hillside atmosphere. Lunch will be served at a local restaurant. After the tour, you will be transferred back to your hotel.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast & Local Lunch as a part of the tour', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Efe Boutique Hotel/ Karaaslan Inn hotel/ Ladies Beach or similar\n\xa0'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nFull Day Pamukkale Tour On Shared Basis (Sic)\nTransfers: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick-up for the same will be from selected central points\nFull Day Pamukkale Tour on SIC basis: Enjoy a full-day guided tour of Pamukkale, including visits to the ancient city of Hierapolis and its remarkable landmarks. Explore the Domitian Gate, Latrina, Oil Factory, Agora, Byzantine Gate, Triton Fountain, and the Temple of Apollo, gaining insight into the region’s rich historical heritage.\nLunch will be served at a local restaurant.\nThe tour concludes with time to admire the spectacular Pamukkale travertines—the famous white terraces formed by mineral-rich thermal waters. Guests may enjoy a unique barefoot walk across these natural formations.\nAt the end of the tour, transfer to Antalya.', 'mealDescription': '\xa0Breakfast & Local Lunch as a part of the tour', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Best Western Khan/ Holiday Inn Lara Hotel or similar'}, {'day': 8, 'description': 'Full Day Antalya Tour On Shared Basis (Sic)\nTransfers: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick-up for the same will be from selected central points\nFull Day Antalya Tour with Kursunlu Waterfall on SIC basis: Enjoy a full-day tour of Antalya, including a visit to the Kursunlu Waterfall, followed by a guided exploration of Kaleiçi (Old Town). Key highlights include Hadrian’s Gate, Hidirlik Tower, Clock Tower, Fluted Minaret, and Palm Street. Lunch at a local restaurant is included.\nAfter the tour, you will be transferred back to your hotel.', 'mealDescription': '\xa0Breakfast & Local Lunch as a part of the tour', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Best Western Khan/ Holiday Inn Lara Hotel or similar'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Antalya\nTransfers: From Antalya hotel to Antalya Airport in a private transfer.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'NA'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nFour Sides Lion