\xa0Private Airport transfer from Cappadocia Hotel to Kayseri Airport\n\xa0Private Airport Transfer from Izmir Airport to Kusadasi Hotel\n\xa0Private Airport transfer from Kusadasi Hotel to Izmir Airport\n\xa0Private Airport Transfer from Antalya Airport to Antalya Hotel\n\xa0Private Airport transfer from Antalya Hotel to Antalya Airport\n\nSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n\n\xa0Full Day Guided Tour of Istanbul on sharing basis (SIC)\n\xa0Cappadocia Sightseeing Tour on sharing basis (SIC)\xa0\n\xa0Full Day Pamukkale Tour on sharing basis (SIC)\xa0\n\xa0Full Day Kusadasi Tour on sharing basis (SIC)\xa0\n\xa0Full Day Antalya Tour with Kursunlu Waterfall on sharing basis (SIC)\xa0\n\nInsurance:\n• Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included\xa0\nCity taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nCost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.\n\n\xa0\nBlackout Dates:\n\n\n\n\nHOLIDAY\n\n\nDATE\n\n\n\n\nNational Sovereignty and Children’s Day\xa0\n\n\n23-04-2026\n\n\n\n\nLabor and Solidarity Day\n\n\n01-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nCommemoration of Atatürk, Youth and Sports Day\n\n\n19-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nEid al-Adha 1st day\n\n\n27-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nEid al-Adha 2nd day\n\n\n28-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nEid al-Adha 3rd day\n\n\n29-04-2026\n\n\n\n\nEid al-Adha last day\n\n\n30-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nDemocracy and National Unity Day\n\n\n15-07-2026\n\n\n\n\nVictory Day\n\n\n30-08-2026\n\n\n\n\nRepublic Day\n\n\n29-10-2026\n\n\n\n', 'termsAndConditions': 'IMPORTANT NOTES:\nThe above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together.\nThe above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\nMaximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room.\nMidnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\nWIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed.\xa0\n(Supplement charges may apply for such services)\nStandard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs.\nMost hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned.\nAt this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability\nTERMS AND CONDITIONS:\nTravel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 September 2026\nBlack out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nMaximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\nSurcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking.\nTo proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour.\nShould the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014768/60842_Mevlana_Museum_in_Konya_Turkey_SRP.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014768/itinerary/Istanbul753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014768/itinerary/Istanbul.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014768/itinerary/Cappadocia7532.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014768/itinerary/Cappadocia7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014768/itinerary/Kusadasi_1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014768/itinerary/Pamukkale.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014768/itinerary/Antalya.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014768/itinerary/Antalya-Beach.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014768/itinerary/return-home.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015295', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015295', 'availableMonths': ['january_2027', 'december_2026'], 'packageName': 'Georgia - Xmas And New Year Special ', 'days': 5, 'cities': [], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG013001_0_20241007131222.pdf', 'price': 61880, 'packageSummary': "The 'Georgia - Xmas And New Year Special' package is a festive 5-day tour covering the scenic destinations of Tbilisi, Mtskheta, and Gudauri. The itinerary includes exploring the beautifully illuminated streets and Christmas markets of Tbilisi, visiting the historic UNESCO-listed Jvari Monastery in Mtskheta, and experiencing the winter wonderland of the Gudauri ski resort. Participants will enjoy guided sightseeing tours, scenic cable car rides to Narikala Fortress, traditional Georgian wine tastings, and various holiday-themed activities to celebrate the Christmas and New Year season in style.", 'images': [], 'minimumPrice': 61880, 'thumbnailImage': 'AlmatyCity.jpeg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015295 is named 'Georgia - Xmas And New Year Special ' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nThe price is 61880.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\nCity\n\xa0Hotel\n\n\nAlmaty (5N)\n\xa0Hotel Regardel or Kazakhstan or similar in Almaty\n\n\n, Overnight stay at the Hotels. Meals include: \nBreakfast\xa0:\xa0Buffet\xa0Breakfast\xa0will\xa0be\xa0offered\xa0at\xa0all\xa0the\xa0hotels.\xa0(\xa0Except\xa0Day\xa01).\xa0\nDinner : Indian Dinner\n, Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Return Airport transfers. 4 nights at Astoria Hotel or similar in Tbilisi. English speaking driver (for 2-6 PAX), English Speaking Guide (for 8-10 Pax) Guided city tour of Tbilisi with Narikala Cable Car. Full Day Excursion to Dashbashi Canyon & Diamond Bridge. Full Day Excursion to WIne Country. Full Day Excursion to Gaudari & Kazbegi. 2 Bottles of water per person per day. All transfers according to program including airport transfers: Sedan (for 2-3 PAX), Mercedes Viano or Vito (for 4-6 PAX), Mercedes Sprinter ( for 8-10 PAX) Travel Insurance (Valid till the age of 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST Visa charges Departure PCR test, if applicable All flights services Meals not mentioned in the itinerary Any tips (Around USD 05.00 per person / per day) - for guide & Driver. Any other sightseeing entrance fees except for the ones mentioned in the Inclusions Anything not mentioned in the inclusions Pre & Post tour services & cost Expenditure of personal nature (Such as the use of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & etc.) All drink and beverages Hotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel Tourism Tax (if applicable) Midnight surcharge The rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adults travelling together at all times. Product Validity : 20th December 2026 - 5th January 2027 SINGLE SUPPLEMENT - USD 357.00. Product Terms and Conditions: The prices will not be valid for any blackout date/ Stop sale period which is informed during confirmation of the booking; if any change in the price, the same will be applicable for all bookings and to be borne by the customer. Terms And Conditions: The package price is valid until 05th January 2027. The hotel upgrade prices are subject to availability at the time of booking. The hotel upgrade prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels. The upgrade hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking. For the upgrade hotel, in case the hotel chosen is unavailable, we will provide multiple options of similar category hotels. The rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adults travelling together at all times. The rates are not valid on block out dates. Surcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same Surcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking. Guests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Prices are not valid during Trade Fair periods. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have the right to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends. Offer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. TCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization. As a practice, all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check-in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as they will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions, and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'G