Domus Australia / Hotel Villa San Lorenzo Maria / Hotel Des Artistes / Hotel Nord Nuova Roma / Hotel Windrose or similar\n\n\n\n\nAmalfi / Sorrento\n\n\nHotel Fontana / Amalfi / Floridiana / Hotel La Pergola / Admiral Sorrento / Hotel La Meridiana or similar\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nAlbergo Firenze / Hotel Boccaccio / Hotel Paris / Hotel Machiavelli Palace / Hotel Luxor Florence or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice\n\n\nHotel Diana / Albergo San Marco / San Zulian / Hotel Montecarlo or similar\n\n\n\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'IT', 'countryName': 'Italy', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard', 'Value'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'price': 238800.0, 'hotels': ['\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nSTANDARD CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\nAndreotti Hotel and Domus Australia / Hotel Villa San Lorenzo Maria / Hotel Des Artistes / Hotel Nord Nuova Roma / Hotel Windrose or similar\n\n\n\n\nAmalfi / Sorrento\n\n\nHotel Fontana / Amalfi / Floridiana / Hotel La Pergola / Admiral Sorrento / Hotel La Meridiana or similar\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nAlbergo Firenze / Hotel Boccaccio / Hotel Paris / Hotel Machiavelli Palace / Hotel Luxor Florence or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice\n\n\nHotel Diana / Albergo San Marco / San Zulian / Hotel Montecarlo or similar\n\n\n\n']}, {'category': 'Value', 'price': 282500.0, 'hotels': ["\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\nBest Western Hotel Artdeco / Atlantico / Hotel Massimo D'azeglio / Hotel Diana Roof Garden / Best Western President or similar\n\n\n\n\nAmalfi / Sorrento\n\n\nLa Bussola / Grand Hotel Excelsior / Art Hotel Gran Paradiso / Michelangelo or Similar\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nAtlantic Palace / De La Ville / Embassy Hotel / Starhotels Michelangelo Florence / Hotel Principe di Firenze / C Hotel Club / C-hotels Ambassadors Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice\n\n\nRoyal San Marco Hotel / San Marco Palace / Hotel Kette / Bonvecchiati or similar or similar\n\n\n\n"]}], 'meals': ['Breakfast Included'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['Transportation:\xa0[Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis]\n\nArrival Airport Transfer from Rome Airport to Rome Hotel\nArrival Transfer from Naples Station to Hotel in Amalfi / Sorrento\nDeparture Transfer from Amalfi Hotel to Naples Train Station\nDeparture Airport Transfer from Venice City Center to Marco Polo VCE Airport (Water Taxi + Car)\n\n\xa0\nTrain Tickets:\xa0[Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed]\n\n2nd Class Train Ticket cost from Rome to Naples\n2nd Class Train Ticket cost from Naples to Florence\n2nd Class Train Ticket cost from Florence to Venice\n'], 'sightseeing': ['Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point)\n\nHop On Hop Off Bus tour in Rome\nPisa and the Leaning Tower Tour from Florence\xa0\xa0\nVenice Gondola Ride (30 Mins) and Serenade\xa0\nMurano, Burano and Torcello Half-Day Sightseeing Tour\xa0\xa0\nMilan City Sightseeing Hop on Hop Off (24 Hrs)\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': '<p>Return Economy Class Airfare</p>', 'inclusions': 'Accommodation:\n\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Rome based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Amalfi / Sorrento based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Florence based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Venice based on the hotel category selected or similar\n\n\xa0\nMeals:\n\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n\n\xa0\nTransportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis]\n\nArrival Airport Transfer from Rome Airport to Rome Hotel\nArrival Transfer from Naples Station to Hotel in Amalfi / Sorrento\nDeparture Transfer from Amalfi Hotel to Naples Train Station\nDeparture Airport Transfer from Venice City Center to Marco Polo VCE Airport (Water Taxi + Car)\n\n\xa0\nTrain Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed]\n\n2nd Class Train Ticket cost from Rome to Naples\n2nd Class Train Ticket cost from Naples to Florence\n2nd Class Train Ticket cost from Florence to Venice\n\n\xa0\nSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point)\n\nHop On Hop Off Bus tour in Rome\nPisa and the Leaning Tower Tour from Florence\xa0\xa0\nVenice Gondola Ride (30 Mins) and Serenade\xa0\nMurano, Burano and Torcello Half-Day Sightseeing Tour\xa0\xa0\nMilan City Sightseeing Hop on Hop Off (24 Hrs)\n\n\xa0\nInsurance:\n\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included in the price.\nCity taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.\n', 'termsAndConditions': '\xa0\nImportant Notes:\n\nThe above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together.\nThe above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\nMaximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room.\nMidnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\nWIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed.\xa0\n(Supplement charges may apply for such services)\nStandard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs.\nMost hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned.\nAt this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability.\n\n\xa0\nTerms & Conditions:\n\nTravel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 September 2026\nBlack out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nMaximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\nSurcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking.\nTo proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour.\nShould the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014526/Florence.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014526/itinerary/Rome753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014526/itinerary/Colosseum_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014526/itinerary/Naples_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014526/itinerary/033755_Amalfi_Coast_Sorrento_Italy_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014526/itinerary/2987_Florence_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014526/itinerary/LeaningTower.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014526/itinerary/62615_Venice_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014526/itinerary/71702_Venice_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014526/itinerary/StMarkVenice.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014542', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014542', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Highlights Of Spain', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Madrid', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Madrid', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Seville', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Seville', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Barcelona', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Barcelona', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Barcelona', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014542_0_20260918115911', 'price': 132532, 'packageSummary': "The 'Highlights Of Spain' package is a 7-day tour covering the vibrant cities of Barcelona, Seville, and Madrid. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the breathtaking Sagrada Familia, the historic Plaza de España, the majestic Royal Palace, and bustling local plazas. Participants will enjoy guided city tours, a traditional live flamenco show, and ample opportunities to explore the rich history, stunning architecture, and world-class culinary scenes of these three legendary Spanish destinations.", 'images': ['Madrid2.jpg', 'MadridRoyalPalace.jpg', 'seville1.jpg', 'Seville.jpg', 'Barcelona.jpg', 'BarcelonaSpain.jpg', 'AdobeStock_200457802_barcelona.jpeg'], 'minimumPrice': 132532, 'thumbnailImage': 'Seville.bmp', 'packageTheme': ['Adventure', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014542 is named 'Highlights Of Spain' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Madrid, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Madrid Transfers: Upon your arrival at the Madrid airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Madrid, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Madrid: Panoramic City Bus Tour Madrid Panoramic City Bus Tour: Route 1 (Blue) will take you to discover Historical Madrid. This circular route takes you through a complete historical, artistic, and monumental circuit featuring the city’s key landmarks. Travel along the beautiful tree-lined Paseo del Prado and admire the magnificent architectural treasures of the Habsburg royal legacy. Discover parts of Madrid’s Art Triangle and enjoy stunning views from the Royal Palace to the Temple of Debod. Route 2 (Green) will take you to discover Modern Madrid. Explore the city beyond its historical landmarks and royal monuments. From Atocha Station to Nuevos Ministerios, and from the iconic Puerta de Alcalá to Puerta del Sol. Admire the most contemporary architectural works in the capital, including the imposing KIO Towers, the modern sculptures of the Public Art Museum, and Real Madrid's Santiago Bernabéu Stadium. Discover Madrid’s vibrant life, art, and modern customs on this itinerary., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Seville, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Madrid To Seville By Train Transfer: Make your way to the Madrid train station for your onward journey to Seville. Upon arrival at Seville train station make your way to the hotel. Special Note: Please note cost of the ticket is included, however the same is subject to vary until ticketed. Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Seville, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Seville: Hop On Hop Off Hop on Hop off Tour: Later enjoy Seville Hop on Hop off sightseeing. This tour is operated by double decker buses you can make a route through more emblematic places of the city of Seville, with commentaries in 16 different languages, which make possible to know the history, culture and heritage of the city, which origin goes back to Old Age, that way this city is a cultures mixing . This service is valid for 24 (basic) or 48 hours (Experience) with a hop on / hop off system , so during this period you can get on and get off of the bus such times as you want in any bus stop. The ticket can be purchase as in the bus as in any of two main bus stop, furthermore in any official sales point. Multilingual Audio System: 16 languages. Panoramic route on double decker buses with 14 stops at the most important locations of the city: Paseo Colon, Plaza de Espana, 1929 Exhibition, Triana-San Jacinto, Triana-Castilla, 1992 Universal Exhibition, Isla Magica, Macarena, Torre de los Perdigones, Alameda de Hercules, Plaza del Duque, Plaza de Armas, plaza de Cuba y Acuario de Sevilla. Hop on , hop off. Individual headsets. Free Entrance: El Salvador Church, Museo de Carruajes, Pabellon de la Navegacion, Casa de la Ciencia, Torre de los Perdigones, Iglesia de Santa Ana and Hospital de la Caridad., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Barcelona, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Seville To Barcelona Via Train Transfers: Make your way to the Seville train station for your onward journey to Valencia. Upon your arrival at Barcelona train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. Special Note: Please note cost of the ticket is included, however the same is subject to vary until ticketed. Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Barcelona, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Barcelona: Hop On Hop Off Hop on Hop off Tour: Hop aboard the Barcelona Bus Turístic, and discover the best of the city aboard a panoramic double-decker bus. Not only can you hop on and off as you wish, but you have the freedom to explore the beautiful city of Barcelona at your own leisure. Highlights - See the most iconic landmarks of the city - Hop on and off as you wish at conveniently located route stops - Learn about the city with a fascinating audioguide available in 16 languages The Barcelona Bus Turístic is the city’s official sightseeing hop-on, hop-off tour. The red route and the blue route take approximately two hours to complete. Others Both routes depart between 9 am and 9:30 am from any stop. The last departures leave at 7pm during the winter months and 8pm in summer. Depending on the season, the bus frequency varies, between 5 and 25 minutes., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Barcelona, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Barcelona Transfers: You will have a private transfer from Barcelona hotel to the airport. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 132532.0. Hotels envisaged include: \xa0\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nSTANDARD CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nMadrid\n\n\nPetit Palace Cliper Gran Via / Petit Palace Tres Cruces / Hotel Los Condes / Petit Palace Chueca / Hotel Madrid Centro, Affiliated by Melia or similar\n\n\n\n\nSeville\n\n\nHotel Derby Sevilla / Las Casas De Los Mercaderes By Silken / Eurostars Regina / H10 Corregidor Boutique Hotel or similar \n\n\n\n\nBarcelona\n\n\nHotel Viladomat By Silken / Catalonia Roma / Leonardo Hotel Barcelona Gran Via / Continental Palacete or similar\xa0 \n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nMadrid\n\n\nEurostars Casa De La Lirica / Hotel Madrid Plaza De Espana Affiliated By Melia /Petit Palace Plaza Espana / Catalonia Gran Via or similar \n\n\n\n\nSeville\n\n\nNH Sevilla Plaza de Armas / Catalonia Giralda / Hotel Las Casas de la Judería or similar\n\n\n\n\nBarcelona\n\n\nExe Cristal Palace / Catalonia Diagonal Centro / Zenit Borell / Catalonia Eixample 1864 / Catalonia Gran Via Bcn or similar\n\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ accommodation in Madrid based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Seville based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Barcelona based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis] Arrival Airport Transfer from Madrid Airport to Madrid Hotel Departure Airport transfer from Barcelona Hotel to Barcelona Airport Train Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed] 2nd Class Train Ticket cost from Madrid to Seville (Subject to availability until ticketed) 2nd Class Train Ticket cost from Seville to Barcelona (Subject to availability until ticketed) Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) Madrid Panoramic City Tour Seville Hop on Hop Off (24 Hrs) Ticket Barcelona Hop on Hop Off (24 Hrs) Ticket Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Note: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability Terms and Conditions: Travel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 September 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItine