 Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability Terms and Conditions: Travel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 September 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'London Paris Delights' package is a 7-day tour covering the spectacular cities of London and Paris. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the Eiffel Tower, the Louvre Museum, Buckingham Palace, and the Tower of London. Participants will enjoy guided city sightseeing tours, a scenic cruise along the River Seine, a ride on the London Eye, and a memorable journey connecting these two historic European capitals.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive London\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0Upon your arrival at the airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle.\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0Check in will be as per the standard timings of 14:00 - 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\n\xa0\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ibis Earls Court (Standard) / Park Plaza (Value) or similar in London\n\xa0'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nHop On Hop Off Tour - Madame Tussauds - London Eye - Tower Of London\n\xa0\nHop on Hop Off Tour:\xa0The London Hop-On Hop-Off Bus Tour is a flexible sightseeing experience that lets you explore the city’s most iconic landmarks at your own pace with multiple routes and stops near attractions.\n\xa0\nMadame Tussauds With Marvel 4d Cinema and Star Wars Experience:\xa0Step into the world of fame and fantasy at Madame Tussauds London. Get up close with lifelike wax figures of celebrities, historical icons, and world leaders. Enjoy the thrilling Marvel 4D Cinema, where superheroes come alive in an immersive experience, and explore the Star Wars Experience, featuring iconic characters and scenes from the legendary saga. It’s an unforgettable mix of glamour, action, and adventure for all ages.\n\xa0\nLondon Eye – Ticket:\xa0The London Eye is one of the city’s most iconic attractions, offering breathtaking 360° views of London’s skyline from a giant observation wheel on the South Bank of the River Thames. Standing at 135 meters tall, it provides a unique perspective of landmarks like Big Ben, Buckingham Palace, and St. Paul’s Cathedral. A must-visit for stunning photo opportunities and an unforgettable experience.\n\xa0\nTower of London:\xa0The Tower of London is a historic fortress on the north bank of the River Thames, famous for its rich history as a royal palace, prison, and treasury. Home to the dazzling Crown Jewels and centuries of intrigue, it offers visitors a glimpse into Britain’s royal past, iconic Yeoman Warders, and legendary tales like that of the ravens. A must-see UNESCO World Heritage Site for history lovers.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ibis Earls Court (Standard) / Park Plaza (Value) or similar in London'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nLondon Day At Leisure (Optional Activity)\n\xa0\nWarner Bros. Studio Tour London (Optional):\xa0Visiting fabled Harry Potter filming locations from London typically involves juggling a lot of logistics—especially for families with children. Take the stress out of planning during this full-day tour to Warner Bros. Studios. Travel by climate-controlled coach from central London. Visit original sets and uncover behind-the-scenes secrets, with air-conditioned transportation from central London. This Harry Potter studio London tour includes round-trip coach transport and entrance tickets. Read more about - Harry Potter Warner Bros. Studio Tour with Transport from London.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ibis Earls Court (Standard) / Park Plaza (Value) or similar in London'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nLondon To Paris Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Paris.\nUpon your arrival at Paris train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\n\xa0\nMoulin Rouge Show (Optional):\xa0Experience the world-famous Moulin Rouge in Paris, an iconic cabaret known for its dazzling performances, vibrant costumes, and spectacular dance routines, including the legendary French Cancan. Located in the heart of Montmartre, this unforgettable show combines music, glamour, and artistry, offering a true taste of Parisian nightlife.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Opera Lafayette (Standard) / Mercure Paris Opera Faubourg Montmartre (Value) or similar in Paris'}, {'day': 5, 'description': "\xa0\nParis City Tour + River Seine Cruise + Eiffel Tower Tour\n\xa0\nParis City Tour:\xa0Later discover Paris's most famous tourist sites and monuments on one unique tour. This tour features a visit to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower with breathtaking views of the capital, a panoramic city tour by coach, plus an hour-long boat trip along the River Seine. This comprehensive tour is the ideal way to discover Paris for the first time.\xa0\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0Thanks to your priority access, you can skip the line and speed up by elevator to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower, Paris's most unmissable monument.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Opera Lafayette (Standard) / Mercure Paris Opera Faubourg Montmartre (Value) or similar in Paris'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nParis Day At Leisure (Optional Activity)\n\xa0\nDisneyland® Paris: 1 Day 2 Parks (Optional):\xa0Experience the magic of Disneyland Paris, Europe’s most enchanting theme park destination. Located just outside Paris, the resort features two incredible parks: Disneyland Park, where fairy tales come to life with iconic attractions like Sleeping Beauty’s Castle, and Walt Disney Studios Park, offering behind-the-scenes movie magic. Enjoy thrilling rides, spectacular parades, and meet your favourite Disney characters. Disneyland Paris is perfect for families, friends, and Disney fans of all ages.\n\xa0\nOR\n\xa0\nThe Palace of Versailles – A Royal Journey (Optional):\xa0Experience the grandeur of Versailles in true royal fashion. Accompanied by a knowledgeable guide, explore a curated selection of the palace’s 700 opulent rooms, and uncover fascinating stories of Louis XIV – the Sun King, his successors, queens, mistresses, and courtiers including Marie Antoinette. Once a humble hunting lodge, Versailles became the dazzling seat of the French court in the 17th and 18th centuries. Even today, its splendour and historical richness remain unmatched.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Opera Lafayette (Standard) / Mercure Paris Opera Faubourg Montmartre (Value) or similar in Paris'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Paris\nTransfers: From Paris hotel to the Airport in Private transfer.\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight.\n\xa0\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valu