n/images/holidays/PKG014532/itinerary/LondonEye.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014532/itinerary/Paris_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014532/itinerary/EiffelTower_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014532/itinerary/Paris_City_new753.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014532/itinerary/29117_Paris_View_France_753.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014950', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014950', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Swiss With Paris - Private Journeys (Winter)', 'days': 8, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Zurich', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014950_0_20260910120614.pdf', 'price': 491388, 'packageSummary': "The 'Swiss With Paris - Private Journeys (Winter)' package is an 8-day tour covering Paris, Zurich, and Central and Southern Switzerland. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the Eiffel Tower, the Louvre Museum, and the historic Old Town of Zurich. Participants will enjoy breathtaking excursions into the snow-capped Swiss Alps, scenic train journeys through stunning winter landscapes, a romantic cruise along the River Seine, and ample opportunities to experience the magical winter charm of these iconic European destinations.", 'images': ['9063_Lucerne_Switzerland_753.jpg', '89366_Mt._Titlis_Engelberg_Switzerland_753.jpg', 'JungfraujochSwitzerland.jpg', '84462_Zurich_lake_Zurich_Switzerland_753.jpg', 'arcdetriumphateveningfrance76115509.jpg', 'VersaillesPalace_new_753.jpg', 'Paris_City_new753.jpeg', 'Paris_new_753.jpeg'], 'minimumPrice': 491388, 'thumbnailImage': 'Interlaken2678.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Private Journeys'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014950 is named 'Swiss With Paris - Private Journeys (Winter)' and spans 8 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Zurich Transfers: Upon your arrival at Zurich International Airport, you will have a private transfer to the hotel in Central Switzerland. Special Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion Point to Point Airport transfer from Zurich Airport to The Hotel, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Excursion to Mt. Titlis Excursion to Mt. Titlis: Discover Mt. Titlis from 3,020 m! Ride the Rotair cable car and admire glaciers, deep crevasses and ice boulders. Enjoy a high alpine panorama, the Ice Grotto, IceFlyer, FunLift and Europe’s highest Cliff Walk. Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Excursion To Jungfraujoch Mountain Jungfraujoch Excursion: Experience the unforgettable Jungfraujoch “Top of Europe” excursion. Travel from Interlaken to Grindelwald, then ride the cogwheel train via Kleine Scheidegg to the summit, enjoying spectacular views of the Eiger, Monch, and Jungfrau peaks along the way. Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Zurich, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Central Switzerland To Zurich : Lindt Home Of Chocolate Transfer: Travel from Central / Southern Switzerland to Zurich on private basis. Visit Lindt Home of Chocolate: Enjoy free time at the Lindt Home of Chocolate in Kilchberg near Lake Zurich. Explore interactive chocolate worlds, learn cocoa’s story, taste Swiss chocolate, see modern production, shop at the world’s largest Lindt store, and relax by the 9 m chocolate fountain. Orientation Tour of Zurich City: Discover Zurich’s highlights on an orientation tour. Walk Bahnhofstrasse, visit Lindenhof, City Hall and St. Peter’s Church, then explore Niederdorf’s Old Town alleys with the Fraumunster and Grossmunster churches. Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs. Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Zurich To Paris Transfer: Travel from Zurich to Paris on private basis. {Travel time of approx. 7 – 8 hrs. depending on traffic and stops in between cities} Moulin Rouge Show (Optional): Experience the world-famous Moulin Rouge in Paris, an iconic cabaret known for its dazzling performances, vibrant costumes, and spectacular dance routines, including the legendary French Cancan. Located in the heart of Montmartre, this unforgettable show combines music, glamour, and artistry, offering a true taste of Parisian nightlife. Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs. Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Visit To Versailles + Seine River Cruise & Effiel Tower 2nd Level Entrance Visit To Versailles + Seine River Cruise & Effiel Tower 2nd Level Entrance: Drive to Versailles with an introduction to the Sun King, then visit the grand Palace of French kings. On return, enjoy a panoramic Paris tour past major landmarks, plus a Seine cruise and Eiffel Tower 2nd floor visit. Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs. Please note Versailles Palace is closed on Tuesday, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Disneyland 1 Day 1 Park Disneyland 1 Day 1 Park: Enjoy a stress free private luxury transfer from your Paris hotel to Disneyland® Paris. Travel at your preferred time, enjoy a full day of fun with a 1 Day 1 Park ticket included, then return comfortably to your hotel in the evening., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Paris Transfers: From Paris hotel to the Airport in private transfer. Special Note: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime. STANDARD Travel Validity from 1 JULY – 31 OCTOBER 2026 NOTE: ADULT & CHILD COSTING WILL BE THE SAME FOR PRIVATE JOURNEYS Package Cost on 3* (Standard) Hotels: Based on Per Person Per Slab Starting From 8 – 9 Guests 10 – 11 Guests 12 Guests € 2,925 + INR 2250 € 2,640 + INR 2250 € 2,520 + INR 2250 VALUE Travel Validity from 1 JULY – 31 OCTOBER 2026 NOTE: ADULT & CHILD COSTING WILL BE THE SAME FOR PRIVATE JOURNEYS Package Cost on 4* (Value) Hotels: Based on Per Person Per Slab Starting From 8 – 9 Guests 10 – 11 Guests 12 Guests € 3,330 + INR 2250 € 3,120 + INR 2250 € 2,990 + INR 2250, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 491388.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4*\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nMetropole Swiss Quality / Interlaken Hotel/ Krebs / Romantik Hotel Wilden Mann /Hotel Continental-Park/ Grand Hotel Europe or similar\n\n\n\n\nZurich \n\n\nNovotel Zurich City West / Hotel Glockenhof or similar\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nNovotel Paris 17 / BEST WESTERN Mercedes Arc de 