.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs.\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Alpina\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Metropole Swiss Quality\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nCentral Switzerland\xa0To Zurich : Lindt Home Of Chocolate\n\xa0\nTransfer: Travel from Central / Southern Switzerland to Zurich on private basis.\n\xa0\nVisit Lindt Home of Chocolate: Enjoy free time at the Lindt Home of Chocolate in Kilchberg near Lake Zurich. Explore interactive chocolate worlds, learn cocoa’s story, taste Swiss chocolate, see modern production, shop at the world’s largest Lindt store, and relax by the 9 m chocolate fountain.\n\xa0\nOrientation Tour of Zurich City: Discover Zurich’s highlights on an orientation tour. Walk Bahnhofstrasse, visit Lindenhof, City Hall and St. Peter’s Church, then explore Niederdorf’s Old Town alleys with the Fraumunster and Grossmunster churches.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nVehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs.\nPlease note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Ibis Zurich City West (Standard) /\xa0Novotel Zurich City West (Value) or similar in Zurich'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nZurich To Paris\n\xa0\nTransfer: Travel from Zurich to Paris on private basis.\xa0\n{Travel time of approx. 7 – 8 hrs. depending on traffic and stops in between cities}\n\xa0\nMoulin Rouge Show (Optional): Experience the world-famous Moulin Rouge in Paris, an iconic cabaret known for its dazzling performances, vibrant costumes, and spectacular dance routines, including the legendary French Cancan. Located in the heart of Montmartre, this unforgettable show combines music, glamour, and artistry, offering a true taste of Parisian nightlife.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nVehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs.\nPlease note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Bellevue Paris Montmartre (Standard) /\xa0Novotel Paris 17 (Value) or similar in Paris'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nVisit To Versailles + Seine River Cruise & Effiel Tower 2nd Level Entrance\n\xa0\nVisit To Versailles + Seine River Cruise & Effiel Tower 2nd Level Entrance: Drive to Versailles with an introduction to the Sun King, then visit the grand Palace of French kings. On return, enjoy a panoramic Paris tour past major landmarks, plus a Seine cruise and Eiffel Tower 2nd floor visit.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nVehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs.\nPlease note Versailles Palace is closed on Tuesday\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast\n\xa0', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Bellevue Paris Montmartre (Standard) /\xa0Novotel Paris 17 (Value) or similar in Paris'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nDisneyland 1 Day 1 Park\nDisneyland 1 Day 1 Park: Enjoy a stress free private luxury transfer from your Paris hotel to Disneyland® Paris. Travel at your preferred time, enjoy a full day of fun with a 1 Day 1 Park ticket included, then return comfortably to your hotel in the evening.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Bellevue Paris Montmartre (Standard) /\xa0Novotel Paris 17 (Value) or similar in Paris'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Paris\nTransfers: From Paris hotel to the Airport in private transfer.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight.\n\xa0\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.\n\xa0\nSTANDARD\n\n\n\n\nTravel Validity from 1 JULY – 31 OCTOBER 2026\n\n\n\n\nNOTE: ADULT & CHILD COSTING WILL BE THE SAME FOR PRIVATE JOURNEYS\nPackage Cost on 3* (Standard) Hotels: Based on Per Person Pe