antik Hotel Wilden Mann /Hotel Continental-Park/ Grand Hotel Europe or similar\n\n\n\n\nZurich \n\n\nNovotel Zurich City West / Hotel Glockenhof or similar\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nNovotel Paris 17 / BEST WESTERN Mercedes Arc de Triomphe / Mercure Paris Bastille Marais / Villa Royale (4*). Mercure Paris Montmarte in Paris / Novotel Paris Centre Tour Eiffel Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n']}], 'meals': ['Breakfast Included'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['Sightseeing: [Tour timing will have to be decided at the time of booking]\n\nLucerne panoramic drive through of the city\nMt. Titlis tickets\nDay trip to Mt. Jungfrau\nReturn tickets to Jungfrau from Grindelwald\nEnroute visit Lindt Home of Chocolate Tickets\xa0\nZurich panoramic drive through of the city\nHalf day trip to Versailles - entrance ticket\nSeine river cruise ticket\n2nd Class Eiffel Tower Tickets - subject to availability.\xa0\nDisneyland 1 Day 1 Park - entrance ticket\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': 'Accommodation:\n\n3 Nights’ accommodation in Central / Southern Switzerland based on the hotel category selected or similar\n1 Night accommodation in Zurich based on the hotel category selected or similar\n3 Nights’ accommodation in Paris based on the hotel category selected or similar\n\n\xa0\nMeals:\n\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n\n\xa0\nTransfers: [Includes Point to Point Transfer with limited waiting hours]\n\nArrival Transfer from Zurich Airport to Central / Southern Swiss Hotel on private basis\nInterhotel transfer from Zurich Hotel to Paris Hotel\nDeparture transfer from Paris Hotel to Paris Airport\nVehicle at disposal for 10 hrs. as mentioned in the itinerary\n\n\xa0\nSightseeing: [Tour timing will have to be decided at the time of booking]\n\nLucerne panoramic drive through of the city\nMt. Titlis tickets\nDay trip to Mt. Jungfrau\nReturn tickets to Jungfrau from Grindelwald\nEnroute visit Lindt Home of Chocolate Tickets\xa0\nZurich panoramic drive through of the city\nHalf day trip to Versailles - entrance ticket\nSeine river cruise ticket\n2nd Class Eiffel Tower Tickets - subject to availability.\xa0\nDisneyland 1 Day 1 Park - entrance ticket\n\n\xa0\nInsurance:\n\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nMeals other than those specified (if any).\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 5/ CHF 5 per person per day is not included in the price.\nCity taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nCost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head\n', 'termsAndConditions': 'GENERAL NOTES:\n\nQuote for 2 guests is based on standard car like Toyota Prius or similar,\xa0\nQuote for 4 – 8 guests is based on Van like VW/Opel/Vito or similar,\xa0\nQuote from 10 guests it will be 14/16/19-seater vehicle or similar.\xa0\nIf the guests exceed the seating capacity of the vehicle, then the rate will change based on a real-time basis as it will fall under coach packages\xa0\nFor 2 to 6 guests, Vehicle is with driver cum guide. No separate guide\nIf there are 5A + 3C or 6A + 2C or 4A + 4C etc. or similar, then we will have to check rates on real time basis.\nBlocking must be done a minimum 45 days prior to travel date with re-confirmation before 30 - 25 days of travel date unless there is an event then the booking has to be made on an immediate basis and the rate will be based on real-time availability\nIf the travel date is during any festival, Sporting / Cultural / State or Government Event, Exhibition, Trade fairs etc. then the rate will change based on a real-time basis.\n\n\xa0\nSPECIAL NOTES:\n\nHotels will be as per the names listed below or similar. If the requested hotels are not available, we will endeavor to book space in similarly priced hotels.\nTips to drive & guide is not included (Nominal Tipping is EUR 5 Per person per day)\nWe do not commit rooms with air conditioning. In case your guests are keen on the aircon, please let us know beforehand\xa0\nAll the below itineraries have point to point transport on the arrival and departure day\nThe vehicle will be on disposal for 10 driving hrs. per day. If guests exceed 10 hours, they will have to the pay extra hr. charges (to be advised at the time of booking) directly to the chauffeur.\xa0\nWe aren’t holding any inventory of hotels / vehicles at the moment\xa0\n\n\xa0\nIMPORTANT NOTES:\n\nThe above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together.\nThe above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\nMaximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room.\nMidnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\nWIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed.\xa0\n(Supplement charges may apply for such services)\nStandard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs.\nMost hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned.\nAt this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability\nTCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost.\n\n\xa0\nTERMS AND CONDITIONS:\n\nTravel Validity: 1 July – 31 October 2026 // Except Blackout Period\nBlack out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ.\nTCS & GST would be levied as applicable\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nMaximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\nSurcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking.\nTo proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour.\nShould the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014950/Interlaken2678.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014950/itinerary/9063_Lucerne_Switzerland_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014950/itinerary/89366_Mt._Titlis_Engelberg_Switzerland_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014950/itinerary/JungfraujochSwitzerland.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014950/itinerary/84462_Zurich_lake_Zurich_Switzerland_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014950/itinerary/arcdetriumphateveningfrance76115509.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014950/itinerary/VersaillesPalace_new_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014950/itinerary/Paris_City_new753.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014950/itinerary/Paris_new_753.jpeg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015666', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015666', 'availableMonths': ['march_2027'], 'packageName': 'Arctic Finland', 'days': 7, 'cities': [], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG015666_0_undefined.pdf', 'price': 299825, 'packageSummary': "The 'Arctic Finland' package is a 7-day tour covering Helsinki, Rovaniemi, and Saariselkä. The itinerary includes visits to the Senate Square, the famous Santa Claus Village, and the Arktikum Museum, alongside many other scenic winter landscapes. Participants will enjoy guided city tours, thrilling husky and reindeer safaris, chasing the magical Northern Lights, and a unique overnight stay in a thermal glass igloo.", 'images': [], 'minimumPrice': 299825, 'thumbnailImage': 'Finland-Rovaniemi.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Adventure'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015666 is named 'Arctic Finland' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nThe price is 299825.0. Hotels envisaged include: \xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nHelsinki\n\n\nHotel Haaga Central Park / Hotel Anna / Hotel Arthur / Scandic Kallio or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Grand Marina /\xa0 Scandic Meilahti\xa0 / Scandic Marski / Valo Hotel Helsinki \xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0, \n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nValue Category\n\n\n\n\nSaariselka\n\n\nStar Arctic or similar\n\n\n\n\nIgloo Stay\n\n\nKakslauttanen resort, small glass igloo or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Pohjanhovi or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0, Overnight stay at the Hotels. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n, Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\xa0. Inclusions: Accommodation: 1 Nights’ accommodation in Helsinki based on the hotel category selected or similar 1 Night’ accommodation in Santa Claus Express Train 4 Nights’ accommodation in Syote based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) 6 Dinner included 1 Wilderness Lunch at Reindeer farm Transportation: [Includes Privates & Shared services from Point-to-Point Basis] Arrival Transfers from Helsinki Vantaa airport to the Hotel Dinner transfers in Helsinki. Pier transfers at Helsinki and Tallinn Helsinki-Tallinn-Helsinki Ferry tickets Transfer from Rovaniemi airport to Syote with 3 hrs visit to Santa Village at Rovaniemi Transfers to from activities as per program Departure Transfer from Syote to Rovaniemi airport Train: Santa Claus Express Overnight Train tickets form Helsinki to Rovaniemi. Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) Tallinn Day excursion on shared basis Guided walking tour of Tallinn old town on shared basis Santa Village Tour on shared basis Crossing the Arctic Circle on shared basis Meeting Santa at his home on shared basis Aurora Snowshoeing and Wilderness Hut with bonfire experience on shared basis Husky sleigh ride experience on shared basis Reindeer Farm Visit and Authentic Sami experience on shared basis Aurora Snowmobile driving experience (2 Pax share 1 Snowmobile. Driver of Snowmobile must be in physical possession of a valid driving License from any county). Cultural visit to Pentik on shared basis Visit to Kuusamo / Village center for local shopping on shared basis Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only) OPTIONAL TOUR Arctic Ice breaker cruise 2.5 hrs. : EUR 495 Guided Authentic Smoke Sauna and Ice dip experience : EUR 200 SPECIAL NOTE: Luggage Capacity 1 check inn and 1 Cabin Luggage Per person. Triple Room at Pikku Syote Resort will be an Upgraded Larger room: Deluxe/ Jr Suite Category. No Quad sharing Possible. For Quad bookings, 2 Dbl room Prices must be calculated. Triple Sharing booking: During Overnight Train, 2 cabins will be allocated for 3 Pax booking. 1 Cabin for 2 Pax and 1 cabin sharing with another passenger. Age limit to participate in FD: 06 Years and above. Overnight Santa Express Train Solo and 3 Pax booking clarification: Solo Pax during Overnight Train will be required to share the cabin with another passenger (Shared basis: 2 Pax in 1 Cabin). Triple Sharing booking: During Overnight Train, 2 cabins will be allocated for 3 Pax booking. 1 Cabin for 2 Pax and 1 cabin sharing with another passenger.. Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: IMPORTANT NOTES: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost. TERMS AND CONDITIONS: Travel Validity: 1 November 2026 – 31 March 2027 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the