 overnight stay in a thermal glass igloo.", 'itinerary': []}, 'hotels': ['\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nHelsinki\n\n\nHotel Haaga Central Park / Hotel Anna / Hotel Arthur / Scandic Kallio or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Grand Marina /\xa0 Scandic Meilahti\xa0 / Scandic Marski / Valo Hotel Helsinki \xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0', '\n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nValue Category\n\n\n\n\nSaariselka\n\n\nStar Arctic or similar\n\n\n\n\nIgloo Stay\n\n\nKakslauttanen resort, small glass igloo or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Pohjanhovi or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0', 'Overnight stay at the Hotels'], 'hotels_list': {'0': '\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nHelsinki\n\n\nHotel Haaga Central Park / Hotel Anna / Hotel Arthur / Scandic Kallio or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Grand Marina /\xa0 Scandic Meilahti\xa0 / Scandic Marski / Valo Hotel Helsinki \xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0', '1': '\n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nValue Category\n\n\n\n\nSaariselka\n\n\nStar Arctic or similar\n\n\n\n\nIgloo Stay\n\n\nKakslauttanen resort, small glass igloo or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Pohjanhovi or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0', '2': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'EE', 'countryName': 'Estonia', 'continentName': 'Europe'}, {'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'FI', 'countryName': 'Finland', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Value'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Value', 'price': 299800.0, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nValue Category\n\n\n\n\nSaariselka\n\n\nStar Arctic or similar\n\n\n\n\nIgloo Stay\n\n\nKakslauttanen resort, small glass igloo or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Pohjanhovi or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0']}], 'meals': ['\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n', 'Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\xa0'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point-to-Point Ba