 cruise to Copenhagen and enjoy on board.\nSpecial Notes: In Oslo it will be day free at leisure.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': '\xa0\nOvernight on Cruise'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0\nCopenhagen City Walking Tour\nTransfers: Upon reaching Copenhagen you will be transferred from port to the hotel on private basis. Early check in is subject to hotel discretion.\nCopenhagen Small Group Walking City Tour: Enjoy small group walking tour of Copenhagen with views from Rundetaarn and visit to Trinitatis Church. Stroll Stroget see Nyhavn Amalienborg Palace Gefion Fountain and the Little Mermaid inspired by H C Andersen.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Scandic or similar in Copenhagen'}, {'day': 10, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart\nTransfers: You will be transferred from Copenhagen hotel to the airport on private transfer.\nSpecial Notes: You will reach airport three to four hours prior to your departure flight.\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'NA'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHELSINKI\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nScandic\xa0Hotel\xa0or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSTOCKHOLM\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nClarion hotel or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOSLO\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nClarion hotel\xa0or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCOPENHAGEN\xa0\n\n\n\n\nScandic Hotel or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'1': '\n\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHELSINKI\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nScandic\xa0Hotel\xa0or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSTOCKHOLM\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nClarion hotel or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOSLO\xa0