osit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour\xa0\xa0\n• Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly\xa0\xa0\n• The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates\xa0\xa0\n• We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package\xa0\xa0\n• International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed\xa0\xa0\n• Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only\xa0\xa0\n• No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service\xa0\xa0\n• All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking\xa0\xa0\n• Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice\xa0\xa0\n• Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends\xa0\xa0\n• Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time\xa0\xa0\n• As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients\xa0\xa0\n• The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation\xa0\xa0', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'N', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015189/Stockholm.avif', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015189/itinerary/Helsinki2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015189/itinerary/Helsinki1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015189/itinerary/Helsinki3.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015189/itinerary/Stockholm2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015189/itinerary/Stockholm1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015189/itinerary/Oslo1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015189/itinerary/Oslo2jpg.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015189/itinerary/Copenhagen2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015189/itinerary/Copenhagen1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015189/itinerary/Copenhagen3.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014896', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014896', 'availableMonths': ['october_2026'], 'packageName': 'London, Paris, Swiss And Italy (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)', 'days': 14, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'London', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'London', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Venice', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Venice', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Florence', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rome', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rome', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rome', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['Free upgrade to 1st class TGV (Paris - Swiss Train sector)'], 'pdfName': 'PKG014896_0_20260609181522.pdf', 'price': 421947, 'packageSummary': "The 'London, Paris, Swiss And Italy (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)' package is a comprehensive 14-day tour that takes travelers through some of Europe's most iconic destinations, covering London, Paris, Venice, Florence, Rome, and the scenic regions of Central and Southern Switzerland. Designed as a festive holiday getaway, the itinerary offers a seamless journey across these historic cities, with the standout highlight of a free upgrade to first-class travel on the high-speed TGV train sector connecting Paris to Switzerland.", 'images': ['London7531.jpg', 'LondonTowerBridge7531.jpg', 'Paris75390.jpg', 'EiffelTowerParisFrance7534.jpg', 'Interlaken2.jpg', '89366_Mt._Titlis_Engelberg_Switzerland_753.jpg', 'Jungfraujoch75345.jpg', 'Glacier.jpg', 'VeniceRialtoBridgeItaly75312.jpg', '71702_Venice_753.jpg', 'Florence_1.jpg', 'rome.jpg', 'Rome-Colosseum.jpg', 'Rome789.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 421947, 'thumbnailImage': 'Rome_SRP.png', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Durga Puja Special', 'Adventure'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Most Booked', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014896 is named 'London, Paris, Swiss And Italy (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)' and spans 14 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - London, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive London Transfers: Upon your arrival at the airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 14:00 - 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - London, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Hop On Hop Off Tour - Madame Tussauds - London Eye - Tower Of London Hop on Hop Off Tour: The London Hop-On Hop-Off Bus Tour is a flexible sightseeing experience that lets you explore the city’s most iconic landmarks at your own pace with multiple routes and stops near attractions. Madame Tussauds With Marvel 4d Cinema and Star Wars Experience: Step into the world of fame and fantasy at Madame Tussauds London. Get up close with lifelike wax figures of celebrities, historical icons, and world leaders. Enjoy the thrilling Marvel 4D Cinema, where superheroes come alive in an immersive experience, and explore the Star Wars Experience, featuring iconic characters and scenes from the legendary saga. It’s an unforgettable mix of glamour, action, and adventure for all ages. London Eye – Ticket: The London Eye is one of the city’s most iconic attractions, offering breathtaking 360° views of London’s skyline from a giant observation wheel on the South Bank of the River Thames. Standing at 135 meters tall, it provides a unique perspective of landmarks like Big Ben, Buckingham Palace, and St. Paul’s Cathedral. A must visit for stunning photo opportunities and an unforgettable experience. Tower of London: The Tower of London is a historic fortress on the north bank of the River Thames, famous for its rich history as a royal palace, prison, and treasury. Home to the dazzling Crown Jewels and centuries of intrigue, it offers visitors a glimpse into Britain’s royal past, iconic Yeoman Warders, and legendary tales like that of the ravens. A must see UNESCO World Heritage Site for history lovers., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Description: London To Paris Via Train Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Paris. Upon your arrival at Paris train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion. Moulin Rouge Show (Optional): Experience the world-famous Moulin Rouge in Paris, an iconic cabaret known for its dazzling performances, vibrant costumes, and spectacular dance routines, including the legendary French Cancan. Located in the heart of Montmartre, this unforgettable show combines music, glamour, and artistry, offering a true taste of Parisian nightlife., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Paris City Tour + River Seine Cruise + Eiffel Tower Tour Paris City Tour: Later discover Paris's most famous tourist sites and monuments on one unique tour. This tour features a visit to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower with breathtaking views of the capital, a panoramic city tour by coach, plus an hour long boat trip along the River Seine. This comprehensive tour is the ideal way to discover Paris for the first time. Special Note: Thanks to your priority access, you can skip the line and speed up by elevator to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower, Paris's most unmissable monument., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Paris To Central Switzerland Via Train Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Central Switzerland. Upon your arrival in Central Switzerland, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion. Lucerne Tour with Swiss Pass on your own (Optional): Travel to Lucerne with Swiss pass on your own as there are many sights in a small area in Lucerne like Chapel Bridge with the Water Tower which is the landmark of Lucerne and the most photographed monument in Switzerland., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Mt. Titlis Excursion Mt. Titlis Excursion: Don't miss the spectacular beauty of Mt Titlis! Discover eternal glaciers and other attractions from more than 3020m / 10000 ft high. Enjoy the spectacular sight of the glacier's deep crevasses and gigantic ice boulders from the revolving cable car ROTAIR. At the top of Mt. Titlis (10'000 ft. above sea level), a high alpine panorama awaits you. Visit the Ice Grotto or take a ride with the chairlift IceFlyer, which brings you close to the crevasses. Enjoy also the FunLift in the snow and the Cliff Walk, Europe's highest suspension bridge. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Jungfraujoch Excursion Jungfraujoch Excursion: Don't miss the highlight of any Swiss holiday and go for this thrilling and unforgettable excursion to Jungfraujoch, Top of Europe! From Interlaken, the heart of the Jungfrau region mountain world and uniquely situated between two lakes, you make your way to famous mountain resort Grindelwald where you board the cogwheel train for a spectacular ride via Kleine Scheidegg to Jungfraujoch. Enjoy stunning views of the world famous triple peaks of Eiger, Monch and Jungfrau accompany you all the way to the top. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Central Switzerland Day At Leisure (Optional Activity) Glacier 3000 (Optional): Escape to the high Alps to breath a fresh air and spectacular mountain vistas on the Glacier 3000 (Optional Mountain Excursion). Glacier 3000, located at the highest point of the Vaudois Alps, is open all year round for winter activities for all! With its stunning views and wide range of activities on offer – including the Peak Walk, a unique suspension bridge linking two mountain peaks - Glacier 3000 is a must for your holidays in Switzerland. Bollywood Tour (Optional): Gstaad region is known as one of the most scenic natural film sets in the world. Many Bollywood blockbusters have been filmed here, such as DDLJ “Bachana Ae Haseenno” and many more. Lunch can be included on this tour., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 9 - Venice, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Central / Southern Swiss To Venice Via Train Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Venice. Upon your arrival at Venice train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. Gondola Ride: Experience Venice in the most Venetian way possible: via a shared gondola ride while being serenaded. Choose between an afternoon or evening ride and then begin the ride, as part of a group of eight different gondolas, with a singer aboard one of the boats. In addition to the song being sun to you, enjoy the sites of Venice's main landmarks, including the grand Canal and Palazzo Barberino., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 10 - Venice, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Murano, Burano And Torcello Half-Day Tour Murano, Burano and Torcello Half-Day Sightseeing Tour: Today visit Torcello, Murano, and Burano — three islands in the Venetian Lagoon — on this tour from Venice by motorboat. With a guide, watch glass being blown at a Murano glass factory, see historical cathedrals on Torcello, and admire exquisite handmade lace on Burano. This is a great way to see more than just the central sights of Venice and enjoy a cruise on the water. Highlights: Visit the three most famous islands in the Venetian Lagoon by motorboat Watch master glass blowers at work at a factory on Murano See Byzantine churches on Torcello— the Church of Santa Fosca Browse for lace on Burano and admire the painted houses McArthurGlen Designer Outlet (Optional): Later you can opt to visit the McArthurGlen Designer Outlet in Noventa di Piave is the most prestigious shopping outlet in Veneto, where you can find the most prestigious fashion with discounts up to 70% all around the year. Located just 30 minutes by car from Venice. Over 100 shops, restaurants, bars, lounges, play areas for children, located in a beautiful setting with architectural mosaics and frescoes inspired by the palaces in Venice and Treviso, where you can satisfy your thirst for great fashion, taking advantage of the offers and services designed specifically to make time spent here unforgettable., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 11 - Florence, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Venice To Florence Via Train Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Florence. Upon your arrival at Florence train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. You will have a transfer from Florence to Pisa and back to Florence. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion. Pisa and the Leaning Tower Tour: This popular half day trip takes you from Florence through the scenic Tuscan countryside to the historic city of Pisa. The tour focuses on Piazza dei Miracoli, a UNESCO World Heritage site, where you’ll see the Leaning Tower, the Cathedral, the Baptistery, and the Monumental Cemetery., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 12 - Rome, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Florence To Rome Via Train Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Rome. Upon your arrival at Rome train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 13 - Rome, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Rome - Hop On Hop Off Tour Hop on Hop Off Tour: Discover Rome's iconic sights and landmarks on a hop-on hop-off bus tour, offering a comprehensive overview of all the city’s highlights. Disembark at any of the multiple stops to see popular landmarks such as the Vatican City, Circus Maximus, the Pantheon, or the Colosseum. While on board the bus, listen to recorded commentary in multiple languages that details the history, architecture, culture, and traditions of the Eternal City., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 14 - Rome, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Rome Transfers: From Rome hotel to airport, you will have a private transfer. Special Notes: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 421947.0. Hotels envisaged include: \xa0\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nSTANDARD CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n\n\nIbis London Earls Court Hotel /\xa0Point A Hotel, London Paddington / Best Western Buckingham Palace Rd\xa0\xa0/The W14 Hotel Kensington / London House Hotel / Mentone Hotel / BW Swiss Cottage or similar\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nHotel Opera Lafayette / Color Design Hotel / Hôtel Champerret-Elysées / Londres Et New York Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nLa Pergola | Ibis Styles Bern City | Prizeotel Bern-city | Jardin | Sorell Hotel Ador or similar\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\nAndreotti Hotel and Domus Australia / Hotel Villa San Lorenzo Maria / Hotel Des Artistes / Hotel Nord Nuova Roma / Hotel Windrose or similar\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nAlbergo Firenze / Hotel Boccaccio / Hotel Paris / Hotel Machiavelli Palace / Hotel Luxor Florence or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice\n\n\nHotel Diana / Albergo San Marco / San Zulian / Hotel Montecarlo or similar\n\n\n\n, Overnight stay at the Hotels, \n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n\n\nPark Plaza London / Park International / Copthorne Tara London Kensington / Holiday Inn® London Kensington / Mercure London Paddington or similar\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nMercure Paris Opéra Faubourg Montmartre / Novotel Paris Center Eiffel Tower / Novotel Paris Center Gare Montparnasse / Mercure Paris Bercy Bibliotheque Hotel / Hotel Mademoiselle or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nCampus Hotel Hertenstein | Romantik Hotel Beau Rivage - Weggis | Hotel Baren Sigriswil | Hotel Eden Spiez | Seegarten Marina or similar\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\nBest Western Hotel Artdeco / Atlantico / Hotel Massimo D'azeglio / Hotel Diana Roof Garden / Best Western President or similar\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nAtlantic Palace / De La Ville / Embassy Hotel / Starhotels Michelangelo Florence / Hotel Principe di Firenze / C Hotel Club / C-hotels Ambassadors Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice\n\n\nRoyal San Marco Hotel / San Marco Palace / Hotel Kette / Bonvecchiati or similar or similar\n\n\n\n. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast Except Day 1\n. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ accommodation in Paris based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in London based on the hotel category selected or similar 4 Nights’ accommodation in Central Switzerland based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Venice based on the hotel category selected or similar 1 Night accommodation in Florence based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Rome based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation:[Includes Privates service s on Point to Point Basis] Arrival Airport Transfer from London Airport to London Hotel Departure Airport Transfer from Rome Hotel to Rome Airport Train Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed] 2nd Class Train Ticket London - Paris (Eurostar): - Subject to availability until ticketed 2nd Class Train Ticket Paris - Zurich /Geneva / Basel (TGV). 2nd Class Train Ticket Lucerne - Zurich - Subject to availability until ticketed. 2nd Class Train Ticket Zurich - Venice: - Subject to availability until ticketed. 2nd Class Train Ticket Venice to Florence: - Subject to availability until ticketed. 2nd Class Train Ticket Florence - Rome: - Subject to availability until ticketed. Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) London Hop On Hop Off Bus tour. London Eye (Entrance Only). Madame Tussauds (Entrance Only). Tower of London (Entrance Only) Interactive City Tour, Seine Cruise and Eiffel Tower 2nd Floor with Priority Access (SIC) Mt Titlis Excursion (in conjunction with Swiss Pass) Jungfraujoch Excursion (in conjunction with Swiss Pass) Venice: Venice Gondola Ride (30 Mins) and Serenade. Venice: Murano, Burano and Torcello Half-Day Sightseeing Tour Florence: Pisa and the Leaning Tower Tour from Florence Rome: Hop on Hop off in Rome Intercity travel by Train (Second Class): London – Paris (Eurostar). Paris – Geneva / Basel (TGV). Swiss Pass 4 Days Consecutive Saver. Lucerne – Venice. Venice – Florence. Florence – Rome. Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Notes: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability Terms And Conditions: Travel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 September 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: Free upgrade to 1st class TGV (Paris - Swiss Train sector).", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'London, Paris, Swiss And Italy (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)' package is a comprehensive 14-day tour that takes travelers through some of Europe's most iconic destinations, covering London, Paris, Venice, Florence, Rome, and the scenic regions of Central and Southern Switzerland. Designed as a festive holiday getaway, the itinerary offers a seamless journey across these historic cities, with the standout highlight of a free upgrade to first-class travel on the high-speed TGV train sector connecting Paris to Switzerland.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive London\n\xa0\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at the airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle.\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 14:00 - 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Ibis Earls Court\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Park Plaza\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0London'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nHop On Hop Off Tour - Madame Tussauds - London Eye - Tower Of London\n\xa0\nHop on Hop Off Tour: The London Hop-On Hop-Off Bus Tour is a flexible sightseeing experience that lets you explore the city’s most iconic landmarks at your own pace with multiple routes and stops near attractions.\n\xa0\nMadame Tussauds With Marvel 4d Cinema and Star Wars Experience: Step into the world of fame and fantasy at Madame Tussauds London. Get up close with lifelike wax figures of celebrities, historical icons, and world leaders. Enjoy the thrilling Marvel 4D Cinema, where superheroes come alive in an immersive experience, and explore the Star Wars Experience, featuring iconic characters and scenes from the legendary saga. It’s an unforgettable mix of glamour, action, and adventure for all ages.\n\xa0\nLondon Eye – Ticket: The London Eye is one of the city’s most iconic attractions, offering breathtaking 360° views of London’s skyline from a giant observation wheel on the South Bank of the River Thames. Standing at 135 meters tall, it provides a unique perspective of landmarks like Big Ben, Buckingham Palace, and St. Paul’s Cathedral. A must visit for stunning photo opportunities and an unforgettable experience.\n\xa0\nTower of London: The Tower of London is a historic fortress on the north bank of the River Thames, famous for its rich history as a royal palace, prison, and treasury. Home to the dazzling Crown Jewels and centuries of intrigue, it offers visitors a glimpse into Britain’s royal past, iconic Yeoman Warders, and legendary tales like that of the ravens. A must see UNESCO World Heritage Site for history lovers.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Ibis Earls Court\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Park Plaza\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0London'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nLondon To Paris Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Paris.\nUpon your arrival at Paris train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\n\xa0\nMoulin Rouge Show (Optional): Experience the world-famous Moulin Rouge in Paris, an iconic cabaret known for its dazzling performances, vibrant costumes, and spectacular dance routines, including the legendary French Cancan. Located in the heart of Montmartre, this unforgettable show combines music, glamour, and artistry, offering a true taste of Parisian nightlife.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Opera Lafayette\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Mercure Paris Opera Faubourg Montmartre\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Paris'}, {'day': 4, 'description': "\xa0Paris City Tour + River Seine Cruise + Eiffel Tower Tour\xa0\nParis City Tour: Later discover Paris's most famous tourist sites and monuments on one unique tour. This tour features a visit to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower with breathtaking views of the capital, a panoramic city tour by coach, plus an hour long boat trip along the River Seine. This comprehensive tour is the ideal way to discover Paris for the first time.\xa0\xa0\nSpecial Note: Thanks to your priority access, you can skip the line and speed up by elevator to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower, Paris's most unmissable monument.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Opera Lafayette\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Mercure Paris Opera Faubourg Montmartre\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Paris'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nParis To Central Switzerland Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Central Switzerland.\xa0\nUpon your arrival in Central Switzerland, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\nLucerne Tour with Swiss Pass on your own (Optional): Travel to Lucerne with Swiss pass on your own as there are many sights in a small area in Lucerne like Chapel Bridge with the Water Tower which is the landmark of Lucerne and the most photographed monument in Switzerland.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola (Standard) /\xa0Campus\xa0Hertenstein\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 6, 'description': "\xa0\nMt. Titlis Excursion\n\xa0\nMt. Titlis Excursion: Don't miss the spectacular beauty of Mt Titlis! Discover eternal glaciers and other attractions from more than 3020m / 10000 ft high. Enjoy the spectacular sight of the glacier's deep crevasses and gigantic ice boulders from the revolving cable car ROTAIR. At the top of Mt. Titlis (10'000 ft. above sea level), a high alpine panorama awaits you. Visit the Ice Grotto or take a ride with the chairlift IceFlyer, which brings you close to the crevasses. Enjoy also the FunLift in the snow and the Cliff Walk, Europe's highest suspension bridge. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass)", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola (Standard) /\xa0Campus\xa0Hertenstein\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 7, 'description': "\xa0\nJungfraujoch Excursion\n\xa0\nJungfraujoch Excursion: Don't miss the highlight of any Swiss holiday and go for this thrilling and unforgettable excursion to Jungfraujoch, Top of Europe! From Interlaken, the heart of the Jungfrau region mountain world and uniquely situated between two lakes, you make your way to famous mountain resort Grindelwald where you board the cogwheel train for a spectacular ride via Kleine Scheidegg to Jungfraujoch. Enjoy stunning views of the world famous triple peaks of Eiger, Monch and Jungfrau accompany you all the way to the top. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass)", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola (Standard) /\xa0Campus\xa0Hertenstein\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nCentral Switzerland Day At Leisure (Optional Activity)\n\xa0\nGlacier 3000 (Optional): Escape to the high Alps to breath a fresh air and spectacular mountain vistas on the Glacier 3000 (Optional Mountain Excursion). Glacier 3000, located at the highest point of the Vaudois Alps, is open all year round for winter activities for all! With its stunning views and wide range of activities on offer – including the Peak Walk, a unique suspension bridge linking two mountain peaks - Glacier 3000 is a must for your holidays in Switzerland.\nBollywood Tour (Optional): Gstaad region is known as one of the most scenic natural film sets in the world. Many Bollywood blockbusters have been filmed here, such as DDLJ “Bachana Ae Haseenno” and many more. Lunch can be included on this tour.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola (Standard) /\xa0Campus\xa0Hertenstein\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 9, 'description': "\xa0\nCentral / Southern Swiss To Venice Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Venice.\xa0\nUpon your arrival at Venice train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nGondola Ride: Experience Venice in the most Venetian way possible: via a shared gondola ride while being serenaded. Choose between an afternoon or evening ride and then begin the ride, as part of a group of eight different gondolas, with a singer aboard one of the boats. In addition to the song being sun to you, enjoy the sites of Venice's main landmarks, including the grand Canal and Palazzo Barberino.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Diana (Standard) /\xa0Royal San Marco (Value) or similar in Venice\xa0'}, {'day': 10, 'description': '\xa0\nMurano, Burano And Torcello Half-Day Tour\n\xa0\nMurano, Burano and Torcello Half-Day Sightseeing Tour: Today visit Torcello, Murano, and Burano — three islands in the Venetian Lagoon — on this tour from Venice by motorboat. With a guide, watch glass being blown at a Murano glass factory, see historical cathedrals on Torcello, and admire exquisite handmade lace on Burano. This is a great way to see more than just the central sights of Venice and enjoy a cruise on the water.\n\xa0\nHighlights:\xa0\n\nVisit the three most famous islands in the Venetian Lagoon by motorboat\xa0\nWatch master glass blowers at work at a factory on Murano\xa0\nSee Byzantine churches on Torcello— the Church of Santa Fosca\xa0\nBrowse for lace on Burano and admire the painted houses\n\n\xa0\nMcArthurGlen Designer Outlet (Optional):\xa0 Later you can opt to visit the McArthurGlen Designer Outlet in Noventa di Piave is the most prestigious shopping outlet in Veneto, where you can find the most prestigious fashion with discounts up to 70% all around the year. Located just 30 minutes by car from Venice. Over 100 shops, restaurants, bars, lounges, play areas for children, located in a beautiful setting with architectural mosaics and frescoes inspired by the palaces in Venice and Treviso, where you can satisfy your thirst for great fashion, taking advantage of the offers and services designed specifically to make time spent here unforgettable.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Diana (Standard) /\xa0Royal San Marco (Value) or similar in Venice\xa0'}, {'day': 11, 'description': '\xa0\nVenice To Florence Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Florence.\xa0\nUpon your arrival at Florence train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\nYou will have a transfer from Florence to Pisa and back to Florence.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\xa0\n\xa0\nPisa and the Leaning Tower Tour: This popular half day trip takes you from Florence through the scenic Tuscan countryside to the historic city of Pisa. The tour focuses on Piazza dei Miracoli, a UNESCO World Heritage site, where you’ll see the Leaning Tower, the Cathedral, the Baptistery, and the Monumental Cemetery.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Albergo Firenze (Standard) / Atlantic Palace (Value) or similar in Florence'}, {'day': 12, 'description': '\xa0\nFlorence To Rome Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Rome.\xa0\nUpon your arrival at Rome train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Andreotti and Domus Australia\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Best Western Artdeco (Value) or similar in Rome'}, {'day': 13, 'description': "\xa0\nRome - Hop On Hop Off Tour\n\xa0\nHop on Hop Off Tour: Discover Rome's iconic sights and landmarks on a hop-on hop-off bus tour, offering a comprehensive overview of all the city’s highlights. Disembark at any of the multiple stops to see popular landmarks such as the Vatican City, Circus Maximus, the Pantheon, or the Colosseum. While on board the bus, listen to recorded commentary in multiple languages that details the history, architecture, culture, and traditions of the Eternal City.\n\xa0\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Andreotti and Domus Australia\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Best Western Artdeco (Value) or similar in Rome'}, {'day': 14, 'description': 'Depart Rome\n\xa0\nTransfers: From Rome hotel to airport, you will have a private transfer.\n\xa0\nSpecial Notes: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight.\n\xa0\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nSTANDARD CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n\n\nIbis London Earls Court Hotel /\xa0Point A Hotel, London Paddington / Best Western Buckingham Palace Rd\xa0\xa0/The W14 Hotel Kensington / London House Hotel / Mentone Hotel / BW Swiss Cottage or similar\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nHotel Opera Lafayette / Color Design Hotel / Hôtel Champerret-Elysées / Londres Et New York Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nLa Pergola | Ibis Styles Bern City | Prizeotel Bern-city | Jardin | Sorell Hotel Ador or similar\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\nAndreotti Hotel and Domus Australia / Hotel Villa San Lorenzo Maria / Hotel Des Artistes / Hotel Nord Nuova Roma / Hotel Windrose or similar\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nAlbergo Firenze / Hotel Boccaccio / Hotel Paris / Hotel Machiavelli Palace / Hotel Luxor Florence or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice\n\n\nHotel Diana / Albergo San Marco / San Zulian / Hotel Montecarlo or similar\n\n\n\n', 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', "\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n\n\nPark Plaza London / Park Internati