nce confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014861/AdobeStock_211359758_BuckinghamPalaceLondon.jpeg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014861/itinerary/London7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014861/itinerary/LondonTowerBridge7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014861/itinerary/AdobeStock_222232218_BuckinghamPalaceLondon.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014861/itinerary/Windermere.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014861/itinerary/Windermere_1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014861/itinerary/Edinburgh7534.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014861/itinerary/EdinburghCastle7536.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014861/itinerary/EdinburghCity7534.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014545', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014545', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Scottish Delights', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Edinburgh', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Edinburgh', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Inverness', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Inverness', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Glasgow', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Glasgow', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Glasgow', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014545_0_20260916174057.pdf', 'price': 164083, 'packageSummary': "The 'Scottish Delights' package is a 7-day tour covering Glasgow, Edinburgh, and Inverness. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as Edinburgh Castle, the historic Glasgow Cathedral, the Royal Mile, and the legendary Loch Ness. Participants will enjoy guided city tours, scenic drives through the breathtaking Scottish Highlands, and authentic Scotch whisky tastings at local distilleries.", 'images': ['Edinburgh7534.jpg', 'EdinburghCastle7536.jpg', 'Inverness2.jpg', 'inverness-ness.jpg', 'Glasgow_753.jpg', 'Glasgow_Cathedral_753.jpg', 'Glasgow_1500.jpeg'], 'minimumPrice': 164083, 'thumbnailImage': 'EdinburghCity7534.jpeg', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Adventure'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014545 is named 'Scottish Delights' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Edinburgh, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive in Edinburgh Transfer: Arrival in Edinburgh (EDI), you will be met by the representative and have a private transfer to the hotel. Special Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion. Skip-the-line Royal Yacht Britannia Private Tour & Transport (Optional Activity): Timing> English 15:00 [Duration approx. 3 hrs] Step aboard the Royal Yacht Britannia, the former floating palace of Queen Elizabeth II. Discover royal secrets, lavish interiors, and life at sea with fast-track entry. Relive history and elegance aboard one of Scotland’s most iconic attractions. [Supplement Cost - € 195 Per Adult and € 100 Per Child], GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Edinburgh, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Edinburgh Hop on Hop Off Sightseeing: Explore Edinburgh at your own pace with a hop-on hop-off bus ticket. Ascend the city's seven hills for spectacular views and marvel at iconic landmarks like Edinburgh Castle and the Royal Mile, connecting the castle to the Palace of Holyrood House. This flexible tour lets you discover the city's rich history, museums, galleries, and restaurants exactly as you wish. Scotch Whisky Tasting - The True Spirit of Scotland (Optional Activity): Whisky Tasting In English 17:30 [Duration Approximately 90 mins] Enjoy a tasting of three single malts from regions across Scotland, plus a new make spirit (unaged whisky). The experience is enriched with the history, traditions, and anecdotes that Scotch carries with it. The experience begins at the entrance of John Knox House, from where we will head to a central whisky bar for the tasting. Experienced local guide. Origins and evolution of Scotch The Golden Age of Scotch whisky Edinburgh’s influence on Scotch’s fame Regions and styles Memorable anecdotes Includes: 3 tastings of exclusive single malts + 1 new make (unaged whisky) [Supplement Cost - € 45 Per Adult, child entrance will be upon request basis only], GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Inverness, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Edinburgh To Inverness Transfer: You will travel from Edinburgh to Inverness on a 2nd Class Train Ticket with changes (4 hrs) Upon your arrival at Inverness train station, make your way to the hotel on your own. Special Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Inverness, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Inverness City Sightseeing Inverness Hop-On Hop-Off Tour: Explore the very best of Inverness on this unlimited hop-on hop-off bus tour. With unlimited access for 24 hours, you'll see all of the key landmarks of this pretty Scottish destination. The bus tour includes an informative audio tour commentary in English, ensuring there is an educational element to the experience. Enjoy stunning panoramic from the open-top deck, seeing Castle Street, Ness Bank, Bank Street, Bishops Road, Dochgarroch Lock and Tomnahurich Bridge on your way round., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Glasgow, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Inverness To Glasgow Transfer: You will travel from Inverness to Glasgow on a 2nd Class Train Ticket with changes (4 hrs) Upon your arrival at Glasgow train station, make your way to the hotel on your own. Special Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Glasgow, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Glasgow Guided Walking Tour: Discover Glasgow’s heritage on a short walking tour featuring iconic landmarks like City Chambers, George Square, Merchant City, and Glasgow Cathedral. Enjoy fascinating stories, stunning Victorian architecture, and quirky statues—all in just about an hour., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Glasgow, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Glasgow Transfer: 3- 4 hrs prior to your departure flight, you will have a private transfer from the hotel to Glasgow (GLA) airport. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 164083.0. Hotels envisaged include: \xa0\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCity\n\n\nStandard \n\n\n\n\nEdinburgh\n\n\nIbis Edinburgh Centre Royal Mile - Hunter Square / Leonardo Hotel Edinburgh City / Holiday Inn Express Edinburgh City - West / Ibis Edinburgh Centre South Bridge - Royal Mile or similar\n\n\n\n\nInverness\n\n\nThe Royal Highland / Glen Mhor Hotel / River Ness Hotel, A Member Of Radisson Individuals or similar\n\n\n\n\nGlasgow\n\n\nMercure Glasgow City Hotel / Ibis Styles Glasgow Centre George Square / Holiday Inn Express Glasgow - City Center Theatreland / Ibis Styles Glasgow Central or similar\n\n\n\n, \xa0\n\n\n\n\n\xa0HOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCity\n\n\nValue\n\n\n\n\nEdinburgh\n\n\nLeonardo Royal Hotel Edinburgh Haymarket / Leonardo Royal Hotel Edinburgh / Novotel Edinburgh Centre Hotel / Mercure Edinburgh Haymarket or similar\n\n\n\n\nInverness\n\n\nLeonardo Hotel Inverness / Mercure Inverness Hotel / Columba or similar\n\n\n\n\nGlasgow\n\n\nJurys Inn Glasgow / Yotel Glasgow / Hilton Garden Inn Glasgow City Centre / Doubletree By Hilton Glasgow Central or similar\n\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ accommodation in Edinburgh in the above mentioned hotel or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Inverness in the above mentioned hotel or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Glasgow in the above mentioned hotel or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Sightseeing: [ Tour starts from a city centre point, service to & from the hotel is not included] Edinburgh Hop on Hop off (1 Day) Inverness Hop on Hop Off Glasgow Hop on Hop off (24 hour) Transfers: [ Includes Point to Point Transfer with limited waiting hours] Arrival Airport transfers in Edinburgh on Private basis Departure airport transfers in Glasgow on Private basis Train: [Subject to availability and cost can vary until ticketed] Edinburgh – Inverness (2nd Class Train Fare) Inverness – Glasgow (2nd Class Train Fare) Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head. Black out Period: Royal Edinburgh Military Tattoo festival: August 7–29, 2026 (*Approx. Surcharge to be GBP 50 – 80 Per Person). Product Terms and Conditions: Important Note: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost. Terms and Conditions: Travel Validity: 01st April to 30th September 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. TCS & GST would be levied as applicable The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayL