VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Treasures of Turkiye - Private Tour' is an 8-day journey covering the historic and scenic destinations of Istanbul, Antalya, and Cappadocia. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the Hagia Sophia, the Blue Mosque, the ancient ruins of Antalya, and the breathtaking volcanic landscapes of Cappadocia. Participants will enjoy private guided city tours, a scenic Bosphorus cruise, and the unforgettable experience of a hot air balloon ride over Cappadocia's famous fairy chimneys.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrival into Istanbul\nTransfers: Upon arrival you will be met the representative & transferred to the hotel on private basis.\nSpecial Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\nOptional Activity: Bosphorus Dinner Cruise\nEnjoy an enchanting evening on the Bosphorus Strait with a leisurely dinner cruise that showcases Istanbul’s beauty by night. Sail between Europe and Asia as you pass iconic landmarks such as the Bosphorus Bridge, Dolmabahçe Palace, and the illuminated waterfront mansions. The experience is complemented by a delicious Turkish dinner and live entertainment, often including traditional music and folk dance performances, making it a memorable blend of scenic views, culture, and cuisine. [The supplement cost for this activity will be approx. US$ 80/- per adult & US$ 55/- for children below 6 years]', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Four Side Lions Taksim\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hilton Double Tree Piyalepasa\xa0(Premium) or similar in\xa0Istanbul'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nFull-Day Guided Tour Of Istanbul On Private Basis\nIstanbul City Tour : Between 09:00 and 10:00 hrs, you will be picked up from your hotel (pickup time subject to hotel location) for a full day guided city tour. The tour includes visits to the Hagia Sophia Mosque (entrance not included), the pride of Byzantine architecture; the Byzantine Hippodrome, once the venue for ancient chariot races; and the Blue Mosque, renowned for its exquisite blue Iznik tiles. You will also visit the Topkapi Palace (entrance not included), the former residence of the Ottoman Sultans, followed by time at the Grand Bazaar, Turkey’s largest covered market with over 4,000 shops.\nLunch will be served at a local restaurant, after which you will be transferred back to your hotel.\nSpecial Notes:\nSightseeing will be conducted on a private basis. The vehicle will be provided only for the scheduled sightseeing activities and will not be at disposal beyond the itinerary.\nEntrance to the Hagia Sophia Mosque and Topkapi Palace is available at an additional supplement.\nSupplement costs:\nHagia Sophia: US$ 35 - 40/- Per adult (*Under 8 years Free)\xa0 \xa0\nTopkapi Palace US$ 65/- Per adult (*Under 6 years Free)\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Four Side Lions Taksim\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hilton Double Tree Piyalepasa\xa0(Premium) or similar in\xa0Istanbul'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nIstanbul To Cappadocia\nTransfers:\n\nToday you will have a private transfer from the hotel to the Airport for onward flight\nUpon arrival at Cappadocia, there will be a private transfer from the airport to the Hotel.\n\nSpecial Notes:\n\nPlease note that the domestic flight from Istanbul to Cappadocia is not included in the tour cost and will be charged as an additional supplement.\nPlease note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Dedeli\xa0Cave\xa0\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hanedan\xa0Cave\xa0Suites\xa0(Premium)\xa0or similar in\xa0Cappadocia'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nExplore Cappadocia\xa0\nOptional Activity: Hot Air Balloon\nIf a hot air balloon ride is on your bucket list, Cappadocia offers one of the most iconic experiences in the world. Drift gently at sunrise above a surreal, lunar like landscape of volcanic rock formations, fairy chimneys, and honeycombed valleys, as dozens of vibrantly colored balloons rise alongside you. This unforgettable experience offers breathtaking panoramic views and spectacular photo opportunities. [The supplement cost for this activity will be upon “On Request Basis”]\nPlease Note:\xa0 Children below 6 years of age or under 120 cm in height are not permitted to participate in the hot air balloon ride.\nCappadocia Sightseeing on Private Basis: After breakfast, between 09:00 and 10:00 hrs, you will be picked up from your hotel to begin a full day tour of Cappadocia. The first stop is Devrent Valley (Imagination Valley), known for its spectacular fairy chimneys and uniquely shaped rock formations set amidst beautiful landscape.\nYou will then visit Pasabag (Monks Valley), famous for its remarkable double\xa0and triple headed rock formations, once used as hermit dwellings by monks. Lunch will be served in Avanos, a town renowned for its traditional pottery craftsmanship and located along the Red River (Kizilirmak).\nAfter lunch, continue to the Goreme Open Air Museum, the heart of Cappadocia, celebrated for its rock cut churches adorned with wall paintings dating back to the 10th century, depicting scenes from the life of Jesus and early Christian monastic life.\nThe tour concludes with a photo stop at Uchisar Castle, a natural rock citadel and one of the largest fairy chimney formations in the region, offering panoramic views of Cappadocia.\nSpecial Notes:\xa0\n\nSightseeing will be conducted on a private basis.\nThe vehicle will be provided only for the scheduled sightseeing activities and will not be at disposal beyond the itinerary.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Dedeli\xa0Cave\xa0\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hanedan\xa0Cave\xa0Suites\xa0(Premium)\xa0or similar in\xa0Cappadocia'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nCappadocia To Antalya\nTransfers:\xa0\n1. Today you will have a private transfer from the hotel to the Airport for onward flight\n2. Upon arrival at Antalya, there will be a private transfer from the airport to the hotel\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Notes:\xa0\n1. Please note that the domestic flight from Cappadocia to Antalya is not included in the tour cost and will be charged as an additional supplement.\n2. Please note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Best Western Khan (Value)/ Holiday Inn Lara Hotel (Premium) or similar\n\xa0\n\xa0\n\xa0'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nFull Day Pamukkale Tour On Private Basis\n\xa0\nTransfers: The sightseeing will be on a private basis. The vehicle will be provided only for the scheduled sightseeing activities and will not be at disposal beyond the itinerary.\nFull Day Pamukkale Tour on PVT basis:\xa0Experience the highlights of Pamukkale on a full day guided tour, including the ancient city of Hierapolis, the famous Cotton Terraces, and key archaeological sites such as the Domitian Gate, Latrina, Oil Factory, Agora, Byzantine Gate, Triton Fountain, and the Temple of Apollo. After the tour, you will be transferred to your hotel.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Best Western Khan (Value)/ Holiday Inn Lara Hotel (Premium) or similar\n\xa0'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nFull Day Antalya Tour On Private Basis\xa0\n\xa0\nTransfers: The sightseeing will be on a private basis. The vehicle will be provided only for the scheduled sightseeing activities and will not be at disposal beyond the itinerary.\nFull Day Antalya Tour on PVT basis:\xa0Enjoy a full day sightseeing experience in Antalya, featuring visits to Kursunlu Waterfall, the historic Old Town of Kaleici, and key landmarks including Hadrian’s Gate, Hidirlik Hill, the Clock Tower, the Fluted Minaret, and Palm Street.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': '\xa0Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Best Western Khan (Value)/ Holiday Inn Lara Hotel (Premium) or similar'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Antalya\nTransfers: From Antalya hotel to Antalya Airport in a private transfer.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': '\xa0Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'NA'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nFour Sides Lion Taksim / Erboy Hotel/ Konak Taksim\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nDedeli Cave / Sunak Cave Hote\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nAntalya\n\n\nBest western Khan / Prime Hotel / Ring Downtown or similar\n\n\n\n', '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n5* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nThe Elysium Taksim/Doubletree Hilton Piyalepasa Hotel\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nHanedan Cave Suites / Acer Cave Suites\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nAntalya\n\n\nHoliday Inn Lara / Doubletree Hilton City Center or similar\n\n\n\n', 'Overnight stay at the Hotels'], 'hotels_list': {'0': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '1': '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nFour Sides Lion Taksim / Erboy Hotel/ Konak Taksim\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nDedeli Cave / Sunak Cave Hote\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nAntalya\n\n\nBest western Khan / Prime Hotel / Ring Downtown or similar\n\n\n\n', '2': '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n5* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nThe Elysium Taksim/Doubletree Hilton Piyalepasa Hotel\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n