nic landmarks such as the Eiffel Tower, the Colosseum, the Vatican Museums, and the breathtaking Swiss Alps. Participants will enjoy guided city sightseeing tours, a romantic gondola ride through the canals of Venice, scenic mountain excursions, and ample opportunities to experience the rich art, history, and culinary delights of Europe.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Paris\n\xa0\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at the airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle.\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 14:00 - 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\n\xa0\nMoulin Rouge Show (Optional): Experience the world-famous Moulin Rouge in Paris, an iconic cabaret known for its dazzling performances, vibrant costumes, and spectacular dance routines, including the legendary French Cancan. Located in the heart of Montmartre, this unforgettable show combines music, glamour, and artistry, offering a true taste of Parisian nightlife.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Opera Lafayette\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Mercure Paris Opera Faubourg Montmartre\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Paris'}, {'day': 2, 'description': "\xa0\nParis City Tour + River Seine Cruise + Eiffel Tower Tour\n\xa0\nParis City Tour: Later discover Paris's most famous tourist sites and monuments on one unique tour. This tour features a visit to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower with breathtaking views of the capital, a panoramic city tour by coach, plus an hour-long boat trip along the River Seine. This comprehensive tour is the ideal way to discover Paris for the first time.\xa0\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Thanks to your priority access, you can skip the line and speed up by elevator to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower, Paris's most unmissable monument.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Opera Lafayette\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Mercure Paris Opera Faubourg Montmartre\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Paris'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nParis To Central Switzerland Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Central Switzerland.\xa0\nUpon your arrival in Central Switzerland, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\n\xa0\nLucerne Tour with Swiss Pass on your own (Optional): Travel to Lucerne with Swiss pass on your own as there are many sights in a small area in Lucerne like Chapel Bridge with the Water Tower which is the landmark of Lucerne and the most photographed monument in Switzerland.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola (Standard) /\xa0Campus Hertenstein (Value) or similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 4, 'description': "\xa0\nMt. Titlis Excursion\n\xa0\nMt. Titlis Excursion: Don't miss the spectacular beauty of Mt Titlis! Discover eternal glaciers and other attractions from more than 3020m / 10000 ft high. Enjoy the spectacular sight of the glacier's deep crevasses and gigantic ice boulders from the revolving cable car ROTAIR. At the top of Mt. Titlis (10'000 ft. above sea level), a high alpine panorama awaits you. Visit the Ice Grotto or take a ride with the chairlift IceFlyer, which brings you close to the crevasses. Enjoy also the FunLift in the snow and the Cliff Walk, Europe's highest suspension bridge. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass)\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola (Standard) /\xa0Campus Hertenstein (Value) or similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 5, 'description': "\xa0\nJungfraujoch Excursion\n\xa0\nJungfraujoch Excursion: Don't miss the highlight of any Swiss holiday and go for this thrilling and unforgettable excursion to Jungfraujoch, Top of Europe! From Interlaken, the heart of the Jungfrau region mountain world and uniquely situated between two lakes, you make your way to famous mountain resort Grindelwald where you board the cogwheel train for a spectacular ride via Kleine Scheidegg to Jungfraujoch. Enjoy stunning views of the world-famous triple peaks of Eiger, Monch and Jungfrau accompany you all the way to the top. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass)\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola (Standard) /\xa0Campus Hertenstein (Value) or similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nCentral Switzerland Day At Leisure (Optional Activity)\n\xa0\nGlacier 3000 (Optional): Escape to the high Alps to breath a fresh air and spectacular mountain vistas on the Glacier 3000 (Optional Mountain Excursion). Glacier 3000, located at the highest point of the Vaudois Alps, is open all year round for winter activities for all! With its stunning views and wide range of activities on offer – including the Peak Walk, a unique suspension bridge linking two mountain peaks – Glacier 3000 is a must for your holidays in Switzerland.\n\xa0\nBollywood Tour (Optional): Gstaad region is known as one of the most scenic natural film sets in the world. Many Bollywood blockbusters have been filmed here, such as DDLJ “Bachana Ae Haseenno” and many more. Lunch can be included on this tour.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola (Standard) /\xa0Campus Hertenstein (Value) or similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 7, 'description': "\xa0\nCentral / Southern Swiss To Venice Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Venice.\xa0\nUpon your arrival at Venice train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nGondola Ride: Experience Venice in the most Venetian way possible: via a shared gondola ride while being serenaded. Choose between an afternoon or evening ride and then begin the ride, as part of a group of eight different gondolas, with a singer aboard one of the boats. In addition to the song being sun to you, enjoy the sites of Venice's main landmarks, including the grand Canal and Palazzo Barberino.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Diana (Standard) / Royal San Marco (Value) or similar in Venice'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nMurano, Burano And Torcello Half-Day Tour\n\xa0\nMurano, Burano and Torcello Half-Day Sightseeing Tour: Today visit Torcello, Murano, and Burano — three islands in the Venetian Lagoon — on this tour from Venice by motorboat. With a guide, watch glass being blown at a Murano glass factory, see historical cathedrals on Torcello, and admire exquisite handmade lace on Burano. This is a great way to see more than just the central sights of Venice and enjoy a cruise on the water.\n\xa0\nHighlights:\xa0\n\nVisit the three most famous islands in the Venetian Lagoon by motorboat\xa0\nWatch master glass blowers at work at a factory on Murano\xa0\nSee Byzantine churches on Torcello— the Church of Santa Fosca\xa0\nBrowse for lace on Burano and admire the painted houses\n\n\xa0\nMcArthurGlen Designer Outlet (Optional):\xa0 Later you can opt to visit the McArthurGlen Designer Outlet in Noventa di Piave is the most prestigious shopping outlet in Veneto, where you can find the most prestigious fashion with discounts up to 70% all around the year. Located just 30 minutes by car from Venice. Over 100 shops, restaurants, bars, lounges, play areas for children, located in a beautiful setting with architectural mosaics and frescoes inspired by the palaces in Venice and Treviso, where you can satisfy your thirst for great fashion, taking advantage of the offers and services designed specifically to make time spent here unforgettable.\n\xa0\nPlanning to Visit?\nClick the link below to conveniently book your shuttle bus tickets and enjoy exciting deals at the nearest outlet: https://mgbooking.tripodeck.com/home?orderCustId=6977233\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Diana (Standard) / Royal San Marco (Value) or similar in Venice'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0\nVenice To Florence Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Florence.\xa0\nUpon your arrival at Florence train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\nYou will have a transfer from Florence to Pisa and back to Florence.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\xa0\n\xa0\nPisa and the Leaning Tower Tour: This popular half-day trip takes you from Florence through the scenic Tuscan countryside to the historic city of Pisa. The tour focuses on Piazza dei Miracoli, a UNESCO World Heritage site, where you’ll see the Leaning Tower, the Cathedral, the Baptistery, and the Monumental Cemetery.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Albergo Firenze (Standard) /\xa0Atlantic Palace (Value) or similar in Florence'}, {'day': 10, 'description': '\xa0\nFlorence To Rome Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Rome.\xa0\nUpon your arrival at Rome train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Andreotti and Domus Australia\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Best Western Artdeco\xa0(Value) or similar in Rome'}, {'day': 11, 'description': "\xa0\nRome - Hop On Hop Off Tour\n\xa0\nHop on Hop Off Tour: Discover Rome's iconic sights and landmarks on a hop-on hop-off bus tour, offering a comprehensive overview of all the city’s highlights. Disembark at any of the multiple stops to see popular landmarks such as the Vatican City, Circus Maximus, the Pantheon, or the Colosseum. While on board the bus, listen to recorded commentary in multiple languages that details the history, architecture, culture, and traditions of the Eternal City.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Andreotti and Domus Australia\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Best Western Artdeco\xa0(Value) or similar in Rome'}, {'day': 12, 'description': 'Depart Rome\n\xa0\nBreakfast at the hotel and free time until check out (depending on the flight departure time).Gather your memories of tour and head on to airport in a private vehicle for your return Journey.\n\xa0\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ["\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nMercure Paris Opéra Faubourg Montmartre / Novotel Paris Center Eiffel Tower / Novotel Paris Center Gare Montparnasse / Mercure Paris Bercy Bibliotheque Hotel / Hotel Mademoiselle or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nCampus Hotel Hertenstein | Romantik Hotel Beau Rivage - Weggis | Hotel Baren Sigriswil | Hotel Eden Spiez | Seegarten Marina or similar\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\nBest Western Hotel Artdeco / Atlantico / Hotel Massimo D'azeglio / Hotel Diana Roof Garden / Best Western President or similar\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nAtlantic Palace / De La Ville / Embassy Hotel / Starhotels Michelangelo Florence / Hotel Principe di Firenze / C Hotel Club / C-hotels Ambassadors Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice\n\n\nRoyal San Marco Hotel / San Marco Palace / Hotel Kette / Bonvecchiati or similar or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0", '\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nSTANDARD CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nHotel Opera Lafayette / Color Design Hotel / Hôtel Champerret-Elysées / Londres Et New York Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nLa Pergola | Ibis Styles Bern City | Prizeotel Be