ors Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice\n\n\nRoyal San Marco Hotel / San Marco Palace / Hotel Kette / Bonvecchiati or similar or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0"}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'IT', 'countryName': 'Italy', 'continentName': 'Europe'}, {'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'FR', 'countryName': 'France', 'continentName': 'Europe'}, {'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'CH', 'countryName': 'Switzerland', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard', 'Value'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'price': 359100.0, 'hotels': ['\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nSTANDARD CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nHotel Opera Lafayette / Color Design Hotel / Hôtel Champerret-Elysées / Londres Et New York Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nLa Pergola | Ibis Styles Bern City | Prizeotel Bern-city | Jardin | Sorell Hotel Ador or similar\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\nAndreotti Hotel and Domus Australia / Hotel Villa San Lorenzo Maria / Hotel Des Artistes / Hotel Nord Nuova Roma / Hotel Windrose or similar\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nAlbergo Firenze / Hotel Boccaccio / Hotel Paris / Hotel Machiavelli Palace / Hotel Luxor Florence or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice\n\n\nHotel Diana / Albergo San Marco / San Zulian / Hotel Montecarlo or similar\n\n\n\n']}, {'category': 'Value', 'price': 429400.0, 'hotels': ["\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nMercure Paris Opéra Faubourg Montmartre / Novotel Paris Center Eiffel Tower / Novotel Paris Center Gare Montparnasse / Mercure Paris Bercy Bibliotheque Hotel / Hotel Mademoiselle or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nCampus Hotel Hertenstein | Romantik Hotel Beau Rivage - Weggis | Hotel Baren Sigriswil | Hotel Eden Spiez | Seegarten Marina or similar\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\nBest Western Hotel Artdeco / Atlantico / Hotel Massimo D'azeglio / Hotel Diana Roof Garden / Best Western President or similar\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nAtlantic Palace / De La Ville / Embassy Hotel / Starhotels Michelangelo Florence / Hotel Principe di Firenze / C Hotel Club / C-hotels Ambassadors Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice\n\n\nRoyal San Marco Hotel / San Marco Palace / Hotel Kette / Bonvecchiati or similar or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0"]}], 'meals': ['Breakfast Included'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['Transportation:\xa0[Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis]\n\nArrival Airport Transfer from Paris Airport to Hotel\nDeparture Airport Transfer from Rome Hotel to Airport\n\n\xa0\nTrain Tickets:\xa0[Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed]\n\n2nd Class Train Ticket Paris – Geneva / Basel (TGV).\nSwiss Pass 4 Days Consecutive Saver\nLucerne – Venice.\nVenice – Florence.\nFlorence – Rome.\n'], 'sightseeing': ['Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point)\n\nInteractive City Tour, Seine Cruise and Eiffel Tower 2nd Floor with Priority Access (SIC)\xa0\nMt Titlis Excursion (in conjunction with Swiss Pass)\nJungfraujoch Excursion (in conjunction with Swiss Pass)\nVenice: Venice Gondola Ride (30 Mins) and Serenade.\xa0\nVenice: Murano, Burano and Torcello Half-Day Sightseeing Tour\nFlorence: Pisa and the Leaning Tower Tour from Florence\xa0\xa0\nRome: Hop on Hop off in Rome\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': 'Accommodation:\n\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Paris based on the hotel category selected or similar\n4 Nights’ accommodation in Central Switzerland based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Venice based on the hotel category selected or similar\n1 Night accommodation in Florence based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Rome based on the hotel category selected or similar\n\n\xa0\nMeals:\n\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n\n\xa0\nTransportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis]\n\nArrival Airport Transfer from Paris Airport to Hotel\nDeparture Airport Transfer from Rome Hotel to Airport\n\n\xa0\nTrain Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed]\n\n2nd Class Train Ticket Paris – Geneva / Basel (TGV).\nSwiss Pass 4 Days Consecutive Saver\nLucerne – Venice.\nVenice – Florence.\nFlorence – Rome.\n\n\xa0\nSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point)\n\nInteractive City Tour, Seine Cruise and Eiffel Tower 2nd Floor with Priority Access (SIC)\xa0\nMt Titlis Excursion (in conjunction with Swiss Pass)\nJungfraujoch Excursion (in conjunction with Swiss Pass)\nVenice: Venice Gondola Ride (30 Mins) and Serenade.\xa0\nVenice: Murano, Burano and Torcello Half-Day Sightseeing Tour\nFlorence: Pisa and the Leaning Tower Tour from Florence\xa0\xa0\nRome: Hop on Hop off in Rome\n\n\xa0\nIntercity travel by Train (Second Class):\n\nLondon – Paris (Eurostar).\nParis – Geneva / Basel (TGV).\nSwiss Pass 4 Days Consecutive Saver.\nLucerne – Venice.\nVenice – Florence.\nFlorence – Rome.\n\n\xa0\nInsurance:\n\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included in the price.\nCity taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.\n', 'termsAndConditions': '\xa0\nImportant Notes:\n\nThe above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together.\nThe above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\nMaximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room.\nMidnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\nWIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed.\xa0\n(Supplement charges may apply for such services)\nStandard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs.\nMost hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned.\nAt this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability\n\n\xa0\nTerms And Conditions:\n\nTravel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 September 2026\nBlack out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nMaximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\nSurcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking.\nTo proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour.\nShould the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014536/Paris75390.jpeg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014536/itinerary/ParisViewFrance7533.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014536/itinerary/EiffelTowerParisFrance7534.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014536/itinerary/Lucerne.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014536/itinerary/89366_Mt._Titlis_Engelberg_Switzerland_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014536/itinerary/JUNGFRAUJOCH_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014536/itinerary/Glacier_3000_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014536/itinerary/VeniceRialtoBridgeItaly75312.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014536/itinerary/MuranoGlassShowroomVenice.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014536/itinerary/Pisa.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014536/itinerary/RomeItlay.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014536/itinerary/colosseum.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014536/itinerary/RomeCity.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014953', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014953', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Paris, Swiss And Italy - Private Journeys (Winter)', 'days': 12, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Venice', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Venice', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Florence', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rome', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rome', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rome', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014953_0_20260910120352.pdf', 'price': 890232, 'packageSummary': "The 'Paris, Swiss And Italy - Private Journeys (Winter)' package is a 12-day tour covering Paris, Central / Southern Switzerland, Florence, Rome, and Venice. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the Eiffel Tower, the Colosseum, the Florence Cathedral, and the historic canals of Venice, alongside breathtaking views of the Swiss Alps. Participants will enjoy private guided city tours, scenic train rides through the snow-capped Swiss countryside, and immersive cultural and historical sightseeing across these classic European destinations.", 'images': ['ParisViewFrance7533.jpg', 'EiffelTowerParisFrance7534.jpg', 'Interlaken2.jpg', 'Jungfraujoch3.jpg', 'Lucerne.jpg', '89366_Mt._Titlis_Engelberg_Switzerland_753.jpg', 'VeniceRialtoBridgeItaly75312.jpg', 'venice-it-11.jpg', 'Pisa.jpg', 'RomeItlay.jpg', 'colosseum.jpg', 'RomeCity.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 890232, 'thumbnailImage': 'Venice2678.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Private Journeys'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014953 is named 'Paris, Swiss And Italy - Private Journeys (Winter)' and spans 12 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Paris, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Paris, France Transfers: Upon your arrival at Paris International Airport, you will have a private transfer to the hotel. Special Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion Point to Point Airport transfer from Paris Airport to The Hotel, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Paris City Tour Paris City Tour: Enjoy a comprehensive Paris city tour with a half day guide, viewing iconic landmarks like the Louvre, Notre Dame, Champs Élysées, Arc de Triomphe, and Eiffel Tower. Includes a 1 hour Seine cruise and access to the Eiffel Tower’s 2nd floor for stunning panoramic views. Special Note: Vehicle at disposal for 10 hrs., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Paris to Central / Southern Switzerland Transfer: Travel from Paris to Switzerland on private basis. Across the border for the onward journey to Basel (Approx travel 6 hr 50 mins) Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs. Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Excursion to Jungfraujoch Mountain Jungfraujoch Excursion: Experience the unforgettable Jungfraujoch “Top of Europe” excursion. Travel from Interlaken to Grindelwald, then ride the cogwheel train via Kleine Scheidegg to the summit, enjoying spectacular views of the Eiger, Monch, and Jungfrau peaks along the way. Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Central Switzerland | Free Day| Free Day Activity (Optional): You will have a day free at leisure, or you can visit the city of lucerne. There are particularly many sights in a small area in Lucerne. The Chapel Bridge with the Water Tower is the landmark of Lucerne and the most photographed monument in Switzerland. Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Excursion to Mt. Titlis Excursion to Mt. Titlis: Discover Mt. Titlis from 3,020 m! Ride the Rotair cable car and admire glaciers, deep crevasses and ice boulders. Enjoy a high alpine panorama, the Ice Grotto, IceFlyer, FunLift and Europe’s highest Cliff Walk. Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Venice, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Central / Southern Switzerland to Venice Transfer: Travel from Switzerland to Venice on private basis. (Time travel of approx. 6-7 hours) Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs. Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Venice, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Venice Orientation Tour and Gondola Ride Transfer: Travel from Switzerland to Venice on private basis. (Time travel of approx. 6-7 hours) Private Transfer from Venice Mestre Hotel to Venice Piazzale Roma/Tronchetto Private Water Taxi from Tronchetto/Piazzale Roma to Venice St. Marks Square Private Water Taxi from Venice St. Marks Square to Tronchetto/Piazzale Roma Venice Orientation Tour and Gondola Ride: Enjoy a sunset walk-through Campo San Polo, Santa Margherita and San Barbara, pass the Frari and Scuola di San Rocco, hear Venice’s secrets, see the Guggenheim, then finish with a gondola ride. Special Note: Point to Point Transfers with Sightseeing on Private basis, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 9 - Florence, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Venice to Florence - Enroute PISA Transfer: Travel from Venice Mestre to Florence Enroute Pisa on private basis. (Time travel of approx. 4 hours) Tour of Pisa: Travel through Tuscany to historic Pisa. Enjoy a visit of Piazza dei Miracoli with the Leaning Tower, Cathedral and Baptistery, expert commentary on the Tower, Cathedral entry, if possible, then free time to explore the old city. (Entrance to Pisa is not included). Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs. (No guide or entrances included) Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 10 - Rome, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Florence to Rome Transfer: Travel from Florence to Rome on private basis. (Time travel of approx. 4 hours) Evening Walking Tour of Rome (Optional): You can opt for an evening walk as Rome reveals its mysterious side. With a guide, explore Campo de' Fiori, Via Giulia and Castel Sant'Angelo, hearing legends and dark tales that bring the Eternal City to life. (Supplement cost EUR 75 per person). Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs. Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 11 - Rome, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Guided Tour of Rome: Vatican & Colosseum. Guided Tour of Rome: Vatican & Colosseum: Tour the Vatican Museums and Sistine Chapel, admiring world class art, galleries and St. Peter’s Basilica. After lunch, explore ancient Rome with special Colosseum access, and see the Arch of Constantine, Palatine Hill and Via Sacra. Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 12 - Rome, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Rome Transfers: From Rome hotel to the Airport in private transfer. Special Note: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight Standard Category Travel Validity from 1 JULY – 31 OCTOBER 2026 NOTE: ADULT & CHILD COSTING WILL BE THE SAME FOR PRIVATE JOURNEYS Package Cost on 3* (Standard) Hotels: Based on Per Person Per Slab Starting From 8 – 9 Guests 10 – 11 Guests 12 Guests € 4,950 + INR 2250 € 4,490 + INR 2250 € 4,205 + INR 2250 Value Category Travel Validity from 1 JULY – 31 OCTOBER 2026 NOTE: ADULT & CHILD COSTING WILL BE THE SAME FOR PRIVATE JOURNEYS Package Cost on 4* (Value) Hotels: Based on Per Person Per Slab Starting From 8 – 9 Guests 10 – 11 Guests 12 Guests € 5,480 + INR 2250 € 5,105 + INR 2250 € 4,795 + INR 2250, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 890232.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4*\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nNovotel Paris 17 or Novotel Paris Centre Gare Montparnasse or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nMetropole Swiss Quality\xa0 / Interlaken Hotel/ Krebs / Romantik Hotel Wilden Mann /Hotel Continental-Park/ Grand Hotel Europe or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice\n\n\nHotel Plaza Venice or Garden Hotel Michelangelo or similar\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nC-hotels Ambasciatori or Hotel Embassy or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\niQ Hotel Roma or Hotel Best Western Premier Hotel Royal Santina or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0, \n\n\n\nHOTELS\xa0ENVISAGED\xa0OR\xa0SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCity\xa0Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\nCitadines Bastille Gare de Lyon Paris or ibis Paris Montmartre 18ème or similar\n\n\n\nCentral\xa0/\xa0Southern\xa0Switzerland\n\nHotel Merkur Interlaken /Chalet Swiss / Hotel Seeburg /Hotel Alpina / Hotel Weisses Kreuz or Hotel Bären or similar\n\n\n\nVenice\xa0Mestre\n\nCampanile Venice Mestre or Ca' dei Barcaroli or similar\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\nHotel Astro Mediceo or Sognando Firenze or similar\n\n\n\nRome\n\nBest Western Globus Hotel or Hotel Kennedy or Hotel Amalfi or similar\n\n\n. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\xa0\n. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ accommodation in Paris in the above-mentioned hotels or similar 4 Nights’ accommodation in Central / Southern Switzerland in the above-mentioned hotels or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Venice Mestre in the above-mentioned hotels or similar 1 Night accommodation in Florence in the above-mentioned hotels or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Rome in the above-mentioned hotels or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transfers: [Includes Point to Point Transfer with limited waiting hours] Arrival Private transfer from Paris Airport to Paris Hotel Departure transfer from Hotel to Rome airport Vehicle at disposal for 10 hrs. as mentioned in the itinerary Sightseeing: [Tour timing will have to be decided at the time of booking] Half day Guided Paris city tour Entrance to Eiffel tower (2nd level) Seine river cruise Jungfrau Excursion Mt. Titlis (Entrance Ticket) Venice Gondola ride Pisa tour Guided tour of Rome (Vatican Museum + Colosseum entrance) Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Meals other than those specified (if any). Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 5/ CHF 5 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head. Product Terms and Conditions: GENERAL NOTES: Quote for 2 guests is based on standard car like Toyota Prius or similar, Quote for 4 – 8 guests is based on Van like VW/Opel/Vito or similar, Quote from 10 guests it will be 14/16/19-seater vehicle or similar. If the guests exceed the seating capacity of the vehicle, then the rate will change based on a real-time basis as it will fall under coach packages For 2 to 6 guests, Vehicle is with driver cum guide. No separate guide If there are 5A + 3C or 6A + 2C or 4A + 4C etc. or similar, then we will have to check rates on real time basis. Blocking must be done a minimum 45 days prior to travel date with re-confirmation before 30 - 25 days of travel date unless there is an event then the booking has to be made on an immediate basis and the rate will be based on real-time availability If the travel date is during any festival, Sporting / Cultural / State or Government Event, Exhibition, Trade fairs etc. then the rate will change based on a real-time basis. SPECIAL NOTES: Hotels will be as per the names listed below or similar. If the requested hotels are not available, we will endeavor to book space in similarly priced hotels. Tips to drive & guide is not included (Nominal Tipping is EUR 5 Per person per day) We do not commit rooms with air conditioning. In case your guests are keen on the aircon, please let us know beforehand All the below itineraries have point to point transport on the arrival and departure day The vehicle will be on disposal for 10 driving hrs. per day. If guests exceed 10 hours, they will have to the pay extra hr. charges (to be advised at the time of booking) directly to the chauffeur. We aren’t holding any inventory of hotels / vehicles at the moment IMPORTANT NOTES: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost. TERMS AND CONDITIONS: Travel Validity: 1 July – 31 October 2026 // Except Blackout Period Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. TCS & GST would be levied as applicable The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayL