note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Merkur Interlaken\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Metropole Swiss Quality\xa0(Value) Or Similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nExcursion to Jungfraujoch Mountain\n\xa0\nJungfraujoch Excursion: Experience the unforgettable Jungfraujoch “Top of Europe” excursion. Travel from Interlaken to Grindelwald, then ride the cogwheel train via Kleine Scheidegg to the summit, enjoying spectacular views of the Eiger, Monch, and Jungfrau peaks along the way.\n\xa0\n Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Merkur Interlaken\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Metropole Swiss Quality\xa0(Value) Or Similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nCentral Switzerland | Free Day|\n\xa0\nFree Day Activity (Optional): You will have a day free at leisure, or you can visit the city of lucerne. There are particularly many sights in a small area in Lucerne. The Chapel Bridge with the Water Tower is the landmark of Lucerne and the most photographed monument in Switzerland.\n\xa0\n Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Merkur Interlaken\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Metropole Swiss Quality\xa0(Value) Or Similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nExcursion to Mt. Titlis\n\xa0\nExcursion to Mt. Titlis: Discover Mt. Titlis from 3,020 m! Ride the Rotair cable car and admire glaciers, deep crevasses and ice boulders. Enjoy a high alpine panorama, the Ice Grotto, IceFlyer, FunLift and Europe’s highest Cliff Walk.\n\xa0\n Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Merkur Interlaken\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Metropole Swiss Quality\xa0(Value) Or Similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nCentral / Southern Switzerland to Venice\nTransfer: Travel from Switzerland to Venice on private basis. (Time travel of approx. 6-7 hours)\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nVehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs.\nPlease note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Campanile Venice Mestre (Standard) /\xa0Hotel Plaza Venice (Value) or Similar in Venice'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nVenice Orientation Tour and Gondola Ride\n\xa0\nTransfer:\xa0\n\nTravel from Switzerland to Venice on private basis. (Time travel of approx. 6-7 hours)\nPrivate Transfer from Venice Mestre Hotel to Venice Piazzale Roma/Tronchetto\nPrivate Water Taxi from Tronchetto/Piazzale Roma to Venice St. Marks Square\nPrivate Water Taxi from Venice St. Marks Square to Tronchetto/Piazzale Roma\n\n\xa0\nVenice Orientation Tour and Gondola Ride: Enjoy a sunset walk-through Campo San Polo, Santa Margherita and San Barbara, pass the Frari and Scuola di San Rocco, hear Venice’s secrets, see the Guggenheim, then finish with a gondola ride.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Point to Point Transfers with Sightseeing on Private basis\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Campanile Venice Mestre (Standard) / Hotel Plaza Venice (Value) or Similar in Venice'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0\nVenice to Florence - Enroute PISA\n\xa0\nTransfer: Travel from Venice Mestre to Florence Enroute Pisa on private basis.\xa0\n(Time travel of approx. 4 hours)\n\xa0\nTour of Pisa: Travel through Tuscany to historic Pisa. Enjoy a visit of Piazza dei Miracoli with the Leaning Tower, Cathedral and Baptistery, expert commentary on the Tower, Cathedral entry, if possible, then free time to explore the old city. (Entrance to Pisa is not included).\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nVehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs. (No guide or entrances included)\nPlease note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Astro Mediceo (Standard) /\xa0C-hotels Ambasciatori\xa0(Value) or Similar in Florence'}, {'day': 10, 'description': "\xa0\nFlorence to Rome\nTransfer: Travel from Florence to Rome on private basis. (Time travel of approx. 4 hours)\n\xa0\nEvening Walking Tour of Rome (Optional): You can opt for an evening walk as Rome reveals its mysterious side. With a guide, explore Campo de' Fiori, Via Giulia and Castel Sant'Angelo, hearing legends and dark tales that bring the Eternal City to life. (Supplement cost EUR 75 per person).\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nVehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs.\nPlease note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\n", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Best Western Globus (Standard) /\xa0iQ Hotel Roma (Value) or Similar in Rome'}, {'day': 11, 'description': '\xa0\nGuided Tour of Rome: Vatican & Colosseum.\n\xa0\nGuided Tour of Rome: Vatican & Colosseum: Tour the Vatican Museums and Sistine Chapel, admiring world class art, galleries and St. Peter’s Basilica. After lunch, explore ancient Rome with special Colosseum access, and see the Arch of Constantine, Palatine Hill and Via Sacra.\n\xa0\n Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Best Western Globus (Standard) / iQ Hotel Roma (Value) or Similar in Rome'}, {'day': 12, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Rome\n\xa0\nTransfers: From Rome hotel to the Airport in private transfer.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight\xa0\n\xa0\nStandard Category\n\n\n\n\nTravel Validity from 1 JULY – 31 OCTOBER 2026\n\n\n\n\nNOTE: ADULT & CHILD COSTING WILL BE THE SAME FOR PRIVATE JOURNEYS\nPackage Cost on 3* (Standard) Hotels: Based on Per Person Per Slab Starting From\n\n\n\n\n8 – 9 Guests\n\n\n10 – 11 Guests