or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014953/Venice2678.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014953/itinerary/ParisViewFrance7533.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014953/itinerary/EiffelTowerParisFrance7534.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014953/itinerary/Interlaken2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014953/itinerary/Jungfraujoch3.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014953/itinerary/Lucerne.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014953/itinerary/89366_Mt._Titlis_Engelberg_Switzerland_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014953/itinerary/VeniceRialtoBridgeItaly75312.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014953/itinerary/venice-it-11.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014953/itinerary/Pisa.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014953/itinerary/RomeItlay.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014953/itinerary/colosseum.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014953/itinerary/RomeCity.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015379', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015379', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Moscow With Murmansk - Private Journeys', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Moscow', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Moscow', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Moscow', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Murmansk', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG012843_0_undefined.pdf', 'price': 233936, 'packageSummary': "The 'Moscow With Murmansk - Private Journeys' package is a 7-day tour covering the historic capital of Moscow and the Arctic city of Murmansk. This curated itinerary offers travelers a mix of cultural exploration and natural wonders, featuring key activities such as chasing the breathtaking Northern Lights, visiting a local husky park, and embarking on guided sightseeing tours of Moscow's iconic Red Square, the Kremlin, and its world-famous metro stations.", 'images': ['89933_Moscow_Kremlin_Russia_753.jpg', '007596_KREMLIN_Moscow_Russia_753.jpg', '650718_Christ_the_Savior_Cathedral_Moscow_Russia_753.jpg', 'Murmansk-1.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 233936, 'thumbnailImage': '44164_Radisson_Hotel_Cruise_Moscow_Russia_Optional_SRP.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015379 is named 'Moscow With Murmansk - Private Journeys' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Moscow, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Moscow Transfer: Upon your arrival at Moscow International Airport (SVO), you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle. Special Note: Hotel check-in will be as per the property’s standard check-in timings or at the sole discretion of the hotel. Early check-in requests are subject to availability and may incur additional charges. Rest of the day is free. Dinner on your own., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Moscow, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Moscow City Tour & River Cruise Meet the English-speaking guide at the hotel lobby for a panoramic Moscow city tour covering iconic landmarks such as Sparrow Hills, Moscow State University, Stalin Buildings, White House, Victory Park, Christ the Savior Cathedral, and Bolshoi Theatre. Later, enjoy a scenic Radisson Cruise ride., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Moscow, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Explore Moscow by Metro & Private Vehicle Meet the English-speaking guide at the hotel lobby for a combined metro and vehicle tour. Explore Red Square with highlights including the Kremlin (inside territory), St. Basil’s Cathedral, Lenin Mausoleum (outside), and GUM Shopping Center. Conclude with a fascinating Moscow Metro tour, showcasing its historic stations adorned with marble, mosaics, and chandeliers, a true underground museum of Russian history., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Murmansk, Meals: Breakfast, Description: St. Petersburg To Murmansk By Flight Transfer: Private Transfer to St. Petersburg Airport. Special Note: ** Domestic flight to Murmansk is not included and to be booked on your own ** Transfer: Private Transfer from Murmansk Airport to Hotel. Murmansk Tour with visit to Lenin Icebreaker Ship: Enjoy a city tour exploring World War II landmarks, including the Alyosha Monument honoring Subarctic defenders, followed by a photo stop at the historic Lenin Icebreaker Ship. Special Note: Hotel check-in will be as per the property’s standard check-in timings or at the sole discretion of the hotel. Early check-in requests are subject to availability and may incur additional charges. Rest of the day is free. Dinner on your own. Northern Lights Hunting Tour: At 21:00 hrs, embark on the ‘Hunting for Northern Lights’ night tour to experience the magical Aurora Borealis. Visibility is not guaranteed, but it’s an unforgettable adventure to try your luck under the Arctic sky., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 233936.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at the Hotels, \n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\xa0 \n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\nStandard Category\n\n\n\n\nMoscow\n\n\nHotel Holiday Inn or Similar\n\n\n\n\nSt. Petersburg\n\n\nCosmos Nevsky/Ambassador/Holiday Inn or Similar\n\n\n\n\nMurmansk\n\n\nAzimut/Meridian/Cosmos or Similar\n\n\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included, \nDaily Buffet Breakfast except on Day 1.\n. Inclusions: Accommodation: 3 Nights’ accommodation in Moscow based on the hotel category selected or similar 3 Nights’ accommodation in Murmansk based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast (Except Day 1). Transportation: [Includes Private Transfers on Point-to-Point Basis] Return Private Transfer from Moscow Airport to the Hotel. Return Private Transfer from Murmansk Hotel to the Airport. Sightseeing: (The tours will operate on Private basis) Panoramic City tour of Moscow Moscow River Cruise Red Square Walking Tour Visit Kremlin Inside Territory Area (Entrance tickets included) Moscow Metro tour Murmansk Northern Lights Hunt Teriberka for the Arctic Coast and Arctic Desert Sledge Ride towards waterfall (Subject to weather conditions) Visit to Severnoe Siyanie park (Active Recreational Husky Park) Reindeer Sledge Ride (Subject to weather conditions) Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs. age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head. Blackout Period: 15th December 26 – 15th January 27. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Notes: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability Terms And Conditions: Travel Validity: 01 November 2026 – 31 March 2027 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', 'cityCode': 'STV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Aurangabad', 'cityCode': 'IXU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Amritsar', 'cityCode': 'ATQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Nagpur', 'cityCode': 'NAG', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Madurai', 'cityCode': 'IXM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Allahabad', 'cityCode': 'IXD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Vadodara', 'cityCode': 'BDQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Moscow With Murmansk - Private Journeys' package is a 7-day tour covering the historic capital of Moscow and the Arctic city of Murmansk. This curated itinerary offers travelers a mix of cultural exploration and natural wonders, featuring key activities such as chasing the breathtaking Northern Lights, visiting a local husky park, and embarking on guided sightseeing tours of Moscow's iconic Red Square, the Kremlin, and its world-famous metro stations.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Moscow\nTransfer: Upon your arrival at Moscow International Airport (SVO), you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle.\nSpecial Note: Hotel check-in will be as per the property’s standard check-in timings or at the sole discretion of the hotel. Early check-in requests are subject to availability and may incur additional charges. Rest of the day is free. Dinner on your own.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Holiday Inn or similar in Moscow'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nMoscow City Tour & River Cruise\nMeet the English-speaking guide at the hotel lobby for a panoramic Moscow city tour covering iconic landmarks such as Sparrow Hills, Moscow State University, Stalin Buildings, White House, Victory Park, Christ the Savior Cathedral, and Bolshoi Theatre. Later, enjoy a scenic Radisson Cruise ride.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Holiday Inn or similar in Moscow'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nExplore Moscow by Metro & Private Vehicle\nMeet the English-speaking guide at the hotel lobby for a combined metro and vehicle tour. Explore Red Square with highlights including the Kremlin (inside territory), St. Basil’s Cathedral, Lenin Mausoleum (outside), and GUM Shopping Center. Conclude with a fascinating Moscow Metro tour, showcasing its historic stations adorned with marble, mosaics, and chandeliers, a true underground museum of Russian history.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Holiday Inn or similar in Moscow'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nSt. Petersburg To Murmansk By Flight\nTransfer: Private Transfer to St. Petersburg Airport.\nSpecial Note: ** Domestic flight to Murmansk is not included and to be booked on your own **\nTransfer: Private Transfer from Murmansk Airport to Hotel.\n\xa0\nMurmansk Tour with visit to Lenin Icebreaker Ship:\nEnjoy a city tour exploring World War II landmarks, including the Alyosha Monument honoring Subarctic defenders, followed by a photo stop at the historic Lenin Icebreaker Ship.\nSpecial Note: Hotel check-in will be as per the property’s standard check-in timings or at the sole discretion of the hotel. Early check-in requests are subject to availability and may incur additional charges. Rest of the day is free. Dinner on your own.\n\xa0\nNorthern Lights Hunting Tour:\nAt 21:00 hrs, embark on the ‘Hunting for Northern Lights’ night tour to experience the magical Aurora Borealis. Visibility is not guaranteed, but it’s an unforgettable adventure to try your luck under the Arctic sky.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Azimut or similar in\xa0Murmansk'}]}, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels', '\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\xa0 \n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\nStandard Category\n\n\n\n\nMoscow\n\n\nHotel Holiday Inn or Similar\n\n\n\n\nSt. Petersburg\n\n\nCosmos Nevsky/Ambassador/Holiday Inn or Similar\n\n\n\n\nMurmansk\n\n\nAzimut/Meridian/Cosmos or Similar\n\n\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'1': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '0': '\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\xa0 \n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\nStandard Category\n\n\n\n\nMoscow\n\n\nHotel Holiday Inn or Similar\n\n\n\n\nSt. Petersburg\n\n\nCosmos Nevsky/Ambassador/Holiday Inn or Similar\n\n\n\n\nMurmansk\n\n\nAzimut/Meridian/Cosmos or Similar\n\n\n\n\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'RU', 'countryName': 'Russia', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Value'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Value', 'price': 233900.0, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels']}], 'meals': ['Breakfast Included', '\nDaily Buffet Breakfast except on Day 1.\n'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point)\n\nMetro tour to explore some beautiful metro stations of Moscow with English speaking guide. (With Entrance Tickets)\nPanoramic City tour of Moscow (Sparrow hills / Moscow State University / Stalin Buildings / White House /Victory Park View / Cathedral of Christ The Savior / Bolshoi Theatre) with English Speaking Guide.\n1 walking tour of Red square / Kremlin area & other surrounding area of famous places of City (To explore the Real heart of the city).\nVisit Kremlin Inside Territory Area with Cathedral (Entrance tickets included), English speaking guide.\nMoscow River 5* Radisson Cruise ride (Cruise ticket Included) (2.30 hrs. Ride)\nThe Hermitage Museum (With Entrance Ticket) with English speaking guide.\nPanoramic City tour of Saint Petersburg city with English speaking in A/c Vehicle on private basis.\nVisit to Kazan Cathedral (Free Entrance) with English speaking guide.\nVisit to Palace Square.\nPanoramic City Tour of Murmansk\nVisit to Peterhof Palace and Parkland (With Entrance)\nVisit the Lenin Icebreaker Museum (without Entrance) Only Photostop\xa0\nHunting for Northern Lights Tours” on shared basis\nTeriberka (Subject to weather conditions)\n', 'Sightseeing as per itinerary'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': 'Accommodation:\n\n3 Nights’ accommodation in Moscow based on the hotel category selected or similar\n3 Nights’ accommodation in Murmansk based on the hotel category selected or similar\n\nMeals:\n\nDaily Breakfast (Except Day 1).\n\n\xa0\nTransportation: [Includes Private Transfers on Point-to-Point Basis]\n\nReturn Private Transfer from Moscow Airport to the Hotel.\nReturn Private Transfer from Murmansk Hotel to the Airport.\n\n\xa0\nSightseeing:\xa0(The tours will operate on Private basis)\n\nPanoramic City tour of Moscow\nMoscow River Cruise\nRed Square Walking Tour\nVisit Kremlin Inside Territory Area (Entrance tickets included)\nMoscow Metro tour\nMurmansk Northern Lights Hunt\xa0\nTeriberka for the Arctic Coast and Arctic Desert\xa0\nSledge Ride towards waterfall (Subject to weather conditions)\nVisit to Severnoe Siyanie park (Active Recreational Husky Park)\nReindeer Sledge Ride (Subject to weather conditions)\n\n\xa0\nInsurance:\n\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs. age group only)\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included in the price.\nCity taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.\nBlackout Period: 15t