PricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Madurai', 'cityCode': 'IXM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Truly Turkiye - Private Tour' package is a 9-day tour covering Antalya, Kusadasi, Cappadocia, and Istanbul. The itinerary includes visits to the ancient ruins of Ephesus, the breathtaking fairy chimneys of Cappadocia, the historic old town of Kaleici in Antalya, and iconic landmarks in Istanbul such as the Hagia Sophia and the Blue Mosque. Participants will enjoy private guided city tours, a scenic Bosphorus cruise, and the unforgettable experience of a hot air balloon ride over the unique Cappadocian landscape.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': 'Arrival into Istanbul\nTransfers: Upon arrival you will be met the representative & transferred to the hotel on private basis.\nSpecial Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\nOptional Activity: Bosphorus Dinner Cruise\nEnjoy an enchanting evening on the Bosphorus Strait with a leisurely dinner cruise that showcases Istanbul’s beauty by night. Sail between Europe and Asia as you pass iconic landmarks such as the Bosphorus Bridge, Dolmabahçe Palace, and the illuminated waterfront mansions. The experience is complemented by a delicious Turkish dinner and live entertainment, often including traditional music and folk dance performances, making it a memorable blend of scenic views, culture, and cuisine. [The supplement cost for this activity will be approx. US$ 80/- per adult & US$ 55/- for children below 6 years]', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Four Side Lions Taksim\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hilton Double Tree Piyalepasa\xa0(Premium) or similar in\xa0Istanbul'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nFull-Day Guided Tour Of Istanbul On Private Basis\nIstanbul City Tour : Between 09:00 and 10:00 hrs, you will be picked up from your hotel (pickup time subject to hotel location) for a full day guided city tour. The tour includes visits to the Hagia Sophia Mosque (entrance not included), the pride of Byzantine architecture; the Byzantine Hippodrome, once the venue for ancient chariot races; and the Blue Mosque, renowned for its exquisite blue Iznik tiles. You will also visit the Topkapi Palace (entrance not included), the former residence of the Ottoman Sultans, followed by time at the Grand Bazaar, Turkey’s largest covered market with over 4,000 shops.\nLunch will be served at a local restaurant, after which you will be transferred back to your hotel.\nSpecial Notes:\nSightseeing will be conducted on a private basis, The vehicle will be provided only for the scheduled sightseeing activities and will not be at disposal beyond the itinerary.\nEntrance to the Hagia Sophia Mosque and Topkapi Palace is available at an additional supplement.\nSupplement costs:\nHagia Sophia: US$ 35 - 40/- Per adult (*Under 8 years Free)\xa0 \xa0\nTopkapi Palace US$ 65/- Per adult (*Under 6 years Free)\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Four Side Lions Taksim\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hilton Double Tree Piyalepasa\xa0(Premium) or similar in\xa0Istanbul'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nIstanbul To Cappadocia\nTransfers:\n\nToday you will have a private transfer from the hotel to the Airport for onward flight\nUpon arrival at Cappadocia, there will be a private transfer from the airport to the Hotel.\n\nSpecial Notes:\n\nPlease note that the domestic flight from Istanbul to Cappadocia is not included in the tour cost and will be charged as an additional supplement.\nPlease note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Dedeli\xa0Cave\xa0\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hanedan\xa0Cave\xa0Suites\xa0(Premium)\xa0or similar in\xa0Cappadocia'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0Explore Cappadocia\xa0\nOptional Activity: Hot Air Balloon\nIf a hot air balloon ride is on your bucket list, Cappadocia offers one of the most iconic experiences in the world. Drift gently at sunrise above a surreal, lunar like landscape of volcanic rock formations, fairy chimneys, and honeycombed valleys, as dozens of vibrantly colored balloons rise alongside you. This unforgettable experience offers breathtaking panoramic views and spectacular photo opportunities. [The supplement cost for this activity will be upon “On Request Basis”]\nPlease Note:\xa0 Children below 6 years of age or under 120 cm in height are not permitted to participate in the hot air balloon ride.\nCappadocia Sightseeing: After breakfast, between 09:00 and 10:00 hrs, you will be picked up from your hotel to begin a full day tour of Cappadocia. The first stop is Devrent Valley (Imagination Valley), known for its spectacular fairy chimneys and uniquely shaped rock formations set amidst beautiful landscape.\nYou will then visit Pasabag (Monks Valley), famous for its remarkable double\xa0and triple headed rock formations, once used as hermit dwellings by monks. Lunch will be served in Avanos, a town renowned for its traditional pottery craftsmanship and located along the Red River (Kizilirmak).\nAfter lunch (on your own), continue to the Goreme Open Air Museum, the heart of Cappadocia, celebrated for its rock cut churches adorned with wall paintings dating back to the 10th century, depicting scenes from the life of Jesus and early Christian monastic life.\nThe tour concludes with a photo stop at Uchisar Castle, a natural rock citadel and one of the largest fairy chimney formations in the region, offering panoramic views of Cappadocia.\nSpecial Notes:\xa0\n\nSightseeing will be conducted on a private basis, The vehicle will be provided only for the scheduled sightseeing activities and will not be at disposal beyond the itinerary.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Dedeli\xa0Cave\xa0\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hanedan\xa0Cave\xa0Suites\xa0(Premium)\xa0or similar in\xa0Cappadocia'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0Cappadocia To Izmir\nTransfers:\xa0\n1. Today you will have a private transfer from the hotel to the Airport for onward flight\n2. Upon arrival at Izmir, there will be a private transfer from the airport to the hotel in Kusadasi.\nSpecial Notes:\xa0\n1. Please note that the domestic flight from Cappadocia to Izmir is not included in the tour cost and will be charged as an additional supplement.\xa0\n2. Please note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Efe Boutique (Value) / Signature blue (Premium) or similar in kusadasi.\n\xa0\n\xa0\n\xa0'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0Full Day Kusadasi Tour On Private Basis\nTransfers: The sightseeing will be on a private basis. The vehicle will be provided only for the scheduled sightseeing activities and will not be at disposal beyond the itinerary.\nFull Day Kusadasi Tour on PVT basis: Enjoy a full-day guided tour of Kusadasi, including a visit to the ancient city of Ephesus, one of the best-preserved archaeological sites in the Mediterranean followed by the Temple of Artemis and the charming Sirince Village\nThe tour then takes you to the charming Sirince Village, known for its traditional architecture, local crafts, and scenic hillside atmosphere. Lunch will be served at a local restaurant. After the tour, you will be transferred back to your hotel.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Efe Boutique (Value) / Signature blue (Premium) or similar in kusadasi.\n\xa0'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nFull Day Pamukkale Tour On Private Basis\nTransfers: The sightseeing will be on a private basis. The vehicle will be provided only for the scheduled sightseeing activities and will not be at disposal beyond the itinerary.\nFull Day Pamukkale Tour on PVT basis: Enjoy a full-day guided tour of Pamukkale, including visits to the ancient city of Hierapolis , the famous Cotton Terraces, and key archaeological sites such as the Domitian Gate, Latrina, Oil Factory, Agora, Byzantine Gate, Triton Fountain, and the Temple of Apollo. After the tour, you will be transferred to Antalya.', 'mealDescription': '\xa0Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Best Western Khan (Value)/ Holiday Inn Lara Hotel (Premium) or similar'}, {'day': 8, 'description': 'Full Day Antalya Tour On Private Basis\nTransfers: The sightseeing will be on a private basis. The vehicle will be provided only for the scheduled sightseeing activities and will not be at disposal beyond the itinerary.\nFull Day Antalya Tour with Kursunlu Waterfall on PVT basis:\xa0Enjoy a full day sightseeing experience in Antalya, featuring visits to Kursunlu Waterfall, the historic Old Town of Kaleici, and key landmarks including Hadrian’s Gate, Hidirlik Hill, the Clock Tower, the Fluted Minaret, and Palm Street.', 'mealDescription': '\xa0Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Best Western Khan (Value)/ Holiday Inn Lara Hotel (Premium) or similar\n\xa0'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0Depart Antalya\nTransfers: From Antalya hotel to Antalya Airport in a private transfer.Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'NA'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nFour Sides Lion Taksim / Erboy Hotel/ Konak Taksim\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nDedeli Cave / Sunak Cave Hote\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nKusadasi\n\n\nEfe Boutique Hotel/