 tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014771/60842_Mevlana_Museum_in_Konya_Turkey_SRP.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014771/itinerary/Istanbul753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014771/itinerary/Istanbul.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014771/itinerary/Cappadocia7532.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014771/itinerary/Cappadocia7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014771/itinerary/Kusadasi_1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014771/itinerary/Pamukkale.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014771/itinerary/Antalya.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014771/itinerary/Antalya-Beach.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014771/itinerary/return-home.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015065', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015065', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Lapland Of Sweden', 'days': 5, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Kiruna', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kiruna', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kiruna', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kiruna', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kiruna', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG012446_0_20240410184106.pdf', 'price': 252185, 'packageSummary': "The 'Lapland Of Sweden' package is a 5-day tour centered in the Arctic destination of Kiruna. The itinerary is packed with unforgettable winter experiences, including guided excursions to witness the breathtaking Northern Lights, thrilling dog sledding adventures, and snowmobile safaris through the pristine wilderness. Participants will also enjoy a visit to the iconic Icehotel, experience traditional Sami culture, and immerse themselves in the magical snowy landscapes of the Swedish highlands.", 'images': ['Kiruna 1.jpg', 'Kiruna_Sweden1.jpg', 'Kiruna_Sweden2.jpg', 'KirunaSweden4jpg.jpg', 'KirunaSweden3jpg.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 252185, 'thumbnailImage': 'Kiruna.avif', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015065 is named 'Lapland Of Sweden' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Kiruna, Meals: NA, Description: Arrive Kiruna Transfers: Upon your arrival you will meet the representative and then be transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle. Kiruna Northern Lights chase by minivan: In the evening enjoy a Northern Lights chase by minivan. The guide finds the best viewing spots within one hundred km and takes you there maximizing your chances of seeing and photographing the stunning Aurora Borealis. Special Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15.00 hrs or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Kiruna, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Icehotel and Dog Sledding Tour Icehotel Tour: Icehotel founded in 1989 is the original hotel made of ice and snow and a world class destination. Icehotel three sixty five features Art Suites Deluxe Suites an ice gallery and Icebar all crafted by international artists and ice builders. Dog sledding tour: Enjoy a dog sledding tour in Laplands Jukkasjarvi and Torne River area. Ride with huskies through snowy wilderness surrounded by silence stunning scenery and the rhythm of sled runners on snow., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Kiruna, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Abisko With National Park Abisko With National Park Tour: Abisko National Park with Lapporten is a highlight of Swedish Lapland. Walk through a dramatic canyon at Abiskojokka enjoy views of Lake Tornetrask and visit the Silver Falls near Bjorkliden a powerful waterfall in the Rakkasjohka valley., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Kiruna, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Snowmobile Tour Snowmobile Tour: Enjoy a three hour snowmobile tour through northern Swedens winter landscape. Ride across frozen lakes and wild forest areas surrounded by deep snow. Experience the thrill of driving while taking in stunning snow covered scenery., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Kiruna, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Transfers: You will be transferred from Kiruna hotel to the Airport on private transfer. Special Notes: You will reach airport three to four hours prior to your departure flight. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 252185.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at the Hotels, \n\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nKIRUNA\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nScandic City or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n, \xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nHelsinki\n\n\nHotel Haaga Central Park / Hotel Anna / Hotel Arthur / Scandic Kallio or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Grand Marina /\xa0 Scandic Meilahti\xa0 / Scandic Marski / Valo Hotel Helsinki \xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n, \n1 dinner included at Northern Lights Village Saariselka Resort\n5 lunches included (days 2, 3, 4, 5 and 6 of the program)\n. Inclusions: Accommodation 4 Nights’ accommodation in Kiruna based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals Daily Breakfast (Except Day 1) Transportation [Includes Privates services on Point-to-Point Basis] Arrival Transfers from Kiruna Airport to the Hotel Departure transfers from Kiruna hotel to Kiruna Airport Sightseeing (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point) Kiruna Northern lights chase by minivan Icehotel Tour Dog sledding tour Abisko With National Park Tour Snowmobile Tour Insurance Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel Cost of foreign exchange for personal use Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head Black out Period: Surcharges could be applicable from 15 December’26 – 10 January’27. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Notes • The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together • The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events • Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room • Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. • WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed • (Supplement charges may apply for such services) • Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. • Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned • At this point of time no services are confirmed an