 'BDQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Lapland Of Sweden' package is a 5-day tour centered in the Arctic destination of Kiruna. The itinerary is packed with unforgettable winter experiences, including guided excursions to witness the breathtaking Northern Lights, thrilling dog sledding adventures, and snowmobile safaris through the pristine wilderness. Participants will also enjoy a visit to the iconic Icehotel, experience traditional Sami culture, and immerse themselves in the magical snowy landscapes of the Swedish highlands.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\n\n\xa0\nArrive Kiruna\nTransfers: Upon your arrival you will meet the representative and then be transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle.\nKiruna Northern Lights chase by minivan: In the evening enjoy a Northern Lights chase by minivan. The guide finds the best viewing spots within one hundred km and takes you there maximizing your chances of seeing and photographing the stunning Aurora Borealis.\nSpecial Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15.00 hrs or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only.\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'NA', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Scandic City or similar in Kiruna'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\n\n\xa0\nIcehotel and Dog Sledding Tour\nIcehotel Tour: Icehotel founded in 1989 is the original hotel made of ice and snow and a world class destination. Icehotel three sixty five features Art Suites Deluxe Suites an ice gallery and Icebar all crafted by international artists and ice builders.\nDog sledding tour: Enjoy a dog sledding tour in Laplands Jukkasjarvi and Torne River area. Ride with huskies through snowy wilderness surrounded by silence stunning scenery and the rhythm of sled runners on snow.\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Scandic City or similar in Kiruna'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\n\n\xa0\nAbisko With National Park\nAbisko With National Park Tour: Abisko National Park with Lapporten is a highlight of Swedish Lapland. Walk through a dramatic canyon at Abiskojokka enjoy views of Lake Tornetrask and visit the Silver Falls near Bjorkliden a powerful waterfall in the Rakkasjohka valley.\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Scandic City or similar in Kiruna'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\n\n\xa0\nSnowmobile Tour\nSnowmobile Tour: Enjoy a three hour snowmobile tour through northern Swedens winter landscape. Ride across frozen lakes and wild forest areas surrounded by deep snow. Experience the thrill of driving while taking in stunning snow covered scenery.\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Scandic City or similar in Kiruna'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\n\n\xa0\nDepart\nTransfers: You will be transferred from Kiruna hotel to the Airport on private transfer.\nSpecial Notes: You will reach airport three to four hours prior to your departure flight.\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Scandic City or similar in Kiruna'}]}, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels', '\n\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nKIRUNA\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nScandic City or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n', '\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nHelsinki\n\n\nHotel Haaga Central Park / Hotel Anna / Hotel Arthur / Scandic Kallio or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Grand Marina /\xa0 Scandic Meilahti\xa0 / Scandic Marski / Valo Hotel Helsinki \xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0'], 'hotels_list': {'2': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '0': '\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nHelsinki\n\n\nHotel Haaga Central Park / Hotel Anna / Hotel Arthur / Scandic Kallio or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Grand Marina /\xa0 Scandic Meilahti\xa0 / Scandic Marski / Valo Hotel Helsinki \xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0', '1': '\n\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nKIRUNA\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nScandic City or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'SE', 'countryName': 'Sweden', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Value'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Value', 'price': 252200.0, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nKIRUNA\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nScandic City or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n']}], 'meals': ['\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n', '\n1 dinner included at Northern Lights Village Saariselka Resort\n5 lunches included (days 2, 3, 4, 5 and 6 of the program)\n'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary', 'Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis]\n\nArrival Transfers from Kiruna Airport to the Hotel\nDeparture transfers from Kiruna hotel to Kiruna Airport\n'], 'sightseeing': ['Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n\nKiruna Northern lights chase by minivan\nIcehotel Tour\nDog sledding tour\nAbisko With National Park Tour\nSnowmobile Tour \n', '\nRental of winter thermal clothing from day 2 to day 7 of the program\xa0\nDay 2: Visit to a husky dog farm & Santa Claus Village\nDay 3 - 3h30m cruise on the icebreaker ship Sampo & Visit to the Ice Castle in Kemi\nDay 5 - 2-hour snowmobile safari &\nVisit to a Sami farm including a short ride on a reindeer sleigh &\xa0\nNight Safari "Aurora Borealis" with grilled sausages and hot drinks\nDay 6 – 4-hour visit to Ranua Zoo\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': 'Accommodation\xa0\xa0\n\n4 Nights’ accommodation in Kiruna based on the hotel category selected or similar\xa0\xa0\n\nMeals\xa0\xa0\n\nDaily Breakfast (Except Day 1)\xa0\xa0\n\nTransportation\xa0\xa0\xa0[Includes Privates services on Point-to-Point Basis]\n\nArrival Transfers from Kiruna Airport to the Hotel\xa0\xa0\nDeparture transfers from Kiruna hotel to Kiruna Airport\xa0\xa0\n\nSightseeing\xa0\xa0\xa0(For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n\nKiruna Northern lights chase by minivan\xa0\xa0\nIcehotel Tour\xa0\xa0\nDog sledding tour\xa0\xa0\nAbisko With National Park Tour\xa0\xa0\nSnowmobile Tour\xa0\xa0\n\nInsurance\xa0\xa0\n\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\xa0\xa0\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges\xa0\xa0\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\xa0\xa0\nDrinks during meals\xa0\xa0\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount\xa0\xa0\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature\xa0\xa0\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included\xa0\xa0\nCity taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel\xa0\xa0\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use\xa0\xa0\nCost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual\xa0\xa0\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head\xa0\xa0\nBlack out Period: Surcharges could be applicable from 15 December’26 – 10 January’27\xa0\xa0\n', 'termsAndConditions': 'Important Notes\xa0\n• The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together\xa0\xa0\n• The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\xa0\xa0\n• Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room\xa0\xa0\n• Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\xa0\xa0\n• WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed\xa0\xa0\n• (Supplement charges may apply for such services)\xa0\xa0\n• Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs.\xa0\xa0\n• Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned\xa0\xa0\n• At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability\xa0\xa0\n• TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost\xa0\xa0\n\xa0\nTerms and Conditions\n• Travel Validity: 1 November 2026 – 31 March 2027\xa0\xa0\n• Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ\xa0\xa0\n• The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times\xa0\xa0\n• Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room\xa0\xa0\n• The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\xa0\xa0\n• Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking\xa0\xa0\n• To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour\xa0\xa0\n• Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly\xa0\xa0\n• The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates\xa0\xa0\n• We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package\xa0\xa0\n• International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed\xa0\xa0\n• Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only\xa0\xa0\n• No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service\xa0\xa0\n• All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking\xa0\xa0\n• Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice\xa0\xa0\n• Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends\xa0\xa0\n• Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time\xa0\xa0\n• As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients\xa0\xa0\n• The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation\xa0\xa0', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'N', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015065/Kiruna.avif', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015065/itinerary/Kiruna_1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015065/itinerary/Kiruna_Sweden1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015065/itinerary/Kiruna_Sweden2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015065/itinerary/KirunaSweden4jpg.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015065/itinerary/KirunaSweden3jpg.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014805', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014805', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Discover Croatia with Slovenia', 'days': 9, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Ljubljana', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Ljubljana', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Zagreb', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Zadar', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Zadar', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Split', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubrovnik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubrovnik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dubrovnik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014805_0_20261007161333.pdf', 'price': 186161, 'packageSummary': "The 'Discover Croatia with Slovenia' package is a 9-day tour covering Dubrovnik, Zadar, Split, Zagreb, and Ljubljana. The itinerary includes visits to the ancient city walls of Dubrovnik, the unique Sea Organ in Zadar, the historic Diocletian's Palace in Split, and the picturesque Ljubljana Castle. Participants will enjoy guided walking tours of historic old towns, scenic coastal drives along the Adriatic, and opportunities to explore charming local markets and cultural landmarks.", 'images': ['Ljubljana.jpg', 'Lake_Bled.jpg', 'Zagerb (1).jpg', 'ZADAR-c.jpg', 'croatia-Split.jpg', 'Diocletians.jpg', 'Dubrovnik-1.jpg', 'DUBROVNIK-para.jpg', 'Croatia-Dubrovnik.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 186161, 'thumbnailImage': 'Zagreb_SRP.jpeg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014805 is named 'Discover Croatia with Slovenia' and spans 9 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Ljubljana, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Ljubljana Transfers: Upon your arrival at the Ljubljana airport, you will be transferred to the hotel on private basis. Walking Tour of Ljubljana with Funicular Ride (Optional): Enjoy an evening walking tour of Ljubljana from Town Hall Square. Explore major sights and the historic center, then ride the funicular to Ljubljana Castle for stunning city views (castle entry not included). Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Ljubljana, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Ljubljana - Lake Bled - Postojna & Predjama Ljubljana - Lake Bled - Postojna & Predjama - Ljubljana: Visit Lake Bled, sail to Bled Island by traditional Pletna boat, and enjoy stunning views. Explore Bled Castle, then continue to Postojna Cave for a scenic train ride through its vast halls. End at Predjama Castle, dramatically set in a cliff. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Zagreb, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Ljubljana - Zagreb | Zagreb Walking Tour Transfers: Today you will travel from Ljubljana to Zagreb by bus on shared basis. Walking Tour of Zagreb: Explore Zagrebs highlights on a guided walking tour with a scenic funicular ride. Discover the charm of both Lower and Upper Town, uncover hidden gems, and hear the stories that shaped Croatias vibrant capital. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Zadar, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Zagreb - Zadar | Enroute Plitvice National Park | Transfers: 1. This morning travel to Zadar, enroute visit Plitvice National Park. 2. Later continue your journey to Zadar Plitvice National Park: Plitvice National Park dazzles with waterfalls, lakes, and forested cliffs. Your ticket includes full access to trails and boardwalks, a panoramic train ride, shuttle buses between lakes, and an electric boat cruise on Kozjak Lake., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Zadar, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Walking Tour Of Zadar Walking Tour of Zadar: Enjoy a guided walking tour of Zadars Old City, including St. Donat, St. Anastasia, city gates, walls, and the Square of Five Wells. Sample Maraschino liqueur and Pag cheese, then relax by the Sea Organ and admire the sunset. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only. 2. You can opt for a Romantic Sunset Cruise at a supplement cost, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Split, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Zadar - Split | Walking Tour Of Split Transfers: Today you will travel from Zadar to Split by bus on shared basis. Walking Tour of Split: Enjoy an evening walking tour of Split and explore the 1700 year old Diocletians Palace. See St. Domnius Cathedral, the Peristil, Golden Gate, and Gregory of Nin. End with the 24 hour sun clock at City Square and the Riva promenade. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Dubrovnik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Split - Dubrovnik| Walking Tour Of Dubrovnik Transfers: Today you will travel from Split to Dubrovnik by bus on shared basis. Walking Tour of Dubrovnik: Enjoy an evening walking tour of Dubrovnik and a Cable Car ride. Explore the Old Towns history, architecture, and culture, then ride to the top of Srd Hill for stunning views of the Adriatic Sea and the city below. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Dubrovnik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Trip To Bosnia & Herzegovina Trip to Bosnia & Herzegovina: Explore Bosnia and Herzegovina on a day trip and visit UNESCO listed Mostar. Wander cobbled streets, see Ottomanera mosques and bathhouses, and admire the iconic Stari Most - one of the modern worlds most remarkable bridges. Special Note: 1. Guest should be carrying their passport with valid Schengen Visa. 2. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 9 - Dubrovnik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Transfers: You will have a private transfer from Dubrovnik hotel to Dubrovnik Airport. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 186161.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nHOTELS\xa0ENVISAGED\xa0OR\xa0SIMILAR\xa0\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCity\xa0Name\n\n\nSTANDARD\xa0CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nLjubljana\n\n\nHotel\xa0Park\xa0Ljubljana,\xa0Ibis\xa0styles\xa0Ljubljana\xa0centre,\xa0Hotel\xa0Center\xa0Ljubljana\xa0or\xa0Similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\nZagreb\n\n\nHotel\xa0Laguna,\xa0Hotel\xa0Central\xa0or\xa0Similar\n\n\n\n\nZadar\n\n\nA'mare\xa0Hotel\xa0Zadar,\xa0Hotel\xa0Mediteran