ry selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis] Private Transfer from Ljubljana Airport to Ljubljana Hotel Private transfer from Zagreb Hotel to Zadar Hotel enroute visit Plitvice National Park Private Transfer from Dubrovnik Hotel to Dubrovnik Airport Bus Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed] Bus ticket from Ljubljana to Zagreb (Subject to availability until ticketed) Bus ticket from Zadar to Split (Subject to availability until ticketed) Bus Ticket from Split to Dubrovnik (Subject to availability until ticketed) Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point) Full Day tour to Lake Bled, Predjama Castle, and Postojna Cave - Small Group Tour Walking tour of Zagreb with Funicular Ride in a group Walking tour of Zadar old town in a group from a central meeting point Walking tour of Split in group Walking tour of Dubrovnik in group Trip to Bosnia & Herzegovina Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees - To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary INCLUSIONS head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Note: Prices are Starting from Rates (please recheck costs with exact dates) IMPORTANT NOTES: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost. TERMS AND CONDITIONS: Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. TCS & GST would be levied as applicable The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Discover Croatia with Slovenia' package is a 9-day tour covering Dubrovnik, Zadar, Split, Zagreb, and Ljubljana. The itinerary includes visits to the ancient city walls of Dubrovnik, the unique Sea Organ in Zadar, the historic Diocletian's Palace in Split, and the picturesque Ljubljana Castle. Participants will enjoy guided walking tours of historic old towns, scenic coastal drives along the Adriatic, and opportunities to explore charming local markets and cultural landmarks.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Ljubljana\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at the Ljubljana airport, you will be transferred to the hotel on private basis.\nWalking Tour of Ljubljana with Funicular Ride (Optional): Enjoy an evening walking tour of Ljubljana from Town Hall Square. Explore major sights and the historic center, then ride the funicular to Ljubljana Castle for stunning city views (castle entry not included).\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Park Ljubljana\xa0(Standard) // Occidental Ljubljana\xa0(Value) // Grand Plaza Hotel\xa0(Premium)\xa0or similar in\xa0Ljubljana\xa0'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\nLjubljana -\xa0 Lake Bled - Postojna & Predjama\xa0\nLjubljana - Lake Bled - Postojna & Predjama - Ljubljana: Visit Lake Bled, sail to Bled Island by traditional Pletna boat, and enjoy stunning views. Explore Bled Castle, then continue to Postojna Cave for a scenic train ride through its vast halls. End at Predjama Castle, dramatically set in a cliff.\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Park Ljubljana\xa0(Standard)//\xa0Occidental Ljubljana\xa0(Value)//\xa0Grand Plaza Hotel\xa0(Premium)\xa0or similar in\xa0Ljubljana\xa0'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nLjubljana - Zagreb | Zagreb Walking Tour\xa0\nTransfers: Today you will travel from Ljubljana to Zagreb by bus on shared basis.\nWalking Tour of Zagreb: Explore Zagrebs highlights on a guided walking tour with a scenic funicular ride. Discover the charm of both Lower and Upper Town, uncover hidden gems, and hear the stories that shaped Croatias vibrant capital.\nSpecial Note:\xa01. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Central (Standard)//\xa0Hotel AS (Value)//Hotel Sheraton (Premuim) in Zagreb'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nZagreb - Zadar | Enroute Plitvice National Park |\nTransfers:\xa0\n1. This morning travel to Zadar, enroute visit Plitvice National Park.\n2. Later continue your journey to Zadar\n\xa0\nPlitvice National Park: Plitvice National Park dazzles with waterfalls, lakes, and forested cliffs. Your ticket includes full access to trails and boardwalks, a panoramic train ride, shuttle buses between lakes, and an electric boat cruise on Kozjak Lake.\xa0\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': "Hotel\xa0A'mare Zadar (Standard)//\xa0Falkensteiner Club Funimation Borik (Value)//Miramare Hotel (Premium)or similar in Zadar"}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nWalking Tour Of Zadar\xa0\xa0\nWalking Tour of Zadar:\xa0 Enjoy a guided walking tour of Zadars Old City, including St. Donat, St. Anastasia, city gates, walls, and the Square of Five Wells. Sample Maraschino liqueur and Pag cheese, then relax by the Sea Organ and admire the sunset.\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n2. You can opt for a Romantic Sunset Cruise at a supplement cost\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': "Hotel\xa0A'mare Zadar (Standard)//\xa0Falkensteiner Club Funimation Borik (Value)//Miramare Hotel (Premium)or similar in Zadar"}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nZadar - Split | Walking Tour Of Split\xa0\nTransfers: Today you will travel from Zadar to Split by bus on shared basis.\nWalking Tour of Split:\xa0 Enjoy an evening walking tour of Split and explore the 1700 year old Diocletians Palace. See St. Domnius Cathedral, the Peristil, Golden Gate, and Gregory of Nin. End with the 24 hour sun clock at City Square and the Riva promenade.\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Jadrran (Standard)//\xa0Hotel Globo (Value)//\xa0Hotel Atrium (Premium)\xa0or similar in Split'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nSplit - Dubrovnik| Walking Tour Of Dubrovnik\xa0\nTransfers: Today you will travel from Split to Dubrovnik by bus on shared basis.\nWalking Tour of Dubrovnik: Enjoy an evening walking tour of Dubrovnik and a Cable Car ride. Explore the Old Towns history, architecture, and culture, then ride to the top of Srd Hill for stunning views of the Adriatic Sea and the city below.\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Vis (Standard)//\xa0Hotel Lero (Value)//Hotel President (Premium) or\xa0similar in Dubrovnik'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nTrip To Bosnia & Herzegovina\xa0\xa0\nTrip to Bosnia & Herzegovina: Explore Bosnia and Herzegovina on a day trip and visit UNESCO listed Mostar. Wander cobbled streets, see Ottomanera mosques and bathhouses, and admire the iconic Stari Most - one of the modern worlds most remarkable bridges.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Guest should be carrying their passport with valid Schengen Visa.\n2. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Vis (Standard)//\xa0Hotel Lero (Value)//Hotel President (Premium) or\xa0similar in Dubrovnik'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart\nTransfers: You will have a private transfer from Dubrovnik hotel to Dubrovnik Airport.\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ["\n\n\n\nHOTELS\xa0ENVISAGED\xa0OR\xa0SIMILAR\xa0\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCity\xa0Name\n\n\nSTANDARD\xa0CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nLjubljana\n\n\nHotel\xa0Park\xa0Ljubljana,\xa0Ibis\xa0styles\xa