 Bergen hotel to the Bergen Airport\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included\xa0\nCity taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nCost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.\n', 'termsAndConditions': '\nTravel Validity: 1 October 2026 – 31 March 2027\nBlack out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nMaximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\nSurcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking.\nTo proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour.\nShould the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015625/RsAlKhaimah_SRP.jpg', 'constructed_images': []}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014864', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014864', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Iceland Highlights (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Vik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Vik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Borgarnes', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Borgarnes', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['Premium Entry to Blue Lagoon'], 'pdfName': 'PKG014864_0_20260609182455.pdf', 'price': 631641, 'packageSummary': "The 'Iceland Highlights (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)' package is a 7-day tour covering the scenic destinations of Borgarnes, Reykjavik, and Vik. Throughout this week-long journey, travelers will experience the very best of Iceland's dramatic landscapes and natural wonders, with the absolute highlight of the itinerary being a premium entry to the world-famous Blue Lagoon, where guests can relax and rejuvenate in the soothing, mineral-rich geothermal waters.", 'images': ['Reykjavik1.jpg', 'VIK_NEW.jpg', 'VIK.jpg', 'borgarnes11.jpg', 'Reykjavik-1.jpg', 'Blulagoon.jpg', 'Gullfoss.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 631641, 'thumbnailImage': 'Lights.bmp', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Durga Puja Special'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014864 is named 'Iceland Highlights (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Reykjavik, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Reykjavik Transfers: Upon arrival in Keflavik Airport, you will meet the representative and get transferred to the hotel on private basis., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Vik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Reykjavik – Vik Transfers: Today you will travel from Reykjavik to Vik on private basis. South Coast tour: Stops include Seljalandsfoss and Skogafoss waterfalls - Seljalandsfoss fed by Eyjafjallajokull, Skogafoss marking the start of the Fimmvorauhals trek. You also see Reynisfjara’s reshaped coast and the blue ice of Solheimajokull glacier. Special Note: 1. Reykjavik downtown has restrictions for bigger vehicles. For pick ups and drop offs, the nearest authorised stops near the hotel will be used if the hotel is located in the downtown area. 2. Sightseeing will be conducted on Private basis., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Vik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Vik - Icebergs & Glaciers Towards Icebergs & glaciers: Drive across MYrdalssandur and Eldhraun lava fields to Kirkjuaejarklaustur. Visit Skaftafell National Park, then explore Jokulsarlon Glacier Lagoon and Diamond Beach, with an exciting amphibian boat ride among icebergs. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on Private basis., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Borgarnes, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Vik - Borgarnes Transfers: Today you will travel from Vik to Borgarnes on Private basis. Golden circle tour: Visit three iconic sights: Pingvellir National Park, the Geysir geothermal area - home to the highly active Strokkur - and Gullfoss waterfall, where massive volumes of water plunge into a dramatic, winding gorge. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on Private basis., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Borgarnes, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Borgarnes West Iceland tour: Explore Snaefellsnes peninsula, a mini Iceland with black beaches, Mountains, volcanic craters, cliffs, birdlife, caves, and glaciers. Visit Arnarstapi, see Kirkjufell, Djupalonssandur bay, and the iconic Saefellsjokull glacier. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on Private basis., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Reykjavik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Borgarnes - Reykjavik Transfers: Today you will travel from Borgarnes along the shores of Hvalfjooour Fjord towards Reykjavik. Blue lagoon: Enjoy a classic Icelandic spa experience at the Blue Lagoon or Sky Lagoon. Soak in mineral rich geothermal waters amid dramatic scenery, from Reykjanes lava fields to an ocean edge infinity pool near Reykjavik. [Please note that this activity operates as a shared experience alongside other participants] Special Note: Entrance to Blue Lagoon or Sky Lagoon will be on shared basis inclusive of other guests., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Reykjavik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Transfers: From Reykjavik hotel to the Keflavik Airport in private transfer. Special Note: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 631641.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nStandard Category\n\n\n\n\nReykjavik\n\n\nHotel Klettur or similar\n\n\n\n\nVik\n\n\nHotel Eyjafjallajokull or similar\n\n\n\n\nBorgarnes\n\n\nHótel Borgarnes or similar\n\n\n\n, \xa0\nHotel Details :\n\xa0\n\n\n\nCity\nHotel Name\n\n\nReykjavik\xa0(2N)\nGrand Hotel Reykjavík or Similar\n\n\nBorgarnes\xa0(2N)\n\xa0Hotel Vesturland or Similar\n\n\nSelfoss\xa0(1N)\nHotel\xa0Selfoss\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0. Meals include: \nBreakfast daily and up to half of your evening meals\n, \nDaily Breakfast Except Day 1\n. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ Split accommodation in Reykjavik based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Night accommodation in Vik area based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Night accommodation in Borgarnes based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis] Private airport transfer upon arrival at KEF Airport Private airport transfer upon departure from KEF Airport Sightseeing: (Sightseeing on private basis as per slab booked) South Coast tour on shared basis Towards Icebergs & glaciers tour on shared basis Jokulsarlon glacial amphibian boat tour Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals Optioanl Activities Tour Name Per Person Price In Euro Easy Glacier Hike 110 Lava Tunnel Tour 75 Ice Cave Tour 185. Product Terms and Conditions: N/A. Highlights of the package: Premium Entry to Blue Lagoon.", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Nagpur', 'cityCode': 'NAG', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kannur', 'cityCode': 'CNN', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Vad