ir geothermal area - home to the highly active Strokkur - and Gullfoss waterfall, where massive volumes of water plunge into a dramatic, winding gorge.\nSpecial Note:\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Sightseeing will be conducted on Private basis.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast\n\xa0\n\xa0', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Borgarnes or similar'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nBorgarnes\nWest Iceland tour: Explore\xa0Snaefellsnes peninsula, a mini Iceland with black beaches, Mountains, volcanic craters, cliffs, birdlife, caves, and glaciers. Visit Arnarstapi, see Kirkjufell, Djupalonssandur bay, and the iconic Saefellsjokull glacier.\nSpecial Note:\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Sightseeing will be conducted on Private basis.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Borgarnes or similar'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nBorgarnes - Reykjavik\nTransfers: Today you will travel from Borgarnes along the shores of Hvalfjooour Fjord towards Reykjavik.\nBlue lagoon: Enjoy a classic Icelandic spa experience at the Blue Lagoon or Sky Lagoon. Soak in mineral rich geothermal waters amid dramatic scenery, from Reykjanes lava fields to an ocean edge infinity pool near Reykjavik. [Please note that this activity\xa0 operates as a shared experience alongside other participants]\nSpecial Note: Entrance to Blue Lagoon or Sky Lagoon will be on shared basis inclusive of other guests.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Klettur or similar'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart\nTransfers: From Reykjavik hotel to the Keflavik Airport in private transfer.\nSpecial Note: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'NA'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nStandard Category\n\n\n\n\nReykjavik\n\n\nHotel Klettur or similar\n\n\n\n\nVik\n\n\nHotel Eyjafjallajokull or similar\n\n\n\n\nBorgarnes\n\n\nHótel Borgarnes or similar\n\n\n\n', '\xa0\nHotel Details :\n\xa0\n\n\n\nCity\nHotel Name\n\n\nR