uded. Inclusions: Return Airport transfers. 3 nights stay at Hotel Port Rivoli or similar in Baku. 1 nights at Gabala Garden Hotel or similar in Gabala. 4 nights at Astoria Hotel or similar in Tbilisi. Sightseeing in districts (Baku, Absheron, Shahdag). English speaking driver (for 2-6 PAX), English Speaking Guide (for 8-10 Pax) Entrance fee for Flame temple, Fire Mountain, Cable Car (2 Lines). Guided city tour of Tbilisi with Narikala Cable Car. Full Day Excursion to Dashbashi Canyon & Diamond Bridge. Full Day Excursion to WIne Country. Full Day Excursion to Gaudari & Kazbegi. 2 Bottles of water per person per day. All transfers according to program including airport transfers: Sedan (for 2-3 PAX), Mercedes Viano or Vito (for 4-6 PAX), Mercedes Sprinter ( for 8-10 PAX) Travel Insurance (Valid till the age of 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST Visa charges Departure PCR test, if applicable All flights services Meals not mentioned in the itinerary Any tips (Around USD 05.00 per person / per day) - for guide & Driver. Any other sightseeing entrance fees except for the ones mentioned in the Inclusions Anything not mentioned in the inclusions Pre & Post tour services & cost Expenditure of personal nature (Such as the use of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & etc.) All drink and beverages Hotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel Tourism Tax (if applicable) Midnight surcharge The rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adults travelling together at all times. SINGLE SUPPLEMENT - USD 238.00. Product Terms and Conditions: The prices will not be valid for any blackout date/ Stop sale period which is informed during confirmation of the booking; if any change in the price, the same will be applicable for all bookings and to be borne by the customer. Terms And Conditions: The package price is valid until 22nd March 2027. The hotel upgrade prices are subject to availability at the time 