Dinner\n', 'Breakfast Included'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['\nAs per itinerary\n', 'As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['Baku City tour (PVT basis)\nTbilisi City Tour (PVT Basis)', 'Visit ALMATY ; walk through the Panfilov Park | Visit the President Park | Visit the Republic Square | Take a ride on the Kok-Tobe cable car | Visit the Ascension ( Zenkov ) Cathedral | Visit Green Bazar\xa0\n\xa0\nVisit SHYMBULAK SKI RESORT; take a cable car to the Shymbulak Ski Resort.\xa0\n\xa0\nVisit KOLSAI LAKE & CHARYN CANYON;\xa0day excursion to the Kolsai Lake & Charyn Canyon.\xa0'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': '<p>Return Economy Class Airfare&nbsp;</p>', 'inclusions': '\nReturn Airport transfers.\n3 nights stay at Hotel Port Rivoli or similar in Baku.\n1 nights at Gabala Garden Hotel or similar in Gabala.\n4 nights at Astoria Hotel or similar in Tbilisi.\nSightseeing in districts (Baku, Absheron, Shahdag).\nEnglish speaking driver (for 2-6 PAX), English Speaking Guide (for 8-10 Pax)\nEntrance fee for Flame temple, Fire Mountain, Cable Car (2 Lines).\nGuided city tour of Tbilisi with Narikala Cable Car.\nFull Day Excursion to Dashbashi Canyon & Diamond Bridge.\nFull Day Excursion to WIne Country.\nFull Day Excursion to Gaudari & Kazbegi.\n2 Bottles of water per person per day.\nAll transfers according to program including airport transfers: Sedan (for 2-3 PAX), Mercedes Viano or Vito (for 4-6 PAX), Mercedes Sprinter ( for 8-10 PAX)\nTravel Insurance (Valid till the age of 60 Yrs.)\n', 'exclusions': '\nTCS & GST\nVisa charges\nDeparture PCR test, if applicable\nAll flights services\nMeals not mentioned in the itinerary\nAny tips (Around USD 05.00 per person / per day) - for guide & Driver.\nAny other sightseeing entrance fees except for the ones mentioned in the Inclusions\nAnything not mentioned in the inclusions\nPre & Post tour services & cost\nExpenditure of personal nature (Such as the use of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, c