iss pass on your own as there are many sights in a small area in Lucerne like Chapel Bridge with the Water Tower which is the landmark of Lucerne and the most photographed monument in Switzerland.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel La Pergola (Standard) / Campus Hertenstein (Value) or similar in Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 2, 'description': "\xa0\nMt. Titlis Excursion\n\xa0\nMt. Titlis Excursion: Don't miss the spectacular beauty of Mt Titlis! Discover eternal glaciers and other attractions from more than 3020m / 10000 ft high. Enjoy the spectacular sight of the glacier's deep crevasses and gigantic ice boulders from the revolving cable car ROTAIR. At the top of Mt. Titlis (10'000 ft. above sea level), a high alpine panorama awaits you. Visit the Ice Grotto or take a ride with the chairlift IceFlyer, which brings you close to the crevasses. Enjoy also the FunLift in the snow and the Cliff Walk, Europe's highest suspension bridge. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass)", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel La Pergola (Standard) / Campus Hertenstein (Value) or similar in Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 3, 'description': "\xa0\nJungfraujoch Excursion\n\xa0\nJungfraujoch Excursion: Don't miss the highlight of any Swiss holiday and go for this thrilling and unforgettable excursion to Jungfraujoch, Top of Europe! From Interlaken, the heart of the Jungfrau region mountain world and uniquely situated between two lakes, you make your way to famous mountain resort Grindelwald where you board the cogwheel train for a spectacular ride via Kleine Scheidegg to Jungfraujoch. Enjoy stunning views of the world-famous triple peaks of Eiger, Monch and Jungfrau accompany you all the way to the top. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass)", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel La Pergola (Standard) / Campus Hertenstein (Value) or similar in Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nCentral Switze