ints. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n\n\xa0', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': '', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015115/itinerary/Tromso3.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015115/itinerary/Tromso1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015115/itinerary/Tromso2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015115/itinerary/Rovaniemi4.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015115/itinerary/Norway1.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015134', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015134', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Finland Adventure', 'days': 8, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Rovaniemi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rovaniemi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rovaniemi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rovaniemi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Helsinki', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Helsinki', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Helsinki', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Helsinki', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG015134_0_20260928155806.pdf', 'price': 391123, 'packageSummary': "The 'Finland Adventure' package is an 8-day tour covering the vibrant capital of Helsinki and the magical Arctic city of Rovaniemi. The itinerary includes visits to the historic Senate Square, the unique Temppeliaukio Rock Church, and the world-famous Santa Claus Village situated right on the Arctic Circle. Participants will enjoy guided city sightseeing, thrilling husky and reindeer sledding safaris, and unforgettable evening excursions to hunt for the mesmerizing Northern Lights.", 'images': ['Rovaniemi2.jpg', 'Rovaniemi1.jpg', 'Rovaniemi3.jpg', 'Rovaniemi4.jpg', 'Helsinki1.jpg', 'Helsinki2.jpg', 'Helsinki3.jpg', 'return-flight.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 391123, 'thumbnailImage': 'Finland-Rovaniemi.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015134 is named 'Finland Adventure' and spans 8 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Rovaniemi, Meals: NA, Description: Arrive Rovaniemi Transfers: Upon your arrival at Rovaniemi airport, you will meet the representative and then be transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle. Rovaniemi Northern Lights Evening Tour: Join a Northern Lights minibus tour. Travel off the beaten track to top viewing spots, relax under a blanket, sip hot cocoa, and watch the Aurora Borealis light up the night sky. Special Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15:00 hrs. or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Rovaniemi, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Visit Santa’s Village and snowmobile to reindeer farm: Discover Santa and his helpers! Meet Father Christmas, visit his Post Office, and shop. Ride snowmobiles to a reindeer farm, join an Arctic Circle crossing ceremony, and return to the city with a special certificate., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Rovaniemi, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Visit Ranua Wildlife Park: Just an hour from Rovaniemi, Ranua Wildlife Park, the northernmost zoo, hosts 50 Arctic species. Enjoy a guided tour to spot bears, wolves, lynx, wolverines, foxes, and birds while learning about wildlife and life in Lapland. Special Note: You can opt for Northern light with campfire (Optional) @ EUR 110, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Rovaniemi, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Husky safari Tour: Feel the thrill of a husky safari through Arctic forests! Meet friendly dogs, then glide in peaceful silence as they pull your sled. Enjoy the snowy scenery, pause in the wilderness, and capture unforgettable photos., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Helsinki, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Transfers: Today you will be transferred from the hotel to Rovaniemi airport on a private basis. Upon arrival at Helsinki airport you will be transferred to the hotel on a private basis. Special Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15:00 hrs. or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Helsinki, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day trip to Tallinn: Take a ferry from Helsinki to Tallinn and explore Old Town at your own pace. Visit boutiques, cozy cafes, and beer cellars, enjoy Christmas markets, and discover trendy areas like Kalamaja and Noblessner before returning by evening ferry., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Helsinki, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Helsinki City Walking Tour (Shared Basis): Join a guided walking tour of Helsinki’s highlights including the Cathedral, Market Square, Temppeliaukio Church, Uspenski Cathedral, and Sibelius Park. Explore historic quarters filled with charming cafés and restaurants., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Helsinki, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Transfers: You will be transferred from Helsinki hotel to the Airport on private transfer. Special Notes: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 391123.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at the Hotels, \xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nHelsinki\n\n\nHotel Haaga Central Park / Hotel Anna / Hotel Arthur / Scandic Kallio or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Grand Marina /\xa0 Scandic Meilahti\xa0 / Scandic Marski / Valo Hotel Helsinki \xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0, \n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nValue Category\n\n\n\n\nSaariselka\n\n\nStar Arctic or similar\n\n\n\n\nIgloo Stay\n\n\nKakslauttanen resort, small glass igloo or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Pohjanhovi or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n, Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\xa0. Inclusions: Accommodation: 4 Nights’ accommodation in Rovaniemi based on the hotel category selected or similar 3 Nights’ accommodation in Helsinki based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point-to-Point Basis] Return Airport Transfer from Rovaniemi airport to the Hotel Return Airport Transfers from Helsinki Airport to the Hotel Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) Rovaniemi Northern Lights Evening Tour Visit Santa’s Village and snowmobile to reindeer farm Visit Ranua Wildlife Park Husky safari Tour Day trip to Tallinn Helsinki City Walking Tour (Shared Basis/SIC) Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only) OPTIONAL TOUR PRICE Northern light with campfire EUR 110 SPECIAL NOTE: You can upgrade your stay to glass igloo in Rovaniemi (On Request). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: IMPORTANT NOTES: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost. TERMS AND CONDITIONS: Travel Validity: 1 November 2026 – 31 March 2027 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', 'cityCode': 'STV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName'