ghtseeing tours without prior notice.\xa0\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\xa0\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\xa0\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\xa0\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\xa0\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015134/Finland-Rovaniemi.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015134/itinerary/Rovaniemi2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015134/itinerary/Rovaniemi1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015134/itinerary/Rovaniemi3.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015134/itinerary/Rovaniemi4.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015134/itinerary/Helsinki1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015134/itinerary/Helsinki2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015134/itinerary/Helsinki3.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015134/itinerary/return-flight.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014607', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014607', 'availableMonths': ['october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Greece Getaway', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Athens', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Athens', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Mykonos', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Mykonos', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Santorini', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Santorini', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Santorini', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014607_STANDARD', 'price': 139734, 'packageSummary': "The 'Greece Getaway' package is a 7-day tour covering the stunning destinations of Santorini, Mykonos, and Athens. Throughout this island-hopping adventure, participants will immerse themselves in the rich history and breathtaking beauty of Greece, enjoying guided tours of ancient ruins in Athens, relaxing on the world-famous beaches of Mykonos, and witnessing the iconic, picturesque sunsets of Santorini.", 'images': ['Athens.jpg', 'AcropolisinAthens.jpg', 'AdobeStock_67990916.jpeg', 'Mykons753.jpg', 'Santorini_1.jpeg', 'SunsetonthefamousOiacityGreece.jpeg', 'Santorini_2.jpeg'], 'minimumPrice': 139734, 'thumbnailImage': 'Santorini7532.jpeg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014607 is named 'Greece Getaway' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Athens, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Athens Transfers: Upon arrival you will be met the representative & transferred to the hotel on private basis. Special Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Athens, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Half-Day Guided Tour Of Athens On Shared Basis (SIC) Athens Sightseeing The Acropolis & Acropolis Museum Step into history on a half-day guided tour of Athens. The morning begins at the Panathenaic Stadium, birthplace of the modern Olympic Games, then past the Temple of Olympian Zeus and the elegant Athens Trilogy University, Academy, and National Library. Ascend to the legendary Acropolis to explore the Parthenon, Erechtheion, and Temple of Athena Nike. End your morning at the Acropolis Museum, where ancient treasures are brought to life. [Entrance fees to Acropolis & Museum is included] Special Note: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick up for the same will be from selected central points., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Mykonos, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Athens To Mykonos and Evening Walking Tour Transfers: Today you will have a private transfer from the hotel to the Port for the ferry to Mykonos. Upon arrival at Mykonos there will be a shared transfer from the port to the Hotel. Guided walking tour of Mykonos: In the evening, enjoy a guided walking tour of Mykonos’ Chora, discovering hidden alleys, historic windmills, Little Venice, and Panagia Paraportiani Church., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Mykonos, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day Free At Leisure Mykonos Sightseeing (Optional). Spend the day enjoying the cosmopolitan charm of Mykonos. Relax on its golden beaches, explore boutiques., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Santorini, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Mykonos To Santorini Transfers: Today you will have a shared transfer from the hotel to the Port for the ferry to Santorini. Upon arrival at Santorini there will be a shared transfer from the port to the Hotel. Special Note: The check-in at the hotel will be as per the standard hotel time. Post check-in the rest of the day will be free at leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Santorini, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Volcanic Adventure & Sunset In Oia Transfers: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick-up for the same will be from selected central points Volcanic Adventure & Sunset in Oia: Today Embark on a guided tour to Santorini’s volcano and hot springs, then sail to Thirassia island for a glimpse into traditional island life. Conclude with a magical sunset in Oia. Cruise around the volcanic islands of Santorini's Caldera on a unique Greek traditional boat. First, sail to Nea Kameni lava islet. Guided walking tour through an ascending path to reach its top where the crater of the still active volcano lies. Enjoy incredible sights of Santorini from a different angle. Return to the boat and continue to the second lava islet called Palea Kameni, also known as the Hot Springs. Jump off the boat and dive into green sulfur thermal waters. Next is the traditional island of Thirassia where you will enjoy some free time. You can relax at the picturesque small port of Thirassia, have lunch (on your own) or visit the village of Manolas, accessed by winding stairs, either by walking or riding a donkey., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Santorini, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Santorini Transfers: From Santorini hotel to the Airport in private transfer. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 139734.0. Hotels envisaged include: Premium Category (5* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\nCATEGORY 5*\nHOTELS\n\n\nAthens (2N)\nWyndham Grand Athens or similar\n\n\n\xa0Mykonos (2N)\nRoyal Myconian or similar\n\n\n\xa0Santorini (2N)\nApeiron Blue Santorini or similar\n\n\n, Standard Category (3* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\nCATEGORY 3*\nHOTELS\n\n\nAthens (2N)\nCentral Hotel or similar\n\n\n\xa0Mykonos (2N)\nErato Hotel or similar\xa0\n\n\n\xa0Santorini (2N)\n\xa0Makris Beach Hotel or similar\n\n\n, Value Category (4* Hotels Or Similar)\n\n\n\nCATEGORY 4*\nHOTELS\n\n\nAthens (2N)\nAthens Avenue or similar\n\n\n\xa0Mykonos (2N)\nAeolos Resort Mykonos or similar\n\n\n\xa0Santorini (2N)\nDaedalus Hotel or similar\n\n\n. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ accommodation in Athens based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Mykonos based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Santorini based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: Private Airport Transfer from Athens Airport to Hotel Private transfer from Athens hotel to Port for the ferry to Mykonos Shared transport from Mykonos Port to the hotel and back to port Shared transport from Santorini port to hotel Private Airport transfer from Santorini Hotel to Airport Ferry Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed] Normal Ferry ticket – Economy class from Athens to Mykonos Speed Ferry ticket - Economy class from Mykonos to Santorini Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis * from a designated point) Half-day City tour of Athens with new Acropolis Museum on sharing basis tour coach. Walking tour in Mykonos Town Volcanic Islands Cruise on sharing basis with transportation from/to meeting point - clients need to go by themselves to the pick-up point for the tour Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head. Add On - Athens (1 Night Extension) Speed Ferry from Santorini to Athens (*Economy Class Tickets: Subject to availability) 1 Night accommodation in Athens as per hotels mentioned on Bed & Breakfast basis Private Transfers from Port - Hotel - Airport Please Refer to the below pricing for the Supplement Cost HOLIDAY PRICE (PER PERSON) IN EUR + INR (INSURANCE) Travel Validity: Average Pricing based on 6 Months (Apr - Sep 2026) CATEGORY TWIN SHARE TRIPLE SHARE SINGLE ROOMING CHILD WITH BED (06 - 11.99 YRS) CHILD W/O BED (02 – 05.99 YRS) 3 Euro 345 Euro 310 Euro 500 Euro 295 Euro 295 4 Euro 355 Euro 355 Euro 515 Euro 320 Euro 320 5 Euro400 Euro 360 Euro 525 Euro 340 Euro 340. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Notes: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability Terms and Conditions: Travel Validity: 1 May 2026 – 15 October 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting even