heion, and Temple of Athena Nike. End your morning at the Acropolis Museum, where ancient treasures are brought to life. [Entrance fees to Acropolis & Museum is included]\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick up for the same will be from selected central points.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Central (Standard) / Athens Avenue (Value) / Wyndham Grand (Premium) or similar in Athens'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nAthens To Mykonos and Evening Walking Tour\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nToday you will have a private transfer from the hotel to the Port for the ferry to Mykonos.\nUpon arrival at Mykonos there will be a shared transfer from the port to the Hotel.\n\n\xa0\nGuided walking tour of Mykonos: In the evening, enjoy a guided walking tour of Mykonos’ Chora, discovering hidden alleys, historic windmills, Little Venice, and Panagia Paraportiani Church.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Erato (Standard) / Aeolos Resort (Value) / Royal Myconian (Premium) or similar in Mykonos'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nDay Free At Leisure\xa0\n\xa0\nMykonos Sightseeing (Optional). Spend the day enjoying the cosmopolitan charm of Mykonos. Relax on its golden beaches, explore boutiques.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Erato (Standard) / Aeolos Resort (Value) / Royal Myconian (Premium) or similar in Mykonos'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nMykonos To Santorini\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nToday you will have a shared transfer from the hotel to the Port for the ferry to Santorini.\nUpon arrival at Santorini there will be a shared transfer from the port to the Hotel.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nThe check-in at the hotel will be as per the standard hotel time.\xa0\nPost check-in the rest of the day will be free at leisure.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Makris Beach (Standard) / Daedalus (Value) / Apeiron Blue Santorini (Premium) or similar in Santorini'}, {'day': 6, 'description': "\xa0\nVolcanic Adventure & Sunset In Oia\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick-up for the same will be from selected central points\n\xa0\nVolcanic Adventure & Sunset in Oia:\xa0Today Embark on a guided tour to Santorini’s volcano and hot springs, then sail to Thirassia island for a glimpse into traditional island life. Conclude with a magical sunset in Oia. Cruise around the volcanic islands of Santorini's Caldera on a unique Greek traditional boat. First, sail to Nea Kameni lava islet. Guided walking tour through an ascending path to reach its top where the crater of the still active volcano lies. Enjoy incredible sights of Santorini from a different angle. Return to the boat and continue to the second lava islet called Palea Kameni, also known as the Hot Springs. Jump off the boat and dive into green sulfur thermal waters. Next is the traditional island of Thirassia where you will enjoy some free time. You can relax at the picturesque small port of Thirassia, have lunch (on your own) or visit the village of Manolas, accessed by winding stairs, either by walking or riding a donkey.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Makris Beach (Standard) / Daedalus (Value) / Apeiron Blue Santorini (Premium) or similar in Santorini'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Santorini\n\xa0\nTransfers: From Santorini hotel to the Airport in private transfer.\n\xa0\n\xa0\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['Premium Category (5* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\nCATEGORY 5*\nHOTELS\n\n\nAthens (2N)\nWyndham Grand Athens or similar\n\n\n\xa0Mykonos (2N)\nRoyal Myconian or similar\n\n\n\xa0Santorini (2N)\n