remium', 'price': 186800.0, 'hotels': ['Premium Category (5* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\nCATEGORY 5*\nHOTELS\n\n\nAthens (2N)\nWyndham Grand Athens or similar\n\n\n\xa0Mykonos (2N)\nRoyal Myconian or similar\n\n\n\xa0Santorini (2N)\nApeiron Blue Santorini or similar\n\n\n']}], 'meals': ['\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n'], 'visa': ['As per itinerary'], 'transfer': ['Transportation:\xa0\xa0\n\nPrivate Airport Transfer from Athens Airport to Hotel\nPrivate transfer from Athens hotel to Port for the ferry to Mykonos\nShared transport from Mykonos Port to the hotel and back to port\nShared transport from Santorini port to hotel\xa0\nPrivate Airport transfer from Santorini Hotel to Airport\n\n\xa0\nFerry Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed]\n\nNormal Ferry ticket – Economy class from Athens to Mykonos\nSpeed Ferry ticket - Economy class from Mykonos to Santorini\n'], 'sightseeing': ['Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis * from a designated point)\n\nHalf-day City tour of Athens with new Acropolis Museum\xa0 on sharing basis tour coach.\nWalking tour in Mykonos Town\nVolcanic Islands Cruise on sharing basis with transportation from/to meeting point - clients need to go by themselves to the pick-up point for the tour\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': '<p>Return Economy Class Airfare</p>', 'inclusions': 'Accommodation:\n\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Athens based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Mykonos based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Santorini based on the hotel category selected or similar\n\n\xa0\nMeals:\n\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n\n\xa0\nTransportation:\xa0\xa0\n\nPrivate Airport Transfer from Athens Airport to Hotel\nPrivate transfer from Athens hotel to Port for the ferry to Mykonos\nShared transport from Mykonos Port to the hotel and back to port\nShared transport from Santorini port to hotel\xa0\nPrivate Airport transfer from Santorini Hotel to Airport\n\n\xa0\nFerry Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed]\n\nNormal Ferry ticket – Economy class from Athens to Mykonos\nSpeed Ferry ticket - Economy class from Mykonos to Santorini\n\n\xa0\nSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis * from a designated point)\n\nHalf-day City tour of Athens with new Acropolis Museum\xa0 on sharing basis tour coach.\nWalking tour in Mykonos Town\nVolcanic Islands Cruise on sharing basis with transportation from/to meeting point - clients need to go by themselves to the pick-up point for the tour\n\n\xa0\nInsurance:\n\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included\xa0\nCity taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nCost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.\n\n\xa0\nAdd On - Athens (1 Night Extension)\n\nSpeed Ferry from Santorini to Athens (*Economy Class Tickets: Subject to availability)\n1 Night accommodation in Athens as per hotels mentioned on Bed & Breakfast basis\nPrivate Transfers from Port - Hotel - Airport\xa0\n\n\xa0\nPlease Refer to the below pricing for the Supplement Cost\n\n\n\n\nHOLIDAY PRICE (PER PERSON) IN EUR + INR (INSURANCE)\n\n\n\n\nTravel Validity:\n\n\nAverage Pricing based on 6 Months (Apr - Sep 2026)\n\n\n\n\nCATEGORY\n\n\nTWIN\nSHARE\n\n\nTRIPLE SHARE\n\n\nSINGLE ROOMING\n\n\nCHILD WITH BED (06 - 11.99 YRS)\n\n\nCHILD W/O BED (02 – 05.99 YRS)\n\n\n\n\n3\n\n\nEuro\xa0345\n\n\nEuro\xa0310\n\n\nEuro 500\n\n\nEuro\xa0295\n\n\nEuro\xa0295\n\n\n\n\n4\n\n\nEuro 355\n\n\nEuro 355\n\n\nEuro 515\n\n\nEuro\xa0\xa0320\n\n\nEuro 320\n\n\n\n\n5\n\n\nEuro400\n\n\nEuro\xa0360\n\n\nEuro\xa0525\n\n\nEuro\xa0340\n\n\nEuro\xa0\xa0340\n\n\n\n', 'termsAndConditions': '\xa0\nImportant Notes:\n\nThe above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together.\nThe above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\nMaximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room.\nMidnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\nWIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed.\xa0\n(Supplement charges may apply for such services)\nStandard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs.\nMost hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned.\nAt this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability\n\nTerms and Conditions:\xa0\n\nTravel Validity: 1 May 2026 – 15 October 2026\nBlack out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nMaximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\nSurcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking.\nTo proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour.\nShould the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014607/Santorini7532.jpeg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014607/itinerary/Athens.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014607/itinerary/AcropolisinAthens.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014607/itinerary/AdobeStock_67990916.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014607/itinerary/Mykons753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014607/itinerary/Santorini_1.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014607/itinerary/SunsetonthefamousOiacityGreece.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014607/itinerary/Santorini_2.jpeg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014518', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014518', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Lively Lisbon', 'days': 4, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Lisbon', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Lisbon', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Lisbon', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Lisbon', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG012121_0_20240110153038.pdf', 'price': 60519, 'packageSummary': "The 'Lively Lisbon' package is a 4-day tour dedicated entirely to exploring the vibrant city of Lisbon. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the historic Belem Tower, the magnificent Jeronimos Monastery, and the charming, winding streets of the Alfama district. Participants will enjoy riding the famous Tram 28, experiencing an authentic live Fado music performance, and indulging in local culinary delights like the traditional Pastel de Nata.", 'images': ['Lisbon753.jpg', 'Lisbon3.jpg', 'Lisbon7532.jpg', 'Lisbon4.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 60519, 'thumbnailImage': 'Lisbon2671.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Adventure', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014518 is named 'Lively Lisbon' and spans 4 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Lisbon, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Lisbon Transfers: Upon your arrival at the Lisbon airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Lisbon, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Hop On Hop Off Tour Hop on Hop Off Tour: Explore Lisbon’s limitless compelling sights with the freedom of a hop-on hop-off bus tour, with an optional line to Cascais. Tickets are valid for 24 hours to grant you the most sightseeing flexibility. This tour offers four different lines to choose from (tickets valid for one, two, three or four lines) with stops at Lisbon’s memorable monuments, viewpoints and neighborhoods. You’ll get a lasting taste of Lisbon’s history and culture on any line, so grab a ticket and hop on., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Lisbon, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day At Leisure (Optional Activities) Lisbon Essentials in One Day: Sintra, Cascais and Belem (Optional Tour 1): Start in central Lisbon and travel by air-conditioned minivan to Sintra. Visit the stunning Pena Palace, a masterpiece of 19th-century Romanticism, and stroll through its exotic gardens. Learn about King Fernando II, the “King-Artist,” and his eclectic architectural vision. Next, head to Cascais, a former royal summer retreat. Enjoy panoramic views of Guincho and Estoril beaches, then take a guided walk through the historic Cascais Citadel, built over 500 years ago to defend against pirates. Afterward, enjoy 1.5 hours of free time for lunch at local seafood restaurants. End the tour in Belem, famous for its riverside charm and Pasteis de Belem. See the exteriors of the Jeronimos Monastery and Belem Tower, both UNESCO World Heritage Sites. Return to Lisbon with tips from your guide for further exploration. [Supplement Cost: EUR 95 per Adult, EUR 80 per Child] Skip the Line - Live Fado Show In Lisbon: 'Fado In Chiado' (Optional Tour 2): Fado in Chiado is a live Fado Show, an excellent way to discover culture and the city. Enjoy a 50 minutes performance featuring two singers and two guitarists. Experience this passion in a show that expresses the soul of Lisbon. [Supplement Cost – EUR 30 Per Adult & EUR 25 Per Child], GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Lisbon, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Lisbon Transfers: From Lisbon hotel to airport, you will have a private transfer. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 60519.0. Hotels envisaged include: \xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nStandard category\n\n\n\nMadrid\n\nPetit Palace Cliper Gran Via / Petit Palace Tres Cruces / Hotel Los Condes / Petit Palace Chueca / Hotel Madrid Centro, Affiliated by Melia or similar\n\n\n\n\nSeville\n\n\nHotel Derby Sevilla / Las Casas De Los Mercaderes By Silken / Eurostars Regina / H10 Corregidor Boutique Hotel or similar\n\n\n\nBarcelona\n\nHotel Viladomat By Silken / Catalonia Roma / Leonardo Hotel Barcelona Gran Via / Continental Palacete or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity\n\n\nValue category\n\n\n\n\nLisbon\n\n\nZenit Lisboa / Vip Executive Saldanha / BE Hotel Lisboa / Hotel Lisboa Plaza / Hotel Lisboa or similar\xa0\xa0\n\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation: 3 Nights’ accommod