r\n\n\xa0\nMeals:\n\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n\n\xa0\nTransportation:\xa0\xa0\n\nPrivate Airport Transfer from Athens Airport to Hotel\nPrivate transfer from Athens hotel to Port for the ferry to Mykonos\nShared transport from Mykonos Port to the hotel and back to port\nShared transport from Santorini port to hotel and back to port\nPrivate transport from Heraklion Port to the hotel\nPrivate Airport transfer from Santorini Hotel to Airport\n\n\xa0\nFerry Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed]\n\nNormal Ferry ticket – Economy class from Athens to Mykonos\nHigh Speed Ferry ticket - Economy class from Mykonos to Santorini\nHigh Speed Ferry ticket - economy class from Santorini to Heraklion\n\n\xa0\nSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n\nHalf-day City tour of Athens with new Acropolis Museum on sharing basis tour coach.\nFull day Santorini panorama bus tour on sharing basis\xa0\n\n\xa0\nInsurance:\n\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included\xa0\nCity taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nCost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.\n', 'termsAndConditions': '\xa0\nImportant Notes:\n\nThe above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together.\nThe above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\nMaximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room.\nMidnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\nWIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed.\xa0\n(Supplement charges may apply for such services)\nStandard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs.\nMost hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned.\nAt this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability\n\nTerms and Conditions:\xa0\n\nTravel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 15 October 2026\nBlack out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nMaximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\nSurcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking.\nTo proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour.\nShould the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014608/AdobeStock_67990916.jpeg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014608/itinerary/Athens.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014608/itinerary/AcropolisinAthens.avif', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014608/itinerary/AdobeStock_67990916.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014608/itinerary/Mykons753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014608/itinerary/Santorini_1.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014608/itinerary/SunsetonthefamousOiacityGreece.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014608/itinerary/Crete7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014608/itinerary/Knossos753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014608/itinerary/Athens75354.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014604', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014604', 'availableMonths': ['october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Grand Tour Of Greece', 'days': 11, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Athens', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Athens', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Mykonos', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Mykonos', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Naxos', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Naxos', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paros', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paros', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Santorini', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Santorini', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Santorini', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014604_0_20260902220820', 'price': 213859, 'packageSummary': "The 'Grand Tour Of Greece' package is an 11-day tour covering Athens, Mykonos, Santorini, Paros, and Naxos. The itinerary includes visits to the iconic Acropolis, the famous windmills of Mykonos, and the breathtaking caldera cliffs of Santorini. Participants will enjoy guided historical tours, scenic ferry rides between the Aegean islands, relaxing on pristine beaches, and exploring the charming traditional villages of Naxos and Paros.", 'images': ['Athens.jpg', 'AcropolisinAthens.jpg', 'AdobeStock_67990916.jpeg', 'Mykons753.jpg', 'Naxos_1.jpg', 'Naxos_2.jpg', 'Paros_1.jpeg', 'Despotiko.jpeg', 'Santorini_2.jpeg', 'SunsetonthefamousOiacityGreece.jpeg', 'Santorini7532.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 213859, 'thumbnailImage': 'Paros_1.jpeg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014604 is named 'Grand Tour Of Greece' and spans 11 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Athens, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Athens Transfers: Upon arrival you will be met the representative & transferred to the hotel on private basis. Special Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Athens, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Half-Day Guided Tour Of Athens On Shared Basis (Sic) Athens Sightseeing The Acropolis & Acropolis Museum Step into history on a half day guided tour of Athens. The morning begins at the Panathenaic Stadium, birthplace of the modern Olympic Games, then past the Temple of Olympian Zeus and the elegant Athens Trilogy University, Academy, and National Library. Ascend to the legendary Acropolis to explore the Parthenon, Erechtheion, and Temple of Athena Nike. End your morning at the Acropolis Museum, where ancient treasures are brought to life. [Entrance fees to Acropolis & Museum is included] Special Note: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick up for the same will be from selected central points., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Mykonos, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Athens To Mykonos & Evening Walking Tour Transfers: Today you will have a private transfer from the hotel to the Port for the ferry to Mykonos. Upon arrival at Mykonos there will be a shared transfer from the port to the Hotel. Guided walking tour of Mykonos: In the evening, enjoy a guided walking tour of Mykonos’ Chora, discovering hidden alleys, historic windmills, Little Venice, and Panagia Paraportiani Church., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Mykonos, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day Free At Leisure Mykonos Sightseeing (Optional). Spend the day enjoying the cosmopolitan charm of Mykonos. Relax on its golden beaches, explore boutiques., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Naxos, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Mykonos To Naxos Transfers: Today you will have a shared transfer from the hotel to the Port for the ferry to Naxos. Upon arrival at Naxos there will be a shared transfer from the port to the Hotel. Special Note: The check-in at the hotel will be as per the standard hotel time. Post check-in the rest of the day will be free at leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Naxos, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Full-Day Kaiki Cruise To Rina Cave & Ano Koufonissi Transfers: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick-up for the same will be from selected central points. Full-Day Kaiki Cruise to Rina Cave & Ano Koufonissi: Embark on a traditional kaiki cruise, sailing through the pristine waters of the southeastern Cyclades. Visit the Blue Lagoon, secret sea caves, and remote beaches for swimming and snorkeling. Enjoy a freshly grilled BBQ lunch on board, complemented by local wine, soft drinks, and fresh fruits. Special Note: Snorkeling masks will be provided., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Paros, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Naxos To Paros Transfers: Today you will have a shared transfer from the hotel to the Port for the ferry to Paros. Upon arrival at Paros there will be a shared transfer from the port to the Hotel. Special Note: The check-in at the hotel will be as per the standard hotel time. Post check-in the rest of the day will be free at leisure, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Paros, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Free Day In Paros Transfers: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick-up for the same will be from selected central points. Kaiki Cruise Around Antiparos & Despotiko [Optional]: Another full-day sea escape on a traditional kaiki. Swim in secluded bays, explore the small island of Despotiko, and enjoy the peaceful atmosphere. Morning coffee, snacks, BBQ lunch, and soft drinks are provided. {Supplement cost for Paros Cruise activity is approx. Euro 95 Per Adult & Euro 90 Per Child respectively} Special Note: Snorkeling masks will be provided., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 9 - Santorini, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Paros To Santorini Transfers: Today you will have a shared transfer from the hotel to the Port for the ferry to Santorini. Upon arrival at Santorini there will be a shared transfer from the port to the Hotel. Special Note: The check-in at the hotel will be as per the standard hotel time. Post check-in the rest of the day will be free at leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 10 - Santorini, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Traditional Tour & Sunset In Oia Transfers: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick-up for the same will be from selected central points. Traditional Tour & Sunset in Oia: Today Begin at Akrotiri Archaeological Site with a licensed archaeologist. Continue to Emporio village, then lunch at Perissa Beach. Ascend Profitis Ilias Mountain for panoramic views, visit a traditional winery for tasting, and conclude with the world-famous sunset in Oia., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 11 - Santorini, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Santorini Transfers: From Santorini hotel to the Airport in private transfer. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 213859.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nValue Category (4* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nMykonos\n\n\nNaxos\n\n\nParos\n\n\nSantorini\n\n\n\n\nAthens\nAvenue or similar\n\n\nAeolos Resort Mykonos or similar\n\n\nAegean\nPalace or similar\n\n\nSeesoo Paros Beachfront Resort or similar\n\n\nDaedalus\nHotel or similar\n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nStandard Category (3* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nMykonos\n\n\nNaxos\n\n\nParos\n\n\nSantorini\n\n\n\n\nCentral Hotel or similar\n\n\nErato Hotel or similar\n\n\nPrincess of\nNaxos or similar\n\n\nAdonis Hotel & Apartments or similar\n\n\nMakris Beach Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nPremium Category (5* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nMykonos\n\n\nNaxos\n\n\nParos\n\n\nSantorini\n\n\n\n\nWyndham Grand Athens or similar\n\n\nRoyal Myconian or similar\n\n\nNaxos Island Hotel or similar\n\n\nAndronis\nMinois or similar\n\n\nApeiron\nBlue Santorini or similar\n\n\n\n. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\nLunch as a part of the Naxos Cruise Experience\n, \n\n\n\n\n\n\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\nLunch as a part of the Naxos Cruise Experience\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\xa0. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ accommodation in Athens based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Mykonos based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Naxos based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Paros based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Santorini based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Lunch as a part of the Naxos Cruise Experience Transportation: Private Airport Transfer from Athens Airport to Hotel Private transfer from Athens hotel to Port for the ferry to Mykonos Shared transport from Mykonos Port to the hotel and back to port Shared transport from Naxos Port to the hotel and back to port Shared transport from Paros Port to the hotel and back to port Shared transport from Santorini port to hotel Private Airport transfer from Santorini Hotel to Airport Ferry Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed] Normal Ferry ticket – Economy class from Athens to Mykonos Speed Ferry ticket - Economy class from Mykonos to Naxos Speed Ferry ticket - Economy class from Naxos to Paros Speed Ferry ticket - Economy class from Paros to Santorini Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point) Half-day City tour of Athens with new Acropolis Museum on sharing basis tour coach. Walking tour in Mykonos Town Full-Day Kaiki Cruise to Rina Cave & Ano Koufonissi Kaiki Cruise Around Antiparos & Despotiko Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Please note: In October, some of the activities on the islands might stop operating. We will be happy to provide alternatives, while making sure that the budget remains at the same level. Important Notes: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability Terms and Conditions: Travel Validity: 1 May 2026 – 15 October 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPri