k-up for the same will be from selected central points.\n\xa0\nKaiki Cruise Around Antiparos & Despotiko [Optional]: Another full-day sea escape on a traditional kaiki. Swim in secluded bays, explore the small island of Despotiko, and enjoy the peaceful atmosphere. Morning coffee, snacks, BBQ lunch, and soft drinks are provided. {Supplement cost for Paros Cruise activity is approx. Euro 95 Per Adult & Euro 90 Per Child respectively}\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Snorkeling masks will be provided.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Adonis & Apartments (Standard) / Seesoo Paros Beachfront Resort (Value) / Andronis Minois (Premium) or similar in Paros'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0\nParos To Santorini\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nToday you will have a shared transfer from the hotel to the Port for the ferry to Santorini.\nUpon arrival at Santorini there will be a shared transfer from the port to the Hotel.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nThe check-in at the hotel will be as per the standard hotel time.\xa0\nPost check-in the rest of the day will be free at leisure.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Makris Beach (Standard) / Daedalus (Value) / Apeiron Blue (Premium) or similar in Santorini'}, {'day': 10, 'description': '\xa0\nTraditional Tour & Sunset In Oia\n\xa0\nTransfers: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick-up for the same will be from selected central points.\n\xa0\nTraditional Tour & Sunset in Oia: Today Begin at Akrotiri Archaeological Site with a licensed archaeologist. Continue to Emporio village, then lunch at Perissa Beach. Ascend Profitis Ilias Mountain for panoramic views, visit a traditional winery for tasting, and conclude with the world-famous sunset in Oia.\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Makris Beach (Standard) / Daedalus (Value) / Apeiron Blue (Premium) or similar in Santorini'}, {'day': 11, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Santorini\n\xa0\nTransfers: From Santorini hotel to the Airport in private transfer.\n\xa0\n\xa0\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nValue Category (4* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nMykonos\n\n\nNaxos\n\n\nParos\n\n\nSantorini\n\n\n\n\nAthens\nAvenue or similar\n\n\nAeolos Resort Mykonos or similar\n\n\nAegean\nPalace or similar\n\n\nSeesoo Paros Beachfront Resort or similar\n\n\nDaedalus\nHotel or similar\n\n\n\n', '\n\n\n\nStandard Category (3* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nMykonos\n\n\nNaxos\n\n\nParos\n\n\nSantorini\n\n\n\n\nCentral Hotel or similar\n\n\nErato Hotel or similar\n\n\nPrincess of\nNaxos or similar\n\n\nAdonis Hotel & Apartments or similar\n\n\nMakris Beach Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n', '\n\n\n\nPremium Category (5* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nMykonos\n\n\nNaxos\n\n\nParos\n\n\nSantorini\n\n\n\n\nWyndham Grand Athens or similar\n\n\nRoyal Myconian or similar\n\n\nNaxos Island Hotel or similar\n\n\nAndronis\nMinois or similar\n\n\nApeiron\nBlue Santorini or similar\n\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'2': '\n\n\n\nPremium Category (5* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nMykonos\n\n\nNaxos\n\n\nParos\n\n\nSantorini\n\n\n\n\nWyndham Grand Athens or similar\n\n\nRoyal Myconian or similar\n\n\nNaxos Island Hotel or similar\n\n\nAndronis\nMinois or similar\n\n\nApeiron\nBlue Santorini or similar\n\n\n\n', '0': '\n\n\n\nStandard Category (3* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nMykonos\n\n\nNaxos\n\n\nParos\n\n\nSantorini\n\n\n\n\nCentral Hotel or similar\n\n\nErato Hotel or similar\n\n\nPrincess of\nNaxos or similar\n\n\nAdonis Hotel & Apartments or similar\n\n\nMakris Beach Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n', '1': '\n\n\n\nValue Category (4* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n