o port\nShared transport from Naxos Port to the hotel and back to port\nShared transport from Paros Port to the hotel and back to port\nShared transport from Santorini port to hotel\xa0\nPrivate Airport transfer from Santorini Hotel to Airport\n\n\xa0\nFerry Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed]\n\nNormal Ferry ticket – Economy class from Athens to Mykonos\nSpeed Ferry ticket - Economy class from Mykonos to Naxos\nSpeed Ferry ticket - Economy class from Naxos to Paros\nSpeed Ferry ticket - Economy class from Paros to Santorini\n'], 'sightseeing': ['Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n\nHalf-day City tour of Athens with new Acropolis Museum on sharing basis tour coach.\nWalking tour in Mykonos Town\nFull-Day Kaiki Cruise to Rina Cave & Ano Koufonissi\nKaiki Cruise Around Antiparos & Despotiko\nTraditional Tour & Sunset in Oia on sharing basis with transportation from/to meeting point - clients need to go by themselves to the pick-up point for the tour\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': '<p>Return Economy Class Airfare</p>', 'inclusions': 'Accommodation:\n\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Athens based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Mykonos based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Naxos based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Paros based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Santorini based on the hotel category selected or similar\n\n\xa0\nMeals:\n\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\nLunch as a part of the Naxos Cruise Experience\n\n\xa0\nTransportation:\xa0\n\nPrivate Airport Transfer from Athens Airport to Hotel\nPrivate transfer from Athens hotel to Port for the ferry to Mykonos\nShared transport from Mykonos Port to the hotel and back to port\nShared transport from Naxos Port to the hotel and back to port\nShared transport from Paros Port to the hotel and back to port\nShared transport from Santorini port to hotel\xa0\nPrivate Airport transfer from Santorini Hotel to Airport\n\n\xa0\nFerry Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed]\n\nNormal Ferry ticket – Economy class from Athens to Mykonos\nSpeed Ferry ticket - Economy class from Mykonos to Naxos\nSpeed Ferry ticket - Economy class from Naxos to Paros\nSpeed Ferry ticket - Economy class from Paros to Santorini\n\n\xa0\nSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n\nHalf-day City tour of Athens with new Acropolis Museum on sharing basis tour coach.\nWalking tour in Mykonos Town\nFull-Day Kaiki Cruise to Rina Cave & Ano Koufonissi\nKaiki Cruise Around Antiparos & Despotiko\xa0\n\nInsurance:\n\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n\n\xa0', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included\xa0\nCity taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nCost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.\n', 'termsAndConditions': '\xa0Please note: In October, some of the activities on the islands might stop operating. We will be happy to provide alternatives, while making sure that the budget remains at the same level.\n\xa0\nImportant Notes:\n\nThe above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together.\nThe above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\nMaximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room.\nMidnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\nWIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed.\xa0\n(Supplement charges may apply for such services)\nStandard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs.\nMost hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned.\nAt this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability\n\nTerms and Conditions:\xa0\n\nTravel Validity: 1 May 2026 – 15 October 2026\nBlack out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nMaximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\nSurcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking.\nTo proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour.\nShould the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014604/Paros_1.jpeg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014604/itinerary/Athens.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014604/itinerary/AcropolisinAthens.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014604/itinerary/AdobeStock_67990916.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014604/itinerary/Mykons753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014604/itinerary/Naxos_1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014604/itinerary/Naxos_2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014604/itinerary/Paros_1.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014604/itinerary/Despotiko.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014604/itinerary/Santorini_2.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014604/itinerary/SunsetonthefamousOiacityGreece.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014604/itinerary/Santorini7532.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014520', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014520', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Paris And Swiss', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014520_0_20260916224353', 'price': 221234, 'packageSummary': "The 'Paris And Swiss' package is a 7-day tour covering the iconic city of Paris and the scenic regions of Central and Southern Switzerland. The itinerary includes visits to world-famous landmarks such as the Eiffel Tower, the Louvre Museum, and the breathtaking Swiss Alps. Participants will enjoy guided city sightseeing tours, a romantic cruise along the River Seine, and unforgettable mountain excursions amidst Switzerland's stunning natural landscapes.", 'images': ['ParisViewFrance7533.jpg', 'EiffelTowerParisFrance7534.jpg', 'Lake_Lucerne.jpg', '89366_Mt._Titlis_Engelberg_Switzerland_753.jpg', 'JUNGFRAUJOCH_753.jpg', 'Glacier_3000_753.jpg', 'Zurich_753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 221234, 'thumbnailImage': 'Interlaken2678.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Adventure'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Trending Now', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014520 is named 'Paris And Swiss' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Paris, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Paris Transfers: Upon your arrival at the airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 14:00 - 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Paris City Tour + River Seine Cruise + Eiffel Tower Tour Paris City Tour: Later discover Paris's most famous tourist sites and monuments on one unique tour. This tour features a visit to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower with breathtaking views of the capital, a panoramic city tour by coach, plus an hour-long boat trip along the River Seine. This comprehensive tour is the ideal way to discover Paris for the first time. Special Note: Thanks to your priority access, you can skip the line and speed up by elevator to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower, Paris's most unmissable monument., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Paris To Central Switzerland Via Train Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Central Switzerland. Upon your arrival in Central Switzerland, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion. Lucerne Tour with Swiss Pass on your own (Optional): Travel to Lucerne with Swiss pass on your own as there are many sights in a small area in Lucerne like Chapel Bridge with the Water Tower which is the landmark of Lucerne and the most photographed monument in Switzerland., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Mt. Titlis Excursion Mt. Titlis Excursion: Don't miss the spectacular beauty of Mt Titlis! Discover eternal glaciers and other attractions from more than 3020m / 10000 ft high. Enjoy the spectacular sight of the glacier's deep crevasses and gigantic ice boulders from the revolving cable car ROTAIR. At the top of Mt. Titlis (10'000 ft. above sea level), a high alpine panorama awaits you. Visit the Ice Grotto or take a ride with the chairlift IceFlyer, which brings you close to the crevasses. Enjoy also the FunLift in the snow and the Cliff Walk, Europe's highest suspension bridge. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Jungfraujoch Excursion Jungfraujoch Excursion: Don't miss the highlight of any Swiss holiday and go for this thrilling and unforgettable excursion to Jungfraujoch, Top of Europe! From Interlaken, the heart of the Jungfrau region mountain world and uniquely situated between two lakes, you make your way to famous mountain resort Grindelwald where you board the cogwheel train for a spectacular ride via Kleine Scheidegg to Jungfraujoch. Enjoy stunning views of the world-famous triple peaks of Eiger, Monch and Jungfrau accompany you all the way to the top. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Central Switzerland Day At Leisure (Optional Activity) Glacier 3000 (Optional): Escape to the high Alps to breath a fresh air and spectacular mountain vistas on the Glacier 3000 (Optional Mountain Excursion). Glacier 3000, located at the highest point of the Vaudois Alps, is open all year round for winter activities for all! With its stunning views and wide range of activities on offer – including the Peak Walk, a unique suspension bridge linking two mountain peaks – Glacier 3000 is a must for your holidays in Switzerland. Bollywood Tour (Optional): Gstaad region is known as one of the most scenic natural film sets in the world. Many Bollywood blockbusters have been filmed here, such as DDLJ “Bachana Ae Haseenno” and many more. Lunch can be included on this tour., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Transfers: Make your way to Lucerne Train station and with the help of the sector ticket head to the Zurich airport for flight back home. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 221234.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4*\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nMercure Paris Opéra Faubourg Montmartre / Novotel Paris Center Eiffel Tower / Novotel Paris Center Gare Montparnasse / Mercure Paris Bercy Bibliotheque Hotel / Hotel Mademoiselle or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nCampus Hotel Hertenstein | Romantik Hotel Beau Rivage - Weggis | Hotel Baren Sigriswil | Hotel Eden Spiez | Seegarten Marina or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0, \xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nHotel Opera Lafayette / Color Design Hotel / Hôtel Champerret-Elysées / Londres Et New York Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nLa Pergola | Ibis Styles Bern City | Prizeotel Bern-city | Jardin | Sorell Hotel Ador or similar\n\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ accommodation in Paris based on the hotel category selected or similar 4 Nights’ accommodation in Central Switzerland based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis] Arrival Airport Transfer from Paris Airport to London Hotel Train Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed] Paris – Geneva / Basel (TGV). Swiss Pass 4 Days Consecutive Saver. Lucerne – Zurich Airport. Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) Interactive City Tour, Seine Cruise and Eiffel Tower 2nd Floor with Priority Access (SIC) Mt Titlis Excursion (in conjunction with Swiss Pass) Jungfraujoch Excursion (in conjunction with Swiss Pass) Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Note: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability Terms and Conditions: Travel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 September 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Paris And Swiss' package is a 7-day tour covering the iconic city of Paris and the scenic regions of Central and Southern Switzerland. The itinerary includes visits to world-famous landmarks such as the Eiffel Tower, the Louvre Museum, and the breathtaking Swiss Alps. Participants will enjoy guided city sightseeing tours, a romantic cruise along the River Seine, and unforgettable mountain excursions amidst Switzerland's stunning natural landscapes.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': 'Arrive Paris\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at the airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle.\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 14:00 - 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Opera Lafayette\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Mercure Paris Opera Faubourg Montmartre\xa0(Value) Or Similar in\xa0Paris'}, {'day': 2, 'description': "Paris City Tour + River Seine Cruise + Eiffel Tower Tour\xa0\nParis City Tour: Later discover Paris's most famous tourist sites and monuments on one unique tour. This tour features a visit to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower with breathtaking views of the capital, a panoramic city tour by coach, plus an hour-long boat trip along the River Seine. This comprehensive tour is the ideal way to discover Paris for the first time.\xa0\xa0\nSpecial Note: Thanks to your priority access, you can skip the line and speed up by elevator to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower, Paris's most unmissable monument.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Opera Lafayette\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Mercure Paris Opera Faubourg Montmartre\xa0(Value) Or Similar in\xa0Paris'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nParis To Central Switzerland Via Train\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Central Switzerland.\xa0\nUpon your arrival in Central Switzerland, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\nLucerne Tour with Swiss Pass on your own (Optional): Travel to Lucerne with Swiss pass on your own as there are many sights in a small area in Lucerne like Chapel Bridge with the Water Tower which is the landmark of Lucerne and the most photographed monument in Switzerland.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Campus Hotel Hertenstein\xa0(Value) Or Similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 4, 'description': "\xa0\nMt. Titlis Excursion\nMt. Titlis Excursion: Don't miss the spectacular beauty of Mt Titlis! Discover eternal glaciers and other attractions from more than 3020m / 10000 ft high. Enjoy the spectacular sight of the glacier's deep crevasses and gigantic ice boulders from the revolving cable car ROTAIR. At the top of Mt. Titlis (10'000 ft. above sea level), a high alpine panorama awaits you. Visit the Ice Grotto or take a ride with the chairlift IceFlyer, which brings you close to the crevasses. Enjoy also the FunLift in the snow and the Cliff Walk, Europe's highest suspension bridge. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass)", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Campus Hotel Hertenstein\xa0(Value) Or Similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 5, 'description': "\xa0\nJungfraujoch Excursion\nJungfraujoch Excursion: Don't miss the highlight of any Swiss holiday and go for this thrilling and unforgettable excursion to Jungfraujoch, Top of Europe! From Interlaken, the heart of the Jungfrau region mountain world and uniquely situated between two lakes, you make your way to famous mountain resort Grindelwald where you board the cogwheel train for a spectacular ride via Kleine Scheidegg to Jungfraujoch. Enjoy stunning views of the world-famous triple peaks of Eiger, Monch and Jungfrau accompany you all the way to the top. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass)", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Campus Hotel Hertenstein\xa0(Value) Or Similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nCentral Switzerland Day At Leisure (Optional Activity)\nGlacier 3000 (Optional): Escape to the high Alps to breath a fresh air and spectacular mountain vistas on the Glacier 3000 (Optional Mountain Excursion). Glacier 3000, located at the highest point of the Vaudois Alps, is open all year round for winter activities for all! With its stunning views and wide range of activities on offer – including the Peak Walk, a unique suspension bridge linking two mountain peaks – Glacier 3000 is a must for your holidays in Switzerland.\nBollywood Tour (Optional): Gstaad region is known as one of the most scenic natural film sets in the world. Many Bollywood blockbusters have been filmed here, such as DDLJ “Bachana Ae Haseenno” and many more. Lunch can be included on this tour.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Campus Hotel Hertenstein\xa0(Value) Or Similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart\nTransfers: Make your way to Lucerne Train station and with the help of the sector ticket head to the Zurich airport for flight back home.\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4*\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nMercure Paris Opéra Faubourg Montmartre / Novotel Paris Center Eiffel Tower / Novotel Paris Center Gare Montparnasse / Mercure Paris Bercy Bibliotheque Hotel / Hotel Mademoiselle or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nCampus Hotel Hertenstein | Romantik Hotel Beau Rivage - Weggis | Hotel Baren Sigriswil | Hotel Eden Spiez | Seegarten Marina or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0', '\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nHotel Opera Lafayette / Color Design Hotel / Hôtel Champerret-Elysées / Londres Et New York Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nLa Pergola | Ibis Styles Bern City | Prizeotel Bern-city | Jardin | Sorell Hotel Ador or similar\n\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'0': '\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nHotel Opera Lafayette / Color Design Hotel / Hôtel Champerret-Elysées / Londres Et New York Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nLa Pergola | Ibis Styles Bern City | Prizeotel Bern-city | Jardin | Sorell Hotel Ador or similar\n\n\n\n', '1': '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4*\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nMercure Paris O