rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014522/VersaillesPalace_new_753.jpeg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014522/itinerary/Paris_new_753.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014522/itinerary/52478_Eiffel_tower_Seine_river_Paris_France_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014522/itinerary/Louvre_Museum_Paris1_753_Adobe.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014522/itinerary/Nicecity_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014522/itinerary/753NiceCity.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014522/itinerary/Nice1_753.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014514', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014514', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Italian Charm', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Rome', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rome', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Florence', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Florence', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Venice', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Venice', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Venice', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014514_0_20260916121639.pdf', 'price': 152474, 'packageSummary': "The 'Italian Charm' package is a 7-day tour covering the historic and enchanting cities of Rome, Florence, and Venice. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the Colosseum, the Trevi Fountain, the Florence Cathedral, and the majestic St. Mark's Basilica. Participants will enjoy guided walking tours through ancient ruins, a romantic gondola ride along the scenic canals of Venice, and opportunities to experience authentic Italian cuisine and local artisan workshops.", 'images': ['40866_Colosseum_Rome_Italy_753.jpg', "447998_Saint_Peter's_Square_Rome_Italy_753.jpg", '2987_Florence_753.jpg', '51449_Field_of_Miracles_Pisa_Italy_753.jpg', '62615_Venice_753.jpg', '59724_Venice_Mark_Square753.jpg', '0886_Venice753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 152474, 'thumbnailImage': 'Italy_SRP.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Most Booked', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014514 is named 'Italian Charm' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Rome, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Italy Transfers: Upon your arrival at the Fiumicino Leonardo Da Vinci (FCO) airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Rome, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Hop On Hop Off Tour Hop on Hop Off Tour: Discover Rome's iconic sights and landmarks on a hop-on hop-off bus tour, offering a comprehensive overview of all the city’s highlights. Disembark at any of the multiple stops to see popular landmarks such as the Vatican City, Circus Maximus, the Pantheon, or the Colosseum. While on board the bus, listen to recorded commentary in multiple languages that details the history, architecture, culture, and traditions of the Eternal City., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Florence, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Rome To Florence Via Train Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Florence. (Duration approx. 1.5 hrs.) Upon your arrival at Florence train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Florence, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Pisa And The Leaning Tower Tour Transfers: You will have a transfer from Florence to Pisa and back to Florence. Pisa and the Leaning Tower Tour: This popular half-day trip takes you from Florence through the scenic Tuscan countryside to the historic city of Pisa. The tour focuses on Piazza dei Miracoli, a UNESCO World Heritage site, where you’ll see the Leaning Tower, the Cathedral, the Baptistery, and the Monumental Cemetery., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Venice, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Florence To Venice Via Train Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Venice. (Duration approx. 2.5 hrs.) Upon your arrival at Venice train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. Gondola Ride: Experience Venice in the most Venetian way possible: via a shared gondola ride while being serenaded. Choose between an afternoon or evening ride and then begin the ride, as part of a group of eight different gondolas, with a singer aboard one of the boats. In addition to the song being sun to you, enjoy the sites of Venice's main landmarks, including the grand Canal and Palazzo Barberino., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Venice, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Murano, Burano And Torcello Half-Day Tour Murano, Burano and Torcello Half-Day Sightseeing Tour: Today visit Torcello, Murano, and Burano — three islands in the Venetian Lagoon — on this tour from Venice by motorboat. With a guide, watch glass being blown at a Murano glass factory, see historical cathedrals on Torcello, and admire exquisite handmade lace on Burano. This is a great way to see more than just the central sights of Venice and enjoy a cruise on the water. Highlights: Visit the three most famous islands in the Venetian Lagoon by motorboat Watch master glass blowers at work at a factory on Murano See Byzantine churches on Torcello— the Church of Santa Fosca Browse for lace on Burano and admire the painted houses McArthurGlen Designer Outlet (Optional): Later you can opt to visit the McArthurGlen Designer Outlet in Noventa di Piave is the most prestigious shopping outlet in Veneto, where you can find the most prestigious fashion with discounts up to 70% all around the year. Located just 30 minutes by car from Venice. Over 100 shops, restaurants, bars, lounges, play areas for children, located in a beautiful setting with architectural mosaics and frescoes inspired by the palaces in Venice and Treviso, where you can satisfy your thirst for great fashion, taking advantage of the offers and services designed specifically to make time spent here unforgettable. Planning to Visit? Click the link below to conveniently book your shuttle bus tickets and enjoy exciting deals at the nearest outlet: https://mgbooking.tripodeck.com/home?orderCustId=6977233, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Venice, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Venice Transfers: From Venice hotel to airport, you will have a private transfer. Special Notes: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 152474.0. Hotels envisaged include: Hotels Envisaged or Similar :\n\n\n\n\nCITY NAME\n\n\n4*\n\n\n\n\nROME\n\n\nBest Western Hotel Artdeco / Atlantico / Hotel Massimo D'azeglio / Hotel Diana Roof Garden / Best Western President or similar\n\n\n\n\nFLORENCE\n\n\nAtlantic Palace / De La Ville / Embassy Hotel / Starhotels Michelangelo Florence / Hotel Principe di Firenze / C Hotel Club / C-hotels Ambassadors Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nVENICE\n\n\nRoyal San Marco Hotel / San Marco Palace / Hotel Kette / Bonvecchiati or similar or similar\n\n\n\n, Hotels Envisaged or Similar:\n\n\n\n\nCITY NAME\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nROME\n\n\nAndreotti Hotel and Domus Australia / Hotel Villa San Lorenzo Maria / Hotel Des Artistes / Hotel Nord Nuova Roma / Hotel Windrose or similar\n\n\n\n\nFLORENCE\n\n\nAlbergo Firenze / Hotel Boccaccio / Hotel Paris / Hotel Machiavelli Palace / Hotel Luxor Florence or similar\n\n\n\n\nVENICE\n\n\nHotel Diana / Albergo San Marco / San Zulian / Hotel Montecarlo or similar\n\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ accommodation in Rome based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Florence based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Venice based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) T