p ticket Trip to Bosnia & Herzegovina Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: IMPORTANT NOTES: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TERMS AND CONDITIONS: Travel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 November 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Pure Croatia' package is an 8-day tour covering the historic and scenic cities of Dubrovnik, Zadar, Zagreb, and Split. Throughout this captivating journey, participants will immerse themselves in Croatia's rich heritage and stunning coastal beauty through guided city tours of ancient Roman ruins, walks along medieval city walls, and visits to vibrant local markets. Travelers will also enjoy scenic coastal drives along the Adriatic Sea, explore historic cathedrals, and experience the unique blend of cultural charm and modern life that defines these iconic Croatian destinations.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Zagreb\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at Zagreb airport, you will be transferred to the hotel on private basis.\n\xa0\nWalking Tour of Zagreb: Explore Zagreb’s highlights on a guided walking tour with a scenic funicular ride. Discover the charm of both Lower and Upper Town, uncover hidden gems, and hear the stories that shaped Croatia’s vibrant capital.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Laguna (Standard)//\xa0Hotel AS (Value)//\xa0Hotel Sheraton (Premium) or similar in Zagreb'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nDay Free At Leisure\nOptional Day Trip To Slovenia on SIC Basis: Enjoy a free day or take an optional trip to Slovenia. Visit the charming capital Ljubljana, then escape into nature at Lake Bled, famous for its scenic lake and hilltop castle—an unforgettable getaway from Zagreb.\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nYou need to be in possession of a multiple entry Schengen visa to visit Slovenia.\nSightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Laguna (Standard)//\xa0Hotel AS (Value)//\xa0Hotel Sheraton (Premium) or similar in Zagreb'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nZagreb - Zadar | Enroute Plitvice National Park |\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nThis morning travel to Zadar, enroute visit Plitvice National Park.\nLater continue your journey to Zadar\n\n\xa0\nPlitvice National Park: Plitvice National Park dazzles with waterfalls, lakes, and forested cliffs. Your ticket includes full access to trails and boardwalks, a panoramic train ride, shuttle buses between lakes, and an electric boat cruise on Kozjak Lake.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': "Hotel A'mare (Standard)//Falkensteiner Club Funimation Borik (Value)//Miramare Hotel (Premium) or similar in Zadar\n\xa0\n\xa0"}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nWalking Tour of Zadar |\xa0Zadar - Split\xa0\n\xa0\nTransfers: Today you will travel from Zadar to Split by bus on shared basis.\n\xa0\nWalking Tour of Zadar:\xa0 Enjoy a guided walking tour of Zadar’s Old City, including St. Donat, St. Anastasia, city gates, walls, and the Square of Five Wells. Sample Maraschino liqueur and Pag cheese, then relax by the Sea Organ and admire the sunset.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Jadrran (Standard)//Hotel Fanat (Value)//Cornaro\xa0(Premium) or similar in Split'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n Blue Lagoon 3 Island Tour | Walking Tour of Split\n\xa0\nBlue Lagoon – 3 Island Tour:\xa0 Enjoy a relaxing Blue Lagoon 3 Island Tour, visiting UNESCO listed Trogir, the Blue Lagoon, and Šolta’s Stomorska village for swimming and exploring. You can also take a Blue Cave 5 Island Tour to Biševo, Vis, Pakleni, Hvar and Brac\xa0for stunning views and swims.\n\xa0\nWalking Tour of Split:\xa0 Enjoy an evening walking tour of Split and explore the 1700 year old Diocletian’s Palace. See St. Domnius Cathedral, the Peristil, Golden Gate, and Gregory of Nin. End with the 24 hour sun clock at City Square and the Riva promenade.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nYou have an opportunity to upgrade your Blue Lagoon and Guided walking tour of Split to a full-day Blue Cave Tour at an additional cost.\nSightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Jadrran (Standard)//Hotel Fanat (Value)//Cornaro\xa0(Premium) or similar in Split'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nSplit – Dubrovnik | Walking Tour of Dubrovnik |\n\xa0\nTransfers: Today you will travel from Split to Dubrovnik by bus on shared basis.\n\xa0\nWalking Tour of Dubrovnik: Enjoy an evening walking tour of Dubrovnik and a Cable Car ride. Explore the Old Town’s history, architecture, and culture, then ride to the top of Srd Hill for stunning views of the Adriatic Sea and the city below.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nSightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\nYou can opt for a Sunset Dinner Cruise (Dalmatian Cuisine) at a supplement cost\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Vis (Standard)//Hotel Lero (Value)//Hotel President (Premium) in Dubrovnik'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nTrip To Bosnia & Herzegovina\nTrip to Bosnia & Herzegovina: Explore Bosnia and Herzegovina on a day trip and visit UNESCO listed Mostar. Wander cobbled streets, see Ottoman era mosques and bathhouses, and admire the iconic Stari Most—one of the modern world’s most remarkable bridges.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nGuest should be carrying their passport with valid Schengen Visa.\nSightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Vis (Standard)//Hotel Lero (Value)//Hotel President (Premium) in Dubrovnik'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart\nTransfers: You will have a private transfer from Dubrovnik hotel to Dubrovnik Airport\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nCity\n\nHotels\n\n\n\nZagreb\n\n\nHotel Sheraton, Hotel Esplanade Zagreb, Hotel Westin or Similar\n\n\n\n\nZadar\n\n\nMiramare Hotel, Teatro Verdi Boutique Hotel, Hotel Bastion or Similar\n\n\n\n\nSplit\n\n\nCornaro Hotel, Radisson Blu Resort & Spa, Hotel Ambasador or Similar\n\n\n\n\nDubrovnik\n\n\nHotel President, Hotel Sun Gardens, Hotel Hilton Imperial or Similar\n\n\n\n', '\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCity\xa0\n\n\nHotels\n\n\n\n\nZagreb\n\n\nHotel Canopy By Hilton, Hotel AS, Hotel Dubrovnik or Similar\n\n\n\n\nZadar\n\n\nFalkensteiner Club Funimation Borik, Hotel Kolovare, Almayer Art And Heritage Hotel or Similar\n\n\n\n\nSplit\n\n\nHotel Fanat, Hotel Globo, Hotel Cora or Similar\n\n\n\n\nDubrovnik\n\n\nHotel Lero, Hotel Valamar Lacroma, Hotel Lapad or Similar\n\n\n\n', "\n\n\n\nCity\n\n\nHotels\n\n\n\n\nZagreb\n\n\nHotel Laguna, Best Western Hotel Stella, Garden Hotel or Similar\n\n\n\n\nZadar\n\n\nA'mare Hotel Zadar, Hotel Mediteran, Hotel Delfin or Similar\n\n\n\n\nSplit\n\n\nArt Hotel Depadansa, Hotel AS, Hotel Jadran or Similar\n\n\n\n\nDubrovnik\n\n\nHotel Vis, Hotel Komodor, Hotel Dubrovnik or Similar\n\n\n\n"], 'hotels_list': {'2': '\n\n\n\nCity\n\nHotels\n\n\n\nZagreb\n\n\nHotel Sheraton, Hotel Esplanade Zagreb, Hotel Westin or Similar\n\n\n\n\nZadar\n\n\nMiramare Hotel, Teatro Verdi Boutique Hotel, Hote