 – expected arrival time in Bergen: 21: 11 hrsOvernight in Bergen.\nNote :\xa0Lunch on your own in Flam OR on Cruise', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Citybox Bergen / Magic Hotel Solheimsviken / Thon Hotel Orion (Standard) / Scandic Neptun / Comfort Hotel Bergen / Scandic Ornen (Value) OR similar in Bergen'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nBergen Like A Local: Customized Private Tour\xa0\n\xa0\nAfter breakfast at the hotel Today you will have a sightseeing Tour of Bergen like a Local. With no set itinerary, you can customize the tour or leave it up to the local for an insightful introduction to the city. Make travel about the people you meet not just the places you see. With the walking tours, you will skip the mundane historical tours and discover the city through a local’s eyes. Experience a tour that will transform the way you travel to make it as much about the people you meet, as it is the places you see.\xa0\nThe local guides (Lokafyers) are passionate about their city and eager to share their knowledge and perspective. Since Lokafyers are not professional guides and tour occasionally, they provide an experience that is authentic and personal, like a friend showing you around their city. By the end of the tour, you will feel comfortable navigating the city and confident that you have all the information you need to make the most of your stay. (Duration – 2 hours)', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Citybox Bergen / Magic Hotel Solheimsviken / Thon Hotel Orion (Standard) / Scandic Neptun / Comfort Hotel Bergen / Scandic Ornen (Value) OR similar in Bergen'}, {'day': 6, 'description': 'Bergen To Tromso\nToday after breakfast, you will have a private airport transfer for the flight to Tromso (Internal Flights not included).\n\xa0\nWelcome to Tromsø, which is located in the heart of the Arctic wilderness, surrounded by steep mountains and beautiful fjords. The stunning nature is so close that you can admire the landscape from the city centre or from the Cable Car. It is also possible to see sea eagles and seals from Tromsø. Upon arrival at Tromsø Airport, Langnes (TOS), you will have a private transfer to your hotel for check in process. Rest of the day will be free at leisure for relax.\n\xa0\nOr you can opt for “Night Reindeer Sledding with Camp Dinner and Chance of Northern Lights”\xa0\n\xa0\nTravel out into the wilderness and walk among 300 reindeer (with the opportunity to feed them too) before enjoying a 15 to 20-minute sleigh ride. Afterwards, enter a candlelit Gamme to enjoy a relaxed three-course meal followed by the sounds of joiking (songs), Sami history and stories. On a clear night, you might be lucky enough to catch the majestic northern lights.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Scandic Grand Tromsø / Tromso Amalie Hotel / Quality Hotel Saga Hotel (Standard) / Home Hotel Aurora / Clarion Hotel The Edge / Tromso Lodge & Camping / Home Hotel (Value) OR similar in Tromso'}, {'day': 7, 'description': "\xa0\nTromso - Free Day\nAfter breakfast at the hotel, rest of the day is free to witness the amazing location or opt for some sightseeing.\n\xa0\nReindeer Sledding Excursion at Wilderness Camp (Available from 15 November onwards) (Optional)\n\xa0\nGet close to the majestic and festive creatures and learn about the people that have been herding them for centuries. Come on this reindeer sledding experience, meet the indigenous Sami people as you learn about their culture, interact with, and feed their reindeers.\n\xa0\nOR Snowmobile Safari in the Scenic Lyngen Alps (Optional)\n\xa0\nExplore the majestic Lyngen Alps on our Lyngen Snowmobile Safari. Behold nature at its very best in the Lyngen Alps, which offers some of the most beautiful scenery in Northern Norway. This is a big wilderness playground where we follow some approved and well-established trails.\n\xa0\nLater in the evening, we have included the Small Northern Lights Tour Max8 Guests PRO Photographer included (Start Time 18:30 / Duration 6 - 8hrs)\n\xa0\n\xa0\nJoin a special journey through the beautiful Arctic landscapes of Tromsø to chase the magical Northern Lights. Best location is chosen based on the aurora forecast and the experience, ensuring the best chances to see the lights. You'll explore peaceful, snowy areas, perfect for capturing the beauty of the Northern Lights. Tour extends between 6 to 8 Hours regarding some weather conditions as it takes time to travel away and find the treasure lights of Aurora.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Scandic Grand Tromsø / Tromso Amalie Hotel / Quality Hotel Saga Hotel (Standard) / Home Hotel Aurora / Clarion Hotel The Edge / Tromso Lodge & Camping / Home Hotel (Value) OR similar in Tromso'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nTromso - Free Day\xa0\nBreakfast at the hotel followed by a day free to explore this amazing destination on your own. You can also opt for the below Optional activities.\nWhale watching in Magic Skjervoy - RIB Boat [Duration 11 hrs with 530 am start time]\n\xa0\nWe pick you up at 5:30 am outside Scandic Ishavshotel, drive you to Skjervoy, give you warm flotation suits, and take you on a once in a life time whale watching experience by Rib-boat!\n\xa0\nThen we give you sandwiches, tea and coffee, and start the panoramic drive (back in Tromso at 6:00 pm).\nWhat’s Included:\n\nRound trip Tromso-Skjervoy-Tromso\nRIB-Boat whale watching excursion\nEnglish speaking skipper/guide\nWarm flotation suits\nBoots\nMittens\nSandwiches\nTea & coffee.\nSnacks\nCoffee and/or Tea\n\nOR\nDog Sledding Afternoon in the Lyngen Alps (Available from 18 November onwards)\n\xa0\nProceed for an afternoon of Dog Sledding at Breivikeidet with views of the majestic Lyngen Alps. Enjoy mushing through stunning scenery and whizzing across open terrain with the friendly and eager huskies.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Scandic Grand Tromsø / Tromso Amalie Hotel / Quality Hotel Saga Hotel (Standard) / Home Hotel Aurora / Clarion Hotel The Edge / Tromso Lodge & Camping / Home Hotel (Value) OR similar in Tromso'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart from Tromso\n\xa0\nBreakfast at the hotel, complete check out formalities and have some free time depending on the flight back home.\xa0 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight – you will have a private transfer to Tromsø Airport (TOS), for your flight back to home\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\nHotels Envigised OR Similar\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4* CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nOslo\n\n\nHotel Scandic Helsfyr / Verdandi Oslo / Thon Hotel Linne (Standard) / Radisson Red Oslo Okern / Scandic Holmenkollen Park / Scandic Vulkan (Value) or similar in Oslo\n\n\n\n\nBergen\n\n\nHotel Citybox Bergen / Magic Hotel Solheimsviken / Thon Hotel Orion (Standard) / Scandic Neptun / Comfort Hotel Bergen / Scandic Ornen (Value) OR similar in Bergen\n\n\n\n\nTromso\n\n\nHotel Scandic Grand Tromsø / Tromso Amalie Hotel / Quality Hotel Saga Hotel (Standard) / Home Hotel Aurora / Clarion Hotel The Edge/ Tromso Lodge & Camping / Home Hotel (Value) OR similar in Tromso\n\n\n\n', '\n\n\nHotels Envisaged OR Similar\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3* CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nOslo\n\n\nHotel Scandic Helsfyr / Verdandi Oslo / Thon Hotel Linne (Standard) / Radisson Red Oslo Okern / Scandic Holmenkollen Park / Scandic Vulkan (Value) or similar in Oslo\n\n\n\n\nBergen\n\n\nHotel Citybox Bergen / Magic Hotel Solheimsviken / Thon Hotel Orion (Standard) / Scandic Neptun / Comfort Hotel Bergen / Scandic Ornen (Value) OR similar in Bergen\n\n\n\n\nTromso\n\n\nHotel Scandic Grand Tromsø / Tromso Amalie Hotel / Quality Hotel Saga Hotel (Standard) / Home Hotel Aurora / Clarion Hotel The Edge/ Tromso Lodge & Camping / Home Hotel (Value) OR similar in Tromso\n\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'1': '\n\n\nHotels Envigised OR Similar\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4* CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nOslo\n\n\nHotel Scandic Helsfy