vel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014550/Ibiza_Castle.jpeg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014550/itinerary/Madrid2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014550/itinerary/MadridRoyalPalace.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014550/itinerary/Ibiza.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014550/itinerary/Ibiza-Castle.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014550/itinerary/Barcelona.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014550/itinerary/cityview_barca.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014550/itinerary/BarcelonaCIty.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014512', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014512', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Best Of Ireland', 'days': 10, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Dublin', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dublin', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Killarney', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Killarney', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Galway', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Galway', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Dublin', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Belfast', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Belfast', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Belfast', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014512_0_20260916114527.pdf', 'price': 205550, 'packageSummary': "The 'Best Of Ireland' package is a 10-day tour covering the iconic cities of Dublin, Belfast, Galway, and Killarney. Throughout this immersive journey, participants will experience key highlights such as scenic drives along the breathtaking Ring of Kerry, marveling at the majestic Cliffs of Moher, and exploring historic landmarks like Trinity College in Dublin and the Titanic Belfast exhibition. The itinerary also includes guided city tours, visits to ancient castles, and ample opportunities to enjoy traditional Irish music and hospitality in local pubs.", 'images': ['Dublin_1.jpg', 'Dublin_2.jpg', 'Killarney.jpg', 'Ring_of_Kerry.jpg', 'Galway.jpg', 'CLIFFS_4.jpeg', 'Dublin_7.jpeg', 'belfast_castle.jpg', 'Causeway_code_poet.jpg', 'BELFAST_2.jpeg'], 'minimumPrice': 205550, 'thumbnailImage': 'belfast_castle.jpeg', 'packageTheme': [], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014512 is named 'Best Of Ireland' and spans 10 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Dublin, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrival at Dublin Transfers: Upon your arrival at the airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Dublin, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Hop On Hop Off Tour Hop on Hop Off Tour: Hop on to discover Dublin's colourful history and rich culture, then hop off to explore the city at your own pace. With one route taking you to over 25 stops covering all of Dublin's most-loved attractions, it's never been easier to explore the city. The red route is designed to cover all the top Dublin City sights and attractions with 25 conveniently located stops to hop on and off from. Stay on board and enjoy live or recorded commentary in 8 languages or hop off at every stop you want to explore, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Killarney, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Dublin To Killarney Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Killarney. (Duration approx 3 hrs 10 mins) Upon your arrival at Killarney train station, you will make your way to the hotel. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Killarney, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Killarney City Tour Ring of Kerry Tour: An essential part of any visit to the Emerald Isle is a tour of the world-famous Ring of Kerry. Take our intimate tour on a 180 km circuit of the county. Our experienced guides will be delighted to show you the unrivalled beauty County Kerry has to offer. Whether you’re looking for an insight into Irish history, a sample of the famous local or simply a great photo opportunity, the Ring of Kerry Tour is exactly what you require., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Galway, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Killarney To Galway Transfers: Make your way to the next destination Galway by bus. Welcome to Galway! Upon your arrival at Galway, check in to the hotel., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Galway, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Galway Full Day Tour Cliffs of Moher & Burren Day Tour: Travel along the Wild Atlantic way to the Cliffs of Moher Visitor Centre and enjoy the natural beauty of the Burren region along the way. Along this route to the Cliffs you will stop at Dunguaire Castle and the Burren region. The Cliffs of Moher is Ireland's top tourist attraction and is not to be missed. Our experienced driver / guide will guide you along the way and give you valuable knowledge of the area., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Dublin, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Galway To Dublin Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Dublin. (Duration approx 2 hrs 30 mins) Welcome to Dublin! Upon your arrival at Dublin train station, you will make your way to the hotel. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Belfast, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Dublin To Belfast Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Belfast. (Duration approx 2 hrs 10 mins) Welcome to Belfast! Upon your arrival at Belfast train station, you will make your way to the hotel. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 9 - Belfast, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Belfast Tour Giant’s Causeway, Glens of Antrim and Dark Hedges Tour: Visit what is often referred to as 'the eighth wonder of the world' on our Giants Causeway and Antrim Coast coach tour. The highlight of the tour is the Giants Causeway, Ireland's only World Heritage site. Here, you can spend some time climbing over the ancient stones, snapping some photographs, as well as enjoying the myths and legends that surround this world-famous attraction. Another photo opportunity is included with a visit to Dunluce Castle. The castle is located on the edge of the north Atlantic coast and is a popular location for the filming of the series the Game of Thrones., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 10 - Belfast, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Belfast Transfers: From Belfast hotel to the Airport in private transfer. Special Notes: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 205550.0. Hotels envisaged include: \xa0\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nSTANDARD CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nDublin\n\n\nBelvedere Hotel / Cassidys Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nKillarney\n\n\nHotel Killarney / Killeen House Hotel & Rozzers Restaurant or similar\n\n\n\n\nGalway\n\n\nEyre Square Hotel / Victoria or similar\n\n\n\n\nBelfast\n\n\nIbis Belfast City Centre or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0, \n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nDublin\n\n\nAshling Hotel Dublin / Jurys Inn Parnell Street / The Address Connolly / Hilton Garden Inn Dublin Custom House or similar\n\n\n\n\nKillarney\n\n\nHotel International / Randles Hotel / Dromhall / Arbutus Hotel Killarney / Castlerosse Park Resort or similar\n\n\n\n\nGalway\n\n\nJurys Inn Hotel / Harbour Hotel / The Galmont Hotel & Spa or similar\n\n\n\n\nBelfast\n\n\nJurys Inn Hotel / Holiday Inn Belfast City Centre / Malmaison Belfast / Europa Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation: 3 Nights’ accommodation in Dublin based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Killarney based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Galway based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Belfast based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis] Arrival Airport Transfer from Dublin Airport to Dublin Hotel Departure Airport transfer from Belfast Hotel to Belfast Airport Second Class Train: Dublin - Killarney // Galway – Dublin // Dublin - Belfast Bus Ticket: Killarney – Galway Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) Dublin Hop On Hop Off (24 hours) Ring of Kerry - Seat in Coach Basis Cliffs of Moher & Burren Tour - Seat in Coach Basis Giant’s Causeway, Glens of Antrim and Dark Hedges Tour - Seat in Coach Basis Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Notes: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability Terms And Conditions: Travel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 September 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Best Of Ireland' package is a 10-day tour covering the iconic cities of Dublin, Belfast, Galway, and Killarney. Throughout this immersive journey, participants will experience key highlights such as scenic drives along the breathtaking Ring of Kerry, marveling at the majestic Cliffs of Moher, and exploring historic landmarks like Trinity College in Dublin and the Titanic Belfast exhibition. The itinerary also includes guided city tours, visits to ancient castles, and 