e price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together.\nThe above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\nMaximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room.\nMidnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\nWIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed.\xa0\n(Supplement charges may apply for such services)\nStandard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs.\nMost hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned.\nAt this point of time no services\xa0\n\n\xa0\nTerms and Conditions:\n\nTravel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 September 2026\nBlack out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nMaximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\nSurcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking.\nTo proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour.\nShould the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014540/BArcelona_SRP.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014540/itinerary/Madrid2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014540/itinerary/MadridRoyalPalace.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014540/itinerary/seville1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014540/itinerary/Seville.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014540/itinerary/Valencia2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014540/itinerary/Valencia.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014540/itinerary/Barcelona.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014540/itinerary/BarcelonaSpain.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014540/itinerary/BarcelonaCIty.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015517', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015517', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Georgia Van Tour - Tbilisi, Batumi & Gudauri', 'days': 8, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Tbilisi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Tbilisi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Tbilisi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Tbilisi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Tbilisi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Batumi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Gudauri', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Tbilisi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['Travel across Georgia on an exclusive & personalized itinerary designed for individuals, families and small groups. On VAN TOURS, your journeys are planned exclusively by private vans and hosted by English speaking drivers & guides. Travel from Tbilisi; covering the most scenic sights of Georgia. Visit Tbilisi; walk through the old town. Don’t miss the snowcapped Caucasian mountains and the Gaudari Ski Resort. Experience the charms of Georgia as you visit the oldest winery regions and visit Kazbegi. Visit old towns and drive past the high passes at Gaudari. Don’t miss the walk over the Dashbashi Canyon as you visit Diamond Bridge. Experience the Las Vegas of the Black Sea in Batumi - The Central Asian Casino City. Our specially designed VAN TOURS will ensure comfort and convenience throughout your travel. TOUR HIGHLIGHTS: Visit TBILISI & CHRONOCILES OF GEORGIA; walk through the old town of Tbilisi and take a cable car to get a beautiful view of the city from the Narikala fortress. Visit Mtskheta, the ancient capital and enclaved city. Visit the Chronicles of Georgia. Visit DASHBASHI CANYON & DIAMOND BRIDGE. Visit BOJORMI, the city of hot springs. Visit KAZBEGI & GAUDARI. Drive past the countryside and stop by the Annauari fortress, visit Gaudari Ski Resort, Friendship Monument and Holy Trinity Church in Kazbegi. Visit SIGHNAGHI & KAKHETI, the old town of Sighnaghi & one of the oldest wines making regions of the world. Visit Batumi: Explore Piazza | St. Nicholas Church | Seaside Park | Miracle Park | Ali and Nino Statue | Batumi Boulevard | Alphabet Tower'], 'pdfName': 'PKG013001_0_20241007131222.pdf', 'price': 84559, 'packageSummary': "The 'Georgia Van Tour - Tbilisi, Batumi & Gudauri' package is an 8-day exclusive and personalized tour covering Tbilisi, Gudauri, and Batumi. Hosted by English-speaking drivers and guides in private vans, this scenic journey features a walking tour of Tbilisi's old town, a cable car ride to the Narikala fortress, and visits to the ancient capital of Mtskheta and the Chronicles of Georgia. Travelers will also experience the stunning Dashbashi Canyon and its Diamond Bridge, the hot springs of Borjomi, the snowcapped Caucasian mountains at Gudauri Ski Resort, and the Holy Trinity Church in Kazbegi. The itinerary is completed with a visit to the historic winemaking region of Kakheti and Sighnaghi, alongside an exploration of Batumi's vibrant sights, including the Piazza, Seaside Park, Alphabet Tower, 