Tax or Tourism Tax Visa charges for NRI passengers (If applicable) Cruise Gratuity (applicable for cruise holidays) Cost of deviation will be advised on confirmation of the deviation date in case you want to deviate from the group departure dates mentioned in the brochure. The tour cost does not include POE charges, porterage, or passport charges. Cost of Basic Travel Quota equivalent to USD 10,000. Govt Taxes & Service taxes as applicable. The cost of airfare included in the above tour cost is based on the fare structure as of 1st August 2025. Any further increase in the airfare due to an increase in the fuel price, change in Government regulations, taxes, etc., charged by the airline will have to be borne by the passengers and the company will not be held responsible for the same. Any increase in the rate of exchange leads to an increase in surface transportation and land arrangements which may come into effect prior to departure. The tour price is subject to increase without notice if this rate of exchange changes substantially prior to departure. Any expenses of personal nature such as laundry, wines, mineral water, food and drink are not in the regular menus provided by us. Tips for guides, hotel waiters, drivers, etc. Meals other than what is mentioned in the itinerary. Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees and local guides availed of by the passengers other than those included in your itinerary. Product Terms and Conditions: Test. Highlights of the package: Travel across Georgia on an exclusive & personalized itinerary designed for individuals, families and small groups. On VAN TOURS, your journeys are planned exclusively by private vans and hosted by English speaking drivers & guides. Travel from Tbilisi; covering the most scenic sights of Georgia. Visit Tbilisi; walk through the old town. Don’t miss the snowcapped Caucasian mountains and the Gaudari Ski Resort. Experience the charms of Georgia as you visit the oldest winery regions and visit Kazbegi. Visit old towns and drive past the high passes at Gaudari. Don’t miss the walk over the Dashbashi Canyon as you visit Diamond Bridge. Experience the Las Vegas of the Black Sea in Batumi - The Central Asian Casino City. Our specially designed VAN TOURS will ensure comfort and convenience throughout your travel. TOUR HIGHLIGHTS: Visit TBILISI & CHRONOCILES OF GEORGIA; walk through the old town of Tbilisi and take a cable car to get a beautiful view of the city from the Narikala fortress. Visit Mtskheta, the ancient capital and enclaved city. Visit the Chronicles of Georgia. Visit DASHBASHI CANYON & DIAMOND BRIDGE. Visit BOJORMI, the city of hot springs. Visit KAZBEGI & GAUDARI. Drive past the countryside and stop by the Annauari fortress, visit Gaudari Ski Resort, Friendship Monument and Holy Trinity Church in Kazbegi. Visit SIGHNAGHI & KAKHETI, the old town of Sighnaghi & one of the oldest wines making regions of the world. Visit Batumi: Explore Piazza | St. Nicholas Church | Seaside Park | Miracle Park | Ali and Nino Statue | Batumi Boulevard | Alphabet Tower.", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 