tyCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Nagpur', 'cityCode': 'NAG', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Istanbul With Cappadocia - SIC Tour' package is a 5-day tour covering the historic city of Istanbul and the mesmerizing landscapes of Cappadocia. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the Hagia Sophia, the Blue Mosque, and the Goreme Open Air Museum. Participants will enjoy guided sightseeing tours, a scenic Bosphorus cruise, and the unforgettable experience of a hot air balloon ride over Cappadocia's famous fairy chimneys.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nArrive Istanbul\n\xa0\nTransfers: Upon arrival you will be met the representative & transferred to the hotel on private basis.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\n\xa0\nOptional Activity: Bosphorus Dinner Cruise\nEnjoy an enchanting evening on the Bosphorus Strait with a leisurely dinner cruise that showcases Istanbuls beauty by night. Sail between Europe and Asia as you pass iconic landmarks such as the Bosphorus Bridge, Dolmabahçe Palace, and the illuminated waterfront mansions. The experience is complemented by a delicious Turkish dinner and live entertainment, often including traditional music and folk dance performances, making it a memorable blend of scenic views, culture, and cuisine. [The supplement cost for this activity will be approx. USD 80 per adult & USD 55 for children below 6 years]', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Four Sides Lion Taksim / Erboy / Konak Taksim (Value) / The Elysium Taksim / Doubletree Hilton Piyalepasa or similar (Premium) in Istanbul'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nFull-Day Guided Tour Of Istanbul On Shared Basis (Sic)\n\xa0\nIstanbul City Tour : Between 07:30 and 09:00 hrs, you will be picked up from your hotel (pickup time subject to hotel location) for a full day guided city tour. The tour includes visits to the Hagia Sophia Mosque (entrance not included), the pride of Byzantine architecture the Byzantine Hippodrome, once the venue for ancient chariot races and the Blue Mosque, renowned for its exquisite blue Iznik tiles. You will also visit the Topkapi Palace (entrance not included), the former residence of the Ottoman Sultans, followed by time at the Grand Bazaar, Turkeys largest covered market with over 4,000 shops.\n\xa0\nLunch will be served at a local restaurant, after which you will be transferred back to your hotel.\n\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Notes:\xa0\n\nSightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\nEntrance to the Hagia Sophia Mosque and Topkapi Palace is available at an additional supplement.\n\n\xa0 \xa0 \xa0 \xa0\nSupplement costs:\n\nHagia Sophia: USD 35 - 40 Per adult (Under 8 years Free)\xa0 \xa0\nTopkapi Palace USD 65 Per adult (Under 6 years Free)\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Local Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Four Sides Lion Taksim / Erboy / Konak Taksim (Value) / The Elysium Taksim / Doubletree Hilton Piyalepasa or similar (Premium) in Istanbul'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nIstanbul To Cappadocia\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nToday you will have a private transfer from the hotel to the Airport for onward flight\nUpon arrival at Cappadocia, there will be a private transfer from the airport to the Hotel.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nPlease note that the domestic flight from Istanbul to Cappadocia is not included in the tour cost and will be charged as an additional supplement.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Dedeli Cave / Sunak Cave (Value) / Hanedan Cave Suites / Acer Cave or similar (Premium) in Cappadocia\xa0'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nExplore Cappadocia\xa0\n\xa0\nOptional Activity: Hot Air Balloon\n\xa0\nIf a hot air balloon ride is on your bucket list, Cappadocia offers one of the most iconic experiences in the world. Drift gently at sunrise above a surreal, lunar like landscape of volcanic rock formations, fairy chimneys, and honeycombed valleys, as dozens of vibrantly colored balloons rise alongside you. This unforgettable experience offers breathtaking panoramic views and spectacular photo opportunities. [The supplement cost for this activity will be upon On Request Basis]\n\xa0\nPlease Note:\xa0 Children below 6 years of age or under 120 cm in height are not permitted to participate in the hot air balloon ride.\n\xa0\nCappadocia Sightseeing: After breakfast, between 09:00 and 10:00 hrs, you will be picked up from your hotel to begin a full day tour of Cappadocia. The first stop is Devrent Valley (Imagination Valley), known for its spectacular fairy chimneys and uniquely shaped rock formations set amidst beautiful landscape.You will then visit Pasabag (Monks Valley), famous for its remarkable double and triple headed rock formations, once used as hermit dwellings by monks. Lunch will be served in Avanos, a town renowned for its traditional pottery craftsmanship and located along the Red River.\n\xa0\nAfter lunch, continue to the Goreme Open Air Museum, the heart of Cappadocia, celebrated for its rock cut churches adorned with wall paintings dating back to the 10th century, depicting scenes from the life of Jesus and early Christian monastic life.The tour concludes with a photo stop at Uchisar Castle, a natural rock citadel and one of the largest fairy chimney formations in the region, offering panoramic views of Cappadocia.\n\xa0\nSpecial Notes:\xa0\n\nSightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Local Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Dedeli Cave / Sunak Cave (Value) / Hanedan Cave Suites / Acer Cave or similar (Premium) in Cappadocia\xa0'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nDepart Cappadocia\n\xa0\nTransfers: From Cappadocia hotel to Kayseri Airport in private transfer.\n\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nPlease note that the domestic flight from Cappadocia to Istanbul is not included in the tour cost and will be charged as an additional supplement.\xa0\n\n\xa0\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels', '\n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY (4* HOTELS OR SIMILAR)\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\n\n\nFour Sides Lion Taksim / Erboy Hotel/ Konak Taksim\xa0or similar\n\n\nDedeli Cave / Sunak Cave Hotel\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n', ' \n\n\n\n\nPREMIUM CATEGORY (5* HOTELS OR SIMILAR)\n\n \n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n \n\n\nThe Elysium Taksim / Doubletree Hilton Piyalepasa Hotel or similar\n\n\nHanedan Cave Suites /\n Acer Cave Hotel or similar\n\n \n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'0': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '2': ' \n\n\n\n\nPREMIUM CATEGORY (5* HOTELS OR SIMILAR)\n\n \n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n \n\n\nThe Elysium Taksim / Doubletree Hilton Piyalepasa Hotel or similar\n\n\nHanedan Cave Suites /\n Acer Cave Hotel or similar\n\n \n\n', '1': '\n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY (4* HOTELS OR SIMILAR)\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\n\n\nFour Sides Lion Taksim / Erboy Hotel/ Konak Taksim\xa0or similar\n\n\nDedeli Cave / Sunak Cave Hotel\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'TR', 'countryName': 'Turkey', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Value', 'Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Value', 'price': 63500.0, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY (4* HOTELS OR SIMILAR)\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\n\n\nFour Sides Lion Taksim / Erboy Hotel/ Konak Taksim\xa0or similar\n\n\nDedeli Cave / Sunak Cave Hotel\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n']}, {'category': 'Premium', 'price': 73900.0, 'hotels': [' \n\n\n\n\nPREMIUM CATEGORY (5* HOTELS OR SIMILAR)\n\n \n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n \n\n\nThe Elysium Taksim / Doubletree Hilton Piyalepasa Hotel or similar\n\n\nHanedan Cave Suites /\n Acer Cave Hotel or similar\n\n \n\n']}], 'meals': ['\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n2 Local Lunches as a part of the itinerary\n', '\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\xa0\n2 Local Lunches as a part of the sightseeing tour\n', 'Breakfast Included'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['\nPrivate Airport Transfer from Istanbul Airport to Hotel\nPrivate transfer from Istanbul hotel to Istanbul Airprort\nPrivate Airport Transfer from Kayseri Airport to Cappadocia Hotel\nPrivate Airport transfer from Cappadocia Hotel to Kayseri Airport\n', 'As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n\nFull Day Guided Tour of Istanbul on sharing basis (SIC)\nCappadocia Sightseeing Tour on sharing basis (SIC)\xa0\n', 'Sightseeing as per itinerary'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': 'Accommodation:\n\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Istanbul based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Cappadocia based on the hotel category selected or similar\n\n\xa0\nMeals:\n\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n2 Local Lunches as a part of the itinerary\n\n\xa0\nTransportation:\xa0\xa0\n\nPrivate Airport Transfer from Istanbul Airport to Hotel\nPrivate transfer from Istanbul hotel to Istanbul Airprort\nPrivate Airport Transfer from Kayseri Airport to Cappadocia Hotel\nPrivate Airport transfer from Cappadocia Hotel to Kayseri Airport\n\n\xa0\nSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n\nFull Day Guided Tour of Istanbul on sharing basis (SIC)\nCappadocia Sightseeing Tour on sharing basis (SIC)\xa0\n\n\xa0\nInsurance:\n\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of US$ 10 per person per day is not included\xa0\nCity taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nCost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.\n\n\xa0\nBlackout Dates:\n\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHOLIDAY\n\n\nDATE\n\n\n\n\nNational Sovereignty and Children’s Day\n\n\n23-04-2026\n\n\n\n\nLabor and Solidarity Day\n\n\n01-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nCommemoration of Atatürk, Youth and Sports Day\n\n\n19-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nEid al-Adha 1st day\n\n\n27-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nEid al-Adha 2nd day\n\n\n28-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nEid al-Adha 3rd day\n\n\n29-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nEid al-Adha last day\n\n\n30-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nDemocracy and National Unity Day\n\n\n15-07-2026\n\n\n\n\nVictory Day\n\n\n30-08-2026\n\n\n\n\nRepublic Day\n\n\n29-10-2026\n\n\n\n', 'termsAndConditions': '\xa0\nIMPORTANT NOTES:\n\nThe above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together.\nThe above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\nMaximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room.\nMidnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\nWIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed.\xa0\n(Supplement charges may apply for such services)\nStandard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs.\nMost hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned.\nAt this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability\n\n\xa0\nTERMS AND CONDITIONS:\n\nTravel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 September 2026\nBlack out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nMaximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\nSurcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking.\nTo proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour.\nShould the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014664/UchisarCastle_SRP.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014664/itinerary/Istanbul753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014664/itinerary/GrandBazar.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014664/itinerary/Cappadocia7532.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014664/itinerary/Cappadocia7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014664/itinerary/Cappodocia753.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG013835', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG013835', 'availableMonths': ['october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Greece Getaway (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)    ', 'days': 7, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Athens', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Athens', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Mykonos', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Mykonos', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Santorini', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Santorini', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Santorini', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['Fast Ferry & Upgrade to Pvt Transfers'], 'pdfName': 'PKG013835_0_20260609182724.pdf', 'price': 139734, 'packageSummary': "The 'Greece Getaway (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)' package is a 7-day tour covering the beautiful destinations of Santorini, Mykonos, and Athens. Throughout this exciting Mediterranean journey, participants will enjoy key highlights such as scenic fast ferry rides between the islands and a premium upgrade to private transfers for seamless travel. This special holiday itinerary offers the perfect blend of leisure and exploration, allowing travelers to experience the iconic whitewashed architecture, stunning sunsets, and rich ancient history of Greece in comfort and style.", 'images': ['Athens753.bmp', 'Olympian_Zeus.png', '82514_Mykonos_753.jpg', '387390_Mykonos_Greece_753.jpg', 'Santhorini.bmp', '32609212_Santorini_Greece_753.jpg', 'Santorini_street.jpeg'], 'minimumPrice': 139734, 'thumbnailImage': 'SRP_Santorini.jpeg', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Durga Puja Special'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG013835 is named 'Greece Getaway (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)    ' and spans 7 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Athens, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Athens Transfers: Upon arrival you will be met the representative and escorted to the hotel on private basis. Special Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Athens, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Half Day Guided Tour Of Athens On Shared Basis (Sic) Athens Sightseeing - The Acropolis & Acropolis Museum: Step into history on a half day guided tour of Athens. The morning begins at the Panathenaic Stadium, birthplace of the modern Olympic Games, then past the Temple of Olympian Zeus and the elegant Athens Trilogy - University, Academy, and National Library. Ascend to the legendary Acropolis to explore the Parthenon, Erechtheion, and Temple of Athena Nike. End your morning at the Acropolis Museum, where ancient treasures are brought to life. Special Note: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick up for the same will be from selected central points., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Mykonos, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Athens to Mykonos and evening walking tour Transfers: 1. Today you will have a private transfer from the hotel to the Port for the ferry to Mykonos. 2. Upon arrival at Mykonos there will be a shared transfer from the port to the Hotel. Guided walking tour of Mykonos: In the evening, enjoy a guided walking tour of Mykonos Chora, discovering hidden alleys, historic windmills, Little Venice, and Panagia Paraportiani Church., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Mykonos, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day Free at Leisure Mykonos Sightseeing (Optional). Spend the day enjoying the cosmopolitan charm of Mykonos. Relax on its golden beaches, explore boutiques., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Santorini, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Mykonos to Santorini Transfers: Today you will have a shared transfer from the hotel to the Port for the ferry to Santorini. Upon arrival at Santorini there will be a shared transfer from the port to the Hotel. Special Note: The check in at the hotel will be as per the standard hotel time. Post check in the rest of the day will be free at leisure., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Santorini, Meals: Breakfast, Description: VOLCANIC ADVENTURE & SUNSET IN OIA Transfers: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick-up for the same will be from selected central points Volcanic Adventure & Sunset in Oia: Today Embark on a guided tour to Santorinis volcano and hot springs, then sail to Thirassia island for a glimpse into traditional island life. Conclude with a magical sunset in Oia. Cruise around the volcanic islands of Santorini's Caldera on a unique Greek traditional boat. First, sail to Nea Kameni lava islet. Guided walking tour through an ascending path to reach its top where the crater of the still active volcano lies. Enjoy incredible sights of Santorini from a different angle. Return to the boat and continue to the second lava islet called Palea Kameni, also known as the Hot Springs. Jump off the boat and dive into green sulfur thermal waters. Next is the traditional island of Thirassia where you will enjoy some free time. You can relax at the picturesque small port of Thirassia, have lunch (on your own) or visit the village of Manolas, accessed by winding stairs, either by walking or riding a donkey., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Santorini, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Santorini Transfers: From Santorini hotel to the Airport in private transfer. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 139734.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nStandard Category (3* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nMykonos\n\n\nSantorini\n\n\n\n\nCentral Hotel or similar\n\n\nErato Hotel or similar\n\n\nMakris Beach Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nStandard Category (4* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nMykonos\n\n\nSantorini\n\n\n\n\nAthens Avenue or similar\n\n\nAeolos Resort Mykonos or similar\n\n\nDaedalus Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nStandard Category (5* Hotels Or Similar)\xa0\n\n\n\n\nAthens\n\n\nMykonos\n\n\nSantorini\n\n\n\n\nWyndham Grand Athens or similar\n\n\nRoyal Myconian or similar\n\n\nApeiron Blue Santorini or similar\n\n\n\n. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ accommodation in Athens based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Mykonos based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Santorini based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis] Private Airport Transfer from Athens Airport to Hotel Private transfer from Athens hotel to Port for the ferry to Mykonos Shared transport from Mykonos Port to the hotel and back to port Shared transport from Santorini port to hotel Private Airport transfer from Santorini Hotel to Airport Ferry Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed] Normal Ferry ticket - economy class from Athens to Mykonos Speed Ferry ticket - from Mykonos to Santorini Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) Half day City tour of Athens with new Acropolis Museum (organized) on sharing basis tour coach. Walking tour in Mykonos Town Volcanic Islands Cruise on sharing basis with transportation from/to meeting point - clients need to go by themselves to the pickup point for the tour Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees - To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: IMPORTANT NOTES: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost. Please note that recently, local authorities have let us know that an increase to the Environmental fee will apply to all overnight stays in your travel destination, Greece, as of 1st of January 2025 onwards. As a result, Hotel may collect this tax from you. TERMS AND CONDITIONS: Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. TCS & GST would be levied as applicable The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs , conventions , and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: Fast Ferry & Upgrade to Pvt Transfers.", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryC