a0(Premium) or similar in Athens'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nHalf Day Guided Tour Of Athens On Shared Basis (Sic)\nAthens Sightseeing - The Acropolis & Acropolis Museum: Step into history on a half day guided tour of Athens. The morning begins at the Panathenaic Stadium, birthplace of the modern Olympic Games, then past the Temple of Olympian Zeus and the elegant Athens Trilogy - University, Academy, and National Library. Ascend to the legendary Acropolis to explore the Parthenon, Erechtheion, and Temple of Athena Nike. End your morning at the Acropolis Museum, where ancient treasures are brought to life.\nSpecial Note: The sightseeing will be on a shared basis and the pick up for the same will be from selected central points.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Central (Standard) / Hotel Athens Avenue (Value) / Hotel\xa0Wyndham Grand Athens\xa0\xa0(Premium) or similar in Athens'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nAthens to Mykonos and evening walking tour\nTransfers:\n\xa0\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Today you will have a private transfer from the hotel to the Port for the ferry to Mykonos.\n2.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Upon arrival at Mykonos there will be a shared transfer from the port to the Hotel.\nGuided walking tour of Mykonos: In the evening, enjoy a guided walking tour of Mykonos Chora, discovering hidden alleys, historic windmills, Little Venice, and Panagia Paraportiani Church.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Erato (Standard) / Hotel\xa0Aeolos Resort Mykonos\xa0(Value) / Hotel\xa0Royal Myconian\xa0(Premium) or similar in Mykonos'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nDay Free at Leisure\nMykonos Sightseeing (Optional). Spend the day enjoying the cosmopolitan charm of Mykonos. Relax on its golden beaches, explore boutiques.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Erato (Standard) / Hotel\xa0Aeolos Resort Mykonos\xa0(Value) / Hotel\xa0Royal Myconian\xa0(Premium) or similar in Mykonos'}, {'day': 5, 