e by credit card or cash; the amount varies by hotel and is returned at checkout. Guests should avoid using debit cards since the amount is charged instantly and may take 2–3 weeks to refund. Any additional hotel services (such as minibar, room service, etc.) may be deducted from this deposit, and Company is not responsible for such transactions, as these are directly between the hotel and the guest.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015319/AdobeStock_172431209_ReuniounIsland.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015319/itinerary/ReuniounIsland.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015319/itinerary/SeaKAYAKING.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015319/itinerary/StGilles.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015319/itinerary/PITONDELAFOURNAISE.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014521', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014521', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Passionate Paris With Disney', 'days': 6, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Disneyland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014521_0_20260916125950.pdf', 'price': 141395, 'packageSummary': "The 'Passionate Paris With Disney' package is a 6-day tour covering the romantic city of Paris and the magical resort of Disneyland. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the Eiffel Tower, the Louvre Museum, and the Arc de Triomphe, alongside a scenic cruise along the River Seine. Participants will enjoy guided sightseeing tours of the French capital and spend thrilling days experiencing the world-class rides, spectacular parades, and magical attractions at Disneyland Paris.", 'images': ['Paris_CITY_753.jpg', 'Eiffeltowerwithseinecruise_753.jpeg', 'VersaillesPalace_new_753.jpg', 'DisneylandParis.jpg', 'Disneylandparis2.jpg', '29117_Paris_View_France_753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 141395, 'thumbnailImage': 'Disneyland_4.jpeg', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Youth Special', 'Adventure'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Most Booked', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014521 is named 'Passionate Paris With Disney' and spans 6 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Paris, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Paris Transfers: On arrival in Paris, you will have a private transfer from Airport to the hotel. Special Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15:00 hrs. or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Paris City Tour + River Seine Cruise + Eiffel Tower Tour Paris City Tour: Later discover Paris's most famous tourist sites and monuments on one unique tour. This tour features a visit to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower with breathtaking views of the capital, a panoramic city tour by coach, plus an hour-long boat trip along the River Seine. This comprehensive tour is the ideal way to discover Paris for the first time. Special Note: Thanks to your priority access, you can skip the line and speed up by elevator to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower, Paris's most unmissable monument., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Paris Day At Leisure (Optional Activities) Paris City Pass (Option 1): With the Paris City Pass, discover the best of Paris with just one ticket! Visit world-renowned landmarks like the Palace of Versailles, the iconic Louvre, and the Arc de Triomphe's breathtaking viewing platform. Enjoy the perks of the Paris Museum Pass, offering free entry to over 50 museums and monuments across the city and its surroundings, giving you the perfect chance to immerse yourself in French culture. McArthurGlen Designer Outlet (Option 2): Visit the McArthurGlen Designer Outlet at Giverny Paris (*approx 60 - 75 mins away from Paris) McArthurGlen Designer Outlet Paris-Giverny is a new designer outlet being constructed by developer and manager of multiple European designer outlets, McArthurGlen. To be located near Monet’s Giverny, the new shopping centre is claimed to be the first and the only luxury designer outlet in the west of Paris. Planning to Visit? Click the link below to conveniently book your shuttle bus tickets and enjoy exciting deals at the nearest outlet: https://mgbooking.tripodeck.com/home?orderCustId=6977233, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Disneyland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Paris To Disneyland Transfers: You will have a private transfer to Disneyland. Welcome to Disneyland Paris! Get to know this destination as it's much more than a Theme Park. The Disney magic comes to life at Disneyland Park, Walt Disney Studios Park, Disney Village and your eight magical themed hotels. Meet your favourite Disney Characters, be amazed by colourful parades and breathtaking shows; the perfect choice for a family break! (With 2 Days 2 Park Tickets), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Explore Disneyland Explore Disneyland: Discover a world of mayhem, summon your Spider-Sense and prepare for battle, at the Walt Disney Studios Park! (With 2 Days 2 Park Tickets), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Transfers: From Paris hotel to the Airport in Private transfer. Special Note: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 141395.0. Hotels envisaged include: \xa0Hotels Envisaged Or Similar :\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCITY NAME\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nHotel Opera Lafayette / Color Design Hotel / Hôtel Champerret-Elysées / Londres Et New York Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nDisneyland\n\n\nCampanile Val de France (Ex Kyriad Disneyland) / Aparthotel Adagio Marne La Vallee Val D'europe or similar (3*) near Disneyland (Outside) or similar\n\n\n\n, Hotels Envisaged Or Similar :\n\n\n\n\nCITY NAME\n\n4*\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nMercure Paris Opéra Faubourg Montmartre / Novotel Paris Center Eiffel Tower / Novotel Paris Center Gare Montparnasse / Mercure Paris Bercy Bibliotheque Hotel / Hotel Mademoiselle or similar\n\n\n\n\nDisneyland\n\nNovotel Marne La Vallée Collégien / Dream Castle Paris / Grand Magic Hotel or similar (4*) near Disneyland (Outside) or similar\n\n\n. Meals include: Daily breakfast except day 1. Inclusions: Accommodation: 3 Nights’ accommodation in Paris based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation near Disneyland based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis] Arrival Airport transfer from Paris Airport to Paris Hotel Departure Airport transfer from Disneyland hotel to Paris Airport Paris Hotel to Disneyland Hotel Transfer on Private basis (Internal Transfer) Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) Interactive City Tour, Seine Cruise and Eiffel Tower 2nd Floor with Priority Access (SIC). Disneyland: 2 Day 2 Parks Disneyland - Entrance Ticket Only (Without Transfers) Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Note: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability Terms and Conditions: Travel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 September 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Kannur', 'cityCode': 'CNN', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Passionate Paris With Disney' package is a 6-day tour covering the romantic city of Paris and the magical resort of Disneyland. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the Eiffel Tower, the Louvre Museum, and the Arc de Triomphe, alongside a scenic cruise along the River Seine. Participants will enjoy guided sightseeing tours of the French capital and spend thrilling days experiencing the world-class rides, spectacular parades, and magical attractions at Disneyland Paris.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Paris\nTransfers: On arrival in Paris, you will have a private transfer from Airport to the hotel.\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15:00 hrs. or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Opera Lafayette (Standard) / Mercure Paris Opera Faubourg Montmartre (Value) or similar in Paris'}, {'day': 2, 'description': "\xa0\nParis City Tour + River Seine Cruise + Eiffel Tower Tour\n\xa0\nParis City Tour: Later discover Paris's most famous tourist sites and monuments on one unique tour. This tour features a visit to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower with breathtaking views of the capital, a panoramic city tour by coach, plus an hour-long boat trip along the River Seine. This comprehensive tour is the ideal way to discover Paris for the first time.\xa0\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Thanks to your priority access, you can skip the line and speed up by elevator to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower, Paris's most unmissable monument.\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Opera Lafayette (Standard) / Mercure Paris Opera Faubourg Montmartre (Value) or similar in Paris'}, {'day': 3, 'description': "\xa0\nParis Day At Leisure (Optional Activities)\n\xa0\nParis City Pass (Option 1): With the Paris City Pass, discover the best of Paris with just one ticket! Visit world-renowned landmarks like the Palace of Versailles, the iconic Louvre, and the Arc de Triomphe's breathtaking viewing platform. Enjoy the perks of the Paris Museum Pass, offering free entry to over 50 museums and monuments across the city and its surroundings, giving you the perfect chance to immerse yourself in French culture.\n\xa0\nMcArthurGlen Designer Outlet (Option 2): Visit the McArthurGlen Designer Outlet at Giverny Paris (*approx 60 - 75 mins away from Paris) McArthurGlen Designer Outlet Paris-Giverny is a new designer outlet being constructed by developer and manager of multiple European designer outlets, McArthurGlen.\xa0 To be located near Monet’s Giverny, the new shopping centre is claimed to be the first and the only luxury designer outlet in the west of Paris.\n\xa0\nPlanning to Visit?\nClick the link below to conveniently book your shuttle bus tickets and enjoy exciting deals at the nearest outlet: https://mgbooking.tripodeck.com/home?orderCustId=6977233", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Opera Lafayette (Standard) / Mercure Paris Opera Faubourg Montmartre (Value) or similar in Paris'}, {'day': 4, 'description': "\xa0\nParis To Disneyland\n\xa0\nTransfers: You will have a private transfer to Disneyland.\xa0\n\xa0\nWelcome to Disneyland Paris! Get to know this destination as it's much more than a Theme Park. The Disney magic comes to life at Disneyland Park, Walt Disney Studios Park, Disney Village and your eight magical themed hotels. Meet your favourite Disney Characters, be amazed by colourful parades and breathtaking shows; the perfect choice for a family break! (With 2 Days 2 Park Tickets)\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Campanile Val de France (Ex Kyriad Disneyland) (Standard) / Novotel Marne La Vallée Collegien (Value) or similar near Disneyland'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nExplore Disneyland\n\xa0\nExplore Disneyland: Discover a world of mayhem, summon your Spider-Sense and prepare for battle, at the Walt Disney Studios Park! (With 2 Days 2 Park Tickets)', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Campanile Val de France (Ex Kyriad Disneyland) (Standard) / Novotel Marne La Vallée Collegien (Value) or similar near Disneyland'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart \n\xa0\nTransfers: From Paris hotel to the Airport in Private transfer. \n\xa0\nSpecial Note: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight.\n\xa0\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ["\xa0Hotels Envisaged Or Similar :\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCITY NAME\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nHotel Opera Lafayette / Color Design Hotel / Hôtel Champerret-Elysées / Londres Et New York Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nDisneyland\n\n\nCampanile Val de France (Ex Kyriad Disneyland) / Aparthotel Adagio Marne La Vallee Val D'europe or similar (3*) near Disneyland (Outside) or similar\n\n\n\n", 'Hotels Envisaged Or Similar :\n\n\n\n\nCITY NAME\n\n4*\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nMercure Paris Opéra Faubourg Montmartre / Novotel Paris Center Eiffel Tower / Novotel Paris Center Gare Montparnasse / Mercure Paris Bercy Bibliotheque Hotel / Hotel Mademoiselle or similar\n\n\n\n\nDisneyland\n\nNovotel Marne La Vallée Collégien / Dream Castle Paris / Grand Magic Hotel or similar (4*) near Disneyland (Outside) or similar\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'0': "\xa0Hotels Envisaged Or Similar :\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCITY NAME\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nHotel Opera Lafayette / Color Design Hotel / Hôtel Champerret-Elysées / Londres Et New York Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nDisneyland\n\n\nCampanile Val de France (Ex Kyriad Disneyland) / Aparthotel Adagio Marne La Vallee Val D'europe or similar (3*) near Disneyland (Outside) or similar\n\n\n\n", '1': 'Hotels Envisaged Or Similar :\n\n\n\n\nCITY NAME\n\n4*\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nMercure Paris Opéra Faubourg Montmartre / Novotel Paris Center Eiffel Tower / Novotel Paris Center Gare Montparnasse / Mercure Paris Bercy Bibliotheque Hotel / Hotel Mademoiselle or similar\n\n\n\n\nDisneyland\n\nNovotel Marne La Vallée Collégien / Dream Castle Paris / Grand Magic Hotel or similar (4*) near Disneyland (Outside) or similar\n\n\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'FR', 'countryName': 'France', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard', 'Value'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'price': 141400.0, 'hotels': ["\xa0Hotels Envisaged Or Similar :\xa0\n\n\n\n\nCITY NAME\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nHotel Opera Lafayette / Color Design Hotel / Hôtel Champerret-Elysées / Londres Et New York Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nDisneyland\n\n\nCampanile Val de France (Ex Kyriad Disneyland) / Aparthotel Adagio Marne La Vallee Val D'europe or similar (3*) near Disneyland (Outside) or similar\n\n\n\n"]}, {'category': 'Value', 'price': 165800.0, 'hotels': ['Hotels Envisaged Or Similar :\n\n\n\n\nCITY NAME\n\n4*\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nMercure Paris Opéra Faubourg Montmartre / Novotel Paris Center Eiffel Tower / Novotel Paris Center Gare Montparnasse / Mercure Paris Bercy Bibliotheque Hotel / Hotel Mademoiselle or similar\n\n\n\n\nDisneyland\n\nNovotel Marne La Vallée Collégien / Dream Castle Paris / Grand Magic Hotel or similar (4*) near Disneyland (Outside) or similar\n\n\n']}], 'meals'