\n\nRadisson\xa0Blu\xa0Resort\xa0&\xa0Spa,\xa0Hotel\xa0Ambasador\xa0or\xa0similar\n\n\n\n\nDubrovnik\n\n\nHotel\xa0President,\xa0hotel\xa0Sun\xa0Gardens,\xa0Hotel\xa0Hilton\xa0Imperial\xa0or\xa0similar\n\n\n\n']}], 'meals': ['\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n'], 'visa': ['As per itinerary'], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary', '\nPrivate Airport transfers (Arrival and Departure City)\nPrivate transfers (Pick Up and Drop Off) to Inter-city Bus Terminal\nInter-city travel by SCHEDULED Air-Conditioned shared coach service.\n'], 'sightseeing': ['Sightseeing:\xa0(For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n\nWalking tour of Zagreb with Funicular Ride in a group\nWalking tour of Zadar old town in a group from a central meeting point\nEntrance to Plitvice National Park\nWalking tour of Split in group\nBlue Lagoon and 3 island group tour from Split\nWalking tour of Dubrovnik in group (Dubrovnik Cable Car Roundtrip ticket)\nTrip to Bosnia & Herzegovina\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': '<p>Return Economy Class Airfare</p>', 'inclusions': 'Accommodation:\n\n2 Nights accommodation in Zagreb based on the hotel category selected or similar\n1 Night accommodation in Plitvice based on the hotel category selected or similar\n1 Night accommodation in Zadar based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights accommodation in Split based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights accommodation in Dubrovnik based on the hotel category selected or similar\n\nMeals:\n\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n\nTransportation: (Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis)\n\nPrivate Transfer from Zagreb Airport to Zagreb Hotel\nPrivate Transfer from Dubrovnik Hotel to Dubrovnik Airport\nBus Tickets: (Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed)\nBus ticket from Zagreb to Plitvice National park (Subject to availability until ticketed)\nBus Ticket from Plitvice to Zadar (Subject to availability until ticketed)\nBus ticket from Zadar to Split (Subject to availability until ticketed)\nBus Ticket from Split to Dubrovnik (Subject to availability until ticketed)\n\nSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n\nWalking tour of Zagreb with Funicular Ride in a group\nWalking tour of Zadar old town in a group from a central meeting point\nEntrance to Plitvice National Park\nWalking tour of Split in group\nBlue Lagoon and 3 island group tour from Split\nWalking tour of Dubrovnik in group (Dubrovnik Cable Car Roundtrip ticket)\nTrip to Bosnia & Herzegovina\n\nInsurance:\n\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': "\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional\xa0excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price.\nCity taxes / Resort Fees - To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary 'INCLUSIONS' head.\n\n\xa0", 'termsAndConditions': 'Note: Prices are Starting from Rates (please recheck costs with exact dates)\n\xa0\nIMPORTANT NOTES:\n\nThe above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together.\nThe above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\nMaximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room.\nMidnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\nWIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed.\n(Supplement charges may apply for such services)\nStandard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs.\nMost hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned.\nAt this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability\nTCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost.\n\n\xa0\nTERMS AND CONDITIONS:\n\nTravel Validity: 01 April 2025 – 31 October 2025\nBlack out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ.\nTCS & GST would be levied as applicable\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nMaximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\nSurcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking.\nTo proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour.\nShould the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/Zagreb_SRP.jpeg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/itinerary/Zagerb.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/itinerary/ZAGRAB-CROATIA.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/itinerary/Plitvice-Lakes-National-Park-1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/itinerary/ZADAR-c.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/itinerary/croatia-Split.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/itinerary/Diocletians.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/itinerary/Dubrovnik_(1).jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/itinerary/DUBROVNIK-para.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014796/itinerary/Croatia-Dubrovnik.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015158', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015158', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Norway Adventure', 'days': 8, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Lofoten Island', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Lofoten Island', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Lofoten Island', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bergen', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bergen', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Oslo', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Oslo', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Oslo', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': None, 'price': 426022, 'packageSummary': "The 'Norway Adventure' package is an 8-day tour covering Oslo, Lofoten Island, and Bergen. The itinerary includes visits to the historic Bryggen wharf, the Vigeland Sculpture Park, and the dramatic peaks and traditional fishing villages of the Lofoten archipelago. Participants will enjoy guided city sightseeing, scenic train journeys, hiking excursions, and breathtaking fjord cruises, offering a perfect blend of urban culture and Norway's stunning natural landscapes.", 'images': ['Norway1.jpg', 'Tromso3.jpg', 'Bergen1.jpg', 'Bergen2jpg.jpg', 'Norway2.jpg', 'Oslo1.jpg', 'Oslo2jpg.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 426022, 'thumbnailImage': 'Norway1.avif', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015158 is named 'Norway Adventure' and spans 8 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Lofoten Island, Meals: NA, Description: Arrive Svolvaer Transfers: Upon your arrival at Svolvaer airport you will meet the representative and then be transferred to the Lofoten Islands hotel in a private vehicle. Lofoten Islands Northern Lights Tour: Northern Lights evening tour in Lofoten Islands located under the Aurora oval for high sighting chances. Visit low light pollution spots with an expert photographer guide who helps you capture the Aurora Borealis using the right camera techniques. Special Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15.00 hrs or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Lofoten Island, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Lofoten in a Nutshell Lofoten in a nutshell Tour: Enjoy a scenic minivan journey through Lofoten stopping at iconic spots like Kabelvag Lyngvar Hov and Henningsvar for stunning views and photos. Discover the regions rich fishing heritage while soaking in the dramatic Arctic landscapes. The tour concludes at the serene twelfth century Gimsoy Church set against majestic mountains., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Lofoten Island, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Sea Eagle Safari to Trollfjorden and Snowshoe Easy Hiking Sea Eagle Safari to Trollfjorden: A perfect trip for nature lovers. Start from Svolvaer and travel through Raftsundet into dramatic Trollfjorden. Experience stunning Lofoten scenery and spot sea eagles often soaring just meters above you one of Norways most unforgettable wildlife encounters. Snowshoe easy hiking: Winter in Lofoten transforms the landscape into a snow covered wonderland. Enjoy a peaceful snowshoe hike through arctic wilderness surrounded by pristine scenery. All gear and guidance are provided for a safe and memorable experience., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Bergen, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Lofoten to Bergen (Domestic Flight Not Included) Transfers: You will be transferred from hotel to the Svolvaer Airport on private basis for your onwards journey to Bergen. Upon arrival at Bergen Airport you will be transferred to the hotel on private basis. Special Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15.00 hrs or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Bergen, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Bergen Walking Tour Bergen City Walking Tour: This tour includes visit to Bryggen Fish Market Aquarium Tollbodkaia Fredriksberg and Bergenhus Fortresses. Ride the Floibanen funicular to Mount Floyen for stunning views of the city fjord and mountains., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Oslo, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Bergen to Oslo Norway in a Nutshell Tour: Start your day with the Norway in a Nutshell tour by train bus and cruise. Travel via Naeroyfjord a UNESCO fjord with steep cliffs and waterfalls. Ride the Flam Railway to Myrdal then continue by train to Oslo with luggage transferred. Special Note: Only one piece of luggage transfer is allowed from Bergen hotel to Oslo hotel., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Oslo, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Oslo City Tour Oslo City Tour: Enjoy a relaxed morning then join an Oslo city tour on shared basis. Visit Aker Brygge Vigeland Park City Hall and Karl Johans Gate. Explore Akershus Fortress the Royal Palace grounds and the Nobel Peace Center., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Oslo, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Transfers: You will be transferred from Oslo hotel to the Airport on private transfer. Special Notes: You will reach airport three to four hours prior to your departure flight. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email, as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 426022.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLOFOTEN ISLANDS\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThon Lofoten\xa0or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBERGEN\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nClarion\xa0or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOSLO\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nClarion\xa0or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation • 3 Nights’ accommodation in Lofoten Islands based on the hotel category selected or similar • 2 Nights’ accommodation in Bergen based on the hotel category selected or similar • 2 Nights’ accommodation in Oslo based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals • Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)* Transportation • Return Airport Transfer from Svolvaer airport to the Lofoten Island Hotel • Arrival Transfers from Bergen Airport to the Hotel • Transfer from Bergen Hotel to the Bergen Train station • Transfer from the Oslo Train station to the Hotel • Departure transfer from Oslo hotel to the Oslo Airport Sightseeing • Lofoten Islands Northern Lights Tour • Lofoten in a nutshell (On Shared basis SIC) • Sea Eagle Safari to Trollfjorden • Snowshoe easy hiking • Bergen City Walking Tour (On Shared basis SIC) • Norway in a Nutshell Tour • Oslo City Tour (On Shared basis SIC) Insurance • Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: • International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges • Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) • Drinks during meals • TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount • Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature • Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included • City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel • Cost of foreign exchange for personal use • Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual • Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head • Black out Period: Surcharges could be applicable from 15 December’26 – 10 January’27. Product Terms and Conditions: IMPORTANT NOTES • The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together • The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events • Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room • Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. • WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed • (Supplement charges may apply for such services) • Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. • Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned • At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability • TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost TERMS AND CONDITIONS • Travel Validity: 1 November 2026 – 31 March 2027 • Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ • The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times • Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room • The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses • Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking • To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour • Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly • The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates • We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package • International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed • Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only • No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service • All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking • Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice • Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends • Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time • As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients • The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', 'cityCode': 'STV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Aurangabad', 'cityCode': 'IXU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kannur', 'cityCode': 'CNN', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Vadodara', 'cityCode': 'BDQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Madurai', 'cityCode': 'IXM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Nagpur', 'cityCode': 'NAG', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Norway Adventure' package is an 8-day tour covering Oslo, Lofoten Island, and Bergen. The itinerary includes visits to the historic Bryggen wharf, the Vigeland Sculpture Park, and the dramatic peaks and traditional fishing villages of the Lofoten archipelago. Participants will enjoy guided city sightseeing, scenic train journeys, hiking excursions, and breathtaking fjord cruises, offering a perfect blend of urban culture and Norway's stunning natural landscapes.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Svolvaer\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at Svolvaer airport you will meet the representative and then be transferred to the Lofoten Islands hotel in a private vehicle.\nLofoten Islands Northern Lights Tour: Northern Lights evening tour in Lofoten Islands located under the Aurora oval for high sighting chances. Visit low light pollution spots with an expert photographer guide who helps you capture the Aurora Borealis using the right camera techniques.\nSpecial Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15.00 hrs or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only.', 'mealDescription': 'NA', 'overnightStay': 'Thon Lofoten or similar'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\n\n\xa0\nLofoten in a Nutshell\nLofoten in a nutshell Tour: Enjoy a scenic minivan journey through Lofoten stopping at iconic spots like Kabelvag Lyngvar Hov and Henningsvar for stunning views and photos. Discover the regions rich fishing heritage while soaking in the dramatic Arctic landscapes. The tour concludes at the serene twelfth century Gimsoy Church set against majestic mountains.\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Thon Lofoten or similar'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nSea Eagle Safari to Trollfjorden and Snowshoe Easy Hiking\nSea Eagle Safari to Trollfjorden: A perfect trip for nature lovers. Start from Svolvaer and travel through Raftsundet into dramatic Trollfjorden. Experience stunning Lofoten scenery and spot sea eagles often soaring just meters above you one of Norways most unforgettable wildlife encounters.\nSnowshoe easy hiking: Winter in Lofoten transforms the landscape into a snow covered wonderland. Enjoy a peaceful snowshoe hike through arctic wilderness surrounded by pristine scenery. All gear and guidance are provided for a safe and memorable experience.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Thon Lofoten or similar'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nLofoten to Bergen (Domestic Flight Not Included)\nTransfers: You will be transferred from hotel to the Svolvaer Airport on private basis for your onwards journey to Bergen. Upon arrival at Bergen Airport you will be transferred to the hotel on private basis.\nSpecial Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15.00 hrs or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Thon Lofoten or similar'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nBergen Walking Tour\nBergen City Walking Tour: This tour includes visit to Bryggen Fish Market Aquarium Tollbodkaia Fredriksberg and Bergenhus Fortresses. Ride the Floibanen funicular to Mount Floyen for stunning views of the city fjord and mountains.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Clarion or similar'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\n\n\xa0\nBergen to Oslo\nNorway in a Nutshell Tour: Start your day with the Norway in a Nutshell tour by train bus and cruise. Travel via Naeroyfjord a UNESCO fjord with steep cliffs and waterfalls. Ride the Flam Railway to Myrdal then continue by train to Oslo with luggage transferred.\nSpecial Note: Only one piece of luggage transfer is allowed from Bergen hotel to Oslo hotel.\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Clarion or similar'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\n\n\xa0\nOslo City Tour\nOslo City Tour: Enjoy a relaxed morning then join an Oslo city tour on shared basis. Visit Aker Brygge Vigeland Park City Hall and Karl Johans Gate. Explore Akershus Fortress the Royal Palace grounds and the Nobel Peace Center.\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Clarion or similar'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\n\n\xa0\nDepart\nTransfers: You will be transferred from Oslo hotel to the Airport on private transfer.\nSpecial Notes: You will reach airport three to four hours prior to your departure flight.\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email, as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.\xa0\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Clarion or similar'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLOFOTEN ISLANDS\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThon Lofoten\xa0or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBERGEN\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nClarion\xa0or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOSLO\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nClarion\xa0or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'1': 