e are not air-conditioned\xa0\xa0\n• At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability\xa0\xa0\n• TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost\xa0\xa0\n\xa0\nTERMS AND CONDITIONS\n• Travel Validity: 1 November 2026 – 31 March 2027\xa0\xa0\n• Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ\xa0\xa0\n• The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times\xa0\xa0\n• Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room\xa0\xa0\n• The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\xa0\xa0\n• Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking\xa0\xa0\n• To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour\xa0\xa0\n• Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly\xa0\xa0\n• The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates\xa0\xa0\n• We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package\xa0\xa0\n• International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed\xa0\xa0\n• Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only\xa0\xa0\n• No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service\xa0\xa0\n• All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking\xa0\xa0\n• Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice\xa0\xa0\n• Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends\xa0\xa0\n• Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time\xa0\xa0\n• As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients\xa0\xa0\n• The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation\xa0\xa0', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'N', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015158/Norway1.avif', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015158/itinerary/Norway1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015158/itinerary/Tromso3.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015158/itinerary/Bergen1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015158/itinerary/Bergen2jpg.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015158/itinerary/Norway2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015158/itinerary/Oslo1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015158/itinerary/Oslo2jpg.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG013819', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG013819', 'availableMonths': ['october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Scenic Swiss  (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)    ', 'days': 8, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Zurich', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'St. Moritz', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'St. Moritz', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Zermatt', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Zermatt', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Montreux', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Montreux', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Montreux', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['Free Sightseeing (Bollywood Tour Lunch/Dinner)'], 'pdfName': 'PKG013819_0_20260609181259.pdf', 'price': 201426, 'packageSummary': "The 'Scenic Swiss (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)' package is an 8-day tour covering the picturesque Swiss destinations of Zermatt, Zurich, St. Moritz, and Montreux. Throughout this festive holiday, participants will enjoy a variety of scenic experiences, with the key highlight of the itinerary being free sightseeing that includes a special Bollywood Tour complete with themed lunch and dinner arrangements.", 'images': ['Zurich_753.jpg', '95133_Zurich_Switzerland_753.jpg', 'st.moritz.png', 'GlacierExpressStMoritz.jpg', 'matterhorn_new.png', '73434_Montreux_Riviera_Geneva_Lake_Switzerland_753.jpg', 'Glacier_3000_753.jpg', 'Montreux.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 201426, 'thumbnailImage': 'Montreux_SRP.jpeg', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Adventure', 'Durga Puja Special'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG013819 is named 'Scenic Swiss  (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)    ' and spans 8 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Zurich, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Zurich Transfers: Upon your arrival at the Zurich airport, you will walk across to the Flughafen station (located adjacent to the airport) for your train to Central Switzerland. From train station transfer on your own to the hotel. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - St. Moritz, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Zurich To St Moritz By Train: Zurich City Tour: This panoramic tour takes you across the famous Bahnhofstrasse and the banking center of the lake with a view of the snow capped mountains, part of the old town with its magnificent guild houses and the churches St. Peter, Grossmunster and Fraumunster. You’ll see the university quarter and the residential area Zurichberg, the National Museum and the Kunsthaus. Transfers: 1. Make your way to the Zurich train station for your onward journey to St. Moritz. 2. Upon arrival at St. Moritz train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. 3. Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - St. Moritz, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day Free at Leisure Local Sightseeing (Optional): Today is free at leisure to explore this beautiful and scenic region on your own or you can take an optional excursion by cable car to the Diavolezza Mountain. Enjoy your lunch with views over the highest peaks of the Eastern Alps. Or you may opt for a Horse Carriage Ride into the Val Fex (optional). In the evening try your luck at the St. Moritz Casino., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Zermatt, Meals: Breakfast, Description: St Moritz To Zermatt By Train (Glacier Express) Transfers: 1. Make your way to the St. Moritz train station for your onward journey to Zermatt by Glacier Express. Experience one of the best train journeys in the world. 2. Upon arrival at Zermatt train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Zermatt, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Zermatt - Matterhorn Mt. Matterhorn Excursion: The Matterhorn - mystical, majestic, the mountain of mountains. No one can escape its fascination. Neither locals nor guests. Triangular. A cragged rock tooth ranging into the heavens. Standing alone on the horizon. A magnet for alpinists, aesthetic emblem, mountain with ideal pr oportions. Rugged rock with magical light.There are a wide variety of different attractions to be discovered around the Matterhorn. A top excursion is Gornergrat. On this three thousand metre mountain ridge there is a viewing platform with a truly unforgettable view of the Matterhorn and the surrounding mountain world. Our if you prefer, the Matterhorn can also be admired from the Rothorn. The Matterhorn glacier paradise is the highest summer ski region in Europe and is open 365 days a year. And there is still plenty to do when the sun isn’t shining! The Matterhorn Museum explains the historic development of Zermatt from a mountain village to an Alpine holiday resort and also has many photographs and facts about the first ascent of the Matterhorn., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Montreux, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Zermatt To Montreux By Train: Transfers: 1. Make your way to the Zermatt train station for your onward journey to Montreux with Swiss Pass. 2. Upon your arrival at Montreux train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Montreux, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Montreux: Glacier 3000 Glacier 3000: Today escape to the high Alps to breath a fresh air and spectacular mountain vistas on the Glacier 3000 (Mountain Excursion). Glacier 3000, located at the highest point of the Vaudois Alps, is open all year round for winter activities for all! With its stunning views and wide range of activities on offer – including the Peak Walk, a unique suspension bridge linking two mountain peaks – Glacier 3000 is a must for your holidays in Switzerland. Bollywood Tour (Optional Tour): You can opt to partake in a Bollywood Tour - Gstaad region is known as one of the most scenic natural film sets in the world. Many Bollywood blockbusters have been filmed here, such as DDLJ Bachana Ae Haseenno and many more. Lunch can be included on this tour., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Montreux, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Montreux Transfers: Make you way to the Montreux train station to go to the Airport for your journey back home. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 201426.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nValue Category\n\n\n\n\nZurich\n\n\nZuri By Fassbind | 25hours Hotel Zurich West | Krone Unterstrass | Hotel Allegra | Holiday Inn Zurich Messe or similar\n\n\n\n\nSt. Moritz\n\n\nHotel Laudinella | Hotel Piz | Hotel Nolda | Hotel Bären | San Gian Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nZermatt\n\n\nSchlosshotel Zermatt | Tradition Julen Hotel | Hotel Daniela | Best Western Plus Alpen | Hotel Ambassador or similar\n\n\n\n\nMontreux\n\n\nEden Palace Au Lac | Rene Capt Golf Or Similar\n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nStandard Category\n\n\n\n\nZurich\n\n\nIbis Zurich City West | Swiss Night By Fassbind | Ibis Styles Zurich City Center | Design Hotel Plattenhof | Montana | Welcome Inn| | Hotel Sternen Oerlikon Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nSt. Moritz\n\n\nHotel Laudinella | Hotel Piz | Hotel Nolda or similar\n\n\n\n\nZermatt\n\n\nHotel Continental | Excelsior | Jagerhof - Hotel & Apartements | Testa Grigia / Walliserhof Zermatt| Hotel Butterfly, Bw Signature Collection Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nMontreux\n\n\nVilla Toscane | Hotel De Chailly | J5 Hotels Helvetie Montreux | Bon Port or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1).\n. Inclusions: Accommodation: 1 Night accommodation in Zurich based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in St. Moritz based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Zermatt based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Montreux based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: Train Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed] Swiss Pass 8 Days Consecutive Saver St. Moritz - Zermatt (Glacier Express - Seat Reservation fees) Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) Zurich: Zurich City Tour - Seat in Coach Basis Zermatt: Mt Matterhorn Excursion (in conjunction with Swiss Pass) Montreux: Glacier 3000 (in conjunction with Swiss Pass) Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of CHF 10 per person per day is not included City taxes / Resort Fees - To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Note: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost. Terms and Conditions: Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. TCS & GST would be levied as applicable The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs , conventions , and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation. Highlights of the package: Free Sightseeing (Bollywood Tour Lunch/Dinner).", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItin