urich airport, you will walk across to the Flughafen station (located adjacent to the airport) for your train to Central Switzerland. From train station transfer on your own to the hotel.\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'N/A\n\xa0', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Ibis Zurich City West\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Zuri By Fassbind\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Zurich'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nZurich To St Moritz By Train:\nZurich City Tour: This panoramic tour takes you across the famous Bahnhofstrasse and the banking center of the lake with a view of the snow capped mountains, part of the old town with its magnificent guild houses and the churches St. Peter, Grossmunster and Fraumunster. You’ll see the university quarter and the residential area Zurichberg, the National Museum and the Kunsthaus.\nTransfers:\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Make your way to the Zurich train station for your onward journey to St. Moritz.\n2.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Upon arrival at St. Moritz train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n3.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Laudinella (Standard) / San Gian (Value) or similar in\xa0St. Moritz'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nDay Free at Leisure\nLocal Sightseeing (Optional): Today is free at leisure to explore this beautiful and scenic region on your own or you can take an optional excursion by cable car to the Diavolezza Mountain. Enjoy your lunch with views over the highest peaks of the Eastern Alps. Or you may opt for a Horse Carriage Ride into the Val Fex (optional). In the evening try your luck at the St. Moritz Casino.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Laudinella (Standard) / San Gian (Value) or similar in\xa0St. Moritz'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nSt Moritz To Zermatt By Train (Glacier Express)\nTransfers:\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Make your way to the St. Moritz train station for your onward journey to Zermatt by Glacier Express. Experience one of the best train journeys in the world.\n2.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Upon arrival at Zermatt train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. ', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Continental\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Schlosshotel Zermatt (Value) or similar in\xa0Zermatt'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nZermatt - Matterhorn\nMt. Matterhorn Excursion:\xa0 The Matterhorn - mystical, majestic, the mountain of mountains. No one can escape its fascination. Neither locals nor guests. Triangular. A cragged rock tooth ranging into the heavens. Standing alone on the horizon. A magnet for alpinists, aesthetic emblem, mountain with ideal pr oportions. Rugged rock with magical light.There are a wide variety of different attractions to be discovered around the Matterhorn. A top excursion is Gornergrat. On this three thousand metre mountain ridge there is a viewing platform with a truly unforgettable view of the Matterhorn and the surrounding mountain world. Our if you prefer, the Matterhorn can also be admired from the Rothorn. The Matterhorn glacier paradise is the highest summer ski region in Europe and is open 365 days a year. And there is still plenty to do when the sun isn’t shining! The Matterhorn Museum explains the historic development of Zermatt from a mountain village to an Alpine holiday resort and also has many photographs and facts about the first ascent of the Matterhorn.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Continental\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Schlosshotel Zermatt (Value) or similar in\xa0Zermatt'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nZermatt To Montreux By Train:\nTransfers:\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Make your way to the Zermatt train station for your onward journey to Montreux with Swiss Pass.\xa0 \n2.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Upon your arrival at Montreux train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0J5 Helvetie\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Eden Palace Au Lac\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Montreux'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nMontreux: Glacier 3000\nGlacier 3000: Today escape to the high Alps to breath a fresh air and spectacular mountain vistas on the Glacier 3000 (Mountain Excursion). Glacier 3000, located at the highest point of the Vaudois Alps, is open all year round for winter activities for all! With its stunning views and wide range of activities on offer – including the Peak Walk, a unique suspension bridge linking two mountain peaks – Glacier 3000 is a must for your holidays in Switzerland.\nBollywood Tour (Optional Tour): You can opt to partake in a Bollywood Tour - Gstaad region is known as one of the most scenic natural film sets in the world. Many Bollywood blockbusters have been filmed here, such as DDLJ Bachana Ae Haseenno and many more. Lunch can be included on this tour.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast\xa0', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0J5 Helvetie\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Eden Palace Au Lac\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Montreux'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Montreux\nTransfers: Make you way to the Montreux train station to go to the Airport for your journey back home.\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nValue Category\n\n\n\n\nZurich\n\n\nZuri By Fassbind | 25hours Hotel Zurich West | Krone Unterstrass | Hotel Allegra | Holiday Inn Zurich Messe or similar\n\n\n\n\nSt. Moritz\n\n\nHotel Laudinella | Hotel Piz | Hotel Nolda | Hotel Bären