gory.\nThe rates are not valid on blackout dates & Trade fair periods.\nAny applicable surcharges will be communicated, and passengers will be required to pay them accordingly.\nSurcharges, if applicable, are additional to the total package price quoted at the time of booking.\nGuests are requested to confirm their onward/connecting flights with the sales team before booking.\nAll rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing at the time of booking.\nWe reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\xa0\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\xa0\nInternational Check in time is 1400/1500 hours & check out time is 1100/1200 hours respectively, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\xa0\nWherever transfers are included, they are provided without night surcharges.\nNo refunds (partial or full) will be provided for any unutilized services.\nAll sightseeing tours and excursions are operated by local service providers; timings and operating days are subject to change. Changes or Updates, if any, will be shared at the time of booking.\nSightseeing tours are strictly subject to weather conditions, and local service providers reserve the right to cancel tours without prior notice.\nRates are subject to change without prior notice, including for clients travelling during weekends.\nAny promotional offer, if applicable, may be withdrawn at any time without prior notice.\nOnce bookings are confirmed, cancellation charges will apply as per policy and will be informed at that time.\nOrganization is not responsible for any price changes arising from factors beyond our control.\nA refundable security deposit is required at check-in as per international hotel policy, payable by credit card or cash; the amount varies by hotel and is returned at checkout. Guests should avoid using debit cards since the amount is charged instantly and may take 2–3 weeks to refund. Any additional hotel services (such as minibar, room service, etc.) may be deducted from this deposit, and Company is not responsible for such transactions, as these are directly between the hotel and the guest.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015323/AdobeStock_172431209_ReuniounIsland.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015323/itinerary/ReuniounIsland.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015323/itinerary/SeaKAYAKING.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015323/itinerary/StGilles.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015323/itinerary/PITONDELAFOURNAISE.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015072', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015072', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Essence Of Iceland', 'days': 5, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG012446_0_20240410184106.pdf', 'price': 265480, 'packageSummary': "The 'Essence Of Iceland' package is a 5-day tour based in the vibrant city of Reykjavik, offering a perfect introduction to the land of fire and ice. Throughout this journey, participants will use the capital city as a gateway to explore Iceland's most iconic natural wonders and cultural landmarks. The itinerary features exciting activities such as touring the famous Golden Circle to witness spectacular geysers and waterfalls, relaxing in the rejuvenating geothermal waters of the Blue Lagoon, hunting for the elusive Northern Lights, and enjoying guided sightseeing around Reykjavik's historic streets and modern architectural marvels.", 'images': ['Reykjavik.jpg', 'Reykjavik_11.jpg', 'Gullfoss21.jpg', 'Blulagoon21.jpg', 'return_home.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 265480, 'thumbnailImage': 'Finland-Rovaniemi.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015072 is named 'Essence Of Iceland' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Reykjavik, Meals: NA, Description: Arrive Reykjavik Transfers: Upon your arrival at Reykjavik airport, you will meet the representative and then be transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle. Reykjavik Northern Lights Cruise Tour: Watching auroras shimmer under a starry sky while the ocean gently rocks is unforgettable. A boat tour offers heated indoor spaces, a café, and 360° views. Expert guides share insights and help you fully enjoy the magical experience. Special Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15:00 hrs. or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Reykjavik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: South Iceland Adventure South Iceland Adventure Tour: On this tour discover Seljalandsfoss and Skogafoss waterfalls, walk behind Seljalandsfoss, visit Reynisfjara black sand beach with basalt columns, and see Solheimajökull glacier with its scenic glacial lake., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Reykjavik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Golden Circle Tour & Northern Lights Golden Circle Tour: Visit Iceland’s top sights: Gullfoss waterfall, Geysir geothermal area, and Þingvellir National Park. See Strokkur geyser erupt and stand near Gullfoss as powerful water cascades into a dramatic gorge. Reykjavik Northern Lights Evening Tour: Join a Northern Lights minibus tour. Travel off the beaten track to top viewing spots, relax under a blanket, sip hot cocoa, and watch the Aurora Borealis light up the night sky., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Reykjavik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Ice Cave Experience Tour: Explore a remote man made ice cave in Langjokull glacier. Travel via Husafell with stops at Deildartunguhver hot spring and Hraunfossar waterfalls, then ride a glacier vehicle to the summit. Discover stunning blue ice with an expert guide in this unforgettable adventure. (Subject to availability), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Reykjavik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: DEPART Transfers: You will be transferred from Reykjavik hotel to the Airport on private transfer. Special Notes: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email, as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 265480.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at the Hotels, \xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nHelsinki\n\n\nHotel Haaga Central Park / Hotel Anna / Hotel Arthur / Scandic Kallio or similar\n\n\n\n\nRovaniemi\n\n\nScandic Grand Marina /\xa0 Scandic Meilahti\xa0 / Scandic Marski / Valo Hotel Helsinki \xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0, \n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\nValue Category\n\n\n\n\nReykjavik\n\n\nHotel Miogarour or similar in Reykjavik\n\n\n\n. Meals include: \n1 dinner included at Northern Lights Village Saariselka Resort\n5 lunches included (days 2, 3, 4, 5 and 6 of the program)\n, \nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n. Inclusions: Accommodation: 4 Nights’ accommodation in Reykjavik based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point-to-Point Basis] Return Airport Transfer from Reykjavik airport to the Hotel Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point) Reykjavik Northern Lights Cruise Tour South Iceland Adventure Tour Golden Circle Tour Reykjavik Northern Lights Evening Tour Ice Cave Experience Tour (Subject to availability) Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included City taxes / Resort Fees - To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head. Black out Period: Surcharges could be applicable from 15 December’26 - 10 January’27. Product Terms and Conditions: Special Note: The itinerary and sightseeing may vary based on availability and seasonality Please note that should the Covid 19 pandemic necessitate further protocols as mandated by the Government and/or the individual properties in the future which results in an increase in our standard tour operator rates, then Thomas Cook India reserves the right to adjust the above quoted rates accordingly. This may lead to an increase in prices quoted. Certain Activities are subject to weather conditions and protocols. Important Notes: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost. Terms and Conditions: Travel Validity: 1 November 2026 – 31 March 2027 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Vadodara', 'cityCode': 'BDQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Amritsar', 'cityCode': 'ATQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', '