ursion to Gaudari & Kazbegi.\n2 Bottles of water per person per day.\nAll transfers according to program including airport transfers: Sedan (for 2-3 PAX), Mercedes Viano or Vito (for 4-6 PAX), Mercedes Sprinter ( for 8-10 PAX)\nTravel Insurance (Valid till the age of 60 Yrs.)\n', 'exclusions': '\nTCS & GST\nVisa charges\nDeparture PCR test, if applicable\nAll flights services\nMeals not mentioned in the itinerary\nAny tips (Around USD 05.00 per person / per day) - for guide & Driver.\nAny other sightseeing entrance fees except for the ones mentioned in the Inclusions\nAnything not mentioned in the inclusions\nPre & Post tour services & cost\nExpenditure of personal nature (Such as the use of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & etc.)\nAll drink and beverages\nHotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel\nTourism Tax (if applicable)\nMidnight surcharge\nThe rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adults travelling together at all times.\n\nProduct Validity : 20th December 2026 - 5th January 2027\n\nSINGLE SUPPLEMENT - USD 440.00\n', 'termsAndConditions': 'The prices will not be valid for any blackout date/ Stop sale period which is informed during confirmation of the booking; if any change in the price, the same will be applicable for all bookings and to be borne by the customer.\n\xa0\nTerms And Conditions:\n\nThe package price is valid until 05th January 2027.\nThe hotel upgrade prices are subject to availability at the time of booking.\nThe hotel upgrade prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels.\nThe upgrade hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking.\nFor the upgrade hotel, in case the hotel chosen is unavailable, we will provide multiple options of similar category hotels.\nThe rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates.\nSurcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same\nSurcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking.\nGuests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their on-wards/connecting flights.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nPrices are not valid during Trade Fair periods.\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\nInternational Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have the right to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends.\nOffer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice.\nBookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nTCIL\xa0is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice, all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check-in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as they will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client.\xa0TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions, and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015298/AlmatyCity.jpeg', 'constructed_images': []}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014699', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014699', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Celebrate Swiss - Honeymoon Special', 'days': 8, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Zurich', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Montreux', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Montreux', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Montreux', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['Explore Zürich’s charm on an intimate eTukTuk ride & indulge in a Hot Stone BBQ with wine Set sail on a serene First Class Lake Lucerne cruise inclusive of lunch Step into a cinematic love story with an exclusive Bollywood Tour experience in Gstaad Add a special touch to your trip with complimentary Glacier 3000 access via Swiss Pass Delight in an intimate surprise lunch amid Gstaad’s Alpine charm Special Gift Hamper'], 'pdfName': 'PKG014699_0_20260917100945.pdf', 'price': 255035, 'packageSummary': "The 'Celebrate Swiss - Honeymoon Special' package is an 8-day tour covering Zurich, Montreux, and Central and Southern Switzerland. This romantic itinerary features an intimate eTukTuk ride through Zurich paired with a hot stone barbecue and wine, alongside a serene first-class cruise on Lake Lucerne with lunch included. Couples will also experience a cinematic Bollywood tour in Gstaad, enjoy a surprise lunch amidst Gstaad's Alpine charm, and receive complimentary access to Glacier 3000 via the Swiss Pass, all topped off with a special gift hamper.", 'images': ['zurich_shutterstock_329494742.jpg', 'LucerneKapellbrucke.jpg', '89366_Mt._Titlis_Engelberg_Switzerland_753.jpg', 'Switzerland1.jpg', 'Interlaken.jpg', 'Montreux753.bmp', 'Montreux7532.jpeg', 'Switzerland.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 255035, 'thumbnailImage': 'Swiss267.bmp', 'packageTheme': ['Honeymoon'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Honeymoon Special', 'packageData': 'Package ID: PKG014699 is named \'Celebrate Swiss - Honeymoon Special\' and spans 8 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Zurich, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Zurich, Switzerland | Heavenly Paradise On Earth | Welcome to Zurich! On arrival in Zurich, you will walk across to the Flughafen station (located adjacent to the airport) for your train to Zurich. On arrival at Zurich station make your way to the hotel. Check inn at the hotel at 15:00 hrs. Rest of the day is free at leisure. Your travel in Switzerland is by SWISS TRAVEL PASS – 8 DAYS CONSECUTIVE PASS Features of Swiss Pass: Swiss Pass allows you unlimited travel on Swiss Travel System which includes trains, trams, buses and boats you can use all of these unlimited to travel throughout Switzerland. It also offers free entrance to over 400 museums in Switzerland. For the evening, we encourage you for a “Romantic Walk to Mühlesteg Bridge” Mühlesteg Bridge is a pedestrian bridge, nestled elegantly over the beautiful Limmat River in the old town area of Zurich. With the view over Central Square, the Mühlesteg Bridge is a favorite spot for walkers to spend some time enjoying the amazing view of Zurich, the largest city in Switzerland. Couples can lock their love at the edge of the bridge with a symbolic padlock and wish for eternal love. Later "Indulge in a Unique Experience" - Zurich eTukTuk Tour - Hot Stone BBQ & Wine Discover Zurich\'s historic charm on an eTukTuk tour through the Old Town, passing iconic landmarks such as Fraumunster with its famous Chagall and Giacometti windows, and the twin towered Grossmunster one of the city\'s most recognizable symbols. Continue along the prestigious Bahnhofstrasse, explore the historic Predigerplatz area, and see key cultural sites like St. Jakob Church. Enjoy a unique Hot Stone BBQ experience paired with Swiss wine as you take in the city\'s ambience. [activity starting at 13:00 / 18:00 / 20:00 hrs and lasts for approx 1.5 hrs], GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Zurich To Central / Southern Swiss By Train Breakfast at the hotel. Free time until check out and later transfer on your own to the Zurich station for your onward journey to Central / Southern Swiss. On arrival at the designated station transfer on your own to hotel and check in. Rests of the day is free at leisure or you can opt to explore Lucerne on your own as there are some unique sights like Chapel Bridge with the Water Tower which is the landmark of Lucerne and the most photographed monument in Switzerland. Later “Feel the wind in your hair in a convertible style cable car (CabriO)" The wind in your hair in a convertible-style cable car. A new cable car system lets guests enjoy fresh air and great views around Mount Stanserhorn. The double-decker cable car has an open upper deck. Riding to the top of the 1,900-meter Mount Stanserhorn with the wind in your hair, the blue sky above you and a fantastic 360° panorama: that was the concept of the new cable car to replace the one from Kälti to Stanserhorn. [Free with Swiss Pass] Go back in time at the Glacier Garden: Just beside the Lion Monument is Glacier Garden, Lucerne’s most unusual attraction, with a unique mirror maze and many beautiful spots., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Central / Southern Swiss – Mt Titlis > | Swiss Transport Museum | Breakfast at the hotel. Don\'t miss the spectacular beauty of Mt Titlis! Discover eternal glaciers and other attractions from more than 3020m / 10000 ft high. Enjoy the spectacular sight of the glacier\'s deep crevasses and gigantic ice boulders from the revolving cable car ROTAIR. At the top of Mt. Titlis (10\'000 ft. above sea level), a high alpine panorama awaits you. Visit the Ice Grotto or take a ride with the chairlift IceFlyer, which brings you close to the crevasses. Enjoy also the FunLift in the snow and the Cliff Walk, Europe\'s highest suspension bridge.Later a Sweet Chocolate Adventure awaits you at the famous Swiss Museum of Transport Use the entrance ticket to head inside the Swiss Chocolate Adventure, a new attraction located at the Swiss Museum of Transport. Take your seat on a traveling cart to embark on a multimedia journey about Swiss chocolate. Listen to fascinating commentary on your audio guide as you pull up to 10 different displays to learn about the history of Swiss chocolate and how it\'s produced, transported and sold. [50% Discount with Swiss Pass] Overnight stay in Central / Southern Switzerland, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Lake Lucerne Harder Kulm Experience Post breakfast, you can explore the region on your own. Later you will make your way to Lucerne to embark on the Lunch Cruise. Board the ship at lunchtime and embark on a relaxing First Class cruise on Lake Lucerne to Vitznau or Kssnacht and back. Admire the stunning views of the lake and its surrounding landscape as you sit down to savour a delicious meal on board. Combine a refreshing cruise with a fine lunch and enjoy the inspiring scenery from the vantage point of the table. All meals aboard are freshly cooked and made of wholsome, regionally sourced ingredients. There is a large selection of Swiss dishes as well as international favourites, thus providing something for every taste. OR Lucerne Lake Cruise & Old Town Tour with Guide & Photographer Discover Lucerne\'s highlights with a guided walking tour and professional photography. Visit the iconic Lion Monument, wander through the charming Old Town\'s cobbled lanes, and cross the famous Chapel Bridge with its historic Water Tower and views of Mt.Pilatus. Enjoy a scenic Lake Lucerne cruise showcasing majestic peaks like Burgenstock, Rigi, and Pilatus. Conclude with free time to explore the festive markets, capturing memorable moments throughout. Depending on the previous night accommodation, you will make your way to designated train station for your overnight stay within Central or Southern Swiss. Upon your arrival, you will proceed to the hotel and recoup. Later we recommend a visit to Interlaken’s home mountain: Harder Kulm known for its panoramic views of! From the viewing platform at 1,322 metres above sea level he would graciously look down upon Lake Brienz and Lake Thun, or admire the Eiger, Monch, and Jungfrau. In fact, the Harder Kulm Panorama Restaurant is reminiscent of a castle. [50% Discount with Swiss Pass], GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: | Fun & Adventure | > Free Day Test your Adrenaline with Tandem Paragliding Experience in Interlaken We drive you up to the mountain at Beatenberg and you will fly down with an experienced paragliding pilot and land right in the center of Interlaken.. Enjoy the great scenic views onto Jungfrau Massive and the Interlaken area with its both lakes: Lake Thun and Lake Brienz. Please note that this experience is allowed for kids from 6 years onwards and a minimum weight of 30kg/65lbs. Maximum weight is 220lbs (100kg) per person except for the 7:15am and 4:45pm time slot when the maximum weight is 176lbs (80kg) [Activity is subject to suitable weather conditions] Supplement Cost: € 250 - 320 Per person based on type of flight Post breakfast at the hotel, Don\'t miss the highlight of any Swiss holiday and head for the thrilling and unforgettable fully guided excursion to Jungfraujoch, Top of Europe! (Optional) From the nearest designated train station, make your way to famous mountain resort Grindelwald where you board the cogwheel train for a spectacular ride via Kleine Scheidegg to Jungfraujoch. Enjoy stunning views of the world-famous triple peaks of Eiger, Monch and Jungfrau accompany you all the way to the top. After long and tiring day, Experience award winning Thai therapy designed around your wellbeing! Where Swiss serenity meets authentic Thai healing Award Winning Thai Tailor Made Private Massage (Optional) Indulge in a personalised wellness experience featuring a soothing cup of Thai tea and a relaxing herbal salt foot scrub on arrival. Skilled Thai therapists then deliver a 60 minute tailor made massage, designed to meet your individual needs and enhance both physical and emotional wellbeing. Supplement Cost: € 115 Per Person for 60 minutes, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Montreux, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Explore The Lake Geneva Region Breakfast at the hotel and later with the help of the Swiss Pass make your journey to the Lake Geneva Region. The town of Montreux nestles in a sheltered Lake Geneva bay, surrounded by vineyards and against the breathtaking backdrop of snow-covered Alps. On arrival at Montreux / Lausanne / Geneva and proceed on your own to hotel. For the evening, we recommend two of the most romantic experiences in South of Swiss! Embrace the warmth of the sun setting by the Chillon Castle [Free with Swiss Pass] The walk from Montreux takes about 40 minutes or you can take bus 201 from just outside the casino and you’ll reach the castle in about 15 minutes. If you take the aforementioned path and head left when looking at the lake, you’ll eventually come to Chateau de Chillon (Chillon Castle), a medieval fortress situated just offshore. Explore the medieval castle at your own pace with the audio guide. Its stunning sight during sunset. OR Taste Switzerland\'s finest chocolates as you wander its prettiest streets Lausanne Chocolate Tasting & Walking Tour Explore Lausanne with a local guide while sampling exquisite Swiss chocolates. Visit historic chocolatiers crafting pralines and ganaches since 1850, and taste organic, ethically sourced varieties. Enjoy sweet moments at landmarks like the Gothic Lausanne Cathedral, the charming Escaliers du Marché, and the scenic Montbenon Esplanade all perfectly paired with premium Swiss chocolate. Supplement Cost: € 190 Per Person for 120 minutes [Time: 11:00 / 14:30 hrs] OR Maison Cailler Visit and Walk A Pioneer in the Meadows: For more than one century Cailler is calling Gruyere, in the heart of the Swiss Alps, its home. To this day, Maison Cailler continues to produce the finest chocolate creations, with fresh milk from local dairies, sustainable cocoa, finest ingredients and in-depth knowledge of the art of chocolate making. Switzerland\'s oldest chocolate brand still in existence. Supplement Cost: € 22 Per Person, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Montreux, Meals: Breakfast and Lunch, Description: | Gstaad : Total Filmy | Post breakfast, make your way to Gstaad and Hit the Swiss mountain peaks with a ticket to Glacier 3000 from Les Diablerets, and ride to an altitude of 9,842 feet (3,000 meters) by cable car. Once at the top of Scex Rouge, you’ll be greeted with dramatic alpine views that stretch to Jungfrau, the Matterhorn, and even Mont Blanc. Your ticket also includes entrance to the Peak Walk by Tissot, the famous peak-to-peak suspension bridge; the Quille du Diable Glacier Walk; Ice Express chairlift; and the snow park. Later escape to the world of Lights, Camera, and Action: The Bollywood Journey! This morning travel by train to Gstaad, one of the most attractive holiday regions in the Swiss Alps. This car-free resort is surrounded by mountains on three sides, but still enjoys a spacious and sunny setting at 1,050m. On arrival in Gstaad you will meet with a representative at Mango Restaurant who will offer an Indian Meal followed by an exclusive “Bollywood Tour” Gstaad region is known as one of the most scenic natural film sets in the world. Many Bollywood blockbusters have been filmed here, such as DDLJ,“Bachana Ae Haseenno” and many more. The tour ends with a sumptuous lunch, reminiscing the most iconic scenes of the movie cinema shot in Switzerland. Stop by for some indianised cuisine at Gstaad! End with a Shopping Spree: Gstaad Promenade and Shopping Mile Whether you are in the mood for a spending spree or just want to enjoy an afternoon of window shopping in Gstaad, you won’t be disappointed. There are plenty of high-end boutiques featuring prestigious brands such as Ralph Lauren and Louis Vuitton., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Montreux, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Swiss Post breakfast make your way to Montreux / Geneva Train station and with the help of the Swiss Pass head to the airport Alternately depending on departure flight timing, you could visit also the regions of Lausanne / Geneva. Suggested Sightseeing: Olympic Museum in Lausanne (Free with the Swiss Pass) To experience the Olympics at close quarters and feel the Olympic spirit the way the athletes felt it, to study the history of the Games from antiquity to today - thanks to the latest computer technology and audiovisual media, all of this can be accomplished in the Olympic Museum in Lausanne. Option for a small snack and chance to see the sporting equipments of famous Indian sportspersons. Suggested Sightseeing: Lake Geneva Cruise (Free with Swiss pass) The Belle Époque boats have been navigating Central Europe’s largest inland lake for 140 years and offer fantastic cruises between France and Switzerland. The views from the boat extend from harbours and castles (Chillon, Morges, Rolle, Yvoire among others) over vineyards to the snow-covered summits of the Swiss and Savoyan Alps. The boat landings are starting points for many exploration activities like city tours (Geneva, Lausanne, Montreux, Vevey). Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 255035.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4*\n\n\n\n\nZurich\n\n\nAllegra Lodge / Hotel Züri by Fassbind / Novotel Zurich City-West / Hotel Krone Unterstrass / Crowne Plaza Zürich or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nCampus Hotel Hertenstein | Romantik Hotel Beau Rivage - Weggis | Hotel Baren Sigriswil | Hotel Eden Spiez | Seegarten Marina or similar\n\n\n\n\nMontreux\n\n\nVilla Toscane / Eden Palace Au Lac /\xa0 Eurotel Montreux or Similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0, \n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nZurich\n\n\nHotel Welcome Inn / Hotel Bristol / Sorell Hotel Rütli / Sorell Hotel Rex / Ibis Styles Zurich City Center or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nLa Pergola | Ibis Styles Bern City |\xa0 Prizeotel Bern-city | Jardin | Sorell Hotel Ador or similar\n\n\n\n\nMontreux\n\n\nHotel Helvetie / Hôtel Bon Port / Tralala Hotel / Hotel de Chailly or Similar\n\n\n\n. Meals include: \nDaily breakfast at the hotel (except on the day of arrival).\nLunch during “Bollywood Tour” or upon your visit to Gstaad – Complimentary Gesture\n. Inclusions: Accommodation: 1 Night accommodation in Zurich at the selected category from the above mentioned or similar 4 Nights’ accommodation in Central / Southern Swiss at the selected category from the above mentioned or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Montreux / Southern Swiss at the selected category from the above mentioned or similar Meals: Daily breakfast at the hotel (except on the day of arrival). Lunch during “Bollywood Tour” or upon your visit to Gstaad – Complimentary Gesture Sightseeing: (Tour starts from a city centre point, transportation to & from the hotel is not included) Zürich eTukTuk Tour – Hot Stone BBQ & Wine tour on shared basis Lucerne: Mt Titlis Excursion (in conjunction with Swiss Pass) Lake Lucerne Cruise with 3-course Gourmet Lunch (Pick up / drop off from designated points) CabriO convertible style cable car ride (in conjunction with Swiss Pass) Entrance to Chillon Castle (in conjunction with Swiss Pass) Transport within Swiss: 8 Days Consecutive Swiss Pass (2nd Class) Glacier 3000 Ticket (in conjunction with Swiss Pass) Insurance: Overseas Medical Insurance (Basic Coverage- Up to 60 years of age). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Meals other than those specified (if any). Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 5 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head. *** IMPORTANT NOTE: SURCHARGE OF EUR 50 – 80 PER PERSON COULD BE APPLICABLE DURING THE STAY PERIOD OF 15 JUNE – 15 JULY 2024 DUE TO INCREASED DEMAND ***. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Note: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost. Terms and Conditions Travel Validity: 1st March 2026 till 31st October 2026. Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. TCS & GST would be levied as applicable The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs , conventions , and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: Explore Zürich’s charm on an intimate eTukTuk ride & indulge in a Hot Stone BBQ with wine Set sail on a serene First Class Lake Lucerne cruise inclusive of lunch Step into a cinematic love story with an exclusive Bollywood Tour experience in Gstaad Add a special touch to your trip with complimentary Glacier 3000 access via Swiss Pass Delight in an intimate surprise lunch amid Gstaad’s Alpine charm Special Gift Hamper.', 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Celebrate Swiss - Honeymoon Special' package is an 8-day tour covering Zurich, Montreux, and Central and Southern Switzerland. This romantic itinerary features an intimate eTukTuk ride through Zurich paired with a hot stone barbecue and wine, alongside a serene first-class cruise on Lake Lucerne with lunch included. Couples will also experience a cinematic Bollywood tour in Gstaad, enjoy a surprise lunch amidst Gstaad's Alpine charm, and receive complimentary access to Glacier 3000 via the Swiss Pass, all topped off with a special gift hamper.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Zurich, Switzerland | Heavenly Paradise On Earth |\nWelcome to Zurich! On arrival in Zurich, you will walk across to the Flughafen station (located adjacent to the airport) for your train to Zurich. On arrival at Zurich station make your way to the hotel. Check inn at the hotel at 15:00 hrs. Rest of the day is free at leisure. \nYour travel in Switzerland is by SWISS TRAVEL PASS – 8 DAYS CONSECUTIVE PASS\nFeatures of Swiss Pass: Swiss Pass allows you unlimited travel on Swiss Travel System which includes trains, trams, buses and boats you can use all of these unlimited to travel throughout Switzerland. It also offers free entrance to over 400 museums in Switzerland.\nFor the evening, we encourage you for a “Romantic Walk to Mühlesteg Bridge”\nMühlesteg Bridge is a pedestrian bridge, nestled elegantly over the beautiful Limmat River in the old town area of Zurich. With the view over Central Square, the Mühlesteg Bridge is a favorite spot for walkers to spend some time enjoying the amazing view of Zurich, the largest city in Switzerland. Couples can lock their love at the edge of the bridge with a symbolic padlock and wish for eternal love.\nLater "Indulge in a Unique Experience" - Zurich eTukTuk Tour - Hot Stone BBQ & Wine\nDiscover Zurich\'s historic charm on an eTukTuk tour through the Old Town, passing iconic landmarks such as Fraumunster with its famous Chagall and Giacometti windows, and the twin towered Grossmunster\xa0 one of the city\'s most recognizable symbols. Continue along the prestigious Bahnhofstrasse, explore the historic Predigerplatz area, and see key cultural sites like St. Jakob Church. Enjoy a unique Hot Stone BBQ experience paired with Swiss wine as you take in the city\'s ambience. [activity starting at 13:00 / 18:00 / 20:00 hrs and lasts for approx 1.5 hrs]', 'mealDescription': 'N/A\n\xa0', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Welcome Inn (Standard) /\xa0Allegra Lodge (Value) or Similar in\xa0Zurich\xa0'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nZurich To Central / Southern Swiss By Train\n\xa0\nBreakfast at the hotel. Free time until check out and later transfer on your own to the Zurich station for your onward journey to Central / Southern Swiss. On arrival at the designated station transfer on your own to hotel and check in. Rests of the day is free at leisure or you can opt to explore Lucerne on your own as there are some unique sights like Chapel Bridge with the Water Tower which is the landmark of Lucerne and the most photographed monument in Switzerland.\nLater “Feel the wind in your hair in a convertible style cable car (CabriO)"\nThe wind in your hair in a convertible-style cable car. A new cable car system lets guests enjoy fresh air and great views around Mount Stanserhorn. The double-decker cable car has an open upper deck. Riding to the top of the 1,900-meter Mount Stanserhorn with the wind in your hair, the blue sky above you and a fantastic 360° panorama: that was the concept of the new cable car to replace the one from Kälti to Stanserhorn. [Free with Swiss Pass]\nGo back in time at the Glacier Garden: Just beside the Lion Monument is Glacier Garden, Lucerne’s most unusual attraction, with a unique mirror maze and many beautiful spots.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola (Standard) /\xa0Campus\xa0Hertenstein (Value) or similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 3, 'description': "\xa0\nCentral / Southern Swiss – Mt Titlis > | Swiss Transport Museum |\nBreakfast at the hotel. Don't miss the spectacular beauty of Mt Titlis! Discover eternal glaciers and other attractions from more than 3020m / 10000 ft high. Enjoy the spectacular sight of the glacier's deep crevasses and gigantic ice boulders from the revolving cable car ROTAIR. At the top of Mt. Titlis (10'000 ft. above sea level), a high alpine panorama awaits you. Visit the Ice Grotto or take a ride with the chairlift IceFlyer, which brings you close to the crevasses. Enjoy also the FunLift in the snow and the Cliff Walk, Europe's highest suspension bridge.Later a Sweet Chocolate Adventure awaits you at the famous Swiss Museum of Transport\nUse the entrance ticket to head inside the Swiss Chocolate Adventure, a new attraction located at the Swiss Museum of Transport. Take your seat on a traveling cart to embark on a multimedia journey about Swiss chocolate. Listen to fascinating commentary on your audio guide as you pull up to 10 different displays to learn about the history of Swiss chocolate and how it's produced, transported and sold. [50% Discount with Swiss Pass]\nOvernight stay in Central / Southern Switzerland", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola (Standard) /\xa0Campus\xa0Hertenstein (Value) or similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 4, 'description': "\xa0\nLake Lucerne\xa0Harder Kulm Experience\nPost breakfast, you can explore the region on your own. Later you will make your way to Lucerne to embark on the Lunch Cruise. Board the ship at lunchtime and embark on a relaxing First Class cruise on Lake Lucerne to Vitznau or Kssnacht and back. Admire the stunning views of the lake and its surrounding landscape as you sit down to savour a delicious meal on board. Combine a refreshing cruise with a fine lunch and enjoy the inspiring scenery from the vantage point of the table. All meals aboard are freshly cooked and made of wholsome, regionally sourced ingredients. There is a large selection of Swiss dishes as well as international favourites, thus providing something for every taste.\n\xa0\nOR Lucerne Lake Cruise & Old Town Tour with Guide & Photographer\nDiscover Lucerne's highlights with a guided walking tour and professional photography. Visit the iconic Lion Monument, wander through the charming Old Town's cobbled lanes, and cross the famous Chapel Bridge with its historic Water Tower and views of Mt.Pilatus. Enjoy a scenic Lake Lucerne cruise showcasing majestic peaks like Burgenstock, Rigi, and Pilatus. Conclude with free time to explore the festive markets, capturing memorable moments throughout.\nDepending on the previous night accommodation, you will make your way to designated train station for your overnight stay within Central or Southern Swiss. Upon your arrival, you will proceed to the hotel and recoup.\nLater we recommend a visit to Interlaken’s home mountain: Harder Kulm known for its panoramic views of! From the viewing platform at 1,322 metres above sea level he would graciously look down upon Lake Brienz and Lake Thun, or admire the Eiger, Monch, and Jungfrau. In fact, the Harder Kulm Panorama Restaurant is reminiscent of a castle. [50% Discount with Swiss Pass]", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola (Standard) /\xa0Campus\xa0Hertenstein (Value) or similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 5, 'description': "\xa0\n| Fun & Adventure | > Free Day\nTest your Adrenaline with Tandem Paragliding Experience in Interlaken\xa0\nWe drive you up to the mountain at Beatenberg and you will fly down with an experienced paragliding pilot and land right in the center of Interlaken.. Enjoy the great scenic views onto Jungfrau Massive and the Interlaken area with its both lakes: Lake Thun and Lake Brienz.\nPlease note that this experience is allowed for kids from 6 years onwards and a minimum weight of 30kg/65lbs. Maximum weight is 220lbs (100kg) per person except for the 7:15am and 4:45pm time slot when the maximum weight is 176lbs (80kg) [Activity is subject to suitable weather conditions] Supplement Cost: € 250 - 320 Per person based on type of flight\nPost breakfast at the hotel, Don't miss the highlight of any Swiss holiday and head for the thrilling and unforgettable fully guided excursion to Jungfraujoch, Top of Europe! (Optional)\nFrom the nearest designated train station, make your way to famous mountain resort Grindelwald where you board the cogwheel train for a spectacular ride via Kleine Scheidegg to Jungfraujoch. Enjoy stunning views of the world-famous triple peaks of Eiger, Monch and Jungfrau accompany you all the way to the top.\n\xa0\nAfter long and tiring day, Experience award winning Thai therapy designed around your wellbeing! Where Swiss serenity meets authentic Thai healing\n\xa0\nAward Winning Thai Tailor Made Private Massage (Optional)\nIndulge in a personalised wellness experience featuring a soothing cup of Thai tea and a relaxing herbal salt foot scrub on arrival. Skilled Thai therapists then deliver a 60 minute tailor made massage, designed to meet your individual needs and enhance both physical and emotional wellbeing. Supplement Cost: € 115 Per Person for 60 minutes", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola (Standard) /\xa0Campus\xa0Hertenstein (Value) or similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 6, 'description': "\xa0\nExplore The Lake Geneva Region\nBreakfast at the hotel and later with the help of the Swiss Pass make your journey to the Lake Geneva Region. The town of Montreux nestles in a sheltered Lake Geneva bay, surrounded by vineyards and against the breathtaking backdrop of snow-covered Alps. On arrival at Montreux / Lausanne / Geneva and proceed on your own to hotel.\nFor the evening, we recommend two of the most romantic experiences in South of Swiss!\n\xa0\nEmbrace the warmth of the sun setting by the Chillon Castle [Free with Swiss Pass]\nThe walk from Montreux takes about 40 minutes or you can take bus 201 from just outside the casino and you’ll reach the castle in about 15 minutes. If you take the aforementioned path and head left when looking at the lake, you’ll eventually come to Chateau de Chillon (Chillon Castle), a medieval fortress situated just offshore. Explore the medieval castle at your own pace with the audio guide. Its stunning sight during sunset.\n\xa0\nOR Taste Switzerland's finest chocolates as you wander its prettiest streets\nLausanne Chocolate Tasting & Walking Tour\nExplore Lausanne with a local guide while sampling exquisite Swiss chocolates. Visit historic chocolatiers crafting pralines and ganaches since 1850, and taste organic, ethically sourced varieties. Enjoy sweet moments at landmarks like the Gothic Lausanne Cathedral, the charming Escaliers du Marché, and the scenic Montbenon Esplanade\xa0 all perfectly paired with premium Swiss chocolate. Supplement Cost: € 190 Per Person for 120 minutes [Time: 11:00 / 14:30 hrs]\n\xa0\nOR Maison Cailler Visit and Walk A Pioneer in the Meadows: For more than one century Cailler is calling Gruyere, in the heart of the Swiss Alps, its home. To this day, Maison Cailler continues to produce the finest chocolate creations, with fresh milk from local dairies, sustainable cocoa, finest ingredients and in-depth knowledge of the art of chocolate making. Switzerland's oldest chocolate brand still in existence. Supplement Cost: € 22 Per Person\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Helvetie (Standard) /\xa0Villa Toscane (Value) or Similar in\xa0Montreux'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\n| Gstaad : Total Filmy |\nPost breakfast, make your way to Gstaad and Hit the Swiss mountain peaks with a ticket to Glacier 3000 from Les Diablerets, and ride to an altitude of 9,842 feet (3,000 meters) by cable car. Once at the top of Scex Rouge, you’ll be greeted with dramatic alpine views that stretch to Jungfrau, the Matterhorn, and even Mont Blanc. Your ticket also includes entrance to the Peak Walk by Tissot, the famous peak-to-peak suspension bridge; the Quille du Diable Glacier Walk; Ice Express chairlift; and the snow park.\nLater escape to the world of Lights, Camera, and Action: The Bollywood Journey!\nThis morning travel by train to Gstaad, one of the most attractive holiday regions in the Swiss Alps. This car-free resort is surrounded by mountains on three sides, but still enjoys a spacious and sunny setting at 1,050m.\n\xa0\nOn arrival in Gstaad you will meet with a representative at Mango Restaurant who will offer an Indian Meal followed by an exclusive “Bollywood Tour”\nGstaad region is known as one of the most scenic natural film sets in the world. Many Bollywood blockbusters have been filmed here, such as DDLJ,“Bachana Ae Haseenno”\xa0 and many more. The tour ends with a sumptuous lunch, reminiscing the most iconic scenes of the movie cinema shot in Switzerland. Stop by for some indianised cuisine at Gstaad!\nEnd with a Shopping Spree: Gstaad Promenade and Shopping Mile\nWhether you are in the mood for a spending spree or just want to enjoy an afternoon of window shopping in Gstaad, you won’t be disappointed. There are plenty of high-end boutiques featuring prestigious brands such as Ralph Lauren and Louis Vuitton.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Helvetie (Standard) /\xa0Villa Toscane (Value) or Similar in\xa0Montreux'}, {'day': 8, 'description': 'Depart\xa0Swiss\n\xa0\nPost breakfast make your way to Montreux / Geneva Train station and with the help of the Swiss Pass head to the airport\nAlternately depending on departure flight timing, you could visit also the regions of Lausanne / Geneva.\nSuggested Sightseeing: Olympic Museum in Lausanne (Free with the Swiss Pass)\nTo experience the Olympics at close quarters and feel the Olympic spirit the way the athletes felt it, to study the history of the Games from antiquity to today - thanks to the latest computer technology and audiovisual media, all of this can be accomplished in the Olympic Museum in Lausanne. Option for a small snack and chance to see the sporting equipments of famous Indian sportspersons.\nSuggested Sightseeing: Lake Geneva Cruise (Free with Swiss pass)\nThe Belle Époque boats have been navigating Central Europe’s largest inland lake for 140 years and offer fantastic cruises between France and Switzerland. The views from the boat extend from harbours and castles (Chillon, Morges, Rolle, Yvoire among others) over vineyards to the snow-covered summits of the Swiss and Savoyan Alps. The boat landings are starting points for many exploration activities like city tours (Geneva, Lausanne, Montreux, Vevey).\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4*\n\n\n\n\nZurich\n\n\nAllegra Lodge / Hotel Züri by Fassbind / Novotel Zurich City-West / Hotel Krone Unterstrass / Crowne Plaza Zürich or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nCampus Hotel Hertenstein | Romantik Hotel Beau Rivage - Weggis | Hotel Baren Sigriswil | Hotel Eden Spiez | Seegarten Marina or similar\n\n\n\n\nMontreux\n\n\nVilla Toscane / Eden Palace Au Lac /\xa0 Eurotel Montreux or Similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0', '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nZurich\n\n\nHotel Welcome Inn / Hotel Bristol / Sorell Hotel Rütli / Sorell Hotel Rex / Ibis Styles Zurich City Center or similar\n\