s such as the Bosphorus Bridge, Dolmabahçe Palace, and the illuminated waterfront mansions. The experience is complemented by a delicious Turkish dinner and live entertainment, often including traditional music and folk dance performances, making it a memorable blend of scenic views, culture, and cuisine. [The supplement cost for this activity will be approx. US$ 80/- per adult & US$ 55/- for children below 6 years]', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Four Side Lions Taksim\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hilton Double Tree Piyalepasa\xa0(Premium) or similar in\xa0Istanbul'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nFull-Day Tour Of Istanbul On Private Basis\nIstanbul City Tour : Between 09:00 and 10:00 hrs, you will be picked up from your hotel (pickup time subject to hotel location) for a full day city tour. The tour includes visits to the Hagia Sophia Mosque (entrance not included), the pride of Byzantine architecture; the Byzantine Hippodrome, once the venue for ancient chariot races; and the Blue Mosque, renowned for its exquisite blue Iznik tiles. You will also visit the Topkapi Palace (entrance not included), the former residence of the Ottoman Sultans, followed by time at the Grand Bazaar, Turkey’s largest covered market with over 4,000 shops.\nSpecial Notes:\n1.\xa0 \xa0 \xa0 \xa0Sightseeing will be conducted on a private basis. The vehicle will be provided only for the scheduled sightseeing activities and will not be at disposal beyond the itinerary.\n2.\xa0 \xa0 \xa0 Entrance to the Hagia Sophia Mosque and Topkapi Palace is available at an additional supplement.\n\xa0\xa0 \xa0Supplement costs:\n\n\xa0 Hagia Sophia: US$ 35 - 40/- Per adult (*Under 8 years Free)\xa0\xa0\n\xa0 Topkapi Palace US$ 65/- Per adult (*Under 6 years Free)\xa0\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Four Side Lions Taksim\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hilton Double Tree Piyalepasa\xa0(Premium) or similar in\xa0Istanbul'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nIstanbul To Cappadocia\n