e Goreme Open Air Museum, the heart of Cappadocia, celebrated for its rock cut churches adorned with wall paintings dating back to the 10th century, depicting scenes from the life of Jesus and early Christian monastic life.\nThe tour concludes with a photo stop at Uchisar Castle, a natural rock citadel and one of the largest fairy chimney formations in the region, offering panoramic views of Cappadocia.\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a private basis. The vehicle will be provided only for the scheduled sightseeing activities and will not be at disposal beyond the itinerary.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Dedeli\xa0Cave\xa0\xa0(Value) /\xa0Hanedan\xa0Cave\xa0Suites\xa0(Premium)\xa0or similar in\xa0Cappadocia'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nCappadocia To Izmir\nTransfers:\xa0\n1. Today you will have a private transfer from the hotel to the Airport for onward flight\n2. Upon arrival at Izmir, there will be a private transfer from the airport to the hotel in Kusadasi.\nSpecial Notes:\xa0\n1. Please note that the domestic flight from Cappadocia to Izmir is not included in the tour cost and will be charged as an additional supplement.\xa0\n2. Please note the standard check in time would be at 14:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Efe Boutique Hotel/ Karaaslan Inn hotel/ Ladies Beach or similar\n\xa0\n\xa0\n\xa0'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nFull Day Pamukkale Tour On Private Basis\nTransfers: Sightseeing will be conducted on a private basis. The vehicle will be provided only for the scheduled sightseeing activities and will not be at disposal beyond the itinerary.\nFull Day Pamukkale Tour on PVT basis: Experience the highlights of Pamukkale on a full day tour, including the ancient city of Hierapolis, the famous Cotton Terraces, and key archaeological sites such as the Domitian Gate, Latrina, Oil Factory, Agora, Byzantine Gate, Triton Fountain, and the Temple of Apollo. After the tour, you will be transferred to the hotel.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Efe Boutique Hotel/ Karaaslan Inn hotel/ Ladies Beach or similar\n\xa0'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Izmir\nTransfers: From Kusadasi hotel to Izmir Airport in a private transfer.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'NA'}]}, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at the Hotels', '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n5* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nThe Elysium Taksim/Doubletree Hilton Piyalepasa Hotel\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nHanedan Cave Suites / Acer Cave Suites\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nKusadasi\n\n\nSignature Blue Hotel / Le Bleu Hotel / Ramada Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n', '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nFour Sides Lion Taksim / Erboy Hotel/ Konak Taksim\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nDedeli Cave / Sunak Cave Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nKusadasi\n\n\nEfe Boutique Hotel/ Karaaslan Inn hotel/ Ladies Beach or similar\n\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'0': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '1': '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nFour Sides Lion Taksim / Erboy Hotel/ Konak Taksim\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nDedeli Cave / Sunak Cave Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nKusadasi\n\n\nEfe Boutique Hotel/ Karaaslan Inn hotel/ Ladies Beach or similar\n\n\n\n', '2': '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n5* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nThe Elysium Taksim/Doubletree Hilton Piyalepasa Hotel\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nHanedan Cave Suites / Acer Cave Suites\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nKusadasi\n\n\nSignature Blue Hotel / Le Bleu Hotel / Ramada Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'TR', 'countryName': 'Turkey', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Value', 'Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Value', 'price': 125800.0, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nFour Sides Lion Taksim / Erboy Hotel/ Konak Taksim\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nDedeli Cave / Sunak Cave Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nKusadasi\n\n\nEfe Boutique Hotel/ Karaaslan Inn hotel/ Ladies Beach or similar\n\n\n\n']}, {'category': 'Premium', 'price': 145100.0, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n5* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nThe Elysium Taksim/Doubletree Hilton Piyalepasa Hotel\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nHanedan Cave Suites / Acer Cave Suites\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\nKusadasi\n\n\nSignature Blue Hotel / Le Bleu Hotel / Ramada Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n']}], 'meals': ['Breakfast Included', '\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) // Half Board if you opt for 5* accommodation in Kusadasi\n'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\n\nFull Day Guided Tour of Istanbul on sharing basis (SIC)\nCappadocia Sightseeing Tour on sharing basis (SIC)\xa0\nFull Day Pamukkale Tour on sharing basis (SIC)\xa0\n\n\xa0'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': '\xa0Accommodation:\n\n\xa02 Nights’ accommodation in Istanbul based on the hotel category selected or similar\n\xa02 Nights’ accommodation in Cappadocia based on the hotel category selected or similar\n\xa02 Nights’ accommodation in Kusdasi based on the hotel category selected or similar\xa0\n\nMeals:\n\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) // Half Board if you opt for 5* accommodation in Kusadasi\xa0\n\nTransportation:\n\n\xa0Private Airport Transfer from Istanbul Airport to Hotel\n\xa0Private transfer from Istanbul hotel to Istanbul Airprort\n\xa0Private Airport Transfer from Kayseri Airport to Cappadocia Hotel\n\xa0Private Airport transfer from Cappadocia Hotel to Kayseri Airport\n\xa0Private Airport Transfer from Izmir Airport to Kusadasi Hotel\n\xa0Private Airport transfer from Kusadasi Hotel to Izmir Airport\n\nSightseeing: (Sightseeing is provided on a private basis only. The vehicle is available strictly as per the sightseeing itinerary and is not available at disposal)\n\n\xa0Full Day Tour of Istanbul on private basis (PVT)\n\xa0Cappadocia Sightseeing Tour on private basis (PVT)\xa0\n\xa0Full Day Pamukkale Tour on private basis (PVT)\xa0\n\nInsurance:\n\n\xa0Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included\xa0\nCity taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nCost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.\n\n\xa0\nBlackout Dates:\n\n\n\n\nHOLIDAY\n\n\nDATE\n\n\n\n\nNational Sovereignty and Children’s Day\xa0\n\n\n23-04-2026\n\n\n\n\nLabor and Solidarity Day\n\n\n01-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nCommemoration of Atatürk, Youth and Sports Day\n\n\n19-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nEid al-Adha 1st day\n\n\n27-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nEid al-Adha 2nd day\n\n\n28-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nEid al-Adha 3rd day\n\n\n29-04-2026\n\n\n\n\nEid al-Adha last day\n\n\n30-05-2026\n\n\n\n\nDemocracy and National Unity Day\n\n\n15-07-2026\n\n\n\n\nVictory Day\n\n\n30-08-2026\n\n\n\n\nRepublic Day\n\n\n29-10-2026\n\n\n\n', 'termsAndConditions': 'IMPORTANT NOTES:\n\nThe above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together.\nThe above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\nMaximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room.\nMidnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\nWIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed.\xa0\n(Supplement charges may apply for such services)\nStandard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs.\nMost hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned.\nAt this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability\n\nTERMS AND CONDITIONS:\n\nTravel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 September 2026\nBlack out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ.\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nMaximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\nSurcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking.\nTo proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour.\nShould the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014765/60842_Mevlana_Museum_in_Konya_Turkey_SRP.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014765/itinerary/Istanbul753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014765/itinerary/Istanbul.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014765/itinerary/Cappadocia7532.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014765/itinerary/Cappadocia7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014765/itinerary/Kusadasi_1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014765/itinerary/Pamukkale.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014765/itinerary/Temple_of_apollo_pamukkale.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014530', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014530', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'London Paris And Swiss', 'days': 9, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'London', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'London', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014530_0_20260916123650.pdf', 'price': 308941, 'packageSummary': "The 'London Paris And Swiss' package is a 9-day tour covering London, Paris, and the scenic regions of Central and Southern Switzerland. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the Eiffel Tower, Buckingham Palace, Big Ben, and the breathtaking Swiss Alps. Participants will enjoy guided city sightseeing tours, a scenic cruise along the River Seine, and memorable mountain excursions in Switzerland.", 'images': ['LondonTowerBridge7531.jpg', 'London7531.jpg', 'Paris_new_753_2.jpeg', 'EiffelTowerParisFrance7534.jpg', 'Interlaken2.jpg', '89366_Mt._Titlis_Engelberg_Switzerland_753.jpg', 'Jungfraujoch75345.jpg', 'Glacier.jpg', '9063_Lucerne_Switzerland_753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 308941, 'thumbnailImage': 'Titles753.jpeg', 'packageTheme': ['Adventure', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014530 is named 'London Paris And Swiss' and spans 9 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - London, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive London Transfers: Upon your arrival at the airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 14:00 - 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - London, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Hop On Hop Off Tour - Madame Tussauds - London Eye - Tower Of London Hop on Hop Off Tour: The London Hop-On Hop-Off Bus Tour is a flexible sightseeing experience that lets you explore the city’s most iconic landmarks at your own pace with multiple routes and stops near attractions. Madame Tussauds With Marvel 4d Cinema and Star Wars Experience: Step into the world of fame and fantasy at Madame Tussauds London. Get up close with lifelike wax figures of celebrities, historical icons, and world leaders. Enjoy the thrilling Marvel 4D Cinema, where superheroes come alive in an immersive experience, and explore the Star Wars Experience, featuring iconic characters and scenes from the legendary saga. It’s an unforgettable mix of glamour, action, and adventure for all ages. London Eye – Ticket: The London Eye is one of the city’s most iconic attractions, offering breathtaking 360° views of London’s skyline from a giant observation wheel on the South Bank of the River Thames. Standing at 135 meters tall, it provides a unique perspective of landmarks like Big Ben, Buckingham Palace, and St. Paul’s Cathedral. A must-visit for stunning photo opportunities and an unforgettable experience., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Description: London To Paris Via Train Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Paris. Upon your arrival at Paris train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion. Moulin Rouge Show (Optional): Experience the world-famous Moulin Rouge in Paris, an iconic cabaret known for its dazzling performances, vibrant costumes, and spectacular dance routines, including the legendary French Cancan. Located in the heart of Montmartre, this unforgettable show combines music, glamour, and artistry, offering a true taste of Parisian nightlife., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Paris City Tour + River Seine Cruise + Eiffel Tower Tour Paris City Tour: Later discover Paris's most famous tourist sites and monuments on one unique tour. This tour features a visit to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower with breathtaking views of the capital, a panoramic city tour by coach, plus an hour-long boat trip along the River Seine. This comprehensive tour is the ideal way to discover Paris for the first time. Special Note: Thanks to your priority access, you can skip the line and speed up by elevator to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower, Paris's most unmissable monument., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Paris To Central Switzerland Via Train Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Central Switzerland. Upon your arrival in Central Switzerland, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. Lucerne Tour with Swiss Pass on your own (Optional): Travel to Lucerne with Swiss pass on your own as there are many sights in a small area in Lucerne like Chapel Bridge with the Water Tower which is the landmark of Lucerne and the most photographed monument in Switzerland. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Mt. Titlis Excursion Mt. Titlis Excursion: Don't miss the spectacular beauty of Mt Titlis! Discover eternal glaciers and other attractions from more than 3020m / 10000 ft high. Enjoy the spectacular sight of the glacier's deep crevasses and gigantic ice boulders from the revolving cable car ROTAIR. At the top of Mt. Titlis (10'000 ft. above sea level), a high alpine panorama awaits you. Visit the Ice Grotto or take a ride with the chairlift IceFlyer, which brings you close to the crevasses. Enjoy also the FunLift in the snow and the Cliff Walk, Europe's highest suspension bridge. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Jungfraujoch Excursion Jungfraujoch Excursion: Don't miss the highlight of any Swiss holiday and go for this thrilling and unforgettable excursion to Jungfraujoch, Top of Europe! From Interlaken, the heart of the Jungfrau region mountain world and uniquely situated between two lakes, you make your way to famous mountain resort Grindelwald where you board the cogwheel train for a spectacular ride via Kleine Scheidegg to Jungfraujoch. Enjoy stunning views of the world-famous triple peaks of Eiger, Monch and Jungfrau accompany you all the way to the top. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Central Switzerland Day At Leisure (Optional Activity) Glacier 3000 (Optional): Escape to the high Alps to breath a fresh air and spectacular mountain vistas on the Glacier 3000 (Optional Mountain Excursion). Glacier 3000, located at the highest point of the Vaudois Alps, is open all year round for winter activities for all! With its stunning views and wide range of activities on offer – including the Peak Walk, a unique suspension bridge linking two mountain peaks – Glacier 3000 is a must for your holidays in Switzerland. Bollywood Tour (Optional): Gstaad region is known as one of the most scenic natural film sets in the world. Many Bollywood blockbusters have been filmed here, such as DDLJ “Bachana Ae Haseenno” and many more. Lunch can be included on this tour., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 9 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Lucerne Transfers: Make your way to Lucerne Train station and with the help of the sector ticket head to the Zurich airport for flight back home. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 308941.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n\n\nPark Plaza London / Park International / Copthorne Tara London Kensington / Holiday Inn® London Kensington / Mercure London Paddington or similar\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nMercure Paris Opéra Faubourg Montmartre / Novotel Paris Center Eiffel Tower / Novotel Paris Center Gare Montparnasse / Mercure Paris Bercy Bibliotheque Hotel / Hotel Mademoiselle or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nCampus Hotel Hertenstein | Romantik Hotel Beau Rivage - Weggis | Hotel Baren Sigriswil | Hotel Eden Spiez | Seegarten Marina or similar\n\n\n\n, \xa0\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nSTANDARD CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n\n\nIbis London Earls Court Hotel /\xa0Point A Hotel, London Paddington / Best Western Buckingham Palace Rd\xa0\xa0/The W14 Hotel Kensington / London House Hotel / Mentone Hotel / BW Swiss Cottage or similar\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nHotel Opera Lafayette / Color Design Hotel / Hôtel Champerret-Elysées / Londres Et New York Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nLa Pergola | Ibis Styles Bern City | Prizeotel Bern-city | Jardin | Sorell Hotel Ador or similar\n\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ accommodation in Paris based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in London based on the hotel category selected or similar 4 Nights’ accommodation in Central Switzerland based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis] Arrival Airport Transfer from London Airport to London Hotel Train Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed] 2nd Class Train Ticket London – Paris (Eurostar): – Subject to availability until ticketed 2nd Class Train Ticket Paris – Geneva / Basel (TGV). Swiss Pass 4 Days Consecutive Saver Lucerne – Zurich Airport: – Subject to availability until ticketed. Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) London Hop On Hop Off Bus tour. London Eye (Entrance Only). Madame Tussauds (Entrance Only). Tower of London (Entrance Only) Interactive City Tour, Seine Cruise and Eiffel Tower 2nd Floor with Priority Access (SIC) Mt Titlis Excursion (in conjunction with Swiss Pass) Jungfraujoch Excursion (in conjunction with Swiss Pass) Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: IMPORTANT NOTES: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TERMS AND CONDITIONS: Travel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 September 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'London Paris And Swiss' package is a 9-day tour covering London, Paris, and the scenic regions of Central and Southern Switzerland. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the Eiffel Tower, Buckingham Palace, Big Ben, and the breathtaking Swiss Alps. Participants will enjoy guided city sightseeing tours, a scenic cruise along the River Seine, and memorable mountain excursions in Switzerland.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive London\n\xa0\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at the airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle.\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 14:00 - 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ibis London Earls Court (Standard) / Park Plaza London (Value) or similar in London'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nHop On Hop Off Tour - Madame Tussauds - London Eye - Tower Of London\n\xa0\nHop on Hop Off Tour: The London Hop-On Hop-Off Bus Tour is a flexible sightseeing experience that lets you explore the city’s most iconic landmarks at your own pace with multiple routes and stops near attractions.\n\xa0\nMadame Tussauds With Marvel 4d Cinema and Star Wars Experience: Step into the world of fame and fantasy at Madame Tussauds London. Get up close with lifelike wax figures of celebrities, historical icons, and world leaders. Enjoy the thrilling Marvel 4D Cinema, where superheroes come alive in an immersive experience, and explore the Star Wars Experience, featuring iconic characters and scenes from the legendary saga. It’s an unforgettable mix of glamour, action, and adventure for all ages.\n\xa0\nLondon Eye – Ticket: The London Eye is one of the city’s most iconic attractions, offering breathtaking 360° views of London’s skyline from a giant observation wheel on the South Bank of the River Thames. Standing at 135 meters tall, it provides a unique perspective of landmarks like Big Ben, Buckingham Palace, and St. Paul’s Cathedral. A must-visit for stunning photo opportunities and an unforgettable experience.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Ibis London Earls Court (Standard) / Park Plaza London (Value) or similar in London'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nLondon To Paris Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\n\n\xa0Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Paris.\nUpon your arrival at Paris train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\n\xa0\nMoulin Rouge Show (Optional): Experience the world-famous Moulin Rouge in Paris, an iconic cabaret known for its dazzling performances, vibrant costumes, and spectacular dance routines, including the legendary French Cancan. Located in the heart of Montmartre, this unforgettable show combines music, glamour, and artistry, offering a true taste of Parisian nightlife.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Opera Lafayette (Standard) / Mercure Paris Opéra Faubourg Montmartre (Value) or similar in Paris'}, {'day': 4, 'description': "\xa0\nParis City Tour + River Seine Cruise + Eiffel Tower Tour\n\xa0\nParis City Tour: Later discover Paris's most famous tourist sites and monuments on one unique tour. This tour features a visit to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower with breathtaking views of the capital, a panoramic city tour by coach, plus an hour-long boat trip along the River Seine. This comprehensive tour is the ideal way to discover Paris for the first time.\xa0\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Thanks to your priority access, you can skip the line and speed up by elevator to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower, Paris's most unmissable monument.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Opera Lafayette (Standard) / Mercure Paris Opéra Faubourg Montmartre (Value) or similar in Paris'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nParis To Central Switzerland Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Central Switzerland.\xa0\nUpon your arrival in Central Switzerland, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\n\xa0\nLucerne Tour with Swiss Pass on your own (Optional): Travel to Lucerne with Swiss pass on your own as there are many sights in a small area in Lucerne like Chapel Bridge with the Water Tower which is the landmark of Lucerne and the most photographed monument in Switzerland.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel La Pergola (Standard) / Campus Hertenstein (Value) or similar in Central / Southern Switzerland\xa0'}, {'day': 6, 'description': "\xa0\nMt. Titlis Excursion\n\xa0\nMt. Titlis Excursion: Don't miss the spectacular beauty of Mt Titlis! Discover eternal glaciers and other attractions from more than 3020m / 10000 ft high. Enjoy the spectacular sight of the glacier's deep crevasses and gigantic ice boulders from the revolving cable car ROTAIR. At the top of Mt. Titlis (10'000 ft. above sea level), a high alpine panorama awaits you. Visit the Ice Grotto or take a ride with the chairlift IceFlyer, which brings you close to the crevasses. Enjoy also the FunLift in the snow and the Cliff Walk, Europe's highest suspension bridge. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass)\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel La Pergola (Standard) / Campus Hertenstein (Value) or similar in Central / Southern Switzerland\xa0'}, {'day': 7, 'description': "\xa0\nJungfraujoch Excursion\n\xa0\nJungfraujoch Excursion: Don't miss the highlight of any Swiss holiday and go for this thrilling and unforgettable excursion to Jungfraujoch, Top of Europe! From Interlaken, the heart of the Jungfrau region mountain world and uniquely situated between two lakes, you make your way to famous mountain resort Grindelwald where you board the cogwheel train for a spectacular ride via Kleine Scheidegg to Jungfraujoch. Enjoy stunning views of the world-famous triple peaks of Eiger, Monch and Jungfrau accompany you all the way to the top. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass)\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel La Pergola (Standard) / Campus Hertenstein (Value) or similar in Central / Southern Switzerland\xa0'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nCentral Switzerland Day At Leisure (Optional Activity)\n\xa0\nGlacier 3000 (Optional): Escape to the high Alps to breath a fresh air and spectacular mountain vistas on the Glacier 3000 (Optional Mountain Excursion). Glacier 3000, located at the highest point of the Vaudois Alps, is open all year round for winter activities for all! With its stunning views and wide range of activities on offer – including the Peak Walk, a unique suspension bridge linking two mountain peaks – Glacier 3000 is a must for your holidays in Switzerland.\n\xa0\nBollywood Tour (Optional): Gstaad region is known as one of the most scenic natural film sets in the world. Many Bollywood blockbusters have been filmed here, such as DDLJ “Bachana Ae Haseenno” and many more. Lunch can be included on this tour.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel La Pergola (Standard) / Campus Hertenstein (Value) or similar in Central / Southern Switzerland\xa0'}, {'day': 9, 'description': 'Depart Lucerne\nTransfers: Make your way to Lucerne Train station and with the help of the sector ticket head to the Zurich airport for flight back home.\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n\n\nPark Plaza London / Park International / Copthorne Tara London Kensington / Holiday Inn® London Kensington / Mercure London Paddington or similar\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nMercure Paris Opéra Faubourg Montmartre / Novotel Paris Center Eiffel Tower / Novo