 at an Indian restaurant.\nDrive towards Ankara the capital city of Turkey. Driving time is approx 6 hours.\nDinner at a Local restaurant / at hotel. Overnight in Ankara.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Local Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel New Park or similar in\xa0Ankara'}, {'day': 4, 'description': "\xa0\n\xa0\nPanoramic Tour of Ankara – Proceed to the magical fairytale land of Cappadocia\nAfter breakfast at the hotel check out and enjoy a quick panoramic city tour of Ankara. Photostop at the Mausoleum of Ataturk (Anitkabir). Next, we proceed towards Cappadocia. Arrive at Cappadocia and enjoy Indian Lunch at Indian restaurant. Driving time is approx 3 hours.\nTime permitting, check in at your hotel. Next enjoy Cardak Underground City, one of Cappadocia's many hidden wonders, offers a glimpse into the past. Carved into volcanic rock, this multi-level city served as a refuge for early Christians. You can explore its intricate tunnels, ventilation shafts, and ingenious design. Indian Dinner at an Indian restaurant.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Barcello or similar in\xa0Cappadocia'}, {'day': 5, 'description': "\xa0\n\xa0\nFull day tour of Cappadocia\nOPTIONAL – HOT AIR BALLOON EXPERIENCE IN CAPPADOCIA - Soaring above Cappadocia in a hot air balloon is an unforgettable experience. As you drift over the unique fairy chimneys and valleys, you'll witness breathtaking sunrises and panoramic views of this otherworldly landscape. It's a truly magical way to explore this ancient region.\n\xa0\nNOTE – The rates for Hot Air Balloon fluctuate a lot due to demand and supply pressures locally. Kindly check all prices before you confirm the Hot Air Balloon ride with us. This activity is heavily weather dependent.\n\xa0\nOptional: Hot Air Balloon (01 April 2026 - 30 September 2026) USD ----- per person\n\xa0\nPost breakfast at the hotel we start the day by visiting Goreme open-air museum, a UNESCO heritage site. Next, we vi