rt Transfer from Venice City Center to Marco Polo VCE Airport (Water Taxi + Car) Train Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed] 2nd Class Train Ticket cost from Rome to Naples 2nd Class Train Ticket cost from Naples to Florence 2nd Class Train Ticket cost from Florence to Venice Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) Hop On Hop Off Bus tour in Rome Pisa and the Leaning Tower Tour from Florence Venice Gondola Ride (30 Mins) and Serenade Murano, Burano and Torcello Half-Day Sightseeing Tour Milan City Sightseeing Hop on Hop Off (24 Hrs) Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Notes: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability. Terms & Conditions: Travel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 September 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: Free upgrade to 1st class Train sector tickets.', 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Amritsar', 'cityCode': 'ATQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Udaipur', 'cityCode': 'UDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Italian Charm With Southern Coast (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)' package is a 9-day tour covering Florence, Venice, Amalfi, and Rome. The itinerary features a seamless journey through these iconic Italian destinations, with key highlights including a complimentary upgrade to first-class train sector tickets for travel between the cities.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Italy\n\xa0\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at the Fiumicino Leonardo Da Vinci (FCO) airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle.\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Andreotti and Domus Australia (Standard) / Best Western Artdeco (Value) or similar in Rome'}, {'day': 2, 'description': "\xa0\nHop On Hop Off Tour\nHop on Hop Off Tour: Discover Rome's iconic sights and landmarks on a hop on hop off bus tour, offering a comprehensive overview of all the city’s highlights. Disembark at any of the multiple stops to see popular landmarks such as the Vatican City, Circus Maximus, the Pantheon, or the Colosseum. While on board the bus, listen to recorded commentary in multiple languages that details the history, architecture, culture, and traditions of the Eternal City.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Andreotti and Domus Australia (Standard) / Best Western Artdeco (Value) or similar in Rome'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nRome To Naples Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Naples. (Duration approx. 1.5 hrs.)\nUpon your arrival at Naples train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\xa0\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Fontana (Standard) / La Bussola (Value) or similar in Amalfi / Sorrento'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nSouthern Coast - Day At Leisure\nCattedrale di Sant’Andrea Tour (Optional): The Cattedrale di SantAndrea, perched above Amalfis main square, is a stunning 9th century cathedral dedicated to Saint Andrew. The tour begins with the dramatic climb up its grand staircase, leading to a striking façade adorned with colorful mosaics and neo Moorish details. Inside, you’ll explore a rich blend of Romanesque, Gothic, Baroque, and Arab Norman architecture. Highlights include the Cloister of Paradise with its elegant columns, the Basilica of the Crucifix housing sacred art, and the crypt where Saint Andrew’s relics rest. This experience offers history, art, and breathtaking views, making it a must see on the Amalfi Coast.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Fontana (Standard) / La Bussola (Value) or similar in Amalfi / Sorrento'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nNaples To Florence Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nPrivate transfer from Amalfi/Sorrento hotel to Naples train station for your onwards journey to Florence (Duration approx. 3 hrs.)\nUpon your arrival at Florence train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\xa0\nFlorence with Uffizi Gallery (Optional): Depending on the train timing, you can opt for 14:15 hrs Visit of Florence with Uffizi Gallery - Afternoon slot. "You depart by coach for a brief excursion to Fiesole, a delightful town of Etruscan origin, positioned on the hill that dominates Florence and the Arno Valley. The tour continues to the historic centre for a visit to the Church of Santa Croce (outside view). A short walk through the historical streets in the heart of Florence brings you to the famous Piazza della Signoria, where you can admire the imposing Palazzo Vecchio (exterior) and the beautiful Loggia dei Lanzi. The tour will then take you to the famous Uffizi Gallery where it is possible to admire the superb paintings of the Botticelli, Michelangelo, Leonardo da Vinci, Raffaello, Giotto, Cimabue and Masaccio.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast\xa0', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Albergo Firenze (Standard) / Atlantic Palace (Value) or similar in Florence'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nPisa And The Leaning Tower Tour\nTransfers: You will have a transfer from Florence to Pisa and back to Florence.\nPisa and the Leaning Tower Tour: This popular half day trip takes you from Florence through the scenic Tuscan countryside to the historic city of Pisa. The tour focuses on Piazza dei Miracoli, a UNESCO World Heritage site, where you’ll see the Leaning Tower, the Cathedral, the Baptistery, and the Monumental Cemetery.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Albergo Firenze (Standard) / Atlantic Palace (Value) or similar in Florence'}, {'day': 7, 'description': "\xa0\nFlorence To Venice Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Venice. (Duration approx. 2.5 hrs.)\nUpon your arrival at Venice train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nGondola Ride: Experience Venice in the most Venetian way possible: via a shared gondola ride while being serenaded. Choose between an afternoon or evening ride and then begin the ride, as part of a group of eight different gondolas, with a singer aboard one of the boats. In addition to the song being sun to you, enjoy the sites of Venice's main landmarks, including the grand Canal and Palazzo Barberino.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Diana (Standard) / Royal San Marco (Value) or similar in Venice\xa0'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nMurano, Burano And Torcello Half-Day Tour\n\xa0\nMurano, Burano and Torcello Half Day Sightseeing Tour: Today visit Torcello, Murano, and Burano - three islands in the Venetian Lagoon - on this tour from Venice by motorboat. With a guide, watch glass being blown at a Murano glass factory, see historical cathedrals on Torcello, and admire exquisite handmade lace on Burano. This is a great way to see more than just the central sights of Venice and enjoy a cruise on the water.\nHighlights:\xa0\n\nVisit the three most famous islands in the Venetian Lagoon by motorboat\xa0\nWatch master glass blowers at work at a factory on Murano\xa0\nSee Byzantine churches on Torcello - the Church of Santa Fosca\xa0\nBrowse for lace on Burano and admire the painted houses\n\n\xa0\nMcArthurGlen Designer Outlet (Optional):\xa0 Later you can opt to visit the McArthurGlen Designer Outlet in Noventa di Piave is the most prestigious shopping outlet in Veneto, where you can find the most prestigious fashion with discounts up to 70% all around the year. Located just 30 minutes by car from Venice. Over 100 shops, restaurants, bars, lounges, play areas for children, located in a beautiful setting with architectural mosaics and frescoes inspired by the palaces in Venice and Treviso, where you can satisfy your thirst for great fashion, taking advantage of the offers and services designed specifically to make time spent here unforgettable.\n\xa0', 'me