l 31st October 2026.\nBlack out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ.\nTCS & GST would be levied as applicable\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nMaximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs , conventions , and major congresses\nSurcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking.\nTo proceed with the booking you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour.\nShould the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014698/9686_Paris_HoneyMoon.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014698/itinerary/753_SeineRiverCruise.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014698/itinerary/52478_Eiffel_tower_Seine_river_Paris_France_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014698/itinerary/EurostarTrainParistoLondon834761.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014698/itinerary/Chantilly_the_palace.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014698/itinerary/Chantilly.png', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014698/itinerary/Rivercruisesceine.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014718', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014718', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Ideal Iceland', 'days': 6, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014718_0_20260916142531', 'price': 99849, 'packageSummary': "The 'Ideal Iceland' package is a 6-day tour centered in the captivating city of Reykjavik. The itinerary includes exploring the breathtaking Golden Circle, witnessing the spectacular Gullfoss waterfall, and visiting the active Geysir geothermal area. Participants will enjoy relaxing in the soothing waters of the Blue Lagoon, embarking on an exciting whale watching excursion, and taking a guided sightseeing tour of Reykjavik's iconic landmarks like the Hallgrímskirkja church.", 'images': ['03286_reykjavik_Iceland_753.jpg', 'Reykjavik.jpg', 'Gullfoss_waterfall.jpg', 'Skogafoss_1.jpg', '8894627_Reykjavik_Iceland_753.jpg', 'Reykjavik-1.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 99849, 'thumbnailImage': 'ICELAND_SRP.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014718 is named 'Ideal Iceland' and spans 6 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Reykjavik, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive In Reykjavik Transfer: Arrival in Keflavik Airport (KEF), you will be met by the representative and have a private transfer to the hotel. Special Note: Hotel check-in will be as per the property’s standard check-in timings or at the sole discretion of the hotel. Early check-in requests are subject to availability and may incur additional charges. Rest of the day is free. Dinner on your own. Optional Activity: “FlyOver Iceland Admission Ticket” Soar over Iceland’s stunning landscapes on FlyOver Iceland, a 30 minute immersive flying ride experience with real aerial footage, a pre show, and local Icelandic refreshments. [Supplement cost for Per Adult would be approx. € 45/- & or € 25/- Per Child ], GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Reykjavik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Reykjavik Walking Tour - With a Viking Or Small Group Reykjavik Highlights Walking Tour: Meet the guide at Ingolfur Square and explore Reykjavik’s historic heart. Visit landmarks like Hallgrimskirkja, Harpa Concert Hall, and the Old Harbour, along with hidden gems such as Iceland’s oldest house and Elf stones. Enjoy stories of Vikings, local culture, and insider tips for the best spots to eat and explore. Optional Activity: “Classic Puffin Watching Cruise” [Subject to favorable weather] Depart from Reykjavík’s Old Harbour for a one hour cruise to the puffin islands, where you can observe Iceland’s summer puffins up close from the boat. The journey also showcases Reykjavík’s landmarks, including Harpa and Hallgrímskirkja. [1000 AM / 12 Noon Activity for approx. 60 - 90 mins at a supplement cost of € 55/- Per Adult & € 28/- Per Child] OR Optional Activity: “Lava Show Reykjavik Admission Ticket” Experience the only live LAVA SHOW in the world! We recreate a volcano eruption by superheating real lava and pouring it into a showroom full of people. A one-of-a-kind experience! Admission Ticket Included [Tour Activity for approx. 50 - 70 mins at a supplement cost of € 55/- Per Adult. This activity is not recommended for Children below 13 years] Special Note for above activity: Please make sure you answer all the mandatory questions during the booking process, otherwise we cannot guarantee the correct provision of the service., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Reykjavik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Reykjavik Free Day Optional Activity: “Small-group Golden Circle Classic Tour” Discover Iceland’s iconic Golden Circle on a small group tour featuring the powerful Gullfoss Waterfall, erupting Strokkur geyser, and historic Þingvellir National Park. Enjoy scenic stops, including Kerið volcanic crater, with time to explore each landmark comfortably. [Full Day Activity for approx. 8 hrs at a supplement cost of EUR 115 Per Adult & EUR 55 Per Child] Special Note for above activity: Due to weather and road conditions we cannot guarantee visits to Nesjavellir in the winter season. Please make sure you answer all the mandatory questions during the booking process. Kindly note that excursions may be subject to change or not available during adverse weather conditions. OR Optional Activity: “Reykjavík - Blue Lagoon - Comfort (*Entrance only - No Transfers included)” Relax in the warm, mineral-rich waters of Iceland’s iconic Blue Lagoon, surrounded by stunning lava fields. Enjoy silica mud masks, state-of-the-art facilities, and a drink of your choice before returning to Reykjavik. [Multiple Slot Options for approx. 4 hrs at a supplement cost of EUR 210 Per Adult & Per Child will be “On Request Basis”], GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Reykjavik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: South Coast Full Day Small-Group Tour Journey along Iceland’s stunning South Coast to visit Skogafoss and Seljalandsfoss waterfalls, the Solheimajokull glacier, and the dramatic black sands of Reynisfjara Beach. Enjoy breathtaking views, rich history, and a photo stop in the charming village of Vik before returning to Reykjavik., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Reykjavik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Reykjavik Free Day Special Note: No activity or sightseeing planned for this day. You would be on your own. Optional activities to choose from Optional Activity: “Red Lava Horse Riding Tour” Enjoy a 2.5 hour horseback riding adventure through the scenic Heiðmörk Nature Reserve, exploring lava hills, volcanic landscapes, and forested trails. Suitable for both beginners and experienced riders, the tour includes gear, small group guidance, and friendly Icelandic horses. [Supplement cost of EUR 145 Per Adult & EUR 65 Per Child - Note: Max weight 110 kgs] OR Optional Activity: “Whale Watching & Dolphin Yacht Cruise” [Subject to weather permitting] Set sail from Reykjavík’s Old Harbour on a scenic 3 hour cruise across Faxaflói Bay, watching for whales, dolphins, and summer puffins. Enjoy panoramic views of the coastline and city landmarks, with expert wildlife commentary and cozy blankets onboard. [Supplement cost of EUR 105 Per Adult & EUR 55 Per Child], GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Reykjavik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Reykjavik Transfer: 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight you will have a private transfer to Keflavik Airport (KEF) Airport. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 99849.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nReykjavik (5N)\n\n\nHotel Reykjavik Saga /\xa0 Fosshotel Baron / Reykjavik Lights / Fosshotel Lind or similar in Reykjavik\n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4*\n\n\n\n\nReykjavik (5N)\n\n\nGrand Hotel Reykjavik / Fosshotel Reykjavik / Hotel Odinsve / Hotel Reykjavik Centrum / Icelandair Hotel Reykjavik Marina or similar in Reykjavik\n\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation: 5 Nights’ accommodation in Reykjavik based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: [Service will be on Point to Point Basis Only] Return Airport transfers in Reykjavik on private basis Sightseeing: [Tour will commence from a designated point, no transfers, unless specified] Reykjavik Walking Tour - Walk with a Viking or Small Group on shared basis Iceland South Coast Full Day Small-Group Tour from Reykjavik (SIC basis) Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR10 per person per day is not included City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Notes: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost. Terms and conditions: Travel Validity: As per dates specified (*01 December 2025 - 31 March 2026) Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. TCS & GST would be levied as applicable The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Allahabad', 'cityCode': 'IXD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', 'cityCode': 'STV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'ho