quired to pay additional charges. Entrance fees Flame temple, Fire Mountain, Gobustan, Mud Volcano, Cable Car (2 Lines). Entrance fees Cable Car in Tbilisi, KTW Wine Tasting, 4x4 jeep to Gergeti, Diamond bridge 2 half a litre bottles of water per person per day. Meals, transfers, entrances, sightseeing, and surface transport as mentioned in the itinerary.. Exclusions: The cost of deviation, if you want to deviate from the group departure dates mentioned in the brochure. City Tax or Tourism Tax Visa charges for NRI passengers (If applicable) Cruise Gratuity (applicable for cruise holidays) Cost of deviation will be advised on confirmation of the deviation date in case you want to deviate from the group departure dates mentioned in the brochure. The tour cost does not include POE charges, porterage, or passport charges. Cost of Basic Travel Quota equivalent to USD 10,000. Govt Taxes & Service taxes as applicable. The cost of airfare included in the above tour cost is based on the fare structure as of 1st August 2025. Any further increase in the airfare due to an increase in the fuel price, change in Government regulations, taxes, etc., charged by the airline will have to be borne by the passengers and the company will not be held responsible for the same. Any increase in the rate of exchange leads to an increase in surface transportation and land arrangements which may come into effect prior to departure. The tour price is subject to increase without notice if this rate of exchange changes substantially prior to departure. Any expenses of personal nature such as laundry, wines, mineral water, food and drink are not in the regular menus provided by us. Tips for guides, hotel waiters, drivers, etc. Meals other than what is mentioned in the itinerary. Cost of excursions, city sightseeing, entrance fees and local guides availed of by the passengers other than those included in your itinerary. Product Terms and Conditions: Note : The above prices will not be valid for any 