rs - 09 Nights / 10 Days' package is a 10-day private van tour covering Baku, Gabala, Tbilisi, Sighnaghi, Kakheti, Mtskheta, Gudauri, and Kazbegi. This exclusive and personalized itinerary offers travelers the chance to explore the historic Inner City of Baku, the Ateshgah Fire Temple, Yanardag, and the scenic Tufandag Ski Resort in Gabala. In Georgia, participants will enjoy exploring the ancient wine-making region of Kakheti, taking a cable car ride to Tbilisi's Narikala Fortress, and visiting the historic town of Mtskheta and the spectacular Dashbashi Canyon with its Diamond Bridge. The tour also features a scenic mountain drive past the Ananuri Fortress to Gudauri and the Holy Trinity Church in Kazbegi, all hosted by English-speaking drivers and guides.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '.', 'mealDescription': '.', 'overnightStay': '.'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '.', 'mealDescription': '.', 'overnightStay': '.'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '.', 'mealDescription': '.', 'overnightStay': '.'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '.', 'mealDescription': '.', 'overnightStay': '.'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n.', 'mealDescription': '.', 'overnightStay': '.'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '.', 'mealDescription': '.', 'overnightStay': '.'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '.', 'mealDescription': '.', 'overnightStay': '.'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '.', 'mealDescription': '.', 'overnightStay': '.'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '.', 'mealDescription': '.', 'overnightStay': '.'}, {'day': 10, 'description': '.', 'mealDescription': '.', 'overnightStay': '.'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\nCity\nAccomodation - 5*\n\n\nBaku\nBaku Marriott Hotel Boulevard OR Similar\xa0\n\n\nShahdag\xa0\nShahdag Resort or Similar\n\n\n', '\n\n\nCity\nAccomodation - 4*\n\n\nBaku\nWyndham Baku\xa0or similar\n\n\nShahdag\xa0\nShahdag Resort or Similar\n\n\n', '\n\n\nCity\nAccomodation - 3*\n\n\nBaku\nDiamond Hotel or Similar\n\n\nShahdag\xa0\nShahdag Resort or Similar\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'2': '\n\n\nCity\nAc