''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Nagpur', 'cityCode': 'NAG', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', 'cityCode': 'STV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kannur', 'cityCode': 'CNN', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Aurangabad', 'cityCode': 'IXU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Iceland Highlights' package is a 7-day tour covering the stunning destinations of Reykjavik, Vik, and Borgarnes. The itinerary includes visits to iconic natural wonders such as the famous Golden Circle, the dramatic black sand beaches of Reynisfjara, and the majestic Seljalandsfoss and Skogafoss waterfalls. Participants will enjoy guided sightseeing tours of the vibrant capital, relaxing dips in geothermal hot springs, and scenic explorations of the volcanic landscapes and historic valleys of Borgarnes.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Reykjavik\nTransfers: Upon arrival in Keflavik Airport, you will meet the representative and get transferred to the hotel on private basis.\n\xa0\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Klettur or similar'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nReykjavik – Vik\nTransfers: Today you will travel from Reykjavik to Vik on private basis.\nSouth Coast tour: Stops include Seljalandsfoss and Skogafoss waterfalls - Seljalandsfoss fed by Eyjafjallajokull, Skogafoss marking the start of the Fimmvorauhals trek. You also see Reynisfjara’s reshaped coast and the blue ice of Solheimajokull glacier.\nSpecial Note:\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Reykjavik downtown has restrictions for bigger vehicles. For pick ups and drop offs, the nearest authorised stops near the hotel will be used if the hotel is located in the downtown area.\n2.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Sightseeing will be conducted on Private basis.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Eyjafjallajokull or similar'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nVik - Icebergs & Glaciers\nTowards Icebergs & glaciers: Drive across Myrdalssandur floodplains and Eldhraun lavafield to Kirkjubaejarklaustur. Visit Skaftafell National Park, shaped by ice and fire, then explore Jokulsarlon Glacier Lagoon and Diamond Beach. Enjoy an amphibian boat ride among floating icebergs. (Amphibian boat ride is valid only till 01 November’26)\nOR\xa0\nIce Cave Tour from Jokulsarlon Glacier Lagoon - Explore a stunning natural ice cave hidden within Vatnajökull glacier, famous for its shimmering blue ice formations. Departing from Jokulsarlon, this guided adventure takes you deep into Iceland’s frozen heart for a truly unforgettable experience.\xa0 (Optional Tour @ Supplement of € 130/- Per Person) {Operational all year around}\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\xa0\n1. Sightseeing will be conducted on Private basis', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Eyjafjallajokull or similar'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nVik - Borgarnes\nTransfers: Today you will travel from Vik to Borgarnes on Private basis.\nGolden circle tour: Visit three iconic sights: Pingvellir National Park, the Geysir geothermal area - home to the highly active Strokkur - and Gullfoss waterfall, where massive volumes of water plunge into a dramatic, winding gorge.\nSpecial Note:\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Sightseeing will be conducted on Private basis.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast\n\xa0\n\xa0', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Borgarnes or similar'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nBorgarnes\nWest Iceland tour: Explore\xa0Snaefellsnes peninsula, a mini Iceland with black beaches, Mountains, volcanic craters, cliffs, birdlife, caves, and glaciers. Visit Arnarstapi, see Kirkjufell, Djupalonssandur bay, and the iconic Saefellsjokull glacier.\nSpecial Note:\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Sightseeing will be conducted on Private basis.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Borgarnes or similar'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nBorgarnes - Reykjavik\nTransfers: Today you will travel from Borgarnes along the shores of Hvalfjooour Fjord towards Reykjavik.\nBlue lagoon: Enjoy a classic Icelandic spa experience at the Blue Lagoon or Sky Lagoon. Soak in mineral rich geothermal waters amid dramatic scenery, from Reykjanes lava fields to an ocean edge infinity pool near Reykjavik. [Please note that this activity\xa0 operates as a shared experience alongside other participants]\nSpecial Note: Entrance to Blue Lagoon or Sky Lagoon will be on shared basis inclusive of other guests.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Klettur or similar'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart\nTransfers: From Reykjavik hotel to the Keflavik Airport in private transfer.\nSpecial Note: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\xa0\nHotel Details :\n\xa0\n\n\n\nCity\nHotel Name\n\n\nReykjavik\xa0(2N)\nGrand Hotel Reykjavík or Similar\n\n\nBorgarnes\xa0(2N)\n\xa0Hotel Vesturland or Similar\n\n\nSelfoss\xa0(1N)\nHotel\xa0Selfoss\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0', '\n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nStandard Category\n\n\n\n\nReykjavik\n\n\nHotel Klettur or similar\n\n\n\n\nVik\n\n\nHotel Eyjafjallajokull or similar\n\n\n\n\nBorgarnes\n\n\nHótel Borgarnes or similar\n\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'1': '\xa0\nHotel Details :\n\xa0\n\n\n\nCity\nHotel Name\n\n\nReykjavik\xa0(2N)\nGrand Hotel Reykjavík or Similar\n\n\nBorgarnes\xa0(2N)\n\xa0Hotel Vesturland or Similar\n\n\nSelfoss\xa0(1N)\nHotel\xa0Selfoss\xa0or similar\n\n\n\n\xa0\n\xa0', '0': '\n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nStandard Category\n\n\n\n\nReykjavik\n\n\nHotel Klettur or similar\n\n\n\n\nVik\n\n\nHotel Eyjafjallajokull or similar\n\n\n\n\nBorgarnes\n\n\nHótel Borgarnes or similar\n\n\n\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'IS', 'countryName': 'Iceland', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'price': 631600.0, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nCities\n\n\nStandard Category\n\n\n\n\nReykjavik\n\n\nHotel Klettur or similar\n\n\n\n\nVik\n\n\nHotel Eyjafjallajokull or similar\n\n\n\n\nBorgarnes\n\n\nHótel Borgarnes or similar\n\n\n\n']}], 'meals': ['\nDaily Breakfast Except Day 1\n', '\nBreakfast daily and up to half of your evening meals\n'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['\nTransportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis]\nPrivate airport transfer upon arrival at KEF Airport\xa0\nPrivate airport transfer upon departure from KEF Airport\n', 'As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['Sightseeing: (Sightseeing on private basis as per slab booked)\n\nSouth Coast tour on shared basis\xa0\nTowards Icebergs & glaciers tour on shared basis\nJokulsarlon glacial amphibian boat tour\nGolden circle tour on shared basis (SIC - Tour)\nWest Iceland tour on shared basis (SIC - Tour)\nEntrance to Sky lagoon *(Comfort Entrance Tickets)\n', "\nDiscover Reykjavík\nVisit Akranes Folk Museum, the 'Golden Circle' - Gullfoss Waterfall, Geysir Hot Spring Area and Thingvellir National Park and the geothermal Blue Lagoon\nView Harpa Concert Hall, Austurvöllur Square, Hallgrímskirkja Church, Waterfalls at Hraunfoss and Barnafoss, Deildartunguhver Hot Spring, Snæfellsnes Peninsula, Sellfoss and Reykjanes Peninsula\nSee Hvalfjörður (Whale Bay), Grundarfjörður Fishing Village, Lake Kleifarvatn and Krýsuvík\n"], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': '<p>Return Economy Class Airfare</p>', 'inclusions': 'Accommodation:\n\n2 Nights’ Split accommodation in Reykjavik based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Night accommodation in Vik area based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Night accommodation in Borgarnes based on the hotel category selected or similar\n\nMeals:\n\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n\nTransportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis]\n\nPrivate airport transfer upon arrival at KEF Airport\xa0\nPrivate airport transfer upon departure from KEF Airport\n\nSightseeing: (Sightseeing on private basis as per slab booked)\n\nSouth Coast tour on shared basis\xa0\nTowards Icebergs & glaciers tour on shared basis\nGolden circle tour on shared basis (SIC - Tour)\nWest Iceland tour on shared basis (SIC - Tour)\nEntrance to Sky lagoon *(Comfort Entrance Tickets)\nJokulsarlon glacial amphibian boat tour\n\nInsurance:\n\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price.\nCity taxes / Resort Fees - To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nCost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.Blackout Period: 15th December 2026 - 10th January 2027\n\n\n\n\n\nOptioanl Activities\n\n\n\n\nTour Name\n\n\nPer Person Price In Euro\n\n\n\n\nEasy Glacier Hike\n\n\n110\n\n\n\n\nLava Tunnel Tour\n\n\n75\n\n\n\n\nIce Cave Tour\n\n\n130\n\n\n\n', 'termsAndConditions': 'Note: Costing given is subject to change and availability', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014957/Lights.bmp', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014957/itinerary/Reykjavik1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014957/itinerary/VIK_NEW.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014957/itinerary/VIK.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014957/itinerary/borgarnes11.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014957/itinerary/Reykjavik-1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014957/itinerary/Blulagoon.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014957/itinerary/Gullfoss.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014849', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014849', 'availableMonths': ['october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Amazing Albania  (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)', 'days': 8, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Tirana', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Tirana', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Shkoder', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Berat', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Vlore', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Sarande', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Tirana', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Tirana', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': None, 'price': 123565, 'packageSummary': "The 'Amazing Albania (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)' package is an 8-day tour covering the scenic and historic cities of Sarande, Tirana, Berat, Shkoder, and Vlore. Throughout this festive journey, participants will immerse themselves in Albania's rich heritage and stunning landscapes through key highlights that include exploring ancient castles, visiting UNESCO World Heritage sites, wandering through vibrant local bazaars, and enjoying scenic coastal drives along the Albanian Riviera.", 'images': ['Tirana_n.jpg', 'TiranaClockTower.jpg', 'Shkoderjp.jpg', 'Beratjpp.jpg', 'Vlore.jpg', 'Sarande.jpg', 'TIRANAKOTOR.jpg', 'Tirana_D.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 123565, 'thumbnailImage': 'Dubrovnik_srp.png', 'packageTheme': ['Globus Escape', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014849 is named 'Amazing Albania  (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)' and spans 8 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Tirana, Meals: NA, Description: Arrive Tirana Transfers: Upon your arrival at Tirana International Airport, you will be transferred to the hotel on private basis. Special Note: 1. Welcome to Tirana, the vibrant capital of Albania, is a lively mix of colorful architecture, rich history, and modern culture. Surrounded by mountains, it offers bustling cafés, fascinating museums, and easy access to nature, making it a charming and energetic destination for travelers. 2. Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Tirana, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Tirana - Kruje - Tirana Visit to Kruja & Tirana City Tour: Today visit a historic town central to Albania’s resistance against the Ottomans, exploring Skanderbeg Castle, the museum, and the old bazaar, before continuing to Tirana for a guided city tour of Albania’s vibrant capital. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only. Optional Sightseeing: Albanian Night - Dinner with Folk Show @ EUR 85/- Per Adult & Child Enjoy an authentic Albanian evening with a traditional folk show and a 7 course local dinner. The experience includes one drink (glass of wine or raki, or a local beer) and duration of 2 hours., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Shkoder, Meals: Breakfast & Lunch at worldwide famous restaurant Mrizi i Zanava, Description: Tirana - Lezhe - Shkoder Transfers: Today travel from Tirana to Lezhe & from Lezhe to Shkoder by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 1 hour) Lezha City Tour: Visit to its top hill castle where you enjoy the fascinating panorama of the Adriatic Riviera and bronze age ancient city walls, and visit the Mausoleum of Skanderbeg (Albanian National Hero). City tour of Shkodra: This Tour includes, Old Bazaar, Centrum, Cathedral and Mosque. Visit the Castle of Rozafa and we will enjoy wonderful views of mountains (Albanian Alps), Shkodra’s lake (the biggest in the Balkans), Drini, Buna and Kir rivers with the valleys around from the top of Rozafa castle., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Berat, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Shkoder - Durres - Berat (Unesco) Transfers: This morning travel from Shkoder to Durres & Durres to Berat by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 2 hours. Enroute Sightseeing) Enroute Sightseeing of Durres: Discover Durres, one of the Mediterranean’s oldest cities, visiting the Balkan’s largest Roman amphitheater, ancient walls, and Byzantine relics. Berat City Tour: Continue to Berat, a UNESCO World Heritage city, Visit the castle of Berat with the Onufri museum and other churches inside; the Mosque of Berat and the old Bridge of Gorica, Onufri Museum and several churches and mosques. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Vlore, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Ardenica Monastery - Apollonia (Unesco) - Vlore Transfers: Today travel from Berat - Vlore by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 2 hours). Enroute Sightseeing. Enroute Sightseeing of Ardenica Monastery: It is a 13th century Byzantine site famed for hosting Skanderbeg’s wedding, then explore the ancient atmospheric ruins of Apollonia. Vlore City Tour: Visit the city, including its old town, independence square and monument, where Albanian independence from the Ottomans was proclaimed on November 28th, 1912. Optional Activity: Dinner with Sea Food Experience in Vlore @ EUR 40/- Per Adult & Child Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Sarande, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Vlore - Himare - Ksamil - Butrint (Unesco) - Saranda Transfers: Today travel from Vlore to Saranda by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 3 hours). Enroute Sightseeing. Enroute Sightseeing of Vlora & Saranda: Travel south through spectacular coastal scenery along Vlora Bay and the Ionian Riviera, stopping in Ksamil/Saranda for lunch and time by the crystal clear sea. Butrint City Tour: Visit Butrint, Albania’s most important UNESCO archaeological site, explore numerous buildings including an acropolis, basilica and palace. The location of the site itself is also very attractive, surrounded by trees and water. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Tirana, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Saranda - Mesopotam - Blue Eye - Gjirokaster (Unesco) - Tirana Transfers: Today travel from Saranda to Tirana by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 4 hours). Enroute Sightseeing. Enroute Sightseeing of Mesopotam monastery & Blue Eye National Park: Travel to Gjirokaster, stopping at Mesopotam Monastery, built over the ancient temple inside the fortress. Later travel to the Blue Eye National Park. Gjirokaster City Tour: Explore this UNESCO listed Stone City, with its cobbled bazaar, distinctive stone houses, and the Gjirokaster Castle and Weapons Museum, before continuing to Tirana for leisure time. Special Note: 1. Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Tirana, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Transfers: You will have a private transfer from Tirana hotel to Tirana International Airport. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 123565.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\nCity\n\xa0No Of Nts\n\xa0Hotel Name\n\n\nTirana\xa0\n\xa03 Nts\nAlbanopolis Hotel or similar\n\n\nShkoder\n\xa01Nts\nTradita G & Tosk Hotel or similar\n\n\nBerat\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHotel Republika or similar\n\n\nVlore\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHotel Partner or similar\n\n\nSaranda\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHavana Hotel or similar\n\n\n. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast except Day 1\n. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ accommodation in Tirana based on the hotel mentioned or similar 1 Nights’ accommodation in Shkoder based on the hotel mentioned or similar 1 Nights’ accommodation in Berat based on the hotel mentioned or similar 1 Nights’ accommodation in Vlore based on the hotel mentioned or similar 1 Nights’ accommodation in Saranda based on the hotel mentioned or similar 1 Nights’ accommodation in Tirana based on the hotel mentioned or similarMeals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Lunch at worldwide famous restaurant Mrizi i ZanavaTransportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis] Private Transfer from Tirana Airport to Tirana Hotel Transportation with modern AC car/minibus/bus, etc during all tour itinerary on shared basis Private Transfer from Tirana Hotel to Tirana AirportSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point) Entry Fees (mandatory): Included (List of the museums and other sites included as per itinerary:) Skanderbeg Museum in Kruja Skanderbeg Mausoleum in Lezha Tophill Fortress in Lezha (+ cost for small vans to climb up to the fortress) Rozafa Castle in Shkodra (+ cost for small vans to climb up to the fortress) Amphitheater in Durres Onufri Museum and St. Mary Church in Berat Ardenica Monastery Apollonia Archeological Park Butrint Antic City Mesopotam monastery Blue Eye National Park Gjirokaster Castle (+ cost for luggage transfer to the hotel in Old Town)Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees - To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Note: Costing given is subject to change and availability. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Aurangabad', 'cityCode': 'IXU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Nagpur', 'cityCode': 'NAG', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Vadodara', 'cityCode': 'BDQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Madurai', 'cityCode': 'IXM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', 'cityCode': 'STV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kannur', 'cityCode': 'CNN', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Amazing Albania (Durga Puja - Navratri Special)' package is an 8-day tour covering the scenic and historic cities of Sarande, Tirana, Berat, Shkoder, and Vlore. Throughout this festive journey, participants will immerse themselves in Albania's rich heritage and stunning landscapes through key highlights that include exploring ancient castles, visiting UNESCO World Heritage sites, wandering through vibrant local bazaars, and enjoying scenic coastal drives along the Albanian Riviera.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Tirana\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at Tirana International Airport, you will be transferred to the hotel on private basis.\nSpecial Note:\n1.\xa0Welcome to Tirana, the vibrant capital of Albania, is a lively mix of colorful architecture, rich history, and modern culture. Surrounded by mountains, it offers bustling cafés, fascinating museums, and easy access to nature, making it a charming and energetic destination for travelers. \n2.\xa0Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion.', 'mealDescription': 'NA', 'overnightStay': 'Albanopolis Hotel or similar'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nTirana - Kruje - Tirana\nVisit to Kruja & Tirana City Tour: Today visit a historic town central to Albania’s resistance against the Ottomans, exploring Skanderbeg Castle, the museum, and the old bazaar, before continuing to Tirana for a guided city tour of Albania’s vibrant capital.\nSpecial Note:\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.\nOptional Sightseeing: Albanian Night - Dinner with Folk Show @ EUR 85/- Per Adult & Child\nEnjoy an authentic Albanian evening with a traditional folk show and a 7 course local dinner. The experience includes one drink (glass of wine or raki, or a local beer) and duration of 2 hours.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Albanopolis Hotel or similar'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nTirana - Lezhe - Shkoder\nTransfers: Today travel from Tirana to Lezhe & from Lezhe to Shkoder by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 1 hour)\nLezha City Tour: Visit to its top hill castle where you enjoy the fascinating panorama of the Adriatic Riviera and bronze age ancient city walls, and visit the Mausoleum of Skanderbeg (Albanian National Hero).\nCity tour of Shkodra: This Tour includes, Old Bazaar, Centrum, Cathedral and Mosque. Visit the Castle of Rozafa and we will enjoy wonderful views of mountains (Albanian Alps), Shkodra’s lake (the biggest in the Balkans), Drini, Buna and Kir rivers with the valleys around from the top of Rozafa castle.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast & Lunch at worldwide famous restaurant Mrizi i Zanava\xa0 \xa0\xa0', 'overnightStay': 'Tradita G & Tosk Hotel or similar'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nShkoder - Durres - Berat (Unesco)\nTransfers: This morning travel from Shkoder to Durres & Durres to Berat by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 2 hours. Enroute Sightseeing)\nEnroute Sightseeing of Durres: Discover Durres, one of the Mediterranean’s oldest cities, visiting the Balkan’s largest Roman amphitheater, ancient walls, and Byzantine relics.\nBerat City Tour: Continue to Berat, a UNESCO World Heritage city, Visit the castle of Berat with the Onufri museum and other churches inside; the Mosque of Berat and the old Bridge of Gorica, Onufri Museum and several churches and mosques.\nSpecial Note:\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Republika or similar'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nArdenica Monastery - Apollonia (Unesco) - Vlore\nTransfers: Today travel from Berat - Vlore by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 2 hours). Enroute Sightseeing.\nEnroute Sightseeing of Ardenica Monastery: It is a 13th century Byzantine site famed for hosting Skanderbeg’s wedding, then explore the ancient atmospheric ruins of Apollonia.\nVlore City Tour: Visit the city, including its old town, independence square and monument, where Albanian independence from the Ottomans was proclaimed on November 28th, 1912.\nOptional Activity: Dinner with Sea Food Experience in Vlore @ EUR 40/- Per Adult & Child\nSpecial Note:\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Partner or similar'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nVlore - Himare - Ksamil - Butrint (Unesco) - Saranda\nTransfers: Today travel from Vlore to Saranda by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 3 hours). Enroute Sightseeing.\nEnroute Sightseeing of Vlora & Saranda: Travel south through spectacular coastal scenery along Vlora Bay and the Ionian Riviera, stopping in Ksamil/Saranda for lunch and time by the crystal clear sea.\nButrint City Tour: Visit Butrint, Albania’s most important UNESCO archaeological site, explore numerous buildings including an acropolis, basilica and palace. The location of the site itself is also very attractive, surrounded by trees and water.\nSpecial Note:\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Havana Hotel or similar'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nSaranda - Mesopotam - Blue Eye - Gjirokaster (Unesco) - Tirana\nTransfers: Today travel from Saranda to Tirana by bus on shared basis (approx. travel of 4 hours). Enroute Sightseeing.\nEnroute Sightseeing of Mesopotam monastery & Blue Eye National Park: Travel to Gjirokaster, stopping at Mesopotam Monastery, built over the ancient temple inside the fortress. \xa0Later travel to the Blue Eye National Park.\nGjirokaster City Tour: Explore this UNESCO listed Stone City, with its cobbled bazaar, distinctive stone houses, and the Gjirokaster Castle and Weapons Museum, before continuing to Tirana for leisure time.\nSpecial Note:\n1.\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa0 Sightseeing will be conducted on a shared basis, with pickups arranged from designated central meeting points only.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Albanopolis Hotel or similar'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart\nTransfers: You will have a private transfer from Tirana hotel to Tirana International Airport.\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'NA'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\nCity\n\xa0No Of Nts\n\xa0Hotel Name\n\n\nTirana\xa0\n\xa03 Nts\nAlbanopolis Hotel or similar\n\n\nShkoder\n\xa01Nts\nTradita G & Tosk Hotel or similar\n\n\nBerat\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHotel Republika or similar\n\n\nVlore\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHotel Partner or similar\n\n\nSaranda\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHavana Hotel or similar\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'1': '\n\n\nCity\n\xa0No Of Nts\n\xa0Hotel Name\n\n\nTirana\xa0\n\xa03 Nts\nAlbanopolis Hotel or similar\n\n\nShkoder\n\xa01Nts\nTradita G & Tosk Hotel or similar\n\n\nBerat\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHotel Republika or similar\n\n\nVlore\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHotel Partner or similar\n\n\nSaranda\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHavana Hotel or similar\n\n\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'AL', 'countryName': 'Albania', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Value'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Value', 'price': 123600.0, 'hotels': ['\n\n\nCity\n\xa0No Of Nts\n\xa0Hotel Name\n\n\nTirana\xa0\n\xa03 Nts\nAlbanopolis Hotel or similar\n\n\nShkoder\n\xa01Nts\nTradita G & Tosk Hotel or similar\n\n\nBerat\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHotel Republika or similar\n\n\nVlore\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHotel Partner or similar\n\n\nSaranda\xa0\n\xa01 Nts\nHavana Hotel or similar\n\n\n']}], 'meals': ['\nDaily Breakfast except Day 1\n'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['\nPrivate Transfer from Tirana Airport to Tirana Hotel\nTransportation with modern AC car/minibus/bus, etc during all tour itinerary on shared basis\nPrivate Transfer from Tirana Hotel to Tirana Airport\n'], 'sightseeing': ['\nSkanderbeg Museum in Kruja\nSkanderbeg Mausoleum in Lezha\nTophill Fortress in Lezha (+ cost for small vans to climb up to the fortress)\nRozafa Castle in Shkodra (+ cost for small vans to climb up to the fortress)\nAmphitheater in Durres\nOnufri Museum and St. Mary Church in Berat\nArdenica Monastery\nApollonia Archeological Park\nButrint Antic City\nMesopotam monastery\nBlue Eye National Park\nGjirokaster Castle (+ cost for luggage transfer to the hotel in Old Town)\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': '\xa0 \xa0 \xa0 \xa0 \xa0 \xa0Accommodation:\n\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Tirana based on the hotel mentioned or similar\n1 Nights’ accommodation in Shkoder based on the hotel mentioned or similar\n1 Nights’ accommodation in Berat based on the hotel mentioned or similar\n1 Nights’ accommodation in Vlore based on the hotel mentioned or similar\n1 Nights’ accommodation in Saranda based on the hotel mentioned or similar\n1 Nights’ accommodation in Tirana based on the hotel mentioned or similarMeals:\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\nLunch at worldwide famous restaurant Mrizi i ZanavaTransportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis]\nPrivate Transfer from Tirana Airport to Tirana Hotel\nTransportation with modern AC car/minibus/bus, etc during all tour itinerary on shared basis\nPrivate Transfer from Tirana Hotel to Tirana AirportSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point)\nEntry Fees (mandatory):\xa0 Included (List of the museums and other sites included as per itinerary:)\nSkanderbeg Museum in Kruja\nSkanderbeg Mausoleum in Lezha\nTophill Fortress in Lezha (+ cost for small vans to climb up to the fortress)\nRozafa Castle in Shkodra (+ cost for small vans to climb up to the fortress)\nAmphitheater in Durres\nOnufri Museum and St. Mary Church in Berat\nArdenica Monastery\nApollonia Archeological Park\nButrint Antic City\nMesopotam monastery\nBlue Eye National Park\nGjirokaster Castle (+ cost for luggage transfer to the hotel in Old Town)Insurance:\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price.\nCity taxes / Resort Fees - To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.\n', 'termsAndConditions': '\xa0\nNote: Costing given is subject to change and availability', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'N', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014849/Dubrovnik_srp.png', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014849/itinerary/Tirana_n.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014849/itinerary/TiranaClockTower.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014849/itinerary/Shkoderjp.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014849/itinerary/Beratjpp.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014849/itinerary/Vlore.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014849/itinerary/Sarande.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014849/itinerary/TIRANAKOTOR.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014849/itinerary/Tirana_D.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014722', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014722', 'availableMonths': ['october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Around Iceland - Fixed Departures', 'days': 8, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Akureyri', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Egilsstadir', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Hofn', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'South Coast', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'South Coast', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014722_0_undefined.pdf', 'price': 353454, 'packageSummary': "The 'Around Iceland - Fixed Departures' package is an 8-day tour covering the South Coast, Akureyri, Reykjavik, Egilsstadir, and Hofn. The itinerary includes scenic drives along the dramatic South Coast, exploring the charming northern town of Akureyri, discovering the vibrant capital of Reykjavik, and traversing the serene eastern fjords around Egilsstadir and Hofn. Participants will enjoy guided sightseeing of Iceland's iconic waterfalls, volcanic landscapes, and coastal wonders, making for an unforgettable journey through the country's diverse natural beauty.", 'images': ['reykjavik_Iceland.jpg', 'Snaefellsness.avif', '329451_Akureyri_city_Iceland_753.jpg', 'LakeMyvatn.avif', 'EastFjords.avif', 'Jokulsarlon.avif', 'BlueLagoon.avif', 'Reyjavik_753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 353454, 'thumbnailImage': 'SRP_Kirkjufell-mountain.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family', 'Adventure'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014722 is named 'Around Iceland - Fixed Departures' and spans 8 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Reykjavik, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Reykjavik Transfers: Upon arrival in Keflavik Airport, you will meet the representative and get transferred to the hotel on private basis., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Reykjavik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Magnificent Snæfellsness Transfers: There will be a pick-up from the scheduled meeting point near the hotel starts between 07:30-08:00 a.m. Magnificent Snæfellsness: Enjoy the scenic guided drive to the Snæfellsness Peninsula (the most popular area because it was a part of the famous web series locations, often referred to as mini-Iceland). Visit Arnarstapi, Kirkjufell Mountain and waterfall (most photographed location), Black Sand Beach, Fishing Villages. Special Note: Reykjavik downtown has restrictions for bigger vehicles. For pick-ups and drop-offs, the nearest authorised stops near the hotel will be used if the hotel is located in the downtown area. Sightseeing will be on shared basis and will be operated as a part of Multi-City Small Group, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Akureyri, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Scenic Journey To North Iceland Transfers: Pick-up from the scheduled meeting point near the hotel starts at 08:45 a.m. Scenic Journey to North Iceland: Start your scenic drive towards North Iceland. Visit Hvalfjörður tunnel, Skagafjörður, Glaumbær - a preserved turf farm offering a quiet look into Icelandic rural life from centuries past. After the visit, the drive continues over the Öxnadalsheiði plateau and into Akureyri. Special Note: Reykjavik downtown has restrictions for bigger vehicles. For pick-ups and drop-offs, the nearest authorized stops near the hotel will be used if the hotel is located in the downtown area. Sightseeing will be on shared basis and will be operated as a part of Multi-City Small Group, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Egilsstadir, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Lake Myvatn Area Myvatn Area: En route to Lake Mývatn, stop at Goðafoss. Explore volcanic and geothermal sights, including Námaskarð’s bubbling mud pits. Visit Dettifoss, then cross the Mödrudalsöræfi highlands to finish the day in Egilsstaðir. Special Note: Sightseeing will be on shared basis and will be operated as a part of Multi-City Small Group, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Hofn, Meals: Breakfast, Description: East Fjords East Fjords: The road trip continues from Egilsstaðir to the fairly isolated and very beautiful East Fjords. Scenic drive via the rugged mountains overlooking the dramatic coastline of the mighty North Atlantic. Special Note: Sightseeing will be on shared basis and will be operated as a part of Multi-City Small Group, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - South Coast, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Glacier Lagoon & South Coast Glacier Lagoon & South Coast: Visit Jökulsárlón Glacier Lagoon to see drifting icebergs and Diamond Beach, with an included amphibious boat ride. Continue to Skaftafell in Vatnajökull National Park, then visit Vík’s black sand Reynisfjara, plus Skógafoss and Seljalandsfoss. Special Note: Sightseeing will be on shared basis and will be operated as a part of Multi-City Small Group, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - South Coast, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Golden Circle & Blue Lagoon Golden Circle, Blue Lagoon: Enjoy a scenic drive to the Golden Circle. Visit Gullfoss Waterfall, Thingvellir National Park, Haukadalur Geothermal Area. Later visit the Blue Lagoon to spend 2 hrs of relaxing time in the natural hot water and enjoying the fantastic facilities there. Special Note: Sightseeing will be on shared basis and will be operated as a part of Multi-City Small Group, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Reykjavik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Transfers: From Reykjavik hotel to the Keflavik Airport in private transfer. Special Note: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 353454.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nREYKJAVIK\n\n\nBerjaya Hotel Reykjavik Natura or similar\n\n\n\n\nAKUREYRI\n\n\nBerjaya Hotel Akureyri or similar\n\n\n\n\nEGILSSTAÐIR\n\n\nBerjaya Hotel Hérað or similar\n\n\n\n\nHÖFN\n\n\nBerjaya Hótel in Höfn or similar\n\n\n\n\nSOUTH COAST AREA\n\n\nHotel Selfoss or similar\n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nReykjavik\n\nFosshotel Baron / Center Klopp / Foss Lind Similar\n\n\nHofn\nHotel Smylabjor or Similar\n\n\nEgillstadir\nBerjaya Hotel Herad or Similar\n\n\nAkureyri\nKea Hotel Akureyri / Nordurland or Similar\n\n\nBorgarnes\nHotel Borgarnes or Similar\n\n\nReykjavik\nFoss Lind or 22 Hill / Klettur or Similar\xa0\n\n\nReykjavik\nFosshotel Baron / Center Klopp/Foss Lind Similar\n\n\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation: 3 Nights’ Split accommodation in Reykjavi