hared basis (SIC - Tour)\nThingvellir National Park on shared basis (SIC - Tour)\nDragon-shaped Sea stack Hvitserkur on shared basis (SIC - Tour)\nBeautiful Kolugljufur canyon\xa0\nEastfjords on shared basis (SIC - Tour)\nWest Iceland on shared basis (SIC - Tour)\nGlaumbær Museum entry fee\nAmphibious Boat Tour on Jökulsárlón Glacier Lagoon\nBlue Lagoon *(Comfort Entrance Tickets)\n', '\nEnglish-speaking Guide.\xa0\nEntry fee to the Geothermal Park with tasting of geothermal bread (Hverabrauð)\n45 mins Amphibian Boat Tour at Jökulsárlón (available from May to September) among floating ice bergs.\nVidgelmir Lava Cave\xa0 Tour : 1-1 ½ hour Lava Caving Expedition\xa0\n3 Hours Whale Watching Boat Tour in Dalvik during fixed departure tour\nGolden Circle tour - Geysers, The Golden waterfall and Thingvellir\nEntry to Kerid Volcano Crater\nBlue Lagoon on Comfort ticket Includes: Entrance to the Blue Lagoon, Silica mud mask, Use of towel and Welcome drink.\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Included as per itinerary', 'inclusions': 'Accommodation:\n\n3 Nights’ Split accommodation in Reykjavik based on the hotel category selected or similar\n1 Night accommodation in Akureyri area based on the hotel category selected or similar\n1 Night accommodation in Egilsstaðir based on the hotel category selected or similar\n1 Night accommodation in Höfn based on the hotel category selected or similar\n1 Night accommodation in South Coast Area based on the hotel category selected or similar\n\n\xa0\nMeals:\n\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n\n\xa0\nTransportation: [Includes Privates services on Point to Point Basis]\n\nPrivate airport transfer upon arrival at KEF Airport\xa0\nPrivate airport transfer upon departure from KEF Airport\n\nSightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point)\n\nScenic Road trip along the Ring Road of Iceland on shared basis (SIC - Tour)\nThe Reykjanes area. on shared basis (SIC - Tour)\nMa