perating norms of 15.00 hrs or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only.', 'mealDescription': 'NA', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Scandic or similar in Helsinki'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nHelsinki Small Group Walking Tour\n\xa0\nHelsinki Small Group Walking Tour:\xa0Join a small group walking tour of Helsinki covering key landmarks Helsingin Tuomiokirkko Market Square Temppeliaukio Church Uspenski Cathedral and Sibelius Park plus historic quarters between Market and Senate Squares with cafes and restaurants.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Scandic or similar in Helsinki'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nHelsinki to Stockholm by Cruise\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0You will be transferred from Helsinki hotel to the port on private basis for the overnight cruise.\n\xa0\nHelsinki to Stockholm Overnight Cruise:\xa0In the evening take overnight cruise to Stockholm and enjoy live entertainment duty free shopping sightseeing.\n\xa0\nSpecial Notes:\xa0In Helsinki it will be day free at leisure.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Overnight on Cruise'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nStockholm Visit Skansen\nTransfers: Upon reaching Stockholm you will be transferred from Stockholm port to the hotel on private basis. Early check in is subject to hotel discretion.\nVisit Skansen: Skansen on Royal Djurgarden offers stunning views of Stockholm. Known as Sweden in miniature it is the worlds oldest open air museum with music dance traditions historic buildings and Nordic animals all in one place.\nSpecial Note: You will check in at the hotel post completing the sightseeing.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Clarion or similar in Stockholm'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nStockholm Walking City Tour\nStockholm Small Group Walking Tour: Small group walking tour of Stockholm covering City Hall Sergel Square and Gamla Stan one of Europes best preserved medieval centers. Visit the Nobel Museum Royal Palace with changing of the guards and the Vasa Museum.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Clarion or similar in Stockholm'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nStockholm to Oslo by Train\nTransfers: You will be transferred from the Stockholm hotel to the train station. Upon arrival at the Oslo train station you will be transferred to the hotel on private basis.\nSpecial Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15.00 hrs or at the discretion of the hotel management.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Clarion or similar in\xa0Oslo'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nOslo Small Group Walking City Tour\nOslo Small Group Walking City Tour: Visit Oslos Royal Palace Vigeland Sculpture Park and Opera House. Explore the Kon Tiki FRAM and Maritime museums Akershus Fortress and its history museums then stroll Karl Johans Gate filled with shops cafes bars and nightlife.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Clarion or similar in\xa0Oslo'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart\nTransfers: You will be transferred from Oslo hotel to the airport on private transfer.\nSpecial Notes: You will reach airport three to four hours prior to your departure flight.\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'NA'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHELSINKI\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nScandic\xa0Hotel\xa0or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSTOCKHOLM\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nClarion hotel or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOSLO\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nClarion hotel\xa0or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'1'