.\xa0\n', 'termsAndConditions': 'IMPORTANT NOTES\xa0\xa0\n• The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together\n• The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\n• Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room\n• Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\n• WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed\n• (Supplement charges may apply for such services)\n• Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs.\n• Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned\n• At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability\n• TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost\nTERMS AND CONDITIONS\xa0\xa0\n• Travel Validity: 1 July 2026 – 15 December 2026\n• Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ\n• The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times\n• Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room\n• The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\n• Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking\n• To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour\n• Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly\n• The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates\n• We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package\n• International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed\n• Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only\n• No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service\n• All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking\n• Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice\n• Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends\n• Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time\n• As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients\n• The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'N', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015184/Norway1.avif', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015184/itinerary/Helsinki2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015184/itinerary/Helsinki1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015184/itinerary/Helsinki3.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015184/itinerary/Stockholm2.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015184/itinerary/Stockholm1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015184/itinerary/Oslo1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015184/itinerary/Oslo2jpg.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015184/itinerary/Stockholm4.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG013979', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG013979', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Georgia - Buy 1 Get 1 Free', 'days': 5, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Tbilisi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Tbilisi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Tbilisi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Tbilisi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Tbilisi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ['*Buy One Get One Free (BOGO) offer is only valid for 2 adults - Pay for one and your adult companion travels FREE!'], 'pdfName': 'PKG013979_0_20260923123324.pdf', 'price': 50361, 'packageSummary': "The 'Georgia - Buy 1 Get 1 Free' package is a 5-day tour covering the historic and vibrant city of Tbilisi. The key highlight of this exciting getaway is the special Buy One Get One Free (BOGO) offer valid for two adults, where you pay for one traveler and your adult companion travels completely for free. Throughout this five-day trip, participants will have the opportunity to immerse themselves in the rich culture, stunning architecture, and local charm of Georgia's capital city.", 'images': ['georgia_753.png', 'narikalafortress.png', 'Sighnaghi.jpg', 'Gudauri_C.jpg', 'Georgia_Tbilis_753.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 50361, 'thumbnailImage': 'GeorgiaBuy267.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Buy 1 Get 1 Free', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG013979 is named 'Georgia - Buy 1 Get 1 Free' and spans 5 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Tbilisi, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrival Tbilisi Welcome to Georgia! Known as the “Cradle of Wine” and nestled at the crossroads of Europe and Asia, Georgia is a land of breathtaking landscapes, ancient history, and warm hospitality. From the snow-capped Caucasus Mountains to lush valleys and vibrant cities, Georgia offers a unique blend of culture, tradition, and modern charm. Upon arrival at Tbilisi International Airport, you will be greeted and transferred to your hotel. Check-in at the hotel (standard time approx. 14:00 hrs.). The rest of the day is free for you to relax and explore the city at your own pace., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Tbilisi, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Tbilisi City Tour Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel After breakfast, begin your Tbilisi city tour at Metekhi Church and the monument of King Vakhtang Gorgasali. Walk through Rike Park and cross the modern Bridge of Peace before taking the cable car up to Narikala Fortress for panoramic city views and a visit to the Mother of Georgia statue. Descend into the Sulphur Bath area, pass the city’s only mosque, and take a short walk to the Legvtakhevi Waterfall. Continue exploring Old Tbilisi as you pass through Meidan Square and the lively Shardeni Street filled with cafés and shops. Visit the historic Sioni Church before heading onward to Freedom Square and the iconic Rustaveli Avenue. Later, continue to Mtatsminda Park, a hilltop amusement park offering excellent views of the city. Conclude your day with a visit to the impressive Chronicles of Georgia monument near the Tbilisi Sea before returning to your hotel., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Tbilisi, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Tbilisi - Bodbe – Sighnaghi – Kakheti - Tbilisi Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel Today, set out on a scenic journey to the Kakheti region, Georgia’s renowned wine country. Begin with a visit to a traditional Georgian winery in Patardzeuli, where you can experience the rich heritage of winemaking and sample local varieties. Continue to the serene Bodbe Monastery, a spiritual site functioning as a nunnery since 1889 and believed to be the burial place of St. Nino, the saint who brought Christianity to Georgia in the 4th century. Next, explore Sighnaghi, famously known as the “City of Love.” This charming hilltop town, once a key point on the Great Silk Road, is surrounded by impressive defensive walls with 23 towers and offers stunning views of the Alazani Valley and the Caucasus Mountains. Stroll through its picturesque streets, enjoy local cuisine, and soak in the romantic atmosphere. On the way back to Tbilisi, you may choose to stop at Badiauri village, where you can taste freshly baked Georgian bread and even participate in a traditional bread-making activity. Return to Tbilisi for an overnight stay., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Tbilisi, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Tbilisi – Day free at leisure Enjoy Breakfast at the Hotel Today is free for you to relax and enjoy Tbilisi at your own pace. You can choose to unwind at your hotel or explore the city’s vibrant streets, charming cafés, and local markets., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Tbilisi, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Departure Morning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India * The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 50361.0. Hotels envisaged include: Overnight stay at hotel, \nOvernight stay at hotel\n. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: 04 night's stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Tbilisi Daily breakfast, except on Day 1 Return airport transfers Tbilisi City Tour Tbilisi - Bodbe – Sighnaghi - Tbilisi Entrance Fees: Tbilisi Cable Car & KTW winery All transfers & sightseeing in Air-Conditioned vehicle on PVT basis – (Sedan) 2 bottles of water daily per person Travel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.). Exclusions: TCS & GST Visa charges Departure PCR test, if applicable All flights services Meals not mentioned in the itinerary Any tips - (Around 5.00 USD per person per day) for guide & Driver Any other sightseeing entrance fees except for the ones mentioned in the Inclusions Anything not mentioned in the inclusions Pre & Post tour services & cost Expenditure of personal nature (Such as the use of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & etc.) All drink and beverages Hotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel Tourism Tax (if applicable) Midnight surcharge The rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adults travelling together at all times. Blackout Dates: 14 Mar – 27 Mar’27 & 15 Dec’26 – 06 Jan’27 The prices will not be valid for any black out date/ Stop sale period which is informed during confirmation of the booking; if any change in the price, the same will be applicable for all bookings and to be borne by the customer.. Product Terms and Conditions: The prices will not be valid for any black out date/ Stop sale period which is informed during confirmation of the booking; if any change in the price, the same will be applicable for all bookings and to be borne by the customer. Terms and Conditions : The hotel upgrade prices are subject to availability at the time of booking. The hotel upgrade prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels. The upgrade hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking. For the upgrade hotel, in case the hotel chosen is unavailable, we will provide multiple options of similar category hotels. The rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adults travelling together at all times. The rates are not valid on block out dates. Surcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same Surcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking. Guests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their onwards/connecting flights. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. Prices are not valid during Trade Fair periods. Rates are valid for Indian Passport holders only. International Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have the right to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends. Offer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. TCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization. As a practice, all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check-in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as they will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions, and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.. Highlights of the package: *Buy One Get One Free (BOGO) offer is only valid for 2 adults - Pay for one and your adult companion travels FREE!.", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Georgia - Buy 1 Get 1 Free' package is a 5-day tour covering the historic and vibrant city of Tbilisi. The key highlight of this exciting getaway is the special Buy One Get One Free (BOGO) offer valid for two adults, where you pay for one traveler and your adult companion travels completely for free. Throughout this five-day trip, participants will have the opportunity to immerse themselves in the rich culture, stunning architecture, and local charm of Georgia's capital city.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nArrival Tbilisi\nWelcome to Georgia! Known as the “Cradle of Wine” and nestled at the crossroads of Europe and Asia, Georgia is a land of breathtaking landscapes, ancient history, and warm hospitality. From the snow-capped Caucasus Mountains to lush valleys and vibrant cities, Georgia offers a unique blend of culture, tradition, and modern charm.\nUpon arrival at Tbilisi International Airport, you will be greeted and transferred to your hotel. Check-in at the hotel (standard time approx. 14:00 hrs.). The rest of the day is free for you to relax and explore the city at your own pace.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Astoria (Standard) /\xa0Novotel Center (Value) /\xa0Radisson Blu (Premium)\xa0or similar in Tbilisi'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nTbilisi City Tour\nEnjoy Breakfast at the Hotel\nAfter breakfast, begin your Tbilisi city tour at Metekhi Church and the monument of King Vakhtang Gorgasali. Walk through Rike Park and cross the modern Bridge of Peace before taking the cable car up to Narikala Fortress for panoramic city views and a visit to the Mother of Georgia statue. Descend into the Sulphur Bath area, pass the city’s only mosque, and take a short walk to the Legvtakhevi Waterfall. Continue exploring Old Tbilisi as you pass through Meidan Square and the lively Shardeni Street filled with cafés and shops. Visit the historic Sioni Church before heading onward to Freedom Square and the iconic Rustaveli Avenue.\nLater, continue to Mtatsminda Park, a hilltop amusement park offering excellent views of the city. Conclude your day with a visit to the impressive Chronicles of Georgia monument near the Tbilisi Sea before returning to your hotel.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Astoria (Standard) /\xa0Novotel Center (Value) /\xa0Radisson Blu (Premium)\xa0or similar in Tbilisi'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nTbilisi - Bodbe – Sighnaghi – Kakheti - Tbilisi\nEnjoy Breakfast at the Hotel\nToday, set out on a scenic journey to the Kakheti region, Georgia’s renowned wine country. Begin with a visit to a traditional Georgian winery in Patardzeuli, where you can experience the rich heritage of winemaking and sample local varieties. Continue to the serene Bodbe Monastery, a spiritual site functioning as a nunnery since 1889 and believed to be the burial place of St. Nino, the saint who brought Christianity to Georgia in the 4th century. Next, explore Sighnaghi, famously known as the “City of Love.” This charming hilltop town, once a key point on the Great Silk Road, is surrounded by impressive defensive walls with 23 towers and offers stunning views of the Alazani Valley and the Caucasus Mountains. Stroll through its picturesque streets, enjoy local cuisine, and soak in the romantic atmosphere. On the way back to Tbilisi, you may choose to stop at Badiauri village, where you can taste freshly baked Georgian bread and even participate in a traditional bread-making activity. Return to Tbilisi for an overnight stay.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Astoria (Standard) /\xa0Novotel Center (Value) /\xa0Radisson Blu (Premium)\xa0or similar in Tbilisi'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nTbilisi – Day free at leisure\nEnjoy Breakfast at the Hotel\nToday is free for you to relax and enjoy Tbilisi at your own pace. You can choose to unwind at your hotel or explore the city’s vibrant streets, charming cafés, and local markets.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Astoria (Standard) /\xa0Novotel Center (Value) /\xa0Radisson Blu (Premium)\xa0or similar in Tbilisi'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nDeparture\n\xa0\nMorning after breakfast; you will be transferred to the airport for your flight back home to India\xa0\n\xa0\n* The itinerary is tentative and subjected to change without prior notice', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at hotel', '\nOvernight stay at hotel\n'], 'hotels_list': {'0': 'Overnight stay at hotel', '1': '\nOvernight stay at hotel\n', '2': '\nOvernight stay at hotel\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'GE', 'countryName': 'Georgia', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard', 'Value', 'Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'price': 50400.0, 'hotels': ['Overnight stay at hotel']}, {'category': 'Value', 'price': 62000.0, 'hotels': ['\nOvernight stay at hotel\n']}, {'category': 'Premium', 'price': 71300.0, 'hotels': ['\nOvernight stay at hotel\n']}], 'meals': ['Breakfast Included'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['\nTbilisi City Tour\nTbilisi - Bodbe – Sighnaghi - Tbilisi\nEntrance Fees: Tbilisi Cable Car & KTW winery\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': "\n04 night's stay at the selected hotel option or similar in Tbilisi\nDaily breakfast, except on Day 1\nReturn airport transfers\nTbilisi City Tour\nTbilisi - Bodbe – Sighnaghi - Tbilisi\nEntrance Fees: Tbilisi Cable Car & KTW winery\nAll transfers & sightseeing in Air-Conditioned vehicle on PVT basis – (Sedan)\n2 bottles of water daily per person\nTravel Insurance (Valid for the age group till 60 Yrs.)\n", 'exclusions': '\nTCS & GST\nVisa charges\xa0\nDeparture PCR test, if applicable\xa0\nAll flights services\xa0\nMeals not mentioned in the itinerary\nAny tips - (Around 5.00 USD per person per day) for guide & Driver\nAny other sightseeing entrance fees except for the ones mentioned in the Inclusions\xa0\xa0\nAnything not mentioned in the inclusions\nPre & Post tour services & cost\xa0\nExpenditure of personal nature (Such as the use of Mini – Bar & Refrigerator, laundry service, telephone call, camera fee, tips & etc.)\nAll drink and beverages\xa0\nHotel promotional rates not valid during Black out Period / Surcharge Dates / Stop Sales on Hotel\xa0\nTourism Tax (if applicable)\nMidnight surcharge\nThe rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adults travelling together at all times.\xa0\nBlackout Dates: 14 Mar – 27 Mar’27 & 15 Dec’26 – 06 Jan’27\nThe prices will not be valid for any black out date/ Stop sale period which is informed during confirmation of the booking; if any change in the price, the same will be applicable for all bookings and to be borne by the customer.\n', 'termsAndConditions': '\nThe prices will not be valid for any black out date/ Stop sale period which is informed during confirmation of the booking; if any change in the price, the same will be applicable for all bookings and to be borne by the customer.\n\nTerms and Conditions :\n\nThe hotel upgrade prices are subject to availability at the time of booking.\nThe hotel upgrade prices DO NOT GUARANTEE rooms at the envisaged hotels.\nThe upgrade hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of booking.\nFor the upgrade hotel, in case the hotel chosen is unavailable, we will provide multiple options of similar category hotels.\nThe rates are valid for a minimum of 02 adults travelling together at all times. \nThe rates are not valid on block out dates.\nSurcharges as and when applicable will be advised and passengers would be requested to pay the same\nSurcharges could be over and above the total package price quoted to the passengers at the time of booking.\nGuests are requested to check with sales staff before booking their onwards/connecting flights.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nPrices are not valid during Trade Fair periods.\nRates are valid for Indian Passport holders only.\nInternational Check in time is 1400 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and checkout is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing tours are strictly based on whether conditions and also local service providers have the right to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients traveling during weekends.\nOffer if any can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice.\nBookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nTCIL is not responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organization.\nAs a practice, all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check-in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as they will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. TCIL would not be responsible for these transactions, and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\n\n\xa0', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013979/GeorgiaBuy267.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013979/itinerary/georgia_753.png', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013979/itinerary/narikalafortress.png', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013979/itinerary/Sighnaghi.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013979/itinerary/Gudauri_C.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG013979/itinerary/Georgia_Tbilis_753.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014704', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014704', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Turkish Romantic Getaway - Honeymoon Special', 'days': 9, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Istanbul', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Istanbul', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Cappadocia', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Cappadocia', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kusadasi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Kusadasi', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Antalya', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Antalya', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Antalya', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': ["Indulge in a romantic Istanbul evening with a private transfer and an unforgettable dinner for two Explore the romance of Istanbul’s Old City together on a Full day tour of its iconic masterpieces Uncover Antalya’s scenic and historic highlights together on a Full day tour Discover ancient wonders and village charm together on a Full day Kusadasi tour Optional: Indulge in a private Bosphorus cruise for a smooth, romantic escape Optional: Capture sunrise magic in Cappadocia with a romantic photoshoot with special Add on's Special Gift Hamper"], 'pdfName': 'PKG004643_0_undefined.pdf', 'price': 150450, 'packageSummary': "The 'Turkish Romantic Getaway - Honeymoon Special' package is a 9-day tour covering Istanbul, Antalya, Kusadasi, and Cappadocia. Designed for couples, this romantic itinerary features an intimate evening in Istanbul with a private transfer and dinner for two, a full-day tour of Istanbul's iconic Old City masterpieces, a full-day tour of Antalya's scenic and historic highlights, and a full-day tour of Kusadasi's ancient wonders and village charm. Travelers will also receive a special gift hamper, with options to add a private Bosphorus cruise and a romantic sunrise photoshoot in Cappadocia to complete their unforgettable escape.", 'images': ['Istanbul753.jpg', 'Istanbul.jpg', 'Cappadocia7532.jpg', 'Cappadocia7531.jpg', 'Kusadasi56.jpg', 'AntalyaCity7532.jpg', 'AntalyaCity75323.jpg', 'AntalyaCity7532.jpg', 'AntalyaCity.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 150450, 'thumbnailImage': 'Cappadocia267.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Honeymoon'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Honeymoon Special', 'packageData': 'Package ID: PKG014704 is named \'Turkish Romantic Getaway - Honeymoon Special\' and spans 9 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Istanbul, Meals: Dinner, Description: Arrive in Istanbul Transfer: Arrival in Istanbul Airport, you will be met by the representative and have a private transfer to the hotel. Romantic dinner: Enjoy a romantic dining experience with private round trip pickup and drop off., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Istanbul, Meals: Breakfast and Lunch, Description: Istanbul Old City Tour (SIC Basis) Istanbul Old City Tour (On Sic Basis): There will be a Pick-up between 07:30 - 09:00 for a full day guided tour including Hagia Sophia Mosque, Hippodrome, Blue Mosque, Topkapi Palace, and the Grand Bazaar. Entrance fees for Hagia Sophia and Topkapi are additional. Private Bosphorus Cruise (Optional): Enjoy a seamless Bosphorus escape with private hotel transfers and a 2 hour private boat tour (no guide). Sail between continents, admire iconic palaces, and relax as every detail is handled for a smooth, luxurious experience. (Supplement cot for 2 adults - 375 USD & English Speaking Guidance: 190 USD in total). Special Note: Entrance to Hagia Sophia Mosque & Topkapi Palace will be at supplement cost., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Cappadocia, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Istanbul - Cappadocia (Domestic Flight is not included) Transfer: Pick up from the hotel in Istanbul and transfer to the airport by the private vehicle. Upon arrival in Cappadocia Airport, you will be met by the representative and have a private transfer to the hotel., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Cappadocia, Meals: Breakfast, Description: A Sunrise Photoshoot In Cappadocia (Optional) Capture the Magic: A Sunrise Photoshoot in Cappadocia (Optional): Experience Cappadocia’s surreal sunrise as hot air balloons fill the sky. Enjoy a 2 hour session across 2-3 scenic locations, carefully selected to capture your most memorable and unique moments against this iconic landscape. Lunch at Avanos, famous for pottery and Redriver (Kizilirmak). (Supplement cot for 2 adults - 340 USD) Special Note: Make your photoshoot even more extraordinary with our premium add ons: Photoshoot Dreamy Horse Farm Location: 200 USD The Iconic "Flying Dress": 90 USD Romantic Tulle Dress: 125 USD Vintage Classical Car: 165 USD, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Kusadasi, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Cappadocia to Kusadasi (Domestic Flight is not included) Transfer: Pick up from the hotel in Cappadocia and transfer to the airport by the private vehicle. Upon arrival in Izmir Airport, you will be met by the representative and have a private transfer to the hotel in Kusadasi., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Kusadasi, Meals: Breakfast and Lunch, Description: Full Day Kusadasi Tour On SIC Full Day Kusadasi Tour on SIC: Today enjoy a Full day Kusadasi SIC tour including Ephesus Ruins, Artemis Temple, Sirince Village, and lunch at a local restaurant. Explore one of the Mediterranean’s best preserved ancient cities and enjoy the region’s cultural highlights., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Antalya, Meals: Breakfast and Lunch, Description: Pamukkale & Hierapolis Ancient City Tour (On SIC Basis) Transfer: Post Full day tour you will get transferred to Antalya. Full Day Pamukkale & Hierapolis Tour on SIC basis: Enjoy Full day Pamukkale SIC tour including Hierapolis, Cotton Terraces, Domitian Gate, Latrina, Oil Factory, Agora, Byzantium Gate, Triton Fountain, and Apollon Temple. Lunch at local restaurant., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Antalya, Meals: Breakfast and Lunch, Description: Full Day Antalya Tour On SIC Basis Full Day Antalya Tour on SIC basis: Today Enjoy a Full day Antalya SIC tour including Kursunlu Waterfall, Old Town Kaleici, Hadrian Gate, Hidirlik Hills, Clock Tower, Fluted Minaret, and Palm Street, with lunch at a local restaurant., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 9 - Antalya, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Antalya (Internal Flight is not Included) Transfer: From Hotel to Antalya Airport on private basis. From Antalya airport to Istanbul for your Journey back home (Internal Flight not included) Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 150450.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nFour Sides Lion Taksim / Erboy Hotel/ Konak Taksim as BB or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nDedeli Cave / Sunak Cave Hotel as BB or similar\n\n\n\n\nKusadasi\n\n\nEfe Boutique Hotel/ Karaaslan Inn hotel /Ladies Beach or similar\n\n\n\n\nAntalya\n\n\nBest western Khan/Prime Hotel/ Ring Downtown or similar\n\n\n\n, Overnight stay at the Hotels, \n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n5* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nThe Elysium Taksim/Doubletree Hilton Piyalepasa Hotel as BB or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nHanedan Cave / Acer Cave Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nKusadasi\n\n\nSignature Blue Hotel / Le Bleu Hotel /Ramada as HB or similar\n\n\n\n\nAntalya\n\n\nHoliday Inn Lara Hotel / Doubletree Hilton City Center or similar\n\n\n\n. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\xa0\nEnjoy a romantic dining experience with private round trip transfers\nLunches on 2,6,7,8\n, Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ accommodation in Istanbul in the above mentioned hotel or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Cappadocia in the above mentioned hotel or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Kusadasi in the above mentioned hotel or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Antalya the above mentioned hotel or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Enjoy a romantic dining experience with private round trip transfers Lunches on 2,6,7,8 Sightseeing: [ Tour starts from a city centre point, service to & from the hotel is not included ] Istanbul Old City Tour (On Sic Basis) Full Day Kusadasi Tour on SIC Full Day Pamukkale & Hierapolis Tour on SIC basis Full Day Antalya Tour on SIC basis Transfers: [ Includes Point to Point Transfer with limited waiting hours] Arrival Airport transfers in Istanbul on Private basis Private transfer from Istanbul hotel to Airport for the onwards flight to Cappadocia From Cappadocia Airport to Hotel on Private Basis Private transfer from Cappadocia hotel to Airport for the onwards flight to Izmir From Izmir to Kusadasi hotel on Private basis Departure airport transfers in Antalya on Private basis Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: N/A. Highlights of the package: Indulge in a romantic Istanbul evening with a private transfer and an unforgettable dinner for two Explore the romance of Istanbul’s Old City together on a Full day tour of its iconic masterpieces Uncover Antalya’s scenic and historic highlights together on a Full day tour Discover ancient wonders and village charm together on a Full day Kusadasi tour Optional: Indulge in a private Bosphorus cruise for a smooth, romantic escape Optional: Capture sunrise magic in Cappadocia with a romantic photoshoot with special Add on\'s Special Gift Hamper.', 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Lucknow', 'cityCode': 'LKO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Guwahati', 'cityCode': 'GAU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', 'cityCode': 'STV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Aurangabad', 'cityCode': 'IXU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Nagpur', 'cityCode': 'NAG', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Vadodara', 'cityCode': 'BDQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Madurai', 'cityCode': 'IXM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Turkish Romantic Getaway - Honeymoon Special' package is a 9-day tour covering Istanbul, Antalya, Kusadasi, and Cappadocia. Designed for couples, this romantic itinerary features an intimate evening in Istanbul with a private transfer and dinner for two, a full-day tour of Istanbul's iconic Old City masterpieces, a full-day tour of Antalya's scenic and historic highlights, and a full-day tour of Kusadasi's ancient wonders and village charm. Travelers will also receive a special gift hamper, with options to add a private Bosphorus cruise and a romantic sunrise photoshoot in Cappadocia to complete their unforgettable escape.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive in Istanbul\nTransfer: Arrival in Istanbul Airport, you will be met by the representative and have a private transfer to the hotel.\n\xa0\nRomantic dinner: Enjoy a romantic dining experience with private round trip pickup and drop off.', 'mealDescription': 'Dinner', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Four Sides Lion Taksim\xa0(Value) /\xa0The Elysium Taksim\xa0(Premium) or Similar in\xa0Istanbul'}, {'day': 2, 'description': 'Istanbul Old City Tour (SIC Basis)\nIstanbul Old City Tour (On Sic Basis): There will be a Pick-up between 07:30 - 09:00 for a full day guided tour including Hagia Sophia Mosque, Hippodrome, Blue Mosque, Topkapi Palace, and the Grand Bazaar. Entrance fees for Hagia Sophia and Topkapi are additional.\n\xa0\nPrivate Bosphorus Cruise (Optional): Enjoy a seamless Bosphorus escape with private hotel transfers and a 2 hour private boat tour (no guide). Sail between continents, admire iconic palaces, and relax as every detail is handled for a smooth, luxurious experience. (Supplement cot for 2 adults -\xa0375 USD & English Speaking Guidance: 190 USD in total).\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Entrance to Hagia Sophia Mosque & Topkapi Palace will be at supplement cost.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Four Sides Lion Taksim\xa0(Value) /\xa0The Elysium Taksim\xa0(Premium) or Similar in\xa0Istanbul'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nIstanbul - Cappadocia (Domestic Flight is not included)\n\xa0\nTransfer:\xa0\n\nPick up from the hotel in Istanbul and transfer to the airport by the private vehicle.\nUpon arrival in Cappadocia Airport, you will be met by the representative and have a private transfer to the hotel.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Dedeli\xa0Cave (Value) /\xa0Hanedan\xa0Cave (Premium)\xa0or similar in\xa0Cappadocia'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nA Sunrise Photoshoot In Cappadocia (Optional)\nCapture the Magic: A Sunrise Photoshoot in Cappadocia (Optional): Experience Cappadocia’s surreal sunrise as hot air balloons fill the sky. Enjoy a 2 hour session across 2-3 scenic locations, carefully selected to capture your most memorable and unique moments against this iconic landscape. Lunch at Avanos, famous for pottery and Redriver (Kizilirmak). (Supplement cot for 2 adults - 340 USD)\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Make your photoshoot even more extraordinary with our premium add ons:\n\nPhotoshoot Dreamy Horse Farm Location: 200 USD\nThe Iconic "Flying Dress": 90 USD\nRomantic Tulle Dress: 125 USD\nVintage Classical Car: 165 USD\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Dedeli\xa0Cave (Value) /\xa0Hanedan\xa0Cave (Premium)\xa0or similar in\xa0Cappadocia'}, {'day': 5, 'description': 'Cappadocia to Kusadasi (Domestic Flight is not included)\nTransfer:\xa0\n\nPick up from the hotel in Cappadocia and transfer to the airport by the private vehicle.\nUpon arrival in Izmir Airport, you will be met by the representative and have a private transfer to the hotel in Kusadasi.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Efe Boutique\xa0(Value) /\xa0Signature Blue\xa0(Premium) or Similar in\xa0Kusadasi'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nFull Day Kusadasi Tour On SIC\nFull Day Kusadasi Tour on SIC: Today enjoy a Full day Kusadasi SIC tour including Ephesus Ruins, Artemis Temple, Sirince Village, and lunch at a local restaurant. Explore one of the Mediterranean’s best preserved ancient cities and enjoy the region’s cultural highlights.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Efe Boutique\xa0(Value) /\xa0Signature Blue\xa0(Premium) or Similar in\xa0Kusadasi'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nPamukkale & Hierapolis Ancient City Tour (On SIC Basis)\nTransfer: Post Full day tour you will get transferred to Antalya.\nFull Day Pamukkale & Hierapolis Tour on SIC basis: Enjoy Full day Pamukkale SIC tour including Hierapolis, Cotton Terraces, Domitian Gate, Latrina, Oil Factory, Agora, Byzantium Gate, Triton Fountain, and Apollon Temple. Lunch at local restaurant.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Best western Khan\xa0(Deluxe) /\xa0Holiday Inn Lara\xa0(Premium) or Similar in\xa0Antalya'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nFull Day Antalya Tour On SIC Basis\nFull Day Antalya Tour on SIC basis: Today Enjoy a Full day Antalya SIC tour including Kursunlu Waterfall, Old Town Kaleici, Hadrian Gate, Hidirlik Hills, Clock Tower, Fluted Minaret, and Palm Street, with lunch at a local restaurant.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast and Lunch', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Best western Khan\xa0(Deluxe) /\xa0Holiday Inn Lara\xa0(Premium) or Similar in\xa0Antalya'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Antalya (Internal Flight is not Included)\nTransfer: From Hotel to Antalya Airport on private basis. From Antalya airport to Istanbul for your Journey back home (Internal Flight not included)\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nFour Sides Lion Taksim / Erboy Hotel/ Konak Taksim as BB or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nDedeli Cave / Sunak Cave Hotel as BB or similar\n\n\n\n\nKusadasi\n\n\nEfe Boutique Hotel/ Karaaslan Inn hotel /Ladies Beach or similar\n\n\n\n\nAntalya\n\n\nBest western Khan/Prime Hotel/ Ring Downtown or similar\n\n\n\n', 'Overnight stay at the Hotels', '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n5* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nThe Elysium Taksim/Doubletree Hilton Piyalepasa Hotel as BB or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nHanedan Cave / Acer Cave Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nKusadasi\n\n\nSignature Blue Hotel / Le Bleu Hotel /Ramada as HB or similar\n\n\n\n\nAntalya\n\n\nHoliday Inn Lara Hotel / Doubletree Hilton City Center or similar\n\n\n\n'], 'hotels_list': {'1': '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nFour Sides Lion Taksim / Erboy Hotel/ Konak Taksim as BB or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nDedeli Cave / Sunak Cave Hotel as BB or similar\n\n\n\n\nKusadasi\n\n\nEfe Boutique Hotel/ Karaaslan Inn hotel /Ladies Beach or similar\n\n\n\n\nAntalya\n\n\nBest western Khan/Prime Hotel/ Ring Downtown or similar\n\n\n\n', '2': '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n5* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nThe Elysium Taksim/Doubletree Hilton Piyalepasa Hotel as BB or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nHanedan Cave / Acer Cave Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nKusadasi\n\n\nSignature Blue Hotel / Le Bleu Hotel /Ramada as HB or similar\n\n\n\n\nAntalya\n\n\nHoliday Inn Lara Hotel / Doubletree Hilton City Center or similar\n\n\n\n', '0': 'Overnight stay at the Hotels'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'TR', 'countryName': 'Turkey', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Value', 'Premium'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Value', 'price': 150400.0, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nFour Sides Lion Taksim / Erboy Hotel/ Konak Taksim as BB or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nDedeli Cave / Sunak Cave Hotel as BB or similar\n\n\n\n\nKusadasi\n\n\nEfe Boutique Hotel/ Karaaslan Inn hotel /Ladies Beach or similar\n\n\n\n\nAntalya\n\n\nBest western Khan/Prime Hotel/ Ring Downtown or similar\n\n\n\n']}, {'category': 'Premium', 'price': 166300.0, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n5* Category\n\n\n\n\nIstanbul\n\n\nThe Elysium Taksim/Doubletree Hilton Piyalepasa Hotel as BB or similar\n\n\n\n\nCappadocia\n\n\nHanedan Cave / Acer Cave Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nKusadasi\n\n\nSignature Blue Hotel / Le Bleu Hotel /Ramada as HB or similar\n\n\n\n\nAntalya\n\n\nHoliday Inn Lara Hotel / Doubletree Hilton City Center or similar\n\n\n\n']}], 'meals': ['\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\xa0\nEnjoy a romantic dining experience with private round trip transfers\nLunches on 2,6,7,8\n', 'Breakfast Included'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['Sightseeing: [Tour starts from a city centre point, service to & from the hotel is not included ]\n\nIstanbul Old City Tour (On Sic Basis)\nFull Day Kusadasi Tour on SIC\xa0\nFull Day Pamukkale & Hierapolis Tour on SIC basis\xa0\nFull Day Antalya Tour on SIC basis\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Return Economy Class Airfare', 'inclusions': 'Accommodation:\n\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Istanbul in the above mentioned hotel or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Cappadocia in the above mentioned hotel or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Kusadasi in the above mentioned hotel or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Antalya the above mentioned hotel or similar\n\nMeals:\n\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\xa0\nEnjoy a romantic dining experience with private round trip transfers\nLunches on 2,6,7,8\n\n\xa0\nSightseeing:\xa0 [ Tour starts from a city centre point, service to & from the hotel is not included ]\n\nIstanbul Old City Tour (On Sic Basis)\nFull Day Kusadasi Tour on SIC\xa0\nFull Day Pamukkale & Hierapolis Tour on SIC basis\xa0\nFull Day Antalya Tour on SIC basis\n\n\xa0\nTransfers: [ Includes Point to Point Transfer with limited waiting hours]\n\nArrival Airport transfers in Istanbul on Private basis\xa0\nPrivate transfer from Istanbul hotel to Airport for the onwards flight to Cappadocia\nFrom Cappadocia Airport to Hotel on Private Basis\nPrivate transfer from Cappadocia hotel to Airport for the onwards flight to Izmir\nFrom Izmir to Kusadasi hotel on Private basis\nDeparture airport transfers in Antalya on Private basis\n\nInsurance:\n\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nLunch & Dinner (if not mentioned)\nDrinks during meals\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included in the price.\nCity taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nCost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.\n', 'termsAndConditions': '', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014704/Cappadocia267.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014704/itinerary/Istanbul753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014704/itinerary/Istanbul.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014704/itinerary/Cappadocia7532.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014704/itinerary/Cappadocia7531.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014704/itinerary/Kusadasi56.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014704/itinerary/AntalyaCity7532.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014704/itinerary/AntalyaCity75323.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014704/itinerary/AntalyaCity7532.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014704/itinerary/AntalyaCity.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014527', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014527', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'London, Paris, Swiss And Italy', 'days': 14, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'London', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'London', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Paris', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Central / Southern Switzerland', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Venice', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Venice', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Florence', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rome', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rome', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rome', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014527_0_20260916141602.pdf', 'price': 421947, 'packageSummary': "The 'London, Paris, Swiss And Italy' package is a spectacular 14-day tour covering London, Paris, Central and Southern Switzerland, Venice, Florence, and Rome. The itinerary includes visits to world-famous landmarks such as the Eiffel Tower, the Colosseum, the Tower of London, and the breathtaking Swiss Alps. Participants will enjoy guided city sightseeing, a scenic cruise along the River Seine, a traditional gondola ride through the canals of Venice, and an exploration of Florence's rich Renaissance heritage.", 'images': ['London7531.jpg', 'LondonTowerBridge7531.jpg', 'Paris75390.jpg', 'EiffelTowerParisFrance7534.jpg', 'Interlaken2.jpg', '89366_Mt._Titlis_Engelberg_Switzerland_753.jpg', 'Jungfraujoch75345.jpg', 'Glacier.jpg', 'VeniceRialtoBridgeItaly75312.jpg', '71702_Venice_753.jpg', 'Florence_1.jpg', 'rome.jpg', 'Rome-Colosseum.jpg', 'Rome789.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 421947, 'thumbnailImage': 'Rome_SRP.png', 'packageTheme': ['Adventure', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Most Booked', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014527 is named 'London, Paris, Swiss And Italy' and spans 14 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - London, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive London Transfers: Upon your arrival at the airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 14:00 - 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - London, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Hop On Hop Off Tour - Madame Tussauds - London Eye - Tower Of London Hop on Hop Off Tour: The London Hop-On Hop-Off Bus Tour is a flexible sightseeing experience that lets you explore the city’s most iconic landmarks at your own pace with multiple routes and stops near attractions. Madame Tussauds With Marvel 4d Cinema and Star Wars Experience: Step into the world of fame and fantasy at Madame Tussauds London. Get up close with lifelike wax figures of celebrities, historical icons, and world leaders. Enjoy the thrilling Marvel 4D Cinema, where superheroes come alive in an immersive experience, and explore the Star Wars Experience, featuring iconic characters and scenes from the legendary saga. It’s an unforgettable mix of glamour, action, and adventure for all ages. London Eye – Ticket: The London Eye is one of the city’s most iconic attractions, offering breathtaking 360° views of London’s skyline from a giant observation wheel on the South Bank of the River Thames. Standing at 135 meters tall, it provides a unique perspective of landmarks like Big Ben, Buckingham Palace, and St. Paul’s Cathedral. A must-visit for stunning photo opportunities and an unforgettable experience. Tower of London: The Tower of London is a historic fortress on the north bank of the River Thames, famous for its rich history as a royal palace, prison, and treasury. Home to the dazzling Crown Jewels and centuries of intrigue, it offers visitors a glimpse into Britain’s royal past, iconic Yeoman Warders, and legendary tales like that of the ravens. A must-see UNESCO World Heritage Site for history lovers., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Description: London To Paris Via Train Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Paris. Upon your arrival at Paris train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion. Moulin Rouge Show (Optional): Experience the world-famous Moulin Rouge in Paris, an iconic cabaret known for its dazzling performances, vibrant costumes, and spectacular dance routines, including the legendary French Cancan. Located in the heart of Montmartre, this unforgettable show combines music, glamour, and artistry, offering a true taste of Parisian nightlife., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Paris, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Paris City Tour + River Seine Cruise + Eiffel Tower Tour Paris City Tour: Later discover Paris's most famous tourist sites and monuments on one unique tour. This tour features a visit to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower with breathtaking views of the capital, a panoramic city tour by coach, plus an hour-long boat trip along the River Seine. This comprehensive tour is the ideal way to discover Paris for the first time. Special Note: Thanks to your priority access, you can skip the line and speed up by elevator to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower, Paris's most unmissable monument., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Paris To Central Switzerland Via Train Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Central Switzerland. Upon your arrival in Central Switzerland, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion. Lucerne Tour with Swiss Pass on your own (Optional): Travel to Lucerne with Swiss pass on your own as there are many sights in a small area in Lucerne like Chapel Bridge with the Water Tower which is the landmark of Lucerne and the most photographed monument in Switzerland., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Mt. Titlis Excursion Mt. Titlis Excursion: Don't miss the spectacular beauty of Mt Titlis! Discover eternal glaciers and other attractions from more than 3020m / 10000 ft high. Enjoy the spectacular sight of the glacier's deep crevasses and gigantic ice boulders from the revolving cable car ROTAIR. At the top of Mt. Titlis (10'000 ft. above sea level), a high alpine panorama awaits you. Visit the Ice Grotto or take a ride with the chairlift IceFlyer, which brings you close to the crevasses. Enjoy also the FunLift in the snow and the Cliff Walk, Europe's highest suspension bridge. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Jungfraujoch Excursion Jungfraujoch Excursion: Don't miss the highlight of any Swiss holiday and go for this thrilling and unforgettable excursion to Jungfraujoch, Top of Europe! From Interlaken, the heart of the Jungfrau region mountain world and uniquely situated between two lakes, you make your way to famous mountain resort Grindelwald where you board the cogwheel train for a spectacular ride via Kleine Scheidegg to Jungfraujoch. Enjoy stunning views of the world-famous triple peaks of Eiger, Monch and Jungfrau accompany you all the way to the top. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Central / Southern Switzerland, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Central Switzerland Day At Leisure (Optional Activity) Glacier 3000 (Optional): Escape to the high Alps to breath a fresh air and spectacular mountain vistas on the Glacier 3000 (Optional Mountain Excursion). Glacier 3000, located at the highest point of the Vaudois Alps, is open all year round for winter activities for all! With its stunning views and wide range of activities on offer – including the Peak Walk, a unique suspension bridge linking two mountain peaks – Glacier 3000 is a must for your holidays in Switzerland. Bollywood Tour (Optional): Gstaad region is known as one of the most scenic natural film sets in the world. Many Bollywood blockbusters have been filmed here, such as DDLJ “Bachana Ae Haseenno” and many more. Lunch can be included on this tour., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 9 - Venice, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Central / Southern Swiss To Venice Via Train Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Venice. Upon your arrival at Venice train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. Gondola Ride: Experience Venice in the most Venetian way possible: via a shared gondola ride while being serenaded. Choose between an afternoon or evening ride and then begin the ride, as part of a group of eight different gondolas, with a singer aboard one of the boats. In addition to the song being sun to you, enjoy the sites of Venice's main landmarks, including the grand Canal and Palazzo Barberino., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 10 - Venice, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Murano, Burano And Torcello Half-Day Tour Murano, Burano and Torcello Half-Day Sightseeing Tour: Today visit Torcello, Murano, and Burano — three islands in the Venetian Lagoon — on this tour from Venice by motorboat. With a guide, watch glass being blown at a Murano glass factory, see historical cathedrals on Torcello, and admire exquisite handmade lace on Burano. This is a great way to see more than just the central sights of Venice and enjoy a cruise on the water. Highlights: Visit the three most famous islands in the Venetian Lagoon by motorboat Watch master glass blowers at work at a factory on Murano See Byzantine churches on Torcello— the Church of Santa Fosca Browse for lace on Burano and admire the painted houses McArthurGlen Designer Outlet (Optional): Later you can opt to visit the McArthurGlen Designer Outlet in Noventa di Piave is the most prestigious shopping outlet in Veneto, where you can find the most prestigious fashion with discounts up to 70% all around the year. Located just 30 minutes by car from Venice. Over 100 shops, restaurants, bars, lounges, play areas for children, located in a beautiful setting with architectural mosaics and frescoes inspired by the palaces in Venice and Treviso, where you can satisfy your thirst for great fashion, taking advantage of the offers and services designed specifically to make time spent here unforgettable. Planning to Visit? Click the link below to conveniently book your shuttle bus tickets and enjoy exciting deals at the nearest outlet: https://mgbooking.tripodeck.com/home?orderCustId=6977233, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 11 - Florence, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Venice To Florence Via Train Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Florence. Upon your arrival at Florence train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. You will have a transfer from Florence to Pisa and back to Florence. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion. Pisa and the Leaning Tower Tour: This popular half-day trip takes you from Florence through the scenic Tuscan countryside to the historic city of Pisa. The tour focuses on Piazza dei Miracoli, a UNESCO World Heritage site, where you’ll see the Leaning Tower, the Cathedral, the Baptistery, and the Monumental Cemetery., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 12 - Rome, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Florence To Rome Via Train Transfers: Make your way to the train station for your onward journey to Rome. Upon your arrival at Rome train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own. Special Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 13 - Rome, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Rome - Hop On Hop Off Tour Hop on Hop Off Tour: Discover Rome's iconic sights and landmarks on a hop-on hop-off bus tour, offering a comprehensive overview of all the city’s highlights. Disembark at any of the multiple stops to see popular landmarks such as the Vatican City, Circus Maximus, the Pantheon, or the Colosseum. While on board the bus, listen to recorded commentary in multiple languages that details the history, architecture, culture, and traditions of the Eternal City., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 14 - Rome, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Rome Transfers: From Rome hotel to airport, you will have a private transfer. Special Notes: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 421947.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n\n\nPark Plaza London / Park International / Copthorne Tara London Kensington / Holiday Inn® London Kensington / Mercure London Paddington or similar\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nMercure Paris Opéra Faubourg Montmartre / Novotel Paris Center Eiffel Tower / Novotel Paris Center Gare Montparnasse / Mercure Paris Bercy Bibliotheque Hotel / Hotel Mademoiselle or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nCampus Hotel Hertenstein | Romantik Hotel Beau Rivage - Weggis | Hotel Baren Sigriswil | Hotel Eden Spiez | Seegarten Marina or similar\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\nBest Western Hotel Artdeco / Atlantico / Hotel Massimo D'azeglio / Hotel Diana Roof Garden / Best Western President or similar\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nAtlantic Palace / De La Ville / Embassy Hotel / Starhotels Michelangelo Florence / Hotel Principe di Firenze / C Hotel Club / C-hotels Ambassadors Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice\n\n\nRoyal San Marco Hotel / San Marco Palace / Hotel Kette / Bonvecchiati or similar or similar\n\n\n\n, \xa0\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nSTANDARD CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n\n\nIbis London Earls Court Hotel /\xa0Point A Hotel, London Paddington / Best Western Buckingham Palace Rd\xa0\xa0/The W14 Hotel Kensington / London House Hotel / Mentone Hotel / BW Swiss Cottage or similar\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nHotel Opera Lafayette / Color Design Hotel / Hôtel Champerret-Elysées / Londres Et New York Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nLa Pergola | Ibis Styles Bern City | Prizeotel Bern-city | Jardin | Sorell Hotel Ador or similar\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\nAndreotti Hotel and Domus Australia / Hotel Villa San Lorenzo Maria / Hotel Des Artistes / Hotel Nord Nuova Roma / Hotel Windrose or similar\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nAlbergo Firenze / Hotel Boccaccio / Hotel Paris / Hotel Machiavelli Palace / Hotel Luxor Florence or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice\n\n\nHotel Diana / Albergo San Marco / San Zulian / Hotel Montecarlo or similar\n\n\n\n, Overnight stay at the Hotels. Meals include: Breakfast Included. Inclusions: Accommodation: 2 Nights’ accommodation in Paris based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in London based on the hotel category selected or similar 4 Nights’ accommodation in Central Switzerland based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Venice based on the hotel category selected or similar 1 Night accommodation in Florence based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Rome based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation:[Includes Privates service s on Point to Point Basis] Arrival Airport Transfer from London Airport to London Hotel Departure Airport Transfer from Rome Hotel to Rome Airport Train Tickets: [Cost is subject to vary until Ticketed] 2nd Class Train Ticket London – Paris (Eurostar): – Subject to availability until ticketed 2nd Class Train Ticket Paris – Geneva / Basel (TGV). Swiss Pass 4 Days Consecutive Saver Lucerne – Zurich Airport: – Subject to availability until ticketed. Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis and from a designated point) London Hop On Hop Off Bus tour. London Eye (Entrance Only). Madame Tussauds (Entrance Only). Tower of London (Entrance Only) Interactive City Tour, Seine Cruise and Eiffel Tower 2nd Floor with Priority Access (SIC) Mt Titlis Excursion (in conjunction with Swiss Pass) Jungfraujoch Excursion (in conjunction with Swiss Pass) Venice: Venice Gondola Ride (30 Mins) and Serenade. Venice: Murano, Burano and Torcello Half-Day Sightseeing Tour Florence: Pisa and the Leaning Tower Tour from Florence Rome: Hop on Hop off in Rome Intercity travel by Train (Second Class): London – Paris (Eurostar). Paris – Geneva / Basel (TGV). Swiss Pass 4 Days Consecutive Saver. Lucerne – Venice. Venice – Florence. Florence – Rome. Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of USD 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: Important Notes: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability Terms And Conditions: Travel Validity: 1 April 2026 – 30 September 2026 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Goa', 'cityCode': 'GOI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'London, Paris, Swiss And Italy' package is a spectacular 14-day tour covering London, Paris, Central and Southern Switzerland, Venice, Florence, and Rome. The itinerary includes visits to world-famous landmarks such as the Eiffel Tower, the Colosseum, the Tower of London, and the breathtaking Swiss Alps. Participants will enjoy guided city sightseeing, a scenic cruise along the River Seine, a traditional gondola ride through the canals of Venice, and an exploration of Florence's rich Renaissance heritage.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive London\n\xa0\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at the airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle.\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 14:00 - 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Ibis Earls Court\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Park Plaza\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0London'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nHop On Hop Off Tour - Madame Tussauds - London Eye - Tower Of London\n\xa0\nHop on Hop Off Tour: The London Hop-On Hop-Off Bus Tour is a flexible sightseeing experience that lets you explore the city’s most iconic landmarks at your own pace with multiple routes and stops near attractions.\n\xa0\nMadame Tussauds With Marvel 4d Cinema and Star Wars Experience: Step into the world of fame and fantasy at Madame Tussauds London. Get up close with lifelike wax figures of celebrities, historical icons, and world leaders. Enjoy the thrilling Marvel 4D Cinema, where superheroes come alive in an immersive experience, and explore the Star Wars Experience, featuring iconic characters and scenes from the legendary saga. It’s an unforgettable mix of glamour, action, and adventure for all ages.\n\xa0\nLondon Eye – Ticket: The London Eye is one of the city’s most iconic attractions, offering breathtaking 360° views of London’s skyline from a giant observation wheel on the South Bank of the River Thames. Standing at 135 meters tall, it provides a unique perspective of landmarks like Big Ben, Buckingham Palace, and St. Paul’s Cathedral. A must-visit for stunning photo opportunities and an unforgettable experience.\n\xa0\nTower of London: The Tower of London is a historic fortress on the north bank of the River Thames, famous for its rich history as a royal palace, prison, and treasury. Home to the dazzling Crown Jewels and centuries of intrigue, it offers visitors a glimpse into Britain’s royal past, iconic Yeoman Warders, and legendary tales like that of the ravens. A must-see UNESCO World Heritage Site for history lovers.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Ibis Earls Court\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Park Plaza\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0London'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nLondon To Paris Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Paris.\nUpon your arrival at Paris train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\n\xa0\nMoulin Rouge Show (Optional): Experience the world-famous Moulin Rouge in Paris, an iconic cabaret known for its dazzling performances, vibrant costumes, and spectacular dance routines, including the legendary French Cancan. Located in the heart of Montmartre, this unforgettable show combines music, glamour, and artistry, offering a true taste of Parisian nightlife.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Opera Lafayette\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Mercure Paris Opera Faubourg Montmartre\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Paris'}, {'day': 4, 'description': "\xa0Paris City Tour + River Seine Cruise + Eiffel Tower Tour\xa0\n\xa0\nParis City Tour: Later discover Paris's most famous tourist sites and monuments on one unique tour. This tour features a visit to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower with breathtaking views of the capital, a panoramic city tour by coach, plus an hour-long boat trip along the River Seine. This comprehensive tour is the ideal way to discover Paris for the first time.\xa0\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Thanks to your priority access, you can skip the line and speed up by elevator to the 2nd floor of the Eiffel Tower, Paris's most unmissable monument.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Opera Lafayette\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Mercure Paris Opera Faubourg Montmartre\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Paris'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nParis To Central Switzerland Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Central Switzerland.\xa0\nUpon your arrival in Central Switzerland, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\n\xa0\nLucerne Tour with Swiss Pass on your own (Optional): Travel to Lucerne with Swiss pass on your own as there are many sights in a small area in Lucerne like Chapel Bridge with the Water Tower which is the landmark of Lucerne and the most photographed monument in Switzerland.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola (Standard) /\xa0Campus\xa0Hertenstein\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 6, 'description': "\xa0\nMt. Titlis Excursion\n\xa0\nMt. Titlis Excursion: Don't miss the spectacular beauty of Mt Titlis! Discover eternal glaciers and other attractions from more than 3020m / 10000 ft high. Enjoy the spectacular sight of the glacier's deep crevasses and gigantic ice boulders from the revolving cable car ROTAIR. At the top of Mt. Titlis (10'000 ft. above sea level), a high alpine panorama awaits you. Visit the Ice Grotto or take a ride with the chairlift IceFlyer, which brings you close to the crevasses. Enjoy also the FunLift in the snow and the Cliff Walk, Europe's highest suspension bridge. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass)", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola (Standard) /\xa0Campus\xa0Hertenstein\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 7, 'description': "\xa0\nJungfraujoch Excursion\n\xa0\nJungfraujoch Excursion: Don't miss the highlight of any Swiss holiday and go for this thrilling and unforgettable excursion to Jungfraujoch, Top of Europe! From Interlaken, the heart of the Jungfrau region mountain world and uniquely situated between two lakes, you make your way to famous mountain resort Grindelwald where you board the cogwheel train for a spectacular ride via Kleine Scheidegg to Jungfraujoch. Enjoy stunning views of the world-famous triple peaks of Eiger, Monch and Jungfrau accompany you all the way to the top. (in conjunction with Swiss Pass)", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola (Standard) /\xa0Campus\xa0Hertenstein\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nCentral Switzerland Day At Leisure (Optional Activity)\n\xa0\nGlacier 3000 (Optional): Escape to the high Alps to breath a fresh air and spectacular mountain vistas on the Glacier 3000 (Optional Mountain Excursion). Glacier 3000, located at the highest point of the Vaudois Alps, is open all year round for winter activities for all! With its stunning views and wide range of activities on offer – including the Peak Walk, a unique suspension bridge linking two mountain peaks – Glacier 3000 is a must for your holidays in Switzerland.\n\xa0\nBollywood Tour (Optional): Gstaad region is known as one of the most scenic natural film sets in the world. Many Bollywood blockbusters have been filmed here, such as DDLJ “Bachana Ae Haseenno” and many more. Lunch can be included on this tour.\n\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0La Pergola (Standard) /\xa0Campus\xa0Hertenstein\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Central / Southern Switzerland'}, {'day': 9, 'description': "\xa0\nCentral / Southern Swiss To Venice Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Venice.\xa0\nUpon your arrival at Venice train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nGondola Ride: Experience Venice in the most Venetian way possible: via a shared gondola ride while being serenaded. Choose between an afternoon or evening ride and then begin the ride, as part of a group of eight different gondolas, with a singer aboard one of the boats. In addition to the song being sun to you, enjoy the sites of Venice's main landmarks, including the grand Canal and Palazzo Barberino.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Diana (Standard) /\xa0Royal San Marco (Value) or similar in Venice\xa0'}, {'day': 10, 'description': '\xa0\nMurano, Burano And Torcello Half-Day Tour\n\xa0\nMurano, Burano and Torcello Half-Day Sightseeing Tour: Today visit Torcello, Murano, and Burano — three islands in the Venetian Lagoon — on this tour from Venice by motorboat. With a guide, watch glass being blown at a Murano glass factory, see historical cathedrals on Torcello, and admire exquisite handmade lace on Burano. This is a great way to see more than just the central sights of Venice and enjoy a cruise on the water.\n\xa0\nHighlights:\xa0\n\nVisit the three most famous islands in the Venetian Lagoon by motorboat\xa0\nWatch master glass blowers at work at a factory on Murano\xa0\nSee Byzantine churches on Torcello— the Church of Santa Fosca\xa0\nBrowse for lace on Burano and admire the painted houses\n\n\xa0\nMcArthurGlen Designer Outlet (Optional):\xa0 Later you can opt to visit the McArthurGlen Designer Outlet in Noventa di Piave is the most prestigious shopping outlet in Veneto, where you can find the most prestigious fashion with discounts up to 70% all around the year. Located just 30 minutes by car from Venice. Over 100 shops, restaurants, bars, lounges, play areas for children, located in a beautiful setting with architectural mosaics and frescoes inspired by the palaces in Venice and Treviso, where you can satisfy your thirst for great fashion, taking advantage of the offers and services designed specifically to make time spent here unforgettable.\n\xa0\nPlanning to Visit?\nClick the link below to conveniently book your shuttle bus tickets and enjoy exciting deals at the nearest outlet: https://mgbooking.tripodeck.com/home?orderCustId=6977233', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Diana (Standard) /\xa0Royal San Marco (Value) or similar in Venice\xa0'}, {'day': 11, 'description': '\xa0\nVenice To Florence Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Florence.\xa0\nUpon your arrival at Florence train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\nYou will have a transfer from Florence to Pisa and back to Florence.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\xa0\n\xa0\nPisa and the Leaning Tower Tour: This popular half-day trip takes you from Florence through the scenic Tuscan countryside to the historic city of Pisa. The tour focuses on Piazza dei Miracoli, a UNESCO World Heritage site, where you’ll see the Leaning Tower, the Cathedral, the Baptistery, and the Monumental Cemetery.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Albergo Firenze (Standard) / Atlantic Palace (Value) or similar in Florence'}, {'day': 12, 'description': '\xa0\n\xa0\nFlorence To Rome Via Train\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Rome.\xa0\nUpon your arrival at Rome train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Andreotti and Domus Australia\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Best Western Artdeco (Value) or similar in Rome'}, {'day': 13, 'description': "\xa0\nRome - Hop On Hop Off Tour\n\xa0\nHop on Hop Off Tour: Discover Rome's iconic sights and landmarks on a hop-on hop-off bus tour, offering a comprehensive overview of all the city’s highlights. Disembark at any of the multiple stops to see popular landmarks such as the Vatican City, Circus Maximus, the Pantheon, or the Colosseum. While on board the bus, listen to recorded commentary in multiple languages that details the history, architecture, culture, and traditions of the Eternal City.\n\xa0\n\xa0", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Andreotti and Domus Australia\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Best Western Artdeco (Value) or similar in Rome'}, {'day': 14, 'description': 'Depart Rome\n\xa0\nTransfers: From Rome hotel to airport, you will have a private transfer.\n\xa0\nSpecial Notes: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight.\n\xa0\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ["\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\n\n\nVALUE CATEGORY\n\n\n\n\nLondon\n\n\nPark Plaza London / Park International / Copthorne Tara London Kensington / Holiday Inn® London Kensington / Mercure London Paddington or similar\n\n\n\n\nParis\n\n\nMercure Paris Opéra Faubourg Montmartre / Novotel Paris Center Eiffel Tower / Novotel Paris Center Gare Montparnasse / Mercure Paris Bercy Bibliotheque Hotel / Hotel Mademoiselle or similar\n\n\n\n\nCentral / Southern Switzerland\n\n\nCampus Hotel Hertenstein | Romantik Hotel Beau Rivage - Weggis | Hotel Baren Sigriswil | Hotel Eden Spiez | Seegarten Marina or similar\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\nBest Western Hotel Artdeco / Atlantico / Hotel Massimo D'azeglio / Hotel Diana Roof Garden / Best Western President or similar\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nAtlantic Palace / De La Ville / Em