the passenger other than those included in your itinerary.\n', 'termsAndConditions': '', 'pkgSubtypeId': 3, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'GIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': -1, 'productId': 4, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package includes flights in the package price.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015156/Tiblisi267Georgia.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015156/itinerary/Baku_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015156/itinerary/753_NizamiStreet.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015156/itinerary/baku-Ateshgah.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015156/itinerary/Nohur-Lake.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015156/itinerary/Tbilisi_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015156/itinerary/Mtshekhta_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015156/itinerary/Ananuri-Castle.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015156/itinerary/Kakheti_Church_Georgia_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG015156/itinerary/Georgia_Tbilis_753.jpg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG014939', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG014939', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'october_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Italy - Private Journeys (Winter)', 'days': 9, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Rome', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rome', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Rome', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Florence', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Florence', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Venice Mestre', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Venice Mestre', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Milan', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Milan', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG014939_0_20260910120150.pdf', 'price': 594423, 'packageSummary': "The 'Italy - Private Journeys (Winter)' package is a 9-day tour covering Milan, Florence, Rome, and Venice Mestre. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the magnificent Duomo in Milan, the Renaissance treasures of Florence, the historic Colosseum in Rome, and the romantic canals of Venice. Participants will enjoy private guided city tours, seamless high-speed train journeys between destinations, and exclusive cultural experiences tailored for a memorable winter getaway.", 'images': ['Romecity.jpg', 'Rome-Colosseum.jpg', 'amalfi.png', '2987_Florence_753.jpg', 'Pisa_1.jpg', 'Venice.png', '59724_Venice_Mark_Square753.jpg', '16950_Duomo_Square_Cathedral_Milan_Italy_753.jpg', 'Milan_Cityview_753.jpeg'], 'minimumPrice': 594423, 'thumbnailImage': 'DuomoSquareCathedral_Milan_SRP.jpg', 'packageTheme': ['Private Journeys', 'Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': '', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG014939 is named 'Italy - Private Journeys (Winter)' and spans 9 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Rome, Meals: N/A, Description: Arrive Rome, Capital Of Italy Transfers: Upon your arrival at Rome International Airport, you will have a private transfer to the hotel. Opera Arias by Opera da Camera di Roma (Optional): Depending on arrival time, attend an evening concert of famous Italian opera arias, Neapolitan songs, and Vivaldi’s Four Seasons. Performed by tenor and soprano with piano, the concerts offer superb acoustics in Rome’s historic Waldesian or Methodist Church. [Supplement Cost of approx. EUR 40 Per Person] Special Note: Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion Point to Point Airport transfer from Rome Airport to Rome Hotel, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Rome, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Rome Sightseeing Rome City Tour: Today visit the Vatican Museums and Sistine Chapel, home to Michelangelo’s Last Judgment, and St. Peter’s Basilica, the world’s largest cathedral. Explore Rome’s icons including Castel Sant’Angelo, Circus Maximus, Colosseum, Roman Forum, and the Trevi Fountain. Special Note: Vehicle at disposal for 10 hrs. inclusive of Entrance ticket to Vatican & Sistine Chapel & Entrance ticket to Colosseum – Both services subject to availability, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Rome, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day Trip To Amalfi Day Trip to Amalfi: Today enjoy a private van journey along the stunning Amalfi Coast, one of the world’s most scenic routes. Stop at Positano, Amalfi, Atrani, and Ravello to admire dramatic cliffs, colorful towns, and breathtaking coastal views before returning to Rome in the evening. Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Florence, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Rome To Florence Transfers: Today you will head to another region in Italy – Florence on private basis! {Travel time of approx. 3 – 3.5 hrs. depending on traffic and stops in between cities} Florence Guided Walking Tour: Enjoy a 2 hour guided walking tour of Florence, visiting highlights like the Duomo and Ponte Vecchio, or explore hidden gems such as the Boboli Gardens and Santo Spirito, perfect for first time and returning visitors. Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs. Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Florence, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Day Trip To Pisa And Siena (Tuscany Regoin) Day Trip to Pisa & Tuscany: Enjoy a scenic day trip to Pisa and Tuscany, featuring the iconic Leaning Tower of Pisa and the charming countryside. Explore picturesque villages, rolling vineyards, and local culture, with opportunities to savour regional cuisine and wines. Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs. Non Guided Activity (Day Trip Excursions from Florence), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Venice Mestre, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Florence To Venice Mestre Transfers: Today you will head to another region in Italy – Venice on private basis! {Travel time of approx. 3 – 3.5 hrs. depending on traffic and stops in between cities} Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs. Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Venice Mestre, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Venice Sightseeing Transfers: Transfer from Venice Mestre Hotel to Venice Tronchetto/Piazzale Roma Private Water Taxi from Tronchetto/Piazzale Roma to Venice St. Marks Sqare (6 pax per taxi) Private Water Taxi from Venice St. Marks Sqare to Tronchetto/Piazzale Roma (6 pax per taxi) Walking Guided Tour of Venice Island: Enjoy a 2 hour guided walking tour of Venice, perfect if you have just one day. Discover the city’s magic while learning its history and seeing exterior highlights like the Doge’s Palace and St. Mark’s Basilica. Private Gondola Ride: Enjoy a romantic private gondola ride through Venice, gliding past palaces along the Grand Canal and charming side canals. See landmarks like Accademia Bridge and Palazzo Grassi, then transfer by private water taxi from St. Mark’s Square to Tronchetto or Piazzale Roma. (30min, 6 pax per Gondola) Special Note: Point to Point Transfers with Sightseeing on Private basis, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Milan, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Venice Mestre - Milan Transfers: Today you will head to the fashion capital – Milan on private basis! {Travel time of approx. 3 – 3.5 hrs. depending on traffic and stops in between cities} Guided Walking Tour of Milan: Discover Milan on a 2 hour guided walking tour with a local expert. Explore the historic city center, Duomo Square and Cathedral, Vittorio Emanuele Gallery, La Scala Theatre, Brera district, and the impressive Sforza Castle while learning about Milan’s rich history and iconic figures. Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs. Please note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion In the evening If you are in for some last-minute shopping you can visit to Quadrilatero d’Oro, Milan’s golden shopping rectangle., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 9 - Milan, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Milan Transfers: From Milan hotel to the Airport in private transfer. Special Note: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight. Do spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime. Standard: Travel Validity from 1 JULY – 31 OCTOBER 2026 NOTE: ADULT & CHILD COSTING WILL BE THE SAME FOR PRIVATE JOURNEYS Package Cost on 3* (Standard) Hotels: Based on Per Person Per Slab Starting From 8 – 9 Guests 10 – 11 Guests 12 Guests € 2,830 + INR 2250 € 2,600 + INR 2250 € 2,465 + INR 2250 Value: Travel Validity from 1 JULY – 31 OCTOBER 2026 NOTE: ADULT & CHILD COSTING WILL BE THE SAME FOR PRIVATE JOURNEYS Package Cost on 4* (Value) Hotels: Based on Per Person Per Slab Starting From 8 – 9 Guests 10 – 11 Guests 12 Guests € 3,420 + INR 2250 € 3,190 + INR 2250 € 3,055 + INR 2250, GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 594423.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4*\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\niQ Hotel Roma or Hotel Best Western Premier Hotel Royal Santina or similar\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nC-hotels Ambasciatori or Hotel Embassy or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice Mestre\n\n\nHotel Plaza Venice or Garden Hotel Michelangelo or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\nMilan\n\n\nBest Western Hotel City — Milano Centro Hotel or Starhotels Ritz or similar\n\n\n\n, \xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\nBest Western Globus Hotel or Hotel Kennedy\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nHotel Astro Mediceo or Sognando Firenze or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice Mestre\n\n\nCampanile Venice Mestre or Ca' dei Barcaroli or similar\n\n\n\n\nMilan\n\n\nibis Milano Centro or Eurohotel Milan Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0. Meals include: \nDaily breakfast except day 1\nOne Beverage Voucher at the Show Cheese Factory in the Engelberg Monastery\n. Inclusions: Accommodation: 3 Nights’ accommodation in Rome based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Florence based on the hotel category selected or similar 2 Nights’ accommodation in Venice Mestre based on the hotel category selected or similar 1 Night accommodation in Milan based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transfers: [Includes Point to Point Transfer with limited waiting hours] Arrival Transfer from Rome Airport to Rome Hotel on private basis Interhotel transfer from Rome Hotel to Florence Hotel Interhotel transfer from Florence Hotel to Venice Mestre Hotel Transfer from Venice Mestre Hotel to Venice Tronchetto/ Piazzale Roma Private Water Taxi from Venice St. Marks Sqare to Tronchetto/ Piazzale Roma & back (6 guests per taxi) Interhotel transfer from Venice Mestre Hotel to Milan Hotel Departure transfer from Milan Hotel to Milan Airport Vehicle at disposal for 10 hrs. as mentioned in the itinerary Sightseeing: [Tour timing will have to be decided at the time of booking] Rome panoramic sightseeing Entrance ticket to Vatican & Sistine Chapel - subject to availability Entrance ticket to Colosseum - subject to availability Day trip to Amalfi - explore on own Florence City on 02hr guided walking tour Day trip to Pisa and Seina (Tuscany region) 02hr walking guided tour of Venice Island Private Gondola Ride - 30min (6 pax per Gondola) 02hr guided walking tour of Milan city (No Entrances) Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Meals other than those specified (if any). Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 5/ CHF 5 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: General Notes: Quote for 2 guests is based on standard car like Toyota Prius or similar, Quote for 4 – 8 guests is based on Van like VW/Opel/Vito or similar, Quote from 10 guests it will be 14/16/19-seater vehicle or similar. If the guests exceed the seating capacity of the vehicle, then the rate will change based on a real-time basis as it will fall under coach packages For 2 to 6 guests, Vehicle is with driver cum guide. No separate guide If there are 5A + 3C or 6A + 2C or 4A + 4C etc. or similar, then we will have to check rates on real time basis. Blocking must be done a minimum 45 days prior to travel date with re-confirmation before 30 - 25 days of travel date unless there is an event then the booking has to be made on an immediate basis and the rate will be based on real-time availability If the travel date is during any festival, Sporting / Cultural / State or Government Event, Exhibition, Trade fairs etc. then the rate will change based on a real-time basis. Special Note: Hotels will be as per the names listed below or similar. If the requested hotels are not available, we will endeavor to book space in similarly priced hotels. Tips to drive & guide is not included (Nominal Tipping is EUR 5 Per person per day) We do not commit rooms with air conditioning. In case your guests are keen on the aircon, please let us know beforehand All the below itineraries have point to point transport on the arrival and departure day The vehicle will be on disposal for 10 driving hrs. per day. If guests exceed 10 hours, they will have to the pay extra hr. charges (to be advised at the time of booking) directly to the chauffeur. We aren’t holding any inventory of hotels / vehicles at the moment Important Notes: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost Terms And Conditions: Travel Validity: 1 July – 31 October 2026 // Except Blackout Period Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. TCS & GST would be levied as applicable The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Coimbatore', 'cityCode': 'CJB', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Varanasi', 'cityCode': 'VNS', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jaipur', 'cityCode': 'JAI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mumbai', 'cityCode': 'BOM', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chandigarh', 'cityCode': 'IXC', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Raipur', 'cityCode': 'RPR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Patna', 'cityCode': 'PAT', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kochi', 'cityCode': 'COK', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Delhi', 'cityCode': 'DEL', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kozhikode', 'cityCode': 'CCJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}], 'packageItinerary': {'summary': "The 'Italy - Private Journeys (Winter)' package is a 9-day tour covering Milan, Florence, Rome, and Venice Mestre. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the magnificent Duomo in Milan, the Renaissance treasures of Florence, the historic Colosseum in Rome, and the romantic canals of Venice. Participants will enjoy private guided city tours, seamless high-speed train journeys between destinations, and exclusive cultural experiences tailored for a memorable winter getaway.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Rome, Capital Of Italy\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at Rome International Airport, you will have a private transfer to the hotel.\n\xa0\nOpera Arias by Opera da Camera di Roma (Optional): Depending on arrival time, attend an evening concert of famous Italian opera arias, Neapolitan songs, and Vivaldi’s Four Seasons. Performed by tenor and soprano with piano, the concerts offer superb acoustics in Rome’s historic Waldesian or Methodist Church. [Supplement Cost of approx. EUR 40 Per Person]\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nPlease note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\nPoint to Point Airport transfer from Rome Airport to Rome Hotel\n', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Best Western Globus (Standard) /\xa0iQ Hotel Roma (Value) or similar in Rome'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\xa0\nRome Sightseeing\n\xa0\nRome City Tour: Today visit the Vatican Museums and Sistine Chapel, home to Michelangelo’s Last Judgment, and St. Peter’s Basilica, the world’s largest cathedral. Explore Rome’s icons including Castel Sant’Angelo, Circus Maximus, Colosseum, Roman Forum, and the Trevi Fountain.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Vehicle at disposal for 10 hrs. inclusive of Entrance ticket to Vatican & Sistine Chapel & Entrance ticket to Colosseum – Both services subject to availability', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Best Western Globus (Standard) / iQ Hotel Roma (Value) or similar in Rome'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nDay Trip To Amalfi\n\xa0\nDay Trip to Amalfi: Today enjoy a private van journey along the stunning Amalfi Coast, one of the world’s most scenic routes. Stop at Positano, Amalfi, Atrani, and Ravello to admire dramatic cliffs, colorful towns, and breathtaking coastal views before returning to Rome in the evening.\n\xa0\n Special Note: Vehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Best Western Globus (Standard) / iQ Hotel Roma (Value) or similar in Rome'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nRome To Florence\n\xa0\nTransfers: Today you will head to another region in Italy – Florence on private basis!\xa0\n{Travel time of approx. 3 – 3.5 hrs. depending on traffic and stops in between cities}\n\xa0\nFlorence Guided Walking Tour: Enjoy a 2 hour guided walking tour of Florence, visiting highlights like the Duomo and Ponte Vecchio, or explore hidden gems such as the Boboli Gardens and Santo Spirito, perfect for first time and returning visitors.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nVehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs.\xa0\nPlease note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Astro Mediceo (Standard) /\xa0C-hotels Ambasciatori (Value) or similar in\xa0Florence'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nDay Trip To Pisa And Siena (Tuscany Regoin)\n\xa0\nDay Trip to Pisa & Tuscany: Enjoy a scenic day trip to Pisa and Tuscany, featuring the iconic Leaning Tower of Pisa and the charming countryside. Explore picturesque villages, rolling vineyards, and local culture, with opportunities to savour regional cuisine and wines.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nVehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs.\nNon Guided Activity (Day Trip Excursions from Florence)\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Astro Mediceo (Standard) / C-hotels Ambasciatori (Value) or similar in Florence'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nFlorence To Venice Mestre\n\xa0\nTransfers: Today you will head to another region in Italy – Venice on private basis!\xa0\n{Travel time of approx. 3 – 3.5 hrs. depending on traffic and stops in between cities}\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nVehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs.\nPlease note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Campanile (Standard) /\xa0Hotel Plaza Venice (Value) or similar in\xa0Venice Mestre'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nVenice Sightseeing\n\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nTransfer from Venice Mestre Hotel to Venice Tronchetto/Piazzale Roma\nPrivate Water Taxi from Tronchetto/Piazzale Roma to Venice St. Marks Sqare (6 pax per taxi)\nPrivate Water Taxi from Venice St. Marks Sqare to Tronchetto/Piazzale Roma (6 pax per taxi)\n\n\xa0\nWalking Guided Tour of Venice Island: Enjoy a 2 hour guided walking tour of Venice, perfect if you have just one day. Discover the city’s magic while learning its history and seeing exterior highlights like the Doge’s Palace and St. Mark’s Basilica.\n\xa0\nPrivate Gondola Ride: Enjoy a romantic private gondola ride through Venice, gliding past palaces along the Grand Canal and charming side canals. See landmarks like Accademia Bridge and Palazzo Grassi, then transfer by private water taxi from St. Mark’s Square to Tronchetto or Piazzale Roma. (30min, 6 pax per Gondola)\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: Point to Point Transfers with Sightseeing on Private basis', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Campanile (Standard) / Hotel Plaza Venice (Value) or similar in Venice Mestre'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nVenice Mestre - Milan\n\xa0\nTransfers: Today you will head to the fashion capital – Milan on private basis!\xa0\n{Travel time of approx. 3 – 3.5 hrs. depending on traffic and stops in between cities}\n\xa0\nGuided Walking Tour of Milan: Discover Milan on a 2 hour guided walking tour with a local expert. Explore the historic city center, Duomo Square and Cathedral, Vittorio Emanuele Gallery, La Scala Theatre, Brera district, and the impressive Sforza Castle while learning about Milan’s rich history and iconic figures.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0\n\nVehicle will be at disposal for 10 hrs.\nPlease note the standard check in time would be at 15:00 hrs. or subject to hotel discretion\nIn the evening If you are in for some last-minute shopping you can visit to Quadrilatero d’Oro, Milan’s golden shopping rectangle.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Ibis Milano Centro\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Best Western Hotel City\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Milan'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Milan\nTransfers: From Milan hotel to the Airport in private transfer.\n\xa0\nSpecial Note: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight.\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.\nStandard:\n\n\n\n\nTravel Validity from 1 JULY – 31 OCTOBER 2026\n\n\n\n\nNOTE: ADULT & CHILD COSTING WILL BE THE SAME FOR PRIVATE JOURNEYS\nPackage Cost on 3* (Standard) Hotels: Based on Per Person Per Slab Starting From\n\n\n\n\n8 – 9 Guests\n\n\n10 – 11 Guests\n\n\n12 Guests\n\n\n\n\n€ 2,830\n\xa0+ INR 2250\n\n\n€ 2,600\n+ INR 2250\n\n\n€ 2,465\n+ INR 2250\n\n\n\n\n\xa0\nValue:\n\n\n\n\nTravel Validity from 1 JULY – 31 OCTOBER 2026\n\n\n\n\nNOTE: ADULT & CHILD COSTING WILL BE THE SAME FOR PRIVATE JOURNEYS\nPackage Cost on 4* (Value) Hotels: Based on Per Person Per Slab Starting From\n\n\n\n\n8 – 9 Guests\n\n\n10 – 11 Guests\n\n\n12 Guests\n\n\n\n\n€ 3,420\n+ INR 2250\n\n\n€ 3,190\n+ INR 2250\n\n\n€ 3,055\n+ INR 2250\n\n\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4*\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\niQ Hotel Roma or Hotel Best Western Premier Hotel Royal Santina or similar\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nC-hotels Ambasciatori or Hotel Embassy or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice Mestre\n\n\nHotel Plaza Venice or Garden Hotel Michelangelo or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\nMilan\n\n\nBest Western Hotel City — Milano Centro Hotel or Starhotels Ritz or similar\n\n\n\n', "\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\nBest Western Globus Hotel or Hotel Kennedy\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nHotel Astro Mediceo or Sognando Firenze or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice Mestre\n\n\nCampanile Venice Mestre or Ca' dei Barcaroli or similar\n\n\n\n\nMilan\n\n\nibis Milano Centro or Eurohotel Milan Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0"], 'hotels_list': {'0': "\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\nBest Western Globus Hotel or Hotel Kennedy\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nHotel Astro Mediceo or Sognando Firenze or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice Mestre\n\n\nCampanile Venice Mestre or Ca' dei Barcaroli or similar\n\n\n\n\nMilan\n\n\nibis Milano Centro or Eurohotel Milan Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0", '1': '\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4*\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\niQ Hotel Roma or Hotel Best Western Premier Hotel Royal Santina or similar\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nC-hotels Ambasciatori or Hotel Embassy or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice Mestre\n\n\nHotel Plaza Venice or Garden Hotel Michelangelo or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\nMilan\n\n\nBest Western Hotel City — Milano Centro Hotel or Starhotels Ritz or similar\n\n\n\n'}, 'continents': [{'continentId': 5, 'countryCode': 'IT', 'countryName': 'Italy', 'continentName': 'Europe'}], 'packageTourType': ['Standard', 'Value'], 'packageTourType_details': [{'category': 'Standard', 'price': 594400.0, 'hotels': ["\xa0\n\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\nBest Western Globus Hotel or Hotel Kennedy\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nHotel Astro Mediceo or Sognando Firenze or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice Mestre\n\n\nCampanile Venice Mestre or Ca' dei Barcaroli or similar\n\n\n\n\nMilan\n\n\nibis Milano Centro or Eurohotel Milan Hotel or similar\n\n\n\n\n\xa0"]}, {'category': 'Value', 'price': 660300.0, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\nHotels Envisaged Or Similar\n\n\n\n\nCity Name\n\n\n4*\n\n\n\n\nRome\n\n\niQ Hotel Roma or Hotel Best Western Premier Hotel Royal Santina or similar\n\n\n\n\nFlorence\n\n\nC-hotels Ambasciatori or Hotel Embassy or similar\n\n\n\n\nVenice Mestre\n\n\nHotel Plaza Venice or Garden Hotel Michelangelo or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\nMilan\n\n\nBest Western Hotel City — Milano Centro Hotel or Starhotels Ritz or similar\n\n\n\n']}], 'meals': ['\nDaily breakfast except day 1\nOne Beverage Voucher at the Show Cheese Factory in the Engelberg Monastery\n'], 'visa': [], 'transfer': ['As per itinerary'], 'sightseeing': ['Sightseeing: [Tour timing will have to be decided at the time of booking]\n\nRome panoramic sightseeing\nEntrance ticket to Vatican & Sistine Chapel - subject to availability\nEntrance ticket to Colosseum - subject to availability\nDay trip to Amalfi - explore on own\nFlorence City on 02hr guided walking tour\nDay trip to Pisa and Seina (Tuscany region)\n02hr walking guided tour of Venice Island\nPrivate Gondola Ride - 30min (6 pax per Gondola)\n02hr guided walking tour of Milan city (No Entrances)\n'], 'tourManagerDescription': '', 'flightDescription': 'Included as per itinerary', 'inclusions': 'Accommodation:\n\n3 Nights’ accommodation in Rome based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Florence based on the hotel category selected or similar\n2 Nights’ accommodation in Venice Mestre based on the hotel category selected or similar\n1 Night accommodation in Milan based on the hotel category selected or similar\n\n\xa0\nMeals:\n\nDaily Breakfast *(Except Day 1)\n\n\xa0\nTransfers: [Includes Point to Point Transfer with limited waiting hours]\n\nArrival Transfer from Rome Airport to Rome Hotel on private basis\nInterhotel transfer from Rome Hotel to Florence Hotel\nInterhotel transfer from Florence Hotel to Venice Mestre Hotel\nTransfer from Venice Mestre Hotel to Venice Tronchetto/ Piazzale Roma\nPrivate Water Taxi from Venice St. Marks Sqare to Tronchetto/ Piazzale Roma & back (6 guests per taxi)\nInterhotel transfer from Venice Mestre Hotel to Milan Hotel\nDeparture transfer from Milan Hotel to Milan Airport\nVehicle at disposal for 10 hrs. as mentioned in the itinerary\n\nSightseeing: [Tour timing will have to be decided at the time of booking]\n\nRome panoramic sightseeing\nEntrance ticket to Vatican & Sistine Chapel - subject to availability\nEntrance ticket to Colosseum - subject to availability\nDay trip to Amalfi - explore on own\nFlorence City on 02hr guided walking tour\nDay trip to Pisa and Seina (Tuscany region)\n02hr walking guided tour of Venice Island\nPrivate Gondola Ride - 30min (6 pax per Gondola)\n02hr guided walking tour of Milan city (No Entrances)\n\n\xa0\nInsurance:\n\nOverseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only)\n', 'exclusions': '\nInternational air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges.\nTCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount.\nMeals other than those specified (if any).\nLaundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature.\nMandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 5/ CHF 5 per person per day is not included in the price.\nCity taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel.\nCost of foreign exchange for personal use.\nCost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual\nAny items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.\n', 'termsAndConditions': 'General Notes:\n\nQuote for 2 guests is based on standard car like Toyota Prius or similar,\xa0\nQuote for 4 – 8 guests is based on Van like VW/Opel/Vito or similar,\xa0\nQuote from 10 guests it will be 14/16/19-seater vehicle or similar.\xa0\nIf the guests exceed the seating capacity of the vehicle, then the rate will change based on a real-time basis as it will fall under coach packages\xa0\nFor 2 to 6 guests, Vehicle is with driver cum guide. No separate guide\nIf there are 5A + 3C or 6A + 2C or 4A + 4C etc. or similar, then we will have to check rates on real time basis.\nBlocking must be done a minimum 45 days prior to travel date with re-confirmation before 30 - 25 days of travel date unless there is an event then the booking has to be made on an immediate basis and the rate will be based on real-time availability\nIf the travel date is during any festival, Sporting / Cultural / State or Government Event, Exhibition, Trade fairs etc. then the rate will change based on a real-time basis.\n\nSpecial Note:\n\nHotels will be as per the names listed below or similar. If the requested hotels are not available, we will endeavor to book space in similarly priced hotels.\nTips to drive & guide is not included (Nominal Tipping is EUR 5 Per person per day)\nWe do not commit rooms with air conditioning. In case your guests are keen on the aircon, please let us know beforehand\xa0\nAll the below itineraries have point to point transport on the arrival and departure day\nThe vehicle will be on disposal for 10 driving hrs. per day. If guests exceed 10 hours, they will have to the pay extra hr. charges (to be advised at the time of booking) directly to the chauffeur.\xa0\nWe aren’t holding any inventory of hotels / vehicles at the moment\xa0\xa0\n\nImportant Notes:\n\nThe above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together.\nThe above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events\nMaximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room.\nMidnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs.\nWIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed.\xa0\n(Supplement charges may apply for such services)\nStandard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs.\nMost hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned.\nAt this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability\nTCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost\n\nTerms And Conditions:\n\nTravel Validity: 1 July – 31 October 2026 // Except Blackout Period\nBlack out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ.\nTCS & GST would be levied as applicable\nThe rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times.\nMaximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room.\nThe rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses\nSurcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking.\nTo proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour.\nShould the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly.\nThe rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates.\nWe are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package.\nInternational Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.\nTransfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only.\nNo refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service.\nAll the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking.\nSightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice.\nRates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends.\nOffer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time.\nAs a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014939/DuomoSquareCathedral_Milan_SRP.jpg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014939/itinerary/Romecity.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014939/itinerary/Rome-Colosseum.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014939/itinerary/amalfi.png', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014939/itinerary/2987_Florence_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014939/itinerary/Pisa_1.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014939/itinerary/Venice.png', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014939/itinerary/59724_Venice_Mark_Square753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014939/itinerary/16950_Duomo_Square_Cathedral_Milan_Italy_753.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014939/itinerary/Milan_Cityview_753.jpeg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015163', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015163', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'december_2026', 'october_2026'], 'packageName': 'Scandinavian Delight', 'days': 9, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Copenhagen', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Copenhagen', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Stockholm', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Stockholm', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Oslo', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Oslo', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bergen', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bergen', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Bergen', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': None, 'price': 404972, 'packageSummary': "The 'Scandinavian Delight' package is a 9-day tour covering the scenic cities of Stockholm, Copenhagen, Bergen, and Oslo. The itinerary includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the historic Bryggen wharf, the Royal Palace, and the vibrant Nyhavn harbor. Participants will enjoy guided city sightseeing tours, a breathtaking fjord cruise, and opportunities to explore local museums and cultural sites, making for an unforgettable Nordic adventure.", 'images': ['Copenhagen1.jpg', 'Copenhagen2.jpg', 'Stockholm2.jpg', 'Stockholm1.jpg', 'Oslo1.jpg', 'Oslo2jpg.jpg', 'Bergen1.jpg', 'Bergen2jpg.jpg', 'Stockholm4.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 404972, 'thumbnailImage': 'Norway1.avif', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015163 is named 'Scandinavian Delight' and spans 9 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Copenhagen, Meals: NA, Description: Arrive Copenhagen Transfers: Upon your arrival at Copenhagen Airport you will meet the representative and then be transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle. Special Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15.00 hrs or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Copenhagen, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Copenhagen Small Group Walking Tour Copenhagen Small Group Walking Tour: Enjoy city views from Rundetaarn and visit Trinitatis Kirke. Walk to Stroget in the Old Town pass colorful Nyhavn to Amalienborg Palace then see the Gefion Fountain and The Little Mermaid inspired by H C Andersen., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Stockholm, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Copenhagen to Stockholm by Train Transfers: You will be transferred from Copenhagen hotel to the train station on private basis. Upon reaching Stockholm train station you will have a private transfer to the hotel. Special Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15.00 hrs or at the discretion of the hotel management., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Stockholm, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Stockholm Small Group Walking City Tour Stockholm Small Group Walking City Tour: Join a small group walking tour of Stockholm. Visit City Hall Sergels Square and Gamla Stan a well preserved medieval center. Explore the Nobel Museum Royal Palace and guard change and discover the historic Vasa warship museum., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Oslo, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Stockholm to Oslo by Train Transfers: You will be transferred from Stockholm hotel to the train station on private basis. Upon reaching Oslo train station you will have a private transfer to the hotel. Special Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15.00 hrs or at the discretion of the hotel management., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Oslo, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Oslo Small Group Walking City Tour Oslo Small Group Walking City Tour: Visit Oslos Royal Palace Vigeland Sculpture Park and Opera House. Explore the Kon Tiki FRAM and Maritime museums Akershus Fortress and its history museums then stroll Karl Johans Gate filled with shops cafes bars and nightlife., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Bergen, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Oslo to Bergen Norway in a Nutshell Tour: Start your day with the Norway in a Nutshell tour by train bus and cruise. Travel via Naeroyfjord a UNESCO fjord with steep cliffs and waterfalls. Ride the Flam Railway to Myrdal then continue by train to Bergen with luggage transferred. Special Note: Only one piece of luggage transfer is allowed from Bergen hotel to Oslo hotel. Your luggage will be transferred from Oslo hotel to Bergen hotel. Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15.00 hrs or at the discretion of the hotel management., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Bergen, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Bergen City Walking Tour Bergen City Walking Tour: Enjoy a small group walking tour in Bergen. The Floibanen funicular can be found in the city center near the fish market and Bryggen. Explore the charming Hanseatic town with historic warehouses cathedral and colorful wooden houses., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 9 - Bergen, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Depart Transfers: You will be transferred from Bergen 