table Nordic adventure.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Copenhagen\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at Copenhagen Airport you will meet the representative and then be transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle.\nSpecial Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15.00 hrs or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only.', 'mealDescription': 'NA', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel The Square or similar in Copenhagen'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\n\n\xa0\nCopenhagen Small Group Walking Tour\nCopenhagen Small Group Walking Tour: Enjoy city views from Rundetaarn and visit Trinitatis Kirke. Walk to Stroget in the Old Town pass colorful Nyhavn to Amalienborg Palace then see the Gefion Fountain and The Little Mermaid inspired by H C Andersen.\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel The Square\xa0or similar\xa0in Copenhagen'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nCopenhagen to Stockholm by Train\nTransfers: You will be transferred from Copenhagen hotel to the train station on private basis. Upon reaching Stockholm train station you will have a private transfer to the hotel.\nSpecial Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15.00 hrs or at the discretion of the hotel management.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Clarion or similar in Stockholm'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nStockholm Small Group Walking City Tour\nStockholm Small Group Walking City Tour: Join a small group walking tour of Stockholm. Visit City Hall Sergels Square and Gamla Stan a well preserved medieval center. Explore the Nobel Museum Royal Palace and guard change and discover the historic Vasa warship museum.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Clarion or similar in Stockholm'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\n\n\xa0\nStockholm to Oslo by Train\nTransfers: You will be transferred from Stockholm hotel to the train station on private basis. Upon reaching Oslo train station you will have a private transfer to the hotel.\nSpecial Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15.00 hrs or at the discretion of the hotel management.\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Scandic or similar in Oslo'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\n\n\xa0\nOslo Small Group Walking City Tour\nOslo Small Group Walking City Tour: Visit Oslos Royal Palace Vigeland Sculpture Park and Opera House. Explore the Kon Tiki FRAM and Maritime museums Akershus Fortress and its history museums then stroll Karl Johans Gate filled with shops cafes bars and nightlife.\n\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Scandic or similar in Oslo'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nOslo to Bergen\nNorway in a Nutshell Tour: Start your day with the Norway in a Nutshell tour by train bus and cruise. Travel via Naeroyfjord a UNESCO fjord with steep cliffs and waterfalls. Ride the Flam Railway to Myrdal then continue by train to Bergen with luggage transferred.\nSpecial Note: Only one piece of luggage transfer is allowed from Bergen hotel to Oslo hotel. Your luggage will be transferred from Oslo hotel to Bergen hotel. Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15.00 hrs or at the discretion of the hotel management.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Clarion or similar in Bergen'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nBergen City Walking Tour\nBergen City Walking Tour: Enjoy a small group walking tour in Bergen. The Floibanen funicular can be found in the city center near the fish market and Bryggen. Explore the charming Hanseatic town with historic warehouses cathedral and colorful wooden houses.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Clarion or similar\xa0in Bergen'}, {'day': 9, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart\nTransfers: You will be transferred from Bergen hotel to the Airport on private transfer.\nSpecial Notes: You will rea