s charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients.\nThe organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.\n', 'pkgSubtypeId': 4, 'pkgSubtypeName': 'FIT', 'pkgTypeId': 1, 'isFlightIncluded': 'Y', 'holidayPlusSubType': 2, 'productId': 11, 'flightsAvailability': 'This package offers optional flights. You can choose to add flights or book separately.', 'serviceSlots': None, 'constructed_thumbnailImage': 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014548/AdobeStock_176653433.jpeg', 'constructed_images': ['https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014548/itinerary/Madrid.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014548/itinerary/MadridRoyalPalace.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014548/itinerary/AdobeStock_176653433.jpeg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014548/itinerary/cityview_barca.jpg', 'https://resources.thomascook.in/images/holidays/PKG014548/itinerary/AdobeStock_200457802_barcelona.jpeg']}, 'score': 1.395028, 'departureCity_details': None, 'fareCalendar': None}, {'id': 'PKG015125', 'itinerary_data': {'packageId': 'PKG015125', 'availableMonths': ['november_2026', 'january_2027', 'december_2026', 'march_2027', 'february_2027'], 'packageName': 'Iceland Adventure', 'days': 8, 'cities': [{'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Reykjavik', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Akureyri', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Akureyri', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Akureyri', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}, {'cityName': 'Akureyri', 'geoLocation': {'lon': 0.0, 'lat': 0.0}}], 'highlights': [''], 'pdfName': 'PKG015125_0_20260901134903', 'price': 417713, 'packageSummary': "The 'Iceland Adventure' package is an 8-day tour covering the stunning destinations of Akureyri and Reykjavik. The itinerary includes visits to the famous Golden Circle, the majestic Godafoss waterfall, and the vibrant city centers of both locations. Participants will enjoy guided sightseeing tours, thrilling whale-watching excursions, relaxing dips in geothermal hot springs, and opportunities to witness the breathtaking volcanic landscapes of Iceland.", 'images': ['Reykjavik1.jpg', 'Blulagoon.jpg', 'Gullfoss (1).jpg', 'Lights.jpg', 'return-flight.jpg', 'AkureyriChurch1.jpg', 'whale_watching.jpg', 'return-flight.jpg'], 'minimumPrice': 417713, 'thumbnailImage': 'Lights.bmp', 'packageTheme': ['Family'], 'isTcilRecomended': 'Recommended', 'packageData': "Package ID: PKG015125 is named 'Iceland Adventure' and spans 8 days. The itinerary includes:\nDay 1 - Reykjavik, Meals: N/A, Description: Transfers: Upon your arrival at Reykjavik airport, you will meet the representative and then be transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle. Reykjavik Northern Lights Evening Tour: Join a Northern Lights minibus tour. Travel off the beaten track to top viewing spots, relax under a blanket, sip hot cocoa, and watch the Aurora Borealis light up the night sky. Special Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15:00 hrs. or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 2 - Reykjavik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Lava Tunnel Tour: Explore Iceland above and below ground. Walk along ancient lava flows and enter one of the countrys largest lava tunnels, up to 30m wide and 10m high, featuring natural light columns and colorful mineral rich rock walls. (Subject to availability) Golden Circle Tour: Visit Icelands top sights: Gullfoss waterfall, Geysir geothermal area, and Þingvellir National Park. See Strokkur geyser erupt and stand near Gullfoss as powerful water cascades into a dramatic gorge., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 3 - Reykjavik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: South Iceland Adventure Tour: On this tour discover Seljalandsfoss and Skogafoss waterfalls, walk behind Seljalandsfoss, visit Reynisfjara black sand beach with basalt columns, and see Solheimajokull glacier with its scenic glacial lake., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 4 - Reykjavik, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Wonders of Snaefellsnes National Park: Explore the Snaefellsnes Peninsula, a mini Iceland with black beaches, volcanic craters, caves, birdlife, and Snaefellsjokull glacier. Visit Arnarstapi, see Kirkjufell, and admire Djupalonssandur’s dramatic cliffs and sands., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 5 - Akureyri, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Transfers: Today you will be transferred from the hotel to the Reykjavik airport on a private basis. Upon arrival at the Akureyri airport you will be transferred to the hotel on a private basis. Special Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15:00 hrs. or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 6 - Akureyri, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Diamond Circle Tour: Visit Lake Myvatn, Godafoss, Dettifoss, and Asbyrgi Canyon. See Hverir mud pools, Viti crater, and basalt cliffs at Hljodaklettar. Travel through dramatic landscapes and stop in Husavik village before returning to Akureyri., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 7 - Akureyri, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Whale Watching Tour: See whales and dolphins in Iceland’s natural habitat. In Akureyri’s rich fjords, spot humpback whales with expert guides, who share insights into their behavior and ensure an unforgettable wildlife experience. (Subject to availability), GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nDay 8 - Akureyri, Meals: Breakfast, Description: Transfers: You will be transferred from Akureyri hotel to the Airport on private transfer. Special Notes: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight., GeoLocation: (Lat: 0.0, Lon: 0.0).\nThe price is 417713.0. Hotels envisaged include: \n\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSTANDARD\xa0CATEGORY\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nREYKJAVIK\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHotel\xa0Miðgarður\xa0or\xa0similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAKUREYRI\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBerjaya Iceland Hotels\xa0or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n, \n\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAGED OR SIMILAR\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCITIES\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVALUE\xa0CATEGORY\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nREYKJAVIK\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHotel\xa0Miðgarður\xa0or\xa0similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAKUREYRI\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHotel Kea\xa0or similar\xa0\n\n\n\n\n\n. Meals include: \nDaily Breakfast Except Day 1\n. Inclusions: HOLIDAY PRICE INCLUDES: Accommodation: 4 Nights’ accommodation in Reykjavik based on the hotel category selected or similar 3 Nights’ accommodation in Akureyri based on the hotel category selected or similar Meals: Daily Breakfast *(Except Day 1) Transportation: [Includes Privates services on Point-to-Point Basis] Return Airport Transfer from Reykjavik airport to the Hotel Return Airport Transfers from Akureyri Airport to the Hotel Sightseeing: (For SIC Package tours will operate on seat in coach basis & from a designated point) Reykjavik Northern Lights Evening Tour Lava Tunnel Tour Golden Circle Tour South Iceland Adventure Tour Wonders of Snæfellsnes National Park Diamond Circle Tour Whale Watching Tour Insurance: Overseas Travel Insurance (up to 60 yrs age group only). Exclusions: International air ticket, Domestic ticket if any, Airport taxes & Visa charges. Lunch & Dinner (if not mentioned) Drinks during meals TCS and GST is not included in the above cost and will be charged on final amount. Laundry, telephone, optional excursions and other items of a personal nature. Mandatory tipping to Guide/ driver of EUR 10 per person per day is not included in the price. City taxes / Resort Fees – To be paid at the hotel. Cost of foreign exchange for personal use. Cost of PCR Test is not included & any medical examination will be treated as actual Any items or services not specified in the itinerary ‘INCLUSIONS’ head.. Product Terms and Conditions: IMPORTANT NOTES: The above price is based on minimum 2 Passengers travelling together. The above price is not valid for travel during Trade Fairs & Events Maximum 3 persons (adult / child) are allowed per room. Midnight surcharges apply for transfers between 2200 hrs. – 0700 hrs. WIFI, Tea / Coffee making facility etc. in the rooms cannot be guaranteed. (Supplement charges may apply for such services) Standard check-in time into the hotel is 1500 Hrs. Most hotels in Europe are not air-conditioned. At this point of time no services are confirmed and the same is subject to availability TCS & GST as applicable on the above tour cost. TERMS AND CONDITIONS: Travel Validity: 1 November 2026 – 31 March 2027 Black out period will attract surcharges and above rates could differ. The rates are valid for minimum 02 adults travelling together at all times. Maximum 3 persons (2 adult + 1 child or 3 adults) are allowed per room. The rates are not valid on block out dates which covers sporting events, trade fairs, conventions, and major congresses Surcharges wherever applicable would be advised at the time of booking. To proceed with the booking, you need to pay Non-Refundable Booking deposit depending on the package which will be adjusted towards the cost of the tour. Should the period of travel, or the number of participants, or the type of accommodation, or the type of transport or the duration of the trip, change the quote will be adjusted accordingly. The rates are subject to availability of hotel accommodation and sightseeing tours at the time of booking. We reserve the right to use an alternate hotel accommodation of an equal or higher standard. If we source a more expensive alternative, we reserve the right to re-quote based on the higher rates. We are not holding any Hotel blocks for this package. International Check in time is 1500 hours / Check out time is 1100 hours, early check in and check-out is subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed. Transfers wherever included are without night surcharges and from specific airports only. No refunds either in part or in full will be made for any unutilized service. All the sightseeing tours and excursions are organized by local companies and may be from designated points. The timings and days of operation are subject to alteration. Changes if any will be intimated at the time of booking. Sightseeing’s tours are strictly based on weather conditions and also local service providers have rights to cancel the sightseeing tours without prior notice. Rates subject to change without prior notice and also for clients travelling during weekends. Offer can be withdrawn at any point without prior notice. Bookings once confirmed are subject to cancellation charges which shall be advised at that time. As a practice all international hotels charge a security deposit via credit card or cash, at the time of check- in for each room. The amount will vary according to the hotel and is refunded back to the clients upon check-out. Debit cards should not be offered as it will be charged immediately and refunded only after 2-3 weeks. If any additional services or mini bar or any other service is utilized at the hotel, the hotel reserves the right to charge the same on this security deposit provided by the client. The said organisation would not be responsible for these transactions and these are solely between the hotels and the clients. The organisation will not be responsible for any change in the price due to factors not in the control of the organisation.. Highlights of the package: .", 'departureCities': [{'cityName': 'Bhubaneswar', 'cityCode': 'BBI', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Visakhapatnam', 'cityCode': 'VTZ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Mangalore', 'cityCode': 'IXE', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Pune', 'cityCode': 'PNQ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Thiruvananthapuram', 'cityCode': 'TRV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kanpur', 'cityCode': 'KNU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bangalore', 'cityCode': 'BLR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Jammu', 'cityCode': 'IXJ', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Bhopal', 'cityCode': 'BHO', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Ahmedabad', 'cityCode': 'AMD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Indore', 'cityCode': 'IDR', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Chennai', 'cityCode': 'MAA', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Kolkata', 'cityCode': 'CCU', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Surat', 'cityCode': 'STV', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Hyderabad', 'cityCode': 'HYD', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cityName': 'Dehradun', 'cityCode': 'DED', 'ltItineraryCode': '', 'holidayLtPricingId': ''}, {'cit