unities to witness the breathtaking volcanic landscapes of Iceland.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0Upon your arrival\xa0at\xa0Reykjavik\xa0airport,\xa0you will meet the representative and then be transferred to the\xa0hotel in a private vehicle.\xa0\nReykjavik\xa0Northern Lights\xa0Evening\xa0Tour:\xa0Join a Northern Lights minibus tour. Travel off the beaten track to top viewing spots, relax under a blanket, sip hot cocoa, and watch the Aurora Borealis light up the night sky.\xa0\nSpecial Note:\xa0Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15:00 hrs.\xa0or at the discretion of the hotel management.\xa0Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will\xa0operate\xa0to selected hotels only.\xa0\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Midgardur\xa0or\xa0similar Reykjavik'}, {'day': 2, 'description': '\n\xa0\nLava Tunnel\xa0Tour:\xa0Explore Iceland above and below ground. Walk along ancient lava flows and enter one of the countrys largest lava tunnels, up to 30m wide and 10m high, featuring natural light columns and\xa0colorful\xa0mineral rich rock walls.\xa0(Subject to availability)\xa0\nGolden\xa0Circle\xa0Tour:\xa0Visit Icelands top sights: Gullfoss waterfall,\xa0Geysir\xa0geothermal area, and\xa0Þingvellir\xa0National Park. See Strokkur geyser erupt and stand near Gullfoss as powerful water cascades into a dramatic gorge.\xa0\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Midgardur\xa0or\xa0similar Reykjavik'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nSouth Iceland Adventure Tour: On this tour discover Seljalandsfoss and Skogafoss waterfalls, walk behind Seljalandsfoss, visit Reynisfjara black sand beach with basalt columns, and see Solheimajokull glacier with its scenic glacial lake.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Midgardur\xa0or\xa0similar Reykjavik'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nWonders of Snaefellsnes National Park: Explore the Snaefellsnes Peninsula, a mini Iceland with black beaches, volcanic craters, caves, birdlife, and Snaefellsjokull glacier. Visit Arnarstapi, see Kirkjufell, and admire Djupalonssandur’s dramatic cliffs and sands.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel\xa0Midgardur\xa0or\xa0similar Reykjavik'}, {'day': 5, 'description': '\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0\xa0\n\nToday you will be transferred from the hotel to the Reykjavik airport on a private basis.\xa0\nUpon arrival at the Akureyri airport you will be transferred to the hotel on a private basis.\xa0\xa0\n\nSpecial Note: Check in is subject to standard operating norms of 15:00 hrs. or at the discretion of the hotel management. Private transfers will have a minimum of 60 mins waiting and will operate to selected hotels only.\xa0\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Berjaya Iceland or similar in Akureyri'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\n\xa0\nDiamond Circle Tour: Visit Lake Myvatn, Godafoss, Dettifoss, and Asbyrgi Canyon. See Hverir mud pools, Viti crater, and basalt cliffs at Hljodaklettar. Travel through dramatic landscapes and stop in Husavik village before returning to Akureyri.\n', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Berjaya Iceland\xa0or similar in Akureyri'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nWhale Watching Tour: See whales and dolphins in Iceland’s natural habitat. In Akureyri’s rich fjords, spot humpback whales with expert guides, who share insights into their behavior and ensure an unforgettable wildlife experience. (Subject to availability)\xa0', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel Berjaya Iceland\xa0or similar in Akureyri'}, {'day': 8, 'description': '\xa0\nTransfers:\xa0You will be transferred from Akureyri hotel to the Airport on private transfer.\xa0\xa0\n\xa0\nSpecial Notes:\xa0You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast\n\xa0\n\xa0', 'overnightStay': 'NA'}]}, 'hotels': ['\n\n\n\n\n\nHOTELS ENVISAG