destinations.", 'itinerary': [{'day': 1, 'description': '\xa0\nArrive Italy\nTransfers: Upon your arrival at the Fiumicino Leonardo Da Vinci (FCO) airport, you will meet the representative and transferred to the hotel in a private vehicle.\xa0\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.', 'mealDescription': 'N/A', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel -\xa0Andreotti\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Best Western Artdeco\xa0(Value) or similar in Rome'}, {'day': 2, 'description': "\xa0\nHop On Hop Off Tour\nHop on Hop Off Tour: Discover Rome's iconic sights and landmarks on a hop on hop off bus tour, offering a comprehensive overview of all the city’s highlights. Disembark at any of the multiple stops to see popular landmarks such as the Vatican City, Circus Maximus, the Pantheon, or the Colosseum. While on board the bus, listen to recorded commentary in multiple languages that details the history, architecture, culture, and traditions of the Eternal City.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel -\xa0Andreotti\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Best Western Artdeco\xa0(Value) or similar in Rome'}, {'day': 3, 'description': '\xa0\nRome To Florence Via Train\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Florence. (Duration approx. 1.5 hrs.)\nUpon your arrival at Florence train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\nSpecial Note: Check in will be as per the standard timings of 15:00 hrs or as per hotel discretion.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel -\xa0Albergo Firenze\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Atlantic Palace\xa0(Value) or similar in Florence'}, {'day': 4, 'description': '\xa0\nPisa And The Leaning Tower Tour\nTransfers: You will have a transfer from Florence to Pisa and back to Florence.\nPisa and the Leaning Tower Tour: This popular half day trip takes you from Florence through the scenic Tuscan countryside to the historic city of Pisa. The tour focuses on Piazza dei Miracoli, a UNESCO World Heritage site, where you’ll see the Leaning Tower, the Cathedral, the Baptistery, and the Monumental Cemetery.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel -\xa0Albergo Firenze\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Atlantic Palace\xa0(Value) or similar in Florence'}, {'day': 5, 'description': "\xa0\nFlorence To Venice Via Train\nTransfers:\xa0\n\nMake your way to the train station for your onward journey to Venice. (Duration approx. 2.5 hrs.)\nUpon your arrival at Venice train station, you will make your way to the hotel on your own.\n\n\xa0\nGondola Ride: Experience Venice in the most Venetian way possible: via a shared gondola ride while being serenaded. Choose between an afternoon or evening ride and then begin the ride, as part of a group of eight different gondolas, with a singer aboard one of the boats. In addition to the song being sun to you, enjoy the sites of Venice's main landmarks, including the grand Canal and Palazzo Barberino.", 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel -\xa0Diana\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Royal San Marco\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Venice'}, {'day': 6, 'description': '\xa0\nMurano, Burano And Torcello Half Day Tour\nMurano, Burano and Torcello Half Day Sightseeing Tour: Today visit Torcello, Murano, and Burano - three islands in the Venetian Lagoon - on this tour from Venice by motorboat. With a guide, watch glass being blown at a Murano glass factory, see historical cathedrals on Torcello, and admire exquisite handmade lace on Burano. This is a great way to see more than just the central sights of Venice and enjoy a cruise on the water.\nHighlights:\n\nVisit the three most famous islands in the Venetian Lagoon by motorboat\xa0\nWatch master glass blowers at work at a factory on Murano\xa0\nSee Byzantine churches on Torcello - the Church of Santa Fosca\xa0\nBrowse for lace on Burano and admire the painted houses\n\n\xa0\nMcArthurGlen Designer Outlet (Optional): Later you can opt to visit the McArthurGlen Designer Outlet in Noventa di Piave is the most prestigious shopping outlet in Veneto, where you can find the most prestigious fashion with discounts up to 70% all around the year. Located just 30 minutes by car from Venice. Over 100 shops, restaurants, bars, lounges, play areas for children, located in a beautiful setting with architectural mosaics and frescoes inspired by the palaces in Venice and Treviso, where you can satisfy your thirst for great fashion, taking advantage of the offers and services designed specifically to make time spent here unforgettable.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'Hotel -\xa0Diana\xa0(Standard) /\xa0Royal San Marco\xa0(Value) or similar in\xa0Venice'}, {'day': 7, 'description': '\xa0\nDepart Venice\nTransfers: From Venice hotel to airport, you will have a private transfer.\nSpecial Notes: You will reach airport 3 - 4 hours prior to your departure flight.\nDo spare a few minutes to share your feedback with our representative or via email - as your valued suggestions will be most appreciated. Arrive home with pleasant memories of your overseas tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.', 'mealDescription': 'Breakfast', 'overnightStay': 'N/A'}]}, 'hotels': ['Hotels Envisaged or Similar:\n\n\n\n\nCITY NAME\n\n\n3*\n\n\n\n\nROME\n\n\nAndreotti Hotel and Domus Australia / Hotel Villa San Lorenzo Maria / Hotel Des Artistes / Hotel Nord Nuova Roma / Hotel Windrose or similar\n\n\n\n\nFLORENCE\n\n\nAlbergo Firenze / Hotel Boccaccio / Hotel Paris / Hotel Machiavelli Palace / Hotel Luxor Florence or similar\n\n\n\n\nVENICE\n\n\nHotel Diana / Albergo San Marco / San Zulian / Hotel Montecarlo or similar\n\n\n\n', "Hotels Envisaged or Similar :\n\n\n\n\nCITY NAME\n\n\n4*\n\n\n\n\nROME\n\n\nBest Western Hotel Artdeco / Atlantico / Hotel Massimo D'azeglio / Hotel Diana Roof Garden / Best Western President or similar\n\n\n\n\nFLORENCE\n\n\nAtlantic Palace / De La Ville / Embassy Hotel / Starhotels Michelangelo Florence 